window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4701,"title":"Chapter 4701: A storm is coming","paragraphs":["After Baili Haojie found out about Ling Han’s strength, he was depressed for a whole three days.","He was the son of a Great Emperor, and should have been invincible among his peers, yet in the end, he had encountered a super freak, who suppressed him completely.","How was he supposed to compete?","This gap was not just a little bit, but was completely one-sided.","It could be said that even if all the Great Emperors in history were summoned, it was guaranteed that no one would be a match for Ling Han in a battle of equal cultivation levels.","It must be because of the treasure passed down by Empress Qingzhu!","It should be known that Empress Qingzhu had foreseen that there would be great dangers in this era, and made arrangements, leaving behind a trump card that could eliminate great chaos. That was why Ling Han was so freakish, right?","—He had guessed half right. However, even without the Seed of the Holy Flame, the Saint that Ling Han would become would still be incredibly powerful. He would only be slightly inferior to the present him.","Baili Haojie was extremely jealous. As the son of a Great Emperor, such a great opportunity actually didn’t fall into his hands!","The heavens were really unjust.","But what could be done? Time could not be reversed.","Even if Ling Han made all kinds of demands that went too far, the two great Imperial Clans could only swallow their grievances.","It could not be helped. Ling Han was too strong.","Right now, they could still rely on the Imperial Weapon and Imperial Formation to resist. However, what would happen when Ling Han became a Nine-Star Saint, or even a Pseudo-Emperor?","He would probably be able to channel the Imperial Weapon endlessly, and by then, aside from the true Great Emperor, who would be able to match him?","En, a Pseudo-Emperor bearing an Imperial Weapon should work as well, but whether it was Buddha Doga, Ge Qianqiu or Qian Yanghao, they were all on Ling Han’s side. Just the thought of it was enough to make one lose hope.","Ling Han left in satisfaction. He had practically squeezed the two great Imperial Clans dry.","In desperate times, desperate measures were naturally necessary. Moreover, he had already formed a great enmity with the Ziwei Imperial Clan. He was already being merciful by not razing them to the ground.","Ling Han went to a few more Imperial Clans, and directly showed his cultivation level as a One Star Saint. If anyone was dissatisfied, he further demonstrated thirty Eight Star Regulations, and immediately, there were no objections. They expressed their willingness to form an alliance with the Nine Suns Holy Land, and they would advance and retreat together.","The alliance was established, but how could real-time communication be achieved?","Even if the Saint’s speed was fast, the journey between two locations would take four to five days, at the very least. This Skeleton Saint Tool was pressing down on them en masse, and it was very possible that a battle would be over in less than half a day’s time, so what meaning was there to it?","Thus, they definitely had to establish a real-time communication network. Then, they also had to greatly shorten the time of travel.","Ling Han began to study formation techniques.","In any case, he was already at the peak stage of One Star Saint, and it was impossible for him to break through just by cultivating diligently. Thus, he had free time to do as he liked.","The method he thought of was naturally formations, but this was still limited.","Finally, he thought of the life plaque.","In the Imperial Clan, every important clansman had a life plaque. Once they died, their life plaque would immediately shatter.","Ling Han’s plan was to rear some pigs and dogs, and create life plaques for them. If anything happened, they could be killed, and the various great Imperial Clans would be immediately informed.","Similarly, the various Imperial Clans could also do the same. This dog corresponded to the Nine Suns Holy Land, and that pig would correspond to another Imperial Clan. Once slaughtered, its life plaque shattered, they would immediately be notified.","This solved the problem of communication. However, Ling Han still needed to think of some way to get the Saint-level reinforcements to arrive quickly. At present, the Transfer Formation was not as fast as a Saint making the journey personally.","However, this method of communication was met with opposition from the large black dog and the perverted pig.","Killing dogs and slaughtering pigs, wasn’t that just mocking them?","\"If I don’t kill dogs and pigs, I’ll kill flies and mosquitoes, all right?\" Ling Han could only compromise.","He had agreed on some details with the Imperial Clans. For example, what level of danger killing flies represented, and what level of danger killing mosquitoes represented. In fact, killing different flies and mosquitoes could also be combined into a complex message, transmitting more specific information.","However, how to get the Saint-level reinforcements to arrive quickly was still a dilemma that could not be solved.","There was really no other way, so he could only use the stupidest method.","Surveillance.","A dozen or so Saints were dispatched to keep an eye on the Skeleton Saint Tool. If there were any signs that they were going to attack any clan, they would immediately send a message and arrive in advance.","After such arrangements, Ling Han finally felt slightly more at ease.","The Skeleton Saint Tool was really too terrifying. It was mainly because there were too many of them. An abundance of ants could bite an elephant to death, and they were completely like lions. Only the Pseudo-Emperor could match them.","Even if Ling Han was so extraordinary, he could only fight one or two of them alone. Once there were too many of them, he would still be beaten to death.","Though the Netherworld did not launch another attack, the atmosphere was incredibly tense.","Ling Han believed that the Netherworld wouldn’t give him time to grow. The twelve Great Emperors had schemed for so many years, so how could they watch as he became a Great Emperor and destroyed everything?","Hence, this was a sign that a storm was about to come, and what would follow would definitely be an incredibly cruel battle.","Most importantly, Ling Han could run, and the large black dog, the empress, and the others could also run, but what about the Four Origin Planet?","There were too many living beings on it.","However, right at this moment, Ling Han suddenly discovered that he was about to break through.","He immediately went into seclusion. Right now, what was most reliable was his own strength. If he could become a Nine-Star Saint... no, as long as he became a Five-Star Saint, that would be enough. That would be enough to force the Skeleton Saint Tool into the ground.","This time, the breakthrough took a long time. A whole three months later, Ling Han finally managed to silently destroy another part of his body, and could thus accommodate even more Regulations.","A Two Star Saint!","His strength immediately soared, and the number of Regulations he had grasped increased from 25 to 30, but the power of belief could only boost Regulations by five times.","Ordinary Saints would only be able to accommodate an additional Regulation after advancing a single level. Those like the Imperial Son would only be able to accommodate an additional two Regulations. Furthermore, it could not be guaranteed that he would be able to reach this number every time he broke through. Only if he was the son of a Great Emperor, would he be able to reach the level of gaining three eight-star Regulations.","But what about Ling Han?","Five flashes!","This was very, very shocking.","However, Ling Han wasn’t overjoyed. Although his battle prowess had increased, it was still insufficient against the Skeleton Saint Tool.","\"Now, it’s definitely no problem for me to fight three Skeleton Saint Tools alone, but...\"","The number of Skeleton Saint Tools was in the hundreds. If they were all mobilized to attack Four Origin Planet, what could Ling Han do?","If he fought with all his might, he would definitely die, and if he abandoned it and fled, how could Ling Han bear to do so?","However, whatever he feared would come true.","On the third day after Ling Han came out of seclusion, he received news that the Skeleton Saint Tools had moved out, and were charging towards Four Origin Planet, and their numbers were... all at once!","This was a message that had been transmitted by the Saints at the front lines through the method of killing flies and mosquitoes.","At the same time, this news also spread to the other Imperial Clans.","The Saints from the various clans had all come. However, they all advised Ling Han not to clash head-on with the army of Skeleton Saint Tools. Instead, it was best for him to sacrifice his pawns to protect the chariot. Otherwise, he would only die with the Four Origin Planet.","No one agreed to defend the Four Origin Planet with their lives. There were far too many Skeleton Saint Tools, and the Imperial Weapons would only awaken for a limited amount of time. Thus, how long could they defend for?","Thus, retreating immediately was the best course of action."]},{"number":4702,"title":"Chapter 4702: Enemy arrives","paragraphs":["None of the Imperial Clans agreed to stay on the Four Origin Planet to fight against the Yin souls.","This was clearly a suicidal action.","The Imperial Weapons could indeed delay them for a while, but could it last forever?","Moreover, there were 12 Ancestral Kings in the Twelve Lands of Death, so there were naturally 12 Imperial Weapons as well. If they really came to blows, they might not be at a disadvantage in terms of Great Emperor-level power.","Thus, the best course of action was to resolutely give up and leave the Four Origin Planet.","Ling Han pondered for a moment, then said, \"If these Skeleton Saint Tools were attacking your ancestral grounds, what would you choose?\"","These words instantly silenced everyone.","Could they bear to abandon the ancestral grounds and flee with only a limited number of people?","Don’t do unto others what you don’t want.","Ling Han swept an eye over the Saints, and continued, \"It is impossible for the invasion of the Netherworld to stop. If we flee the moment they attack, there will eventually come a day when we will have no foothold!\"","\"Everyone, can the speed at which you push the ancestral grounds to leave compare to the speed at which the Skeleton Saint Tools attack?\"","The Saints were even more silent, their expressions grim.","The Netherworld’s battle line was indeed not advancing very quickly. This was limited by the suppression of heaven and earth. However, the Skeleton Saint Tool could attack on its own, and with about a hundred of them arriving at the same time, what Imperial Clan would be able to withstand it?","Now, it was Four Origin Planet. What if it was Ziwei Imperial Clan, Donglin Imperial Clan or the Peacock Imperial Clan next?","The attacks of a few Imperial Weapons would definitely be able to blast open the imperial formation. At that time, the Skeleton Saint Tool would be able to penetrate deeply, and wouldn’t the people be massacred?","\"Thus, we must have the courage to fight to the death!\" Ling Han said.","\"Let’s battle!\" Brother Monkey raised the metal rod, divine light shooting from his eyes. His fighting spirit was already blazing.","\"Let’s battle!\" the young Imperial Sons said respectively.","Though the veteran Saints still had some hesitation in their hearts, they were all on the edge of death now. If Four Origin Planet was destroyed, then perhaps it would be their own ancestral planet’s turn next.","Moreover, if they didn’t help Ling Han, how could Ling Han possibly help them?","\"All right, let’s battle!\" The Saints all nodded.","There was really no way out for them. They were irreconcilable with the Netherworld, and there was absolutely no way that they could compromise and coexist. Thus, their only option was to battle.","Since they had made up their minds, the Saints also calmed down, and waited quietly.","In the upcoming great battle, it was possible that Saints would fall like rain.","But in the face of this kind of Interrealm War, how could the deaths of Saints be avoided?","No one could possibly stay out of it.","One day, two days, three days. All of a sudden, the air became incredibly oppressive.","Shua!","An attack suddenly blasted over. This was a flash of sword light, as long as 5,000 km. It was entwined with eight-star Regulations, and slashed over.","\"Humph!\"","Brother Monkey attacked, brandishing his staff to parry the sword light.","Peng! With a single strike, the sword light was instantly obliterated.","\"Who are you, little brat!\" Brother Monkey’s expression was filled with violence, as he slung the staff over his shoulder.","\"Descendant of the Battle Saint Emperor.\" In space, a person walked out, extremely casual, as if he was walking in his own backyard.","This was a young man, his white robes fluttering, exuding an otherworldly air.","\"And who are you?\" Brother Monkey asked.","\"The son of the Three Purity Great Emperor, Li Dangping,\" this young man said calmly. He was clearly showing off his strength, yet seemed to have no anger at all, which was a very conflicting scene.","The Three Purity Great Emperor!","Beneath them, the Saints all heard clearly that another identity of the Lords of Death had come to light.","However, it didn’t matter whether they knew their identities or not. In any case, these twelve people were definitely Great Emperors who had suppressed an era. Each of them had once been an invincible emperor.","When they thought of this, all the Saints trembled. How were they supposed to block this kind of enemy? Would they have any chance of winning?","\"Come battle!\" Brother Monkey brandished his staff and charged towards Li Dangping.","The current Brother Monkey had already successfully advanced into Three Stars. With a wave of his staff, there was a monstrous vicious might.","Boom!","Li Dangping swept out with his sword, and when Brother Monkey’s attack was blocked, he counterattacked aggressively. In just a few moves, he had the complete upper hand.","\"Monkey, you’re not the son of a Great Emperor, so how can your aptitude compare to mine?\" Li Dangping said calmly. He had also suppressed his cultivation level to three stars, but his battle prowess was enough to suppress Brother Monkey by three levels.","It could not be helped. This was the son of a Great Emperor!","However, Brother Monkey was completely unconcerned. So what if your battle prowess is stronger than mine? I still want to hit you!","Boom, an air of endless violence exuded from Brother Monkey’s body. This was fighting spirit. It actually forcibly increased his battle prowess, and gradually turned the tables on his opponent.","This!","Ling Han looked on with a frown.","The line of the Battle Saint Emperor were indeed natural battle maniacs. However, though Brother Monkey was presently domineering, he had sacrificed his life force as a price. This meant that Brother Monkey’s lifespan would be far from reaching the theoretical one million years of a Saint.","Even for those like the Battle Saint Emperor, who had battled all their lives, they had expended too much energy, and were completely unable to live a second life. They had long since gone to the edge of the universe.","This kind of bloodlust was already branded into the depths of their bodies, and could not be changed at all.","However, Ling Han didn’t stop him.","This was Brother Monkey’s choice. If he forcefully stopped him, that would be disrespectful to Brother Monkey.","Thinking of this, he couldn’t help but feel angered.","If it was not for the invasion of the Netherworld, would Brother Monkey have been forced into such a bloody battle?","Xiu, xiu, xiu! In space, multiple powerful auras appeared. Those were the Imperial Sons of the Twelve Lands of Death.","Shi Gang, Di Wuji, Zhang Yu, Lu Xun, and so on. All of them stood proudly in spaced, exuding an air of dominance.","The son of a Great Emperor was naturally extraordinary.","Ling Han was currently filled with anger. He immediately let out a battle cry, and charged over alone.","\"Ling Han, you are too arrogant, aren’t you!\" Di Wuji said coldly. He shot out a punch, which turned into a black wolf that was thirty thousand meters long, that pounced to bite at Ling Han.","\"Scram!\" Ling Han shouted loudly. Peng, this silver wolf was forcibly shattered.","What!","Di Wuji paled in shock. Was Ling Han really as strong as the legends said, to the extent that he could only look up to him in admiration?","How was this possible?","Boom, Ling Han had already charged over with his iron fists, bringing with him his nameless fury.","Peng!","Yang Yihuan, He Luo, Tong Ming, and the other Imperial Sons all summoned their Saint Tools at the same time. They joined forces to parry Ling Han’s attacks. However, with a single punch, these Imperial Sons were all sent flying, as if they were flowers scattered by a celestial maiden.","This caused all the Imperial Sons to feel chills all over their bodies. In the past, they had all been supreme king tiers that could shake the heavens and earth. Their natural talent could almost match that of their father. If it was not for the fact that only one person was allowed to become Emperor in an era, it may not be impossible for them to become Emperor.","Now that they had traversed countless years, wanting to become Emperor this era, they also thought that their strength was enough to sweep aside any so-called king tier. However, with more than ten of them joining forces, they were actually no match for a single punch from Ling Han!","\"What a terrifying opponent!\" a young man in black said with a faint smile. \"I’m the third son of the Four Directions Great Emperor, Chang Tingjian.\"","Though the Chang Clan Clan had hold of the Galaxy Network, they themselves were very mysterious. To this day, no one knew where their ancestral grounds were.","Ling Han stared at Chang Tingjian, and frowned, \"Eight-star Saint!\"","It was not that he was wary of the other’s strength, but rather that his cultivation level was too high, and was close to the peak stage of Saint-level. Then, what if the other managed to become Emperor before him?","Instantly, his killing intent soared."]},{"number":4703,"title":"Chapter 4703: Fight with your backs against the wall","paragraphs":["The Living Realm’s only hope was for a new Great Emperor to appear and eradicate the darkness all by himself.","However, if this Great Emperor was born from the Twelve Lands of Death... then everything would be over.","A Great Emperor ruled over an era. Those Pseudo-Emperors, Imperial Weapons and Imperial Formations and whatsover, in front of a true Great Emperor, were all trash. The difference between them lay in how many moves they would be able to block from the hands of a Great Emperor.","In the past, those descendants of the Great Emperors had never participated in the competition for the throne. Thus, the heaven and earth would allow them to become Emperor in this era.","With their aptitude... it was very possible.","Thus, Chang Tingjian was actually an eight-star Saint, and his lead was considerably large. This caused Ling Han’s killing intent to rise, and he wanted to kill him.","For example, Yang Yihuan, He Luo, Feng Miaoling, these Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters from the Twelve Lands of Death who had appeared the earliest, were only three-star or four-star Saints. This was far from enough to pose a threat to becoming Emperor.","Ling Han stared at Chang Tingjian, his aura completely locked onto this person.","If he moved, it would definitely be a swift strike.","Chang Tingjian smiled faintly, \"Ling Han, or rather Number One in the Galaxy, I have long wanted to spar with you.\"","Number One in the Galaxy?","What, Ling Han was Number One in the Galaxy?","To say nothing of the people on the Four Origin Planet, even Imperial Sons like Di Wuji and the others were greatly shocked. As it turned out, the person who had broken records time and time again on the Galaxy Network, and suppressed Heaven Crushing and Origin, was actually Ling Han!","When Ling Han had called himself Number One in the Galaxy, who knew how many people had teased him? Even when Ling Han had broken records time and time again, but there was still no one who truly admitted that he was Number One in the Galaxy.","Because on the long path of cultivation, it was very likely that Ling Han would encounter an accident, and die young.","But now?","Number One in the Galaxy really lived up to his name.","Others could not possibly know this kind of secret, but the Chang Clan had hold of Galaxy Network, so how could they not know?","Ling Han looked at Chang Tingjian coldly, \"What is it? Are you dissatisfied?\"","\"Indeed.\" Chang Tingjian nodded. He drew out a staff, and laid it out in front of him. Weng, instantly, the staff glowed, multiple seals lighting up, exuding a terrifying saintly might.","This was a Saint Tool!","Ling Han was displeased. He actually dared to use the same weapon as Brother Monkey?","\"Ling Han, without the treasure that Empress Qingzhu obtained from the Primitive Abyss, how could you have possibly become so strong?\" Chang Tingjian’s expression was filled with defiance. If the Four Directions Great Emperor had also been able to obtain a supreme treasure in the past, then he would definitely be stronger than Ling Han.","Because he was the son of a Great Emperor!","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"My strength comes from myself. Everything else is only icing on the cake!\"","\"Don’t act like you’re innocent when you have obtained an unfair advantage!\" Chang Tingjian charged over, his staff sweeping out.","Boom! The might of his Eight Star Saint physique was on full display, and 24 streaks of Eight Star Regulations shone brilliantly.","Ling Han smiled faintly. When he had been a One Star Saint, he had more than just this bit of strength, all right?","\"Scram!\" He didn’t need the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and directly greeted this attack with his fists.","Peng! With this strike, Chang Tingjian was instantly sent flying. The web between his thumb and forefinger split open, and blood flowed profusely.","His eyes widened, completely unable to accept this.","He, an eight-star Saint, was actually no match for a single punch from Ling Han?","How was this possible?","He was the son of a Great Emperor!","Hiss, what kind of treasure had this guy obtained from the Primitive Abyss? His battle prowess was actually freakish to this extent?","\"Trash!\" Ling Han said disdainfully. His figure charged out. He was going to kill this Imperial Son in a single go.","He used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and his speed was astonishingly fast.","Chang Tingjian was shocked, and hurriedly brandished his staff to parry.","This time, he had activated the power of belief, and blasted out as many as 27 Regulations.","However, in front of Ling Han, what was the use?","Peng!","With a single punch, Chang Tingjian was once again sent flying, and what terrified him was the fact that the staff in his hand had clearly bent.","This was Saintly Material!","Inferior only to Origin Gold, the hardest material in the world, it was actually bent by a single punch. How could this be believed?","Are you a Pseudo-Emperor?","Without the word ’Emperor’, how could you be so powerful?","However, Ling Han didn’t give him any time to catch his breath. With a quick stride, he caught up to him and threw another punch.","In this strike, he was going to completely destroy this Imperial Son.","Boom! The iron fist arrived, and just as it was about to strike Chang Tingjian, a large hand suddenly stretched out, blocking between the two of them.","Ling Han’s fist arrived, yet it landed on this large hand, causing the light of this large hand to flicker madly. Yet, it actually did not shatter.","Because this was the Skeleton Saint Tool!","The Netherworld’s most terrifying weapon had finally arrived!","Ling Han’s heart clenched. Even if he was freakish, he still had to be careful when encountering this deadly weapon. If he was besieged and attacked by over a hundred Skeleton Saint Tools, even he would die.","Weng, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower floated above his head. He channeled Destructive Energy, and the holy flame was also ready to be unleashed at any time, unleashing his most terrifying destructive power.","\"Haha, Brother Ling, let us help you!\" A heroic laugh rang out, and Ding Shu and the Genesis World’s rulers all appeared.","Previously, they had been cultivating in seclusion. He had not thought that they would actually appear at this most crucial moment.","Ling Han nodded, and laughed loudly, \"All right, we will fight side by side.\"","Xiu, xiu, xiu! More Saints appeared in space, facing the Skeleton Saint Tools head-on.","They had to fight this battle head-on.","They could not retreat, and could not lose.","\"Die!\"","There was nothing else to say; the only thing left was to fight.","Instantly, an intense battle broke out.","These were all people with Saint-level power, so how terrifying was it?","Thankfully, there were no more planets here. Though the Void had cracked and collapsed from the impact, it had not implicated the bystanders.","\"Ling Han, die!\" Tong Ming shouted loudly. He pointed a finger, and 30 Skeleton Saint Tools appeared, charging towards Ling Han.","They had gathered their strongest troops this time round, and their purpose was to kill Ling Han.","They had no choice but to kill him. Otherwise, if this guy became Emperor, that would really be too dangerous.","How could the plans of the Great Emperors be ruined in his hands?","Thus, they would kill him at all costs!","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The 30 Skeleton Saint Tools charged over, and no one could block them at all.","This was far too terrifying. This was equivalent to several thousand Saint Tools attacking at the same time. Who could block this?","Ling Han couldn’t do it either. He used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to forcefully break out of the siege.","Then, he immediately charged back.","The Skeleton Saint Tool was far too terrifying. He had to stall as many of them as possible.","Boom! He resolutely unleashed the holy flame.","At the same time, he transmitted his divine sense to Ding Shu and the others. That was the complete Spirit Diagram of Destructive Energy.","Now that things had come to this, he could no longer keep his skills to himself. He had to make everyone stronger as much as possible.","And only the Genesis World’s Masters could channel the Destructive Energy. Combined with the holy flame, it could even pose a threat to the Skeleton Saint Tools.","In the face of such a great matter, Ling Han was not allowed to keep any secrets.","For the Genesis World’s rulers, grasping Destructive Energy was close to an instinctive ability. As long as they had the corresponding Spirit Diagram, they would be able to quickly learn it.","Die! Die! Die!","Ling Han went berserk, and pushed his battle prowess to the extreme."]},{"number":4704,"title":"Chapter 4704: The Great Emperor makes his move","paragraphs":["It had to be admitted that the power of the Netherworld far surpassed that of the Living Realm.","There were hundreds of Skeleton Saint Tools. Even if Ling Han held back 30 of them, there were still close to 70 of them. How could they be blocked?","The merging of the babies could only block one of them. Ding Shu and the other Genesis World rulers used their full strength and used the holy flame, but they could only block one each.","The remaining ones could only be temporarily suppressed by the might of the Imperial Weapon. However, the Imperial Weapon couldn’t be maintained in an endless state of recovery, and it would eventually dim.","What could they do? What could they do?","Ling Han looked at the Four Origin Planet in the distance. In the midst of the great battle, everyone had deliberately drawn out the distance, to prevent the battle from affecting the Four Origin Planet.","At first, he had thought that by stimulating the fighting spirit of the Saints, and fighting to the death, they would be able to block this wave of attack from the Netherworld. But from the look of things now, that was still not possible.","True, the 12 Great Emperors had schemed and planned for so many years, so how could they possibly allow Ling Han to resolve the situation so easily?","If things went on like this, they were definitely going to lose. If they fought to the death here, then there would really be no hope at all.","But... giving up on Four Origin Planet?","Ling Han was unwilling to give up. All of a sudden, his thoughts flew, wanting to think of a way out.","All of a sudden, a thought flashed through his mind.","Since he could release the people of Genesis World, could he take them in again?","He would give it a try. At present, he could only put everything on the line as a last resort.","Ling Han channeled the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight and flew toward Four Origin Planet. Behind him, the 30 Skeleton Saint Tools chased after him.","Weng!","Ling Han unleashed a murderous aura attack, but it wasn’t targeted at the pursuers behind him. Instead, it was targeted at Four Origin Planet.","He strictly controlled the intensity of the murderous aura. In fact, he even used a different intensity on different living beings. When the murderous aura surged past Four Origin Planet, all the living beings on it had passed out.","It wasn’t that he hadn’t possessed a Spatial Spirit Tool that could store living beings before. The Spirit Tool needed the recipient to have no mental resistance against it. Otherwise, the recipient could only be brought in after knocking them unconscious.","There were countless living beings on the Four Origin Planet, so could Ling Han notify them one by one not to resist?","There was too little time, and now it was Yin souls that were pressing down on their territory. Everyone was anxious, and the rate of execution of commands would decrease by a considerable amount.","Thus, it would be better to just knock them all out.","Ling Han unleashed his divine sense and wrapped it around Four Origin Planet.","It definitely had to work!","Shua, a scene that caused one’s eyes to pop out appeared. The massive Four Origin Planet suddenly disappeared from the universe.","’Holy f*ck!’","All of a sudden, the battles in space stopped. Of course, the Skeleton Saint Tool had no emotions, nor did it have intelligence. It only knew to carry out commands, so they continued to attack without the slightest pause.","However, even Lu Xun and the other sons of Great Emperors were dumbfounded.","What was going on?","How could a planet disappear just like that?","They could accept that Ling Han’s punch, or even a single thought from Ling Han was capable of destroying Four Origin Planet. However, they couldn’t accept the fact that a planet had disappeared so soundlessly.","Could a Great Emperor do the same?","Only Ding Shu and the other Genesis World elites could guess that Ling Han had most likely absorbed the Four Origin Planet into his body.","The problem was, this was a planet from a great world, so how colossal was it?","\"Wa!\" Ling Han threw up blood madly. After storing a planet into his body, he felt like his whole person was about to explode.","This was really too forceful. The pain was indescribable.","\"Retreat!\" he shouted loudly. In this state, he would not be able to last much longer.","Only now did the Saints come to their senses as if they had just woken up from a dream. There was actually such a thing?","Are you trying to defy the heavens?","However, the Skeleton Saint Tool was far too powerful, so much so that they couldn’t block it at all. If they didn’t leave now, when would they?","Furthermore, Ling Han had the means to take away a planet like this. Then, in future, when the Yin souls attacked their ancestral grounds, Ling Han could also help them like this.","With this in mind, they were naturally reassured.","Regardless of how Ling Han did it, the most important thing was that this solved a huge problem.","All of a sudden, the Saints began to retreat. As long as they managed to throw off their opponents, they would immediately tear a rip into space and leave.","Ling Han also unleashed his full battle prowess to cover everyone.","His speed was the fastest, and when the time came, he could directly use Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to break out of the siege.","Boom!","Right at this moment, a large hand that was as black as ink suddenly tore open the Void and stretched out, grabbing out at Ling Han.","It was as if this strike had been destined by the heavens, and was moving with the great trends. It could not be blocked at all, and could not be blocked.","A terrifying Imperial Might spread out, enshrouding space.","This, this was the action of a Great Emperor!","Heavens!","All of a sudden, everyone felt a strong sense of despair.","Emperor, the strongest in the world, who could stop him?","Oh no, they were done for.","All the Saints had always thought that the Lords of Death were capable of \"immortality\", and must have been restricted by some kind of powerful restriction from the heaven and earth, which was why they could not make a move, and had to rely on the hands of the Skeleton Saint Tools to sweep through the universe.","This was also where hope lay. Otherwise, with the arrival of the Great Emperor, any resistance would be futile.","But now... the Great Emperor had made his move.","Aside from despair, what other ideas could they have?","Boom, the large hand grabbed out. There was nowhere to dodge, and he was no match for it.","Ling Han definitely wouldn’t give up. He activated the Imperial Weapon and charged forward.","The large hand collided with the Clear Bamboo Sword, and instantly, Imperial Might diffused into the surroundings. Even Saints felt suffocated.","That large hand... had been blocked!","This wasn’t strange. With the awakening of the Imperial Weapon, it was equivalent to a Great Emperor moving, so it was only natural that he would be able to defeat another Great Emperor. However, this was also because the Great Emperor that had moved hadn’t truly appeared. He had only stretched out a hand through the boundless universe.","Boom, this large hand paused, and grabbed out again, its might even more frightening.","Ling Han tried to block it again, but the Clear Bamboo Sword could block it, and he only sustained a tiny bit of the shockwave, but it was enough to make him throw up blood madly. All the skin on his body had exploded, and he had become a figure of blood.","At this rate, in three or four moves at most, he would definitely die.","That large hand was merciless, and blasted towards him for the third time.","This was the power of the Great Emperor. With a flip of his hand, he could summon clouds, and with a flip of his hand, he could summon rain. He was invincible in this world.","\"Pu!\" Ling Han spat out another mouthful of blood. He felt as if at least half of the bones in his body had been shattered, and he was in extreme pain.","So what if he was the strongest Saint? In front of the Great Emperor, he was nothing but trash.","Boom, the large hand struck again. This time, Ling Han could no longer resist, and even if he still had power to burst out, his body had already reached the critical point. With this strike, he would definitely be crushed into pieces.","He was done for.","This was the strongest prodigy of all eternity. If he could become a Great Emperor, he would definitely be the strongest Ancestral King in history. Unfortunately, the Great Emperor had moved now, and directly erased him, not giving him any room for growth at all.","Everyone believed that the Lords of Death would definitely have to pay a huge price for their actions. However, the Great Emperor was too decisive. Even if he had to sacrifice himself, he had to completely eliminate the unstable factors.","Sigh!","The giant hand grabbed out, enshrouded in the paramount Nine Star Regulations, causing even the heavens to pale.","Peng!","A terrifying soundwave rang out. Even if this was space, so what? The booming sound spread far and wide.","When the light of energy dissipated completely, everyone shockingly discovered that Ling Han actually hadn’t died!","How was this possible? Had he managed to block an attack from the Great Emperor?","No.","An old man was shockingly standing beside Ling Han.","Ge Qianqiu!"]},{"number":4705,"title":"Chapter 4705: Fighting the Great Emperor","paragraphs":["Ge Qianqiu, Pseudo-Emperor!","The Pseudo-Emperor moved, blocking the deadly attack of the Lord of Death, saving Ling Han.","\"Ge Qianqiu, you are seeking your own death.\" An incredibly cold voice rang out in space. It was emotionless, as if all other living beings were nothing but stray dogs.","This was definitely the Great Emperor who had attacked. It was just that they didn’t know who he was.","Ge Qianqiu’s face was slightly flushed. After all, he had blocked the attack of a Great Emperor. Even if he was a Pseudo-Emperor, so what? How could it possibly be easy?","\"What joy is there in life? What bitterness would death hold?\" He laughed loudly, \"You Great Emperors should have died long ago, yet have used evil techniques to live to this day!\"","\"Mere mortals, what do you know!\" This Great Emperor said calmly, \"Taking into account the fact that you have cultivated to the level of Pseudo-Emperor with much difficulty, I will give you a chance. Leave immediately, and I will spare your life!\"","\"Hahaha!\" Ge Qianqiu laughed loudly. \"You’re only afraid of fighting me, which would force you to use your full power, and cause you to injure yourself!\"","The Lord of Death definitely couldn’t attack casually, or else there wouldn’t be anyone else’s business at all. Thus, now that the Lord of Death had forcefully attacked, he would definitely cause damage to himself, and if he wanted to fight a Pseudo-Emperor, the price he had to pay would definitely be even greater.","Before this, several Lords of Death of Death had been \"successfully persuaded\" by Buddha Doga, Ge Qianqiu and Qian Yanghao respectively, and the reason was precisely because they didn’t want to sacrifice themselves.","That Great Emperor paused for a moment, then said, \"Since you are so determined to seek death, I shall oblige you!\"","Boom, this Great Emperor moved again. He stretched out a palm, and grabbed out in the direction of Ling Han.","\"Senior!\" Ling Han handed over the Clear Bamboo Sword. Using his divine sense, he transmitted the technique to control the Imperial Weapon to Ge Qianqiu.","The latter had already blocked the attack of the Great Emperor for him, so what need was there for him to keep this a secret?","Ge Qianqiu caught the Clear Bamboo Sword, and slashed at the large hand that was attacking him.","In this instant, it was naturally impossible for him to grasp the control of the Clear Bamboo Sword, but the combination of Pseudo-Emperor and Origin Gold was still very powerful.","Peng!","With this strike, the large hand was turned back in defeat. However, Ge Qianqiu wasn’t much better off either. He retreated rapidly, his face alternating between red and white.","No one felt disdain because of this.","The opponent was a Great Emperor. Being able to survive was a symbol of strength.","But what was despairing was that the Great Emperor had not appeared at all. He had only moved from a boundless distance away, and his might was already so terrifying.","The Emperor was invincible in the world, and these were really not just empty words.","\"Go!\" A voice rang out in Ling Han’s mind. This was Ge Qianqiu transmitting a message to his divine sense.","\"But senior—\" How could Ling Han watch helplessly as Ge Qianqiu battled the Great Emperor alone?","So what if he was a Pseudo-Emperor? Once the Great Emperor became serious, his only fate would definitely be death.","\"You are the only hope for the future!\" Ge Qianqiu’s voice continued to ring out, \"You are very special. There is a power in your body that has blocked destiny. Even the Great Emperor would not be able to predict your whereabouts.\"","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. Was this because he was the Genesis World’s ruler, or because he had fused with the Seed of the Holy Flame?","\"Go quickly. If this Great Emperor unleashes his full strength, I won’t be able to stop him even if I wield the Imperial Weapon,\" Ge Qianqiu said in a slightly hurried voice.","Ling Han did not hesitate any longer. He stretched out a hand, wanting to tear a rip into space, and leave this place.","Once he left, Ge Qianqiu naturally wouldn’t need to stay here any longer. He could leave as he liked.","If he cleared the path with the Imperial Weapon, there was still a very high chance that he could escape from the hands of the Great Emperor.","After all, the Lord of Death also had his reservations, and it was very unlikely that he would attack with his full strength.","But right at this moment, boom, another large hand stretched out from the Void.","Unlike the large hand that was as black as ink previously, this hand was burning with raging flames, illuminating this part of the sky.","The Golden Crow Great Emperor!","This name suddenly flashed through Ling Han’s mind. This was because this large hand was different from ordinary human hands. It actually looked a little like a claw, and was of the fire element. The possibility that it was the Golden Crow Great Emperor’s hand that had moved was very high.","This!","A second Great Emperor had actually made his move.","Heavens, a Great Emperor was capable of suppressing an entire era, and was absolutely invincible. And now, there was actually a second Great Emperor. How was he supposed to block this?","Ge Qianqiu gave a loud shout, and the Clear Bamboo Sword suddenly exploded with a terrifying might, slashing towards the first Great Emperor. Then, he charged towards that giant hand of fire, the aura all over his body rising endlessly.","At this moment, it was as if he wasn’t a Pseudo-Emperor, but a true Great Emperor.","Peng! With a single strike, the giant hand of flames was instantly sent flying.","Ge Qianqiu stood proudly in space, his hand holding onto the Clear Bamboo Sword. Imperial might spread out, and it was unclear whether it was exuding from him or the Clear Bamboo Sword.","\"Ge Qianqiu, you only have that little bit of Imperial Source, and now it’s burning, allowing you to temporarily possess Great Emperor-level battle prowess. How long can you last?\" The Golden Crow Great Emperor’s cold voice rang out, \"Once the Imperial Source is burnt to nothing, you will die. Is it worth it?\"","Ling Han was shocked. As it turned out, Ge Qianqiu had to pay such a heavy price!","\"Old man!\" he hurriedly said.","Ge Qianqiu shook his head, and said, \"I know very well whether it’s worth it or not! Ling Han, when you become Emperor and eradicate the chaos, remember to toast a cup of wine in front of my grave and share it with me.\"","All of a sudden, Ling Han felt as if something was stuck in his throat, and could not say a single word.","However, the two Great Emperors wouldn’t give them any time to catch their breath. Boom! The two giant hands slammed down from the sky again.","\"Go!\" Ge Qianqiu shouted loudly, battling two Great Emperors alone.","Ling Han gritted his teeth, and suppressed all his emotions. He stretched out a hand and tore a rip into space.","He entered into the Void, and turned around to take a look. He saw that Ge Qianqiu was exuding an endless might, fighting the two Great Emperors head-on. However, the two Great Emperors also seemed to be truly angered, and wanted even more to detain Ling Han, their battle prowess increased endlessly.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","So what if he had the Imperial Weapon? So what if he had ignited his Imperial Source? In front of a true Great Emperor, he would not even be able to withstand a single blow.","In just a few moves, Ge Qianqiu was blown up, while the Clear Bamboo Sword were sent flying, shooting into the depths of the universe.","Boom! The hands of the two Great Emperors mercilessly grabbed over.","\"Senior!\" Ling Han turned around with tears in his eyes, and entered into the Void.","Hong long long, the hand of the Great Emperor sent the Void splitting apart. Imperial might spread out, and set off in pursuit of Ling Han.","Ling Han unleashed the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to block the oncoming Imperial Might. Phoenix Wings Divine Flight activated, and he sped through the Void.","Behind them, the Imperial Might receded like floodwaters, and the attack from the two Great Emperors was finally dispersed.","\"Wa!\" Ling Han rushed out of the Void, immediately throwing up blood madly. Furthermore, he could no longer control himself. Four Origin Planet appeared from within his body, floating in the pitch-black universe.","\"Senior!\" There were tears in his eyes, and his hands were tightly clenched into fists.","Ge Qianqiu had died to save him.","As a dignified Pseudo-Emperor, as long as he was willing to protect himself wisely, even the Lord of Death would not deliberately target him.","However, he could clearly transcend the rest of the world, yet would rather fight to the death.","\"I definitely won’t let Senior sacrifice for nothing!\" Ling Han wiped away his tears, his expression determined."]},{"number":4706,"title":"Chapter 4706: Summoned by Buddha Doga","paragraphs":["Before this, Ling Han had heard of countless legends of Great Emperors.","The Emperor was invincible.","This was only a vague explanation. He had no idea what kind of invincibility it was.","But now, Ling Han knew.","Even for someone as strong as a Pseudo-Emperor, who had ignited the Imperial Source, who could be considered a Great Emperor for a short period of time, with the Imperial Weapon in hand, he was still blasted into smithereens in a few moves.","To fight a Great Emperor head-on, anyone would only be seeking death.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel fortunate. When he had been in Buddhist Land, Ah Han had only activated the Imperial Weapon to kill him. He hadn’t moved to kill him himself. Otherwise, how could he have survived until now?","This was truly a power that could drive one to despair. So what if he was the strongest Saint in all eternity? In front of Imperial Might, he could not even withstand a single blow.","Ling Han took a deep breath, regaining his confidence.","It was very normal that he was no match for the Great Emperor at present. He was only a Two Star Saint. If he could withstand the attack of the Great Emperor, then the invincibility of the Great Emperor would be a joke.","However, if he became a Pseudo-Emperor, he should be able to match a Lord of Death who would not dare use their full power.","With a thought, he channelled the secret technique, summoning the Clear Bamboo Sword.","Xiu, in a short while, the Void split open, and the Clear Bamboo Sword shot out, caught in his hand.","Now, the empress, Brother Monkey, and the others had all torn a rip into the Void to escape. Without the means to contact through Galaxy Network, wanting to reunite everyone was naturally not an easy task.","However, Saints roamed the world, so as long as they weren’t personally targeted by the Great Emperor, they should have no problem protecting themselves.","Ling Han believed that the Lords of Death probably wouldn’t waste their energy on Brother Monkey and the others. After all, they would definitely have to pay a huge price each time they attacked.","As for him, Ge Qianqiu said that there was a special power to conceal destiny, and even the Great Emperor could not predict his whereabouts.","Thus, he should be safe for the moment.","Ling Han returned to Four Origin Planet, and continued to push this planet towards the edge of the universe.","He began to recall how it felt to hold a planet in his body.","At the beginning, that had only been an act of desperation as there was nothing else he could do. He hadn’t thought that he would really succeed.","He could actually hold a planet. However, compared to the millions and millions of dimensions inside his body, this burden was indescribably heavy.","Was it because the living beings on the planet were too powerful?","Or was it because the planet itself was a colossal source of energy?","Ling Han set this problem aside first. If he encountered the assault of the Netherworld again, he could take Four Origin Planet into his body and flee, and it would no longer become a visible target.","Then, he communicated with the various Imperial Clans through killing mosquitoes and flies.","Thankfully, the Saints had all returned to their respective ancestral planets. At present, there were no attacks from the Skeleton Saint Tools, so it was still considered safe.","In Ling Han’s eyes, it was most likely the Lords of Death didn’t give a toss about them.","Even if there were these Imperial Clans, so what? They would not be able to affect their grand plans at all.","Only Ling Han was a variable. Once he became Emperor, or it was possible that as long as he became a Pseudo-Emperor, it would cause damage to the plans that the Lords of Death had planned for countless years.","Now, Ling Han didn’t dare to reveal his location. What if the Lords of Death charged over again?","Have Buddha Doga or Qian Yanghao tep out and make another sacrifice?","He could only hope that Brother Monkey and the others would first go to the various Imperial Clans and get in touch with him. Then, he would bring them back to the Four Origin Planet.","As expected, Brother Monkey, the empress, and the others shared the same thoughts as Ling Han. If they couldn’t find Ling Han, they would find the Imperial Clans first. Very quickly, Ling Han brought everyone back to the Four Origin Planet.","When they found out that Ge Qianqiu had died in order to save Ling Han, everyone was both grateful, furious and grieved.","This was a Pseudo-Emperor!","\"The old man definitely won’t have sacrificed himself for nothing,\" the large black dog said solemnly. It was rare for him to become serious.","Ling Han nodded approvingly. When they became Emperor, he would have these Lords of Death beheaded, one after another.","So what if they had once been Great Emperors? They were definitely not allowed to trample over the universe so despicably.","Ling Han frowned. Time waited for no man. He had to improve his cultivation level as soon as possible. However, at his height, it was already very, very difficult to speed up his cultivation, unless there waas that kind of rare Great Herb.","The problem was, since it was so rare, how could it possibly be obtained?","The majority of territory in the Living Realm had already been transformed into the Netherworld, and the Celestial medicines had naturally all died out. Thus, this kind of rare Great Herb was even harder to find.","If he had to cultivate step by step, how long would he need to reach the level of a nine-star Saint?","Even if Ling Han’s natural talent was astonishing, he would definitely need a very, very long time.","\"Now, there is only one place that I could possibly obtain such a Great Herb,\" Ling Han murmured.","’Where?’","The Primitive Abyss.","That was where the entire universe had been born. He was sure that the Spirit Diagram of Destructive Energy, the Divine Stone, and the babies had all come from there, and the Seed of the Holy Flame was also incredibly awesome.","Thus, if he could find Great Herbs there, it would definitely help Ling Han increase his cultivation level extremely quickly.","However, there were two dilemmas.","Firstly, how was he supposed to get there?","It was too far away. Previously, Ling Han and Brother Monkey had already made a trip, but the distance was still very far. Even if Ling Han’s current speed had soared to another level, he believed that it would still need an extremely long time.","Secondly, his strength was enough to sweep aside all Saints, but the Primitive Abyss was something that even the Great Emperors dared not enter lightly. The majority of them would only enter and take a gamble in their later years.","Thus, even if he could enter the Primitive Abyss now, it was possible that he wouldn’t be able to obtain the Great Herb and would lose his life first.","\"However, time waits for no man. If I don’t enter the Primitive Abyss and take a gamble, it’s extremely likely that I won’t have another chance.\"","However, even if he was willing to take the risk, what could he do when he couldn’t even go there?","Time passed quietly, and another few days later, Ling Han suddenly received news that Buddha Doga had gone to the Donglin Imperial Clan and wanted to see him.","’Buddha Doga?’","Ling Han didn’t immediately move, because he didn’t know if this was a trap.","His whereabouts could not be deduced, but the Twelve Lands of Death could think of some way to draw him out.","What if... the Donglin Imperial Clan was suddenly conquered, and they were forced to send a false message to Ling Han?","There was no Galaxy Network now, so they could only send a message through the shattering of life plaques. In theory, this was completely feasible.","However, he still had to go.","Ling Han brought the Imperial Weapon with him. He first arrived in the area of space near the Donglin Imperial Clan. Then, he quietly entered, and only appeared after confirming that there was no danger.","This wasn’t a trap. Indeed, Buddha Doga was waiting for him there.","This Pseudo-Emperor who had achieved Dao through killing stood with his hands clasped behind his back, standing in front of a plum blossom tree. He looked so peaceful as if there wasn’t the slightest bit of temper in him.","\"Do you want to rapidly increase your cultivation level?\" Buddha Doga asked. However, he didn’t turn around.","\"Yes!\" Ling Han nodded.","\"You should have some understanding of the Primitive Abyss, right?\" Buddha Doga asked.","\"Yes.\" Ling Han nodded.","Only then did Buddha Doga turn around and say, \"Every Great Emperor has entered the Primitive Abyss before. If they want to live a second life, they can only obtain supremely valuable medicines from there.\"","\"There, there is a substance called Genesis, which contains the secret of the formation of the universe.The Great Herb that absorbs this substance to grow has effects that surpass all Celestial medicines.\"","\"If you obtain it, you can rush to the pinnacle of Saint Tier in the shortest time possible.\""]},{"number":4707,"title":"Chapter 4707: Primitive Abyss","paragraphs":["Buddha Doga paused for a moment before turning to Ling Han and asking, \"Do you dare to take this trip?\"","Ling Han couldn’t help but chuckle. He was just worrying about being unable to quickly increase his cultivation level, and wanted to go to the Primitive Abyss. However, he was only a Saint, so it would take him an unknown amount of time to get there.","Hence, he could only think about it.","By the looks of it, Buddha Doga was intending to send him there?","\"I dare, but I don’t know how to go,\" Ling Han said.","Buddha Doga nodded and said, \"I can send you there.\"","\"All right.\" Ling Han nodded. When talking to top-notch elites, it was best to be concise and comprehensive. No one could afford to waste their time.","Boom! A powerful aura suddenly erupted from the body of Buddha Doga. Flames of light blazed, and it was as if a Great Emperor had descended into the world.","Ling Han was greatly astonished. He had sensed this kind of aura from Ge Qianqiu. That was the aura that came from burning Imperial Source, which allowed him to temporarily reach the height of Great Emperor.","However, this was an act of putting his life on the line.","\"Senior!\" he exclaimed in astonishment.","\"We don’t have much time,\" Buddha Doga said calmly. \"We can’t leave slowly.\"","He stretched out a hand to grab Ling Han, and a golden path instantly spread out beneath his feet, heading directly into the boundless distance. He took another step, and in an instant, had already disappeared without a trace.","At this time, the people of Donglin Imperial Clan all rushed over. Naturally, they couldn’t see anything at all, which made them feel surprised. What exactly happened? Why was there suddenly imperial might pervading the air, making them think that something big was about to happen.","Light and shadow flashed before Ling Han’s eyes, and he could no longer see clearly.","But at this moment, he could only feel touched.","In order to help him reach the Primitive Abyss as soon as possible, Buddha Doga did not hesitate to burn his Imperial Source. This could possibly cause him to fall out of the level of Pseudo-Emperor, or even die.","Everything was for the greater good of the world.","Ge Qianqiu buried himself and revived over ten million years. He was strong enough to become Pseudo-Emperor, yet he died in battle.","Buddha Doga was a mighty figure from hundreds of millions of years ago, one of the two prodigies of the Buddhist Race. He had lived a second life in this era, and was also a Pseudo-Emperor, yet he was also silently making sacrifices.","In the world, there were formidable characters like the Lords of Death, as well as heroes like Old Man Ge and Buddha Doga.","Ling Han’s heart became even more resolute. He definitely had to become Emperor, and pacify the darkness, even if it meant paying the price of death.","For him, this was also a massive change.","Even though Ling Han had repeatedly reached the pinnacle of the world, his initial goal was actually very simple, and that was to gain enough strength, so he did not need to be bullied by anyone.","He did not have any ambitions to become the overlord of heaven and earth, and rule over countless people.","What he wanted was very simple. To have his lovers by his side, and his children and grandchildren gathered around him.","However, after witnessing the sacrifice of Ge Qianqiu and Buddha Doga, his mindset suffered a huge blow, and he had a different opinion.","After burning the Imperial Source, the speed of Buddha Doga was astonishingly fast. The great golden path spread out, and with a single thought, it could reach the various planets in the universe.","However, the empty space in the universe was even larger, and the Primitive Abyss was boundlessly far.","It should be known that even with Ling Han’s vision, he was still unable to capture the exact details of the scenery. He could only see darkness flying by.","Thankfully, there were no more planets here, and only darkness was left. There was no need to feel dizzy and blurred vision anymore.","A whole day later, Buddha Doga finally stopped. His aura fluctuated wildly, and was extremely unstable.","\"Senior!\" Ling Han hurriedly exclaimed. His expression was filled with worry.","Buddha Doga waved his hand and said, \"It’s fine. I won’t die yet. However, I can only send you to this point. U need to rest.\"","His words were very simple. He said he was just going to rest for a while, but Ling Han knew that Buddha Doga had paid an unimaginable price to send him here.","\"Senior, I definitely won’t disappoint you!\" Ling Han said in the most solemn tone.","Buddha Doga smiled, \"Go on! From now on, you can only depend on yourself. However, I have exaggerated a little previously. There are Genesis-level Celestial medicines in the periphery of the abyss, but they are very rare. You can search there. Don’t go too deep. Even Great Emperors could possibly die there.\"","After saying this, he sent another divine sense message to Ling Han. This contained his understanding of the Primitive Abyss.","Billions of years ago, Buddha Doga had come here before. It was also because of that he had obtained a great fated opportunity that allowed him to traverse millions and millions of years and live a second life.","—He was different from Ge Qianqiu. Old Man Ge had only sealed himself with the Primordial Source Clay.","Ling Han nodded and looked ahead.","With his and Buddha Doga’s personality, what need was there for them to be pretentious?","All he could do was become stronger as soon as possible. Only then would he be worthy of Old Man Ge and Buddha Doga’s sacrifices.","Ahead of them lay a massive fissure, as if heaven and earth had been sliced open by a Divine Sword. Just how wide and how long was it? Even with Ling Han’s vision, he could not see the end.","He used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and with a flap of his fiery wings, he arrived above this massive fissure.","The Primitive Abyss.","The entity of heaven and earth was born here, and within it, there was hidden the secret of how the entity of heaven and earth had formed, as well as incredibly precious Genesis Substance.","Ling Han could clearly see that the abyss wasn’t completely dark. Instead, there was a faint flickering of light. However, this light was different from any other light of the universe. It was as if it belonged to another world.","He did not hesitate, and immediately leaped in.","When he had completely entered into the abyss, he discovered that he had lost all contact with the outside world.","This was reflected in the fact that he could no longer sense the Regulations of heaven and earth.","However, Saints could absorb Regulations, so even if they lost their connection with heaven and earth, they could still use Saint-level power.","And in Ling Han’s case, he was even more different.","This was because the power of belief in his body originated from the dimensions in his body, and it was self-contained. Even after entering this place, he could still use it.","Thus, his battle prowess wasn’t weakened in the slightest.","As he ventured deeper and deeper, this abyss did not seem to be much different from the outside world. It was just a dark space, with occasional spots of light flickering.","Ling Han went over to capture it, and discovered that these were actually floating particles. However, he couldn’t tell what kind of material they were. They were burning and emitting light.","Boom!","However, he shockingly discovered that a particle in the distance had suddenly exploded, turning into a terrifying shockwave.","Even at such a far distance, Ling Han could still sense that powerful energy fluctuation.","This was enough to insta-kill a nine-star Saint.","Ling Han gritted his teeth, and hurriedly distanced himself from that glowing particle.","His strength was strong, and this shockwave was not enough to injure him. However, if it suddenly exploded at close quarters, he would probably be injured as well.","Eye technique activated, and Ling Han carefully observed the particle. After a long time, he came to a conclusion.","This was actually a star core!","No, it should be said that this was a star that had been compressed into the size of a grain of rice. Furthermore, it was a Sun-level star. Thus, once it exploded, it could even insta-kill a Nine Star Saint.","Ling Han swept his gaze over the surroundings, and couldn’t help but inhale sharply, because there were innumerable such particles of light.","No wonder it was said that the whole universe had spurted out from this abyss.","Just look, just a single particle was equivalent to a super-large star.","It should be the unique environment of the abyss that had caused it to become the size of a grain of rice.","That’s not right!","This was originally the size of a grain of rice, but after it was shot out of the abyss, it expanded endlessly, turning into the multiple stars that he was familiar with.","The Primitive Abyss, the beginning of everything."]},{"number":4708,"title":"Chapter 4708: Discovery","paragraphs":["Yi!","Ling Han suddenly realized that this was similar to his situation.","There were dimensions in his body, and these dimensions contained countless planets. These planets nurtured all matter.","In terms of difference, the scale of this place was much larger. It was extremely difficult for him to even accommodate a single star.","Hold on, if he became Emperor, then wouldn’t he be able to do it?","Ling Han had already been suspicious before, and now, he was practically certain.","The so-called Divine Stones came from the Primitive Abyss.","However, added with Ding Shu and the others, there were a total of seven Divine Stones.","Yi, this was the same thing as the Calabash Brothers?","\"We have a close relationship with Xuan Taiyu.\"","\"Xuan Taiyu has come to the Primitive Abyss before, and the Divine Stones clearly came from here.\"","\"Xuan Taiyu definitely couldn’t have thrown the Divine Stones away rashly, so the Divine Stones only dispersed to every corner of the universe after Xuan Taiyu died.\"","\"At that time, there was clearly no opportunity for immortality, but the Lords of Death appeared. What are they fighting over?\"","\"The Spirit Diagram of Destructive Energy, or... the so-called Divine Stones?\"","The Spirit Diagram of Destructive Energy could allow one to channel ten stars of high-level energy. Furthermore, aside from them, the Genesis World’s rulers, no one else could cultivate it.","However, what about the Great Emperor?","Which Great Emperor would be able to grasp this kind of high-level energy? If they could, even among Great Emperors, they could be considered extremely awesome, right?","Right, why had Xuan Taiyu been able to match the twelve Lords of Death at that time?","One of the reasons was that those ancient Great Emperors were unable to unleash their full power, but the other was probably because Xuan Taiyu had mastered Destructive Energy, which was why he was able to intimidate those ancient Great Emperors.","However, Emperors were too strong, and in a battle of twelve against one, even if Xuan Taiyu had heaven-defying luck and obtained the Divine Stones and Spirit Diagram of Destructive Energy, he had only just become Emperor, after all, and his battle prowess hadn’t reached its peak yet, so he was heavily injured. Even if he temporarily suppressed the Twelve Lands of Death, he still died not long after.","This made sense, but as for the specific details... Xuan Taiyu was already dead, and only the Lords of Death would know.","Ling Han continued onwards, but this path seemed to have no end. All the while, he could only see the particles that were dancing and glowing. Occasionally, they would explode, creating a terrifying shockwave that would insta-kill Saints.","In the divine sense message that Buddha Doga had transmitted to him, there was not a single detail.","After travelling for a whole seventeen days, he finally uncovered something different.","Ahead of him, an expanse of Primal Chaos appeared. He could vaguely see that it contained all things, but could not see anything clearly.","This area of Primal Chaos was astonishingly huge. He could not see the end of it with a single glance, and outside this area, there was another ring-shaped area that surrounded this area of Primal Chaos.","Ling Han knew that this ring-shaped area was the outer circle of the Primitive Abyss. Meanwhile, that area of Primal Chaos was the real Primitive Abyss . It was so dangerous that it could even kill a Great Emperor.","At present, he could only search for Genesis-level Celestial medicines in the outer regions. He only had to obtain one, and his cultivation level would soar.","Why?","The Genesis Substance was the cornerstone of that great world outside. All Regulations were formed from the Genesis Substance, so if he refined the Genesis Substance, how could his cultivation level not soar?","If he could go to the Primal Chaos area, his gains would definitely be astonishing. For example, the Seed of the Holy Flame had come from there. However, if Ling Han had barged in now, he would definitely not be able to return.","Thus, he had best just obediently try his luck in the outer circle.","He leaped up, and entered into that ring-shaped area.","This was still astonishingly huge.","This was really an \"earth\" zone. There was solid ground here, and it was not a boundless space.","However, Ling Han had just neared, when he felt an astonishing suction force assault him, causing him to crash towards the ground.","He hurriedly used his power to resist, but his figure was still falling. It was just that his speed had decreased slightly.","Ling Han shouted lightly, and pushed his power to the extreme. Finally, he steadied his footing. Furthermore, he could also increase the height he was at, leaving the ground far behind him. However, his speed was frighteningly slow, and furthermore, he had expended too much power, causing sweat to instantly form on his forehead.","This felt like he was standing off against a supreme elite.","Ling Han’s eyes lit up. If he could cultivate his physique and physical power here, he would be able to obtain a terrifying increase.","Next, he did not resist this kind of suction force any longer, and landed on this piece of land.","Peng, he landed heavily. Under the acceleration of such a terrifying suction force, just how astonishing was his speed?","However, when he landed on the ground, he shockingly discovered that there wasn’t even a hole in the ground, what more shattering it.","This!","Ling Han was stunned. It should be known that his high-speed crash was completely not inferior to a casual strike from a Saint, but he actually did not manage to create a hole. Instead, it caused his feet to go slightly numb.","Just how freakish was the sturdiness of this land?","Ling Han dug at the dirt on the ground, but it was as if this was a Saintly Material. He spent a great deal of effort to break a bit off. Then, he shockingly discovered that it was as if he was holding up several hundred stars.","No wonder it was so hard.","How could it not be extremely heavy and hard, with several hundred stars compressed to such a small size?","If there was a battle here, to say nothing of the fact that it would be very difficult for Saints to cause damage, there would probably only be a limited number of Great Emperors that could.","As expected of the beginning of the universe.","He no longer focused his attention on this land. Even if there were treasures hidden underneath, with his power, it was practically impossible to pry them out.","He walked with great difficulty on this piece of land.","The gravity fields were far too powerful, so much so that his progress was extremely slow. To say nothing of the fact that his speed could not match the speed of a Saint, even a mere cultivator of Foundation Building Tier would be much faster than him.","Ling Han viewed this as a kind of tempering, and this kind of opportunity was really too hard to come by.","Did others have the chance to come here?","Aside from the Great Emperor, it was extremely likely that even a nine-star Saint would be killed by the specks of stars during their previous advance. And when they reached this place, to say nothing of advancing, they would be sprawled out on the ground, unable to move even a single finger.","Then... they would just have to wait for death.","Ling Han also gritted his teeth. Buddha Doga was truly confident in him. Wasn’t he afraid that he wouldn’t be able to withstand this kind of extreme gravity?","This place was completely desolate. To say nothing of the fact that there was no one here, there wasn’t even a blade of grass.","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. In this place, even a Nine-Star Saint could possibly be crushed into mush, what more plants.","However, if there were really plants growing, it would definitely be supremely valuable medicines.","He looked forward to it, but was not in a rush.","Walking here was also a rare opportunity to cultivate.","In the blink of an eye, seven days had passed. Ling Han didn’t gain anything, and was still advancing with great difficulty. However, if one compared him with seven days ago, they would discover that his speed was actually slightly faster.","Though it was only a little bit, he had indeed sped up.","This meant that Ling Han was slowly adapting to such a terrifying gravity field.","Others might not know, but Ling Han knew very well that the organs in his body, as well as his mind, were all reborn.","Of course, this was a very long process, and would not be reflected in the short term.","Another month passed, and Ling Han’s speed became slightly faster. In fact, he could even occasionally jump a few times."]},{"number":4709,"title":"Chapter 4709: Genesis-level Great Herb","paragraphs":["Unknowingly, Ling Han had already been here for a year.","However, Ling Han was still not the slightest bit anxious.","Because here, the flow of time was different.","The gravity fields here were far too powerful, so much so that they actually affected the flow of time.","According to the calculations of Buddha Doga, time passed much faster here, at least a hundred times faster than in the outside world.","Thus, even if he stayed here for a hundred years, only about a year would have passed outside.","A year had passed, and Ling Han’s adaptability had greatly improved.","In the first place, he had already cultivated the True Dragon’s Body Art, and his physique was incredibly tough. However, it could not be denied that this secret technique was tailor-made for the True Dragon, after all. He could learn it, but it was destined that he could not reach the peak stage.","It should be known that even if he used a higher level of energy to temper his body, the toughness of his body was only equal to that of the little azure dragon.","However, he was tempering his body here, and under the incomparably high-intensity resistance, Ling Han was modifying this Body Art that only belonged to the line of True Dragons, so it was more suitable for him.","He was already a Saint by now, and was only a step away from the peak stage of power of the world. Thus, he was qualified to make modifications.","In this one year, his improvement was astonishing.","Firstly, it was indeed because he had spent a long time and his body had gotten used to it, but no matter how much he had gotten used to it, there was still a limit, and the fact that he could keep improving was the result of him modifying the True Dragon Body Art.","\"At this rate, when I leave, my Body Art alone would probably be enough to suppress a Nine-Star Saint.\"","\"Even if I stand still and allow the nine-star Saint to attack me, would they be able to penetrate my physique?\"","This was definitely shocking, but Ling Han wouldn’t be proud because of this.","That was because his opponent... was the ancient Great Emperors!","Even if there were 10,000 Saints added together, they would still be no match for a single finger of a Great Emperor.","However, even if he hadn’t left, the benefits were still very obvious.","Ling Han’s speed was now comparable to when he had been in the Foundation Building Tier.","This naturally greatly increased the speed of his exploration. However, after a whole year, he still did not find any Genesis-level Great Herb.","It should be said that he had not discovered any living matter at all.","This was difficult to find in the first place.","Even in the area of the Primal Chaos, the Genesis-level Great Herb was extremely rare, what more in the outer circle. Furthermore, Ling Han’s speed was so slow, so the area he could search in a year was also limited. It was not strange that he did not find anything.","In any case, time passed quickly here, so it was fine.","However, he wanted to make use of the fast flow of time here to complete the \"rapid\" improvement of his cultivation level?","This was impossible.","That was because there were no Regulations of heaven and earth here at all, so how could he cultivate here?","In this place, Ling Han’s cultivation level was stagnant.","Thus, he could only place his hopes on the Genesis-level Great Herb.","Two years, three years, ten years... Time slowly passed, and Ling Han still didn’t gain anything.","Of course, his speed had also increased again, and could be compared to when he had been in the Cauldron Forging Tier. However, this was also his limit. It was not that the strength of his physique could no longer be improved, but rather the gravity here was too terrifying after all.","As his physique improved, his speed could still increase, but it would definitely be extremely minor.","Twenty years, fifty years, a hundred years... Ling Han had already been here for a very, very long time. His physique had finally reached the limit of his current level. Unless he broke through to Emperor Tier, there would be no further improvement.","Previously, he had been training his physique, and even if he did not gain anything, he at least had a goal. However, now that his physique had reached its limit, he became bored.","This place was really too desolate.","Thankfully, he had millions and millions of dimensions in his body, as well as beautiful wives like Shui Yanyu. He could communicate with them at all times, so he did not go crazy from being too lonely.","After a long time, he was still a little numb. He walked expressionlessly, spreading out his divine sense to search for a special fluctuation.","According to Buddha Doga, Genesis Substance had a special fluctuation. Once one approached it, it would be very easy to discover.","—The Genesis-level Great Herb was only a manifestation of the Genesis Substance. Actually, it could still exist in other objects, such as Origin Gold.","However, comparatively speaking, there were more Celestial medicines.","Walk, walk, walk. Ling Han was like a walking corpse. In this place, he could not cultivate. Aside from walking and exploring, there was nothing else he could do.","’Hmm?’","He suddenly stopped in his tracks, an expression of delight appearing on his face.","He had sensed it, he had sensed a special fluctuation!","Genesis Substance!","He hurriedly turned around, and after walking for a while, he saw that a purple-red plant was shockingly growing ahead of him.","This plant was very peculiar. It had a stem and no leaves, and its stem was like a beautiful jade. It was translucent, and just looking at it gave one a pleasing and incredibly comfortable feeling.","A Genesis-level Great Herb!","Ling Han laughed loudly. It had been more than a hundred years, and he had finally reaped some rewards.","It had been too long.","—If Buddha Doga knew about this, he would definitely complain endlessly.","That was because he had entered into the zone of Primal Chaos all those years ago, but it had still taken him more than a thousand years to find the Genesis-level Great Herb, which allowed him to lay out his plans, and appear in this era.","Of course, though they were both Genesis-level Great Herbs, the amount of Genesis Substance they contained was completely different.","The one Ling Han found contained far too little.","However, Ling Han was only a Two Star Saint, and it wasn’t as if he were going to live a second life. In terms of merely increasing his cultivation level, this was already astonishing enough.","Moreover, he had only spent over a hundred years in the outer circle, and he had already gained something. Was that not enough?","The Great Herb was found, but digging out this Celestial medicine took Ling Han a whole nine months’ time.","It couldn’t be helped. He couldn’t directly pull it out, or the Great Herb would definitely break, and the Genesis Substance would be lost.","He could only dig it out bit by bit.","However, just how hard was this ground?","To dig out the Great Herb in one piece was definitely a massive test.","Nine months was not a long time.","\"I’ve finally dug it out!\" Ling Han revealed an overjoyed expression. Then, he stuffed the Great Herb into his mouth and swallowed it whole. He didn’t even chew, and directly swallowed it.","Then, he immediately began to refine it.","In just a short while, a special substance circulated in Ling Han’s body, giving him an ancient feeling, as if he had seen the origins of everything.","Genesis Substance, the cornerstone of heaven and earth.","Weng! A beam of light burst from his forehead. This was none other than the Dao of Heaven and Earth.","This was the source of heaven and earth, yet did not belong to the heaven and earth. There was no Dao or Regulations here. However, when the Genesis Substance was refined, the Dao of Heaven and Earth actually appeared.","These were not Regulations, but rather superior to Regulations.","What were Regulations?","It served the Dao of Heaven and Earth.","You see, the power of belief could also transform into Regulations, and someone as strong as the Saint could even create an absolute zone, and change the Regulations within this zone.","Thus, Regulations could be changed, but great dao would never change.","This was the true cornerstone of the heaven and earth, so how could it possibly be changed?","All of a sudden, enlightenment rose up in Ling Han’s mind. It was as if he was about to grasp the core of everything, and penetrate the secrets of heaven and earth, but at the same time, it was as if there was a film, so he could not truly touch it, which made him feel extremely uncomfortable.","He hurriedly suppressed these emotions, because this was the internal demon in his heart!","His enlightenment was real, and the internal demon was also real. If he pursued that secret of heaven and earth at all costs, it would only make him lose his way.","That was because his present cultivation level was still insufficient."]},{"number":4710,"title":"Chapter 4710: Sandstorm","paragraphs":["Ling Han grasped the Dao of Heaven and Earth that had appeared in this short amount of time, and began to appreciate it.","The Dao of Heaven and Earth, superior to Regulations.","The Regulations had its limitations. For example, there were no Regulations here at all. One could not cultivate here, and could not extract them. Once the Regulations contained in one’s body was exhausted, battle prowess would immediately decline.","However, the great dao was different. This was the foundation of the universe, the essence.","No wonder the Genesis Substance could increase one’s cultivation level. One had skipped over Regulations and headed straight for the core. How could it not be awesome?","Furthermore, Ling Han also discovered that while he was accommodating the Regulations, his body was not silently destroyed.","It should be known that only by assimilating with the heaven and earth, could one accommodate more Regulations. This was the path of advancement for Saints.","A Saint would experience Silent Destruction nine times. This was his limit, and that was becoming a nine-star Saint.","However, different Saints had different natural talents. Some could accommodate one Regulation when they experienced Silent Destruction once, while others could accommodate two or even three Regulations, and freaks like Ling Han could accommodate five Regulations at a time!","But no matter what, this still required one’s body to experience Silent Destruction, to walk in the direction of being assimilated by heaven and earth.","However, Ling Han’s body clearly accommodated more Regulations, but there was no Silent Destruction of his body.","Then could he be considered to have broken through?","Even Ling Han himself didn’t know this.","If he continued to do this, would he be able to accommodate all the Regulations after absorbing going through Silent Destruction twice?","Then, as a Two Star Saint, would he be able to directly break through to Emperor Tier?","Ling Han was slightly confused. This was something that had never happened before.","What Saint could come here to cultivate?","Even a Nine-Star Saint was also about to be crushed to the ground, and had no option but to wait until the day his lifespan dried up.","Hence, he should be the only Saint that was cultivating here. Otherwise, only those Pseudo-Emperors could enter into this space.","Ling Han thought for a moment, and felt that his understanding of the Silent Destruction Tier was wrong. In fact, everyone in the Silent Destruction Tier was wrong.","Silent Destruction Tier elites didn’t need to annihilate their bodies nine times. Instead, nine times was the limit, and they couldn’t annihilate their bodies anymore. After nine times, their bodies would more or less be assimilated with heaven and earth. If they annihilated their bodies again, they would become one with heaven and earth.","—No matter how strong a Saint was, how could he be stronger than heaven and earth?","Thus, once one was completely assimilated with the heaven and earth, that was equivalent to having died.","Thus, the Silent Destruction Tier was actually trying to accommodate as many Regulations as possible before completely assimilating with heaven and earth.","\"If possible, accommodating all eight-star Regulations in a single go is the proper way to go.\"","This was because stepping into Emperor Tier meant that one had to become independent. This was the complete opposite of having one’s body transform into heaven and earth.","Thus, if the number of times elites experienced Silent Destruction when they were at the level of Saint decreased, it would be even easier for them to break through to Emperor Tier.","Ling Han focused on cultivating and appreciation. Three days later, the essence was exhausted, and the great dao disappeared. His cultivation progress stopped there.","The number of Regulations in his body had reached as many as 35.","Theoretically speaking, he should have broken through to become a Three Star Saint, because every time he broke through, he would be able to accommodate five more Regulations. This was his previous experience.","Forget it. Regardless of how many stars of Saint Tier he was, the most important thing was how many Regulations he could use.","According to his experience, the maximum number of Regulations should be 99. Thus, when the number of Regulations he could accommodate in his body reached 99, he would be able to begin breaking through to the level of Pseudo-Emperor.","Ling Han set out again. After his cultivation level increased, he naturally felt a little more relaxed, but it was not obvious. He was afraid that if he did not become Emperor, he would not be able to relax here no matter what.","All of a sudden, another two years had passed, and Ling Han still did not make any progress.","This was very normal. Genesis Substance was so precious, so how could it be so easily found?","To say nothing of two years, it wouldn’t be strange even if he didn’t gain anything in two hundred or two thousand years.","As he walked, a change took place in the ground. It was no longer flat ground, but multiple stone pillars that were protruding from the ground. The tallest were three thousand meters tall, and the shortest was only about a foot tall. They were all greyish white in colour.","Ling Han walked closer, and pressed down with a finger. This pillar was indeed extraordinarily hard. This push did not cause the slightest bit of damage.","It seemed that the structure here was all the same. Even dirt the size of a grain of rice could turn into a star.","He walked into the forest of stone pillars and began his search.","Seven years had passed, and Ling Han was already accustomed to the boundless loneliness. He only had one thought, and that was to find the Genesis Substance.","Suddenly, his eyes widened.","He sensed a terrifying commotion.","Could it be?","He climbed up an extremely tall stone pillar, and looked into the distance. He saw that a sandstorm had appeared very far away.","Instantly, his expression changed drastically.","If this was the outside world, then what was a sandstorm worth?","But in this place, every single particle was as heavy as a star. Furthermore, it was only so small. What kind of concept was it to be hit by them?","This was no weaker than being blasted by a nine-star Saint, right?","And at the same time, there were several thousand, tens of thousands of grains of sand surging up at the same time. Who could bear that?","Even the Great Emperor would frown at this. He wouldn’t dare to treat this lightly, would he?","Ling Han learned about this kind of sandstorm from the information given to him by Buddha Doga. It was indeed extremely terrifying. Even a Pseudo-Emperor like Buddha Doga didn’t dare to face it head-on. It was one of the most terrifying dangers in the outer circle.","However, Ling Han had entered this place for more than a hundred years, and had never encountered it before. This was really good luck.","Faced with this kind of sandstorm, it was impossible to run.","The gravity field was too strong, and his speed was restricted. He couldn’t outrun the speed of the sandstorm at all.","Thus, he could only immediately seek cover to avoid this terrifying storm.","Ling Han searched for thick stone pillars, then leaned back, waiting for the storm to arrive.","So fast!","It wasn’t long before the sandstorm arrived, sweeping past Ling Han.","Thankfully, his back was leaning against the stone pillar, and this had blocked the majority of the impact for him. However, there were still some \"sand particles\" that blew over and landed on him.","’Holy f*ck!’","Even with Ling Han’s powerful physique, he still gritted his teeth in pain. This was far too terrifying. It was as if stars were crashing toward him, causing him incredible pain.","And this was thanks to the fact that the present him had already reached the limits of Saint-level in Body Art. Otherwise, this would not be a matter of pain, but he would rather be smashed through and destroyed.","If he didn’t have the protection of the stone pillar, and confronted them head-onâ¦ he would definitely be dead.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel relieved that he hadn’t encountered the sandstorm in the previously flat and unobstructed desolate plain. Otherwise, even if he revived the Imperial Weapon, how long would it be able to last?","Hiding inside the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower?","Under the impact of the shockwave, it would still be shattered into pieces.","After a whole hour, the sandstorm finally passed. Ling Han looked at his body. His clothes had all turned into pieces, and disappeared with the sandstorm. Now, his naked body was covered with red dots.","This had been created by the \"sand\". It was too terrifying, and he still had some protection from the sandstorm.","\"I haven’t encountered any dangers for over a hundred years, so I was a little careless. I almost forgot that this is the most terrifying place under heaven and earth. Even the Great Emperor could possibly die with resentment here.\" Ling Han gritted his teeth.","The sandstorm passed, and Ling Han continued to advance.","This stone forest was astonishingly huge, and Ling Han’s luck seemed to have become bad. He began to encounter frequent sandstorms, causing his search progress to be extremely slow.","In the blink of an eye, another 600 years had passed.","Yi, Ling Han’s dazed expression suddenly changed.","He had sensed a special fluctuation again!"]},{"number":4711,"title":"Chapter 4711: Visitor","paragraphs":["Good!","Ling Han’s spirits were lifted, and he immediately followed the fluctuation.","It was still a Celestial medicine, completely emerald green in colour, pleasing to the eye.","Ling Han immediately began to dig. Similarly, it was extremely difficult to dig. The ground was too hard, and the Celestial medicine itself was very fragile. If he was not careful, he would damage it.","This excavation took a long time, and quickly, half a year had passed, but Ling Han was still unable to complete digging it out. He was still a little bit away from extracting it fully. No matter what, he had to work for another month or so.","But right at this moment, he sensed another wave.","A unique fluctuation!","Yi?","Ling Han was astonished. Had another Genesis-level Great Herb suddenly grown in this space?","However, that wasn’t right. He could sense that this fluctuation was actually approaching.","Would the Celestial medicine run away on its own?","Er, there were indeed such medicines in the outside world. The Celestial medicine had developed a spirit, and to say nothing of fleeing, it could even spit at you.","However, was it the same here?","This fluctuation was getting closer and closer, heading straight for him.","Ling Han turned around. In an instant, he saw someone walking over from ahead of him.","What!","He was shocked. He could actually see another person here?","How was this possible?","It should be known that the gravity field here was astonishingly strong. Even if a nine-star Saint came, he would still be suppressed to the ground, unless he was as awesome as he was.","Aside from that, it was either a Pseudo-Emperor or a Great Emperor, and there was no fourth possibility.","If the other was also a Saint, then that would definitely be a super great enemy of his, and if it was a Pseudo-Emperor or even a Great Emperor in fact... the consequences would be unimaginable.","He focused his gaze, and saw that it was a young man. His whole body was covered with a silver Battle Armor, and it was this Battle Armor that was releasing a special wave.","Saint.","Ling Han could clearly see with his eye technique that there was a green-colored holy flame flickering inside this young man’s body.","In other words, he was a six-star Saint.","Hiss, a six-star Saint was able to come here. In fact, it was as if he was walking on flat ground, even more relaxed than he had been. This was definitely a strong opponent.","He was shocked, and the young man opposite him was even more shocked than he was. His mouth involuntarily gaped, his eyes wide, as if he had seen a ghost.","What was going on?","Which side was he from?","Why wasn’t he wearing a Battle Armor?","Someone without a Battle Armor could actually walk around here?","Are you a f****** monster?","All of a sudden, his mind was filled with questions, shaking him to the point that he could not think at all.","\"Hello.\" Ling Han waved a hand. He was also very curious about the origins of this young man.","Hearing his voice, the young man finally calmed down. His eyes turned towards that green Celestial medicine, and was just about to speak, when he heard Ling Han speak up first, \"This is mine!\"","Er!","He couldn’t help but grimace. ’Your reaction is a little too fast, isn’t it? I haven’t even spoken yet.’","Furthermore, how do you know that I want this Celestial medicine?","—Why didn’t he think about who Ling Han usually hung out with?","It was the large black dog, and it was well-known to be stingy!","Thus, wasn’t it a joke to want to take advantage of Ling Han?","This was completely the gulf between an ancestor and a grand-disciple.","The young man turned his eyes to Ling Han, and frowned, \"Which Great Emperor are you under?\"","Ling Han’s heart instantly jolted.","Which Great Emperor was he under?","A Great Emperor!","In this instant, countless thoughts streaked through Ling Han’s mind.","As far as he knew, there was at least the Battle Saint Emperor, the Canopy Demon Emperor and the Ancestral King Lingtian who had entered the Primitive Abyss. From then onwards, there was no news of them.","However, even after countless years had passed, a great many forces were still wary that these Ancestral Kings were still alive, especially the Battle Saint Emperor and the Canopy Demon Emperor.","Thus, Brother Monkey was only suppressed, and the pervert pig’s cultivation level was also sealed.","Perhaps, there were other Great Emperors that had also come here, though they were not recorded in historical records.","If these Great Emperors had really managed to attain immortality, and had for some reason stayed in the Primitive Abyss, then his words were very significant.","—These Great Emperors were spreading their roots here, and they had successors and descendants?","Though it was only a single sentence, there was really too much information contained within.","Thoughts streaked through Ling Han’s mind, but his expression remained unchanged. He decided to extort some information.","\"I am a disciple of the Battle Saint Emperor.\"","Boom!","Unexpectedly, when these words fell, the young man immediately moved, and shot out a punch at Ling Han. There were clearly only 12 flashes of Regulations flickering, yet they had been imbued with some kind of special power, causing their might to far surpass 12 stars.","Where had he revealed a weakness?","Could it be that it was because Brother Monkey’s ancestor was too bellicose, offending even the Great Emperors here? Thus, the moment he announced the name of the Battle Saint Emperor, he was immediately targeted?","However, his attention was immediately drawn by the other’s attack.","There were only twelve Regulations activated, but their might had reached the height of twenty stars!","What was going on here?","Could it be that this person also possessed a deadly weapon like the Destructive Energy?","Additionally, there was clearly no Regulations here, so where had this guy cultivated these Regulations from?","Genesis Substance!","Or... had he been to the outside world before?","It should be known that though the Primitive Abyss was dangerous, the danger was referring to entering it, and not coming out of it.","Moreover, his battle prowess had reached twenty stars in a single strike?","For a six-star Saint, this was very, very shocking. In fact, it had even surpassed the son of a Great Emperor, and was perhaps only slightly inferior to Ding Shu and the others.","Judging from his tone, it seemed like he was also a disciple of a Great Emperor. Then that was strange. The disciple of a Great Emperor was even more naturally talented than the son of a Great Emperor?","Or was it because the environment here was unique, and a person that had cultivated to become a Saint here was even more awesome?","Ling Han became more and more confused. In this moment of distraction, even parrying was full of flaws.","\"You are courting death!\" The young man smirked coldly. Faced with his attack, you actually dare to be so careless. Wasn’t that just courting death?","Peng!","He leaned over and threw a punch at Ling Han’s chest.","Ling Han instantly stumbled back in retreat.","’F*ck!’","That young man was clearly the one who had the upper hand, but now, he was so terrified that his scalp was numb, and his whole body was covered in cold sweat.","He had unleashed at least 80% of his battle prowess in this strike, and it had landed solidly on Ling Han, but actually only caused him to retreat seven steps back.","Then, there was no ’then’!","’Holy f*ck!’","What kind of monster was this?","Hiss, this couldn’t be a Great Emperor in disguise, right?","\"You, who exactly are you?\" Even his voice was trembling.","Only then did Ling Han come back to his senses. Though the other’s strength was extraordinary, he was stronger. Furthermore, he had been here for almost a thousand years, so just how strong was his physique?","The True Dragon’s Imperial Technique, added with being tempered by Nine Stars Energy, as well as the terrifying gravity fields here made Ling Han’s physique incredibly tough.","It could be said that even Saintly Material was not as sturdy as Ling Han’s body. If he could advance into the level of Pseudo-Emperor, his physique might soar to match the toughness at the level of Origin Gold even.","Then... he would also be able to take a few blows from a Great Emperor’s attacks head-on. In fact, he would be able to take even more blows than that.","’You’re a six-star Saint, yet you’ve only unleashed a battle prowess of around 20 stars. It’s already impressive enough that you were able to strike me to the point of retreat, okay?’","\"You’re very strong,\" Ling Han praised.","F***, do you have no shame?","The young man’s expression instantly became dark. ’Oh, I’m so strong, yet you only took seven steps back after taking a punch from me head-on. Just how strong are you?’","How could anyone be so shameless as to praise themselves?","\"Who exactly are you?\" he asked again.","This was definitely not a Great Emperor. There was no Great Emperor that was as shameless as this."]},{"number":4712,"title":"Chapter 4712: Genesis Battle Armor","paragraphs":["Thankfully, Ling Han did not know what this young man was thinking. Otherwise, he would definitely be defiant. What right did he have to say that he was shameless?","Ling Han cracked a smile, and said, \"Didn’t I already tell you? I’m a disciple of the Battle Saint Emperor, and who are you?\"","The young man scoffed. ’Do you take me for an idiot?!’","\"I am Wang Zhe,\" he said, but did not mention which Great Emperor he was under.","Ling Han shook his head, rolled up his sleeves, and muttered, \"Looks like I have to beat him up first. If I beat him into submission, he’ll definitely behave.\"","His muttering was not soft, and Wang Zhe immediately looked furious.","What arrogance!","\"Don’t think that just because your physique is tough, you can ignore my existence!\" he protested.","\"Come!\" Ling Han beckoned with his hand, \"You’ll be obedient later.\"","\"Impudence!\" Wang Zhe roared loudly, and charged towards Ling Han.","His attacks were exceptionally simple, and there was nothing fancy about them. There were only twelve eight-star Regulations, but their might was explosively powerful.","Ling Han could only sigh in emotion. This was the Primitive Abyss, and thi was as expected of the beginning of the universe. Any random person that came out was already so awesome.","However, compared to him, there was still too much of a gap.","Ling Han charged forwards, and did not use Regulations. He merely used the power that he had cultivated through Body Art.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Now that they were actually exchanging blows, Ling Han was completely certain that the other party indeed only had twelve flashes of Regulations. However, this person’s strength had reached twenty stars.","Where had this additional battle prowess come from?","It was not his Body Art. Power was indeed a part of battle prowess, but it was far from being so exaggerated.","However, Ling Han was only using pure power, so no matter how strong he was, it was still limited. Even for someone like him, his battle prowess would only be around 10 stars. He was far from being Wang Zhe’s match.","However, his physique was too tough. Though Wang Zhe’s battle prowess was \"more\" than his, it was absolutely impossible for him to defeat and injure Ling Han.","\"Humph, I thought you were very strong, but as it turned out, you have nothing but Body Art!\" Wang Zhe said coldly, showing a hint of disdain.","No matter how strong your physique is, what use is it if you don’t have powerful battle prowess?","\"When I capture you, and search your soul, your identity can no longer be concealed!\" His offensive became even fiercer.","Ling Han couldn’t help but smile, \"Where do you get such confidence from?\"","\"In the face of reality, are you still not prepared?\" Wang Zhe scoffed. Boom, he shot out another punch. There were clearly only twelve flashes of Regulations, but with the boost of some mysterious energy, he could unleash a battle prowess of twenty stars.","Strange.","Precisely because of his curiosity, Ling Han chose to content with him, and did not use the power of Regulations.","Of course, the other consideration was that if he used them in the Primitive Abyss, the Regulations in his body would decrease with each use, and he could only rely on the Genesis Substance to replenish them.","To be able to use the precious Genesis Substance to replenish Regulations instead of to increase one’s cultivation level, just how great of a waste was that?","He was observing Wang Zhe. The latter’s battle system was something that he had never seen before, which made him want to study it.","After several hundred exchanges, Ling Han finally made some discoveries.","Actually, Wang Zhe himself was not very strong.","He was indeed a six-star Saint, but his natural talent was definitely no higher than the son of a Great Emperor. Instead... that mysterious energy came from the Battle Armor on his body.","Ling Han couldn’t help but think. Previously, he had sensed a special wave, and it had also come from the Battle Armor on Wang Zhe’s body.","En!","He suddenly strengthened his offensive, and finally used the power of Regulations, instantly boosting his battle prowess to a terrifying level.","Peng!","With a single punch, he had directly thrown Wang Zhe onto the ground.","\"Yo, I used too much force, that I knocked him unconscious.\" Ling Han gritted his teeth. He hadn’t fought with anyone for a long time, and his strength had increased too quickly, so it was inevitable that he couldn’t control himself.","He took off Wang Zhe’s Battle Armor. However, it was really not easy to take it off. It stuck firmly onto Wang Zhe’s body, as if it was a part of his body.","However, in front of Ling Han’s brute force, resistance was only temporary.","\"Yi?\"","When he took off the Battle Armor, he saw that Wang Zhe had actually been directly flattened, instantly turned into dust, and died.","This!","Ling Han couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat. He had never planned to kill Wang Zhe. Even if he wanted to, he would wait until he had clarified the situation.","But now, this guy had died.","Why?","It was very simple. He had been forcefully crushed into smithereens by the extreme weight of the gravity fields here, and even his spirit had been instantly shattered. Naturally, he had died immediately, and there was no doubt about it.","He looked at the Battle Armor in his hand, and enlightenment rose up in his heart. Previously, the reason why the other had been able to come and go more easily than him was because of this Battle Armor.","It could counter gravity?","Now that the Battle Armor had been removed, this guy had died.","Sigh, he really had no intention of killing anyone.","\"In this place, you can’t even be a ghost, so you can only blame your bad luck,\" Ling Han murmured.","He began to study this Battle Armor. He discovered that the material used to forge this Battle Armor was a type of metal, and Genesis Substance was contained within. This should have had a related effect, turning what was ordinary into something amazing.","Then, he put on the Battle Armor. Instantly, he felt as light as a swallow.","Er, there was still gravity, but compared to before, it was so light that there was practically no comparison.","Right now, Ling Han could unleash the speed of Venerate Tier.","\"Furthermore, the defenses of this thing is also very high.\"","Being able to resist the gravity fields here, how could it not be extremely hard?","Even Saintly Material would find it difficult to compare, right?","Of course, the most important thing was still the Genesis Substance. With its existence, the Battle Armor was equipped with special effects. Otherwise, one could just dig out some of the ground directly to make one, and wouldn’t it also be extremely hard?","But if that was the case, he would be the first to be crushed to the ground.","\"This guy... does he come from the zone of Primal Chaos?\" Ling Han looked into the distance. Under the enshrouding of Primal Chaos, all things could not be seen clearly, and could only be vaguely seen.","\"Are the Great Emperors that entered this place all still alive?\"","\"More importantly, just how many Great Emperors have entered this place?\"","\"If they can all appear, the Twelve Lands of Death will no longer be a threat in an instant.\"","Who would be weaker than the other among those who could become Emperors?","Thus, if there were also twelve Great Emperors here, they would naturally be able to easily resolve the threat posed by the Twelve Lands of Death.","\"Should I explore inside?\"","In the past, Ling Han definitely wouldn’t dare to act so recklessly. However, now that he had a Battle Armor, his speed increased explosively, and his defense also increased greatly. He was now qualified to take risks.","\"However, I’ll still circle around the outer area first, and try my best to find Genesis Substance. The stronger my strength, the safer it would be to enter.\"","Ling Han continued to dig for medicine, and after another twenty plus days, he finally dug out this Great Herb, and then immediately refined it.","Boom, the pillar of light of great dao once again rushed out of his head.","He comprehended it carefully, thinking that if he could grasp the great dao itself, who in this world would be able to match him?","The Great Emperor had only grasped the Nine Star Regulations, but the Regulations had all evolved from the great dao, and if he grasped the great dao, it was equivalent to having grasped the source of everything."]},{"number":4713,"title":"Chapter 4713: Light of great dao","paragraphs":["However, to grasp the great dao, this was completely unrealistic.","This was too majestic and vast, and could not be understood at all. For example, how a person who had never learnt how to read be able to cultivate it even if he was given a supreme treasured book?","Ling Han was just about to give up, when he suddenly discovered that his body had actually resonated with the great dao!","No, no, no. He immediately discovered that it wasn’t the great dao, but Genesis Substance.","Why hadn’t he done so before?","Was it because this was the second time that there was already a remnant of Genesis Substance in his body?","But in the next instant, he discovered that something was off, because there was a terrifying energy bubbling all over his body.","Destructive Energy!","Then, the holy flame also shook violently, as if it had received some kind of stimulation.","This!","Ling Han knew that whether it was Destructive Energy or Seed of the Holy Flame, they all came from the Primitive Abyss, but they actually resonated with great dao?","What in the world was going on?","Yi!","He suddenly discovered that the Battle Armor on his body had also resonated. The Genesis Substance was being extracted and fused into the light of great dao.","Hey, hey, hey. Ling Han hurriedly tried to stop it. He still had great use for this Battle Armor. He wanted to use it to enter into the territory of Primal Chaos. If the Genesis Substance was extracted, it would be a pile of scrap metal.","However, he couldn’t stop it. Genesis Substance was continuously being extracted, burning like flames.","Ling Han had no choice but to cultivate faster. Otherwise, his losses would be even greater.","Four days later, the light of great dao on his body disappeared.","Now, how many stars of Saint-level was he considered?","The color of the holy flame was still red. This meant that he was a Two Star Saint, but in truth, the Regulations that he could accomodate in his body had already reached as many as 38.","This was because the Genesis Substance had allowed him not to experience the Silent Destruction of his body, so he could accommodate even more Regulations.","Yi, going by that theory, Wang Zhe, a six-star Saint, was really too weak.","You see, as long as one had obtained the Genesis Substance, they would be able to accommodate even more Regulations without Silent Destruction of their body. And even if Wang Zhe had experienced Silent Destruction of his body six times, he was only able to accommodate twelve eight-star Regulations.","This meant that his talent was actually inferior to that of the Golden Generation.","Just look at how many times he had used Genesis Substance. The more he used, the worse his natural talent naturally was.","After all, this was the largest danger zone in the universe. It was already inconceivable that there were living beings here, but the population was definitely small. This large premise determined that it was impossible for too many prodigies to appear in this place.","Oh, so heavy!","Ling Han suddenly discovered that he was still wearing the Battle Armor. Right now, the Genesis Substance inside it had already been expended, and it instantly became extremely heavy.","This belated realization was because Ling Han’s physique was too tough. Even if there were millions of stars hanging from his body, he was actually able to withstand it.","\"Now that Wang Zhe has died, and the Battle Armor has been destroyed, how am I supposed to enter the Primitive Abyss?\"","It was definitely impossible for him to barge in forcefully. No matter how strong he was, he was only a Saint, and had only grasped 38 eight-star Regulations.","\"I can only continue to search in the outer circle.\"","\"Yi?\"","He looked into his mind, and saw that there was actually a beam of light in the midst of the burning holy flame.","The Dao of Heaven and Earth!","Ling Han was dumbfounded. A Dao of Heaven and Earth had actually appeared in his mind!","No, it wasn’t that exaggerated. This still couldn’t be called the Dao of Heaven and Earth, but only the light of great dao, just like the light of great dao that had absorbed the Genesis Substance and shot out from his body.","However, it was still incredibly awesome.","If he used the light of great dao, just how powerful would his battle prowess become?","Let’s give it a try.","He threw a punch, which landed on the ground. Peng, the ground did not even tremble, because with the sturdiness of the ground, it was completely comparable to a Saint Tool.","In this punch, Ling Han had only used Body Art.","He then used all the Regulations, and added with the power of belief, he blasted out a total of 43 flashes.","Peng, when this punch landed, the ground was still the same, and not even a trace was left behind.","\"I’m about to get serious.\"","Ling Han channelled the light of great dao from the holy flame, and shot out his fist for the third time.","Peng, this time, a hole shockingly appeared in the ground, as deep as a foot.","Heavens!","This destructive power was too terrifying, and this was completely because the light of great dao had been infused into the attack.","It was only a single beam, and it was extremely weak.","Genesis Substance!","It must be because of Genesis Substance. However, it wasn’t completely because of Genesis Substance.","Ling Han felt that he himself was also very useful. The Destructive Energy and the holy flame were both responding, and even his body was part of it.","\"If the Divine Stones originate from the Primitive Abyss, then it wouldn’t be strange for me to resonate with this place.\"","Ling Han murmured to himself. Then, he suddenly had an idea. What would happen if he used the light of the great dao and the Destructive Energy together?","Moreover, his holy flame was different from others. What if he used it as well?","Though the more the holy flame was used, the less there would be left, he could still bear the expense of a single strike.","Ling Han channeled three types of unique energies at the same time: the light of the great dao, the Destructive Energy and the holy flame. Boom! He threw another punch, and instantly, a pit that was three feet in diameter and three feet deep appeared on the ground.","In the outside world, this kind of attack would only be Meridian Opening Tier-level, but in this place, it was too terrifying.","If he were to face the Skeleton Saint Tool again at this moment, he would probably be able to blast this kind of existence to bits.","At the very least, a single punch would be enough to break the legs and arms of the Skeleton Saint Tool.","\"I’ll continue to search for Genesis Substance. As long as I can become a Pseudo-Emperor, then even against a Great Emperor, I would be qualified to render some resistance.\"","Ling Han’s confidence soared, and he began to search again.","However, without the Battle Armor, the gravity field he suffered was extraordinarily strong, so his speed still couldn’t increase.","One day after another, year after year passed, and Ling Han returned to his extremely lonely and boring life. His daily routine was to search for Genesis Substance, and sense that unique fluctuation.","With this search, another seven hundred years passed.","Calculating, it had already been more than 1600 years since Ling Han entered into this space. In the outside world, it had also been around 16 years.","Ling Han strolled slowly. He was already used to being alone.","He had come from the Genesis World, and in the Genesis World, a period of seclusion would easily take tens of thousands or even millions of years. Thus, though the process of searching was extremely boring, it did not bring him much negative effects.","In the meantime, he experienced several more sandstorms, but he still hadn’t walked out of this vast stone forest. Thus, he didn’t encounter any other dangers.","’Hmm?’","He faltered slightly, because he suddenly sensed a special fluctuation, and it was approaching him.","Could it be that another person like Wang Zhe had come?","Ling Han was filled with anticipation as he turned around to look.","In a short while, two figures shot out.","Similar to Wang Zhe, they were also wearing Battle Armors. However, unlike Wang Zhe’s silver armor, their Battle Armor was bronze in color. Moreover, it wasn’t metal, but stone. The Genesis Substance’s waves were clearly weaker than Wang Zhe’s."]},{"number":4714,"title":"Chapter 4714: The First Generation Divine Beast","paragraphs":["These two people were also exuding Saint-level fluctuations, and added with the air from Genesis Substance, they formed a special pressure.","After discovering Ling Han, the two of them also acted like Wang Zhe, revealing incredibly stunned expressions.","There was actually someone who could move around here without wearing a Battle Armor?","\"Hey, hey, hey, what’s with the look in your eyes?\" Ling Han was displeased. \"I’m only not wearing Battle Armor, but it’s not like I’m completely naked!\"","The two of them were still astounded. Not wearing Battle Armors was much more shocking than not wearing clothes.","What kind of freak are you?","Hold on!","They hurriedly shook their heads. The two of them had come out to find disciples of the Great Emperors, not to show off their shock.","\"Who are you?\" one of them asked. His name was Luo Qi, and the other was Chu Tang.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"I am a disciple of a Great Emperor, and who are you people?\"","Luo Qi and Chu Tang wore strange expressions. ’How the f*ck can you be a disciple of a Great Emperor?’","What disciple of a Great Emperor would be as poor as you, not even having a Battle Armor?","\"There must be something strange about this person!\" Luo Qi said to Chu Tang.","Chu Tang nodded, \"The disappearance of the Nine Kings may be related to this person.\"","\"Capture him!\"","\"All right!\"","Ling Han sighed, \"Though you guys are whispering to each other, I still heard very clearly.\"","\"So what?\" Chu Tang smirked coldly, \"We are wearing bronze Saintly Armor, so how could we not be able to suppress you?\"","Yi, the battle prowess contest here is a comparison of Battle Armor?","Ling Han couldn’t help but complain, saying, \"The Battle Armor that you’re wearing is clearly made of stone. Don’t think that just because it exudes a bronze luster, you can call it Bronze Battle Armor. Are you trying to take advantage of the fact that I’m not educated?\"","At this point, Luo Qi and Chu Tang really wanted to complain. What kind of guy was this person in front of them?","\"Ignore him. Capture him first and then interrogate him.\"","\"All right!\"","Luo Qi and Chu Tang shook their hands at the same time, and instantly, a long spear appeared in their hands. It was also made of stone, but exuding an air of vitality, they instantly exerted a strong sense of danger.","In this place, Genesis Substance wasn’t just used to cultivate. It had a wide variety of uses, and at least, it could be used to forge Battle Armor and weapons.","Doubt arose in Ling Han’s heart. Just how many people were there in this Primitive Abyss?","He hadn’t heard about it from Buddha Doga.","Could it be that this kind of change was something that had happened after the departure of Buddha Doga?","Right at this moment, Luo Qi and Chu Tang had already charged over. They extended their long spears, and stabbed at his left and right shoulders respectively, intending to nail him to the spot.","Er, you guys are thinking too much.","Ling Han had only seen the Battle Armor that had been forged from Genesis Substance before, but he had never seen the might of a weapon before. Thus, he was naturally very intrigued, and allowed the two of them to stab at him.","Peng!","The two long spears struck Ling Han’s shoulder at the same time. However, not only did they not manage to pierce through Ling Han’s shoulder, but under the massive impact, the web between the thumb and forefinger of Luo Qi and Chu Tang’s hands became numb, and they almost lost their grip on their spears.","What kind of monster was this!","The two of them were transfixed with shock. Just how sharp were the weapons forged by Genesis Substance? Aside from the Battle Armor that was also forged by Genesis Substance, what could it not pierce or slice through?","Ling Han lowered his head to take a look. The clothes on his shoulders had turned into pieces. Being crushed by the terrifying gravity fields, so what if this was woven from high-level material? It instantly turned into ashes.","He shook his head, \"If you damage my clothes, you will have to pay compensation.\"","Luo Qi and Chu Tang exchanged a glance before turning around to flee.","This was practically a monster, and was definitely not someone that they could stand against. They had best flee quickly.","They would go back and ask for help.","\"Don’t be anxious!\" Ling Han unleashed his power. Peng! He caught up to the two of them, but it was a little difficult. After all, he would be affected by the super gravity, while the gravity on Luo Qi and Chu Tang would be offset by the Battle Armor.","Thankfully, the speed of these two people had not soared, and he had directly caught up to them.","Ling Han stretched out his hands and placed them on their shoulders. Instantly, the two of them were rendered immobile.","\"What is it? You don’t want to pay?\" Ling Han asked with a smile.","\"We will, we will!\" Luo Qi and Chu Tang hurriedly said. Right now, their only wish was to escape. This man was far too mysterious and strange. He was not someone they could oppose at all.","Ling Han smiled, \"Come, tell me about your origins.\"","Luo Qi and Chu Tang were both a little stunned. What did he mean by ’our origins’? At this moment, they didn’t know how to respond.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before asking again, \"Which Great Emperor subordinate are you?\"","Luo Qi and Chu Tang exchanged looks, and both came to a realization. \"You’re from the outside world!\" they exclaimed.","Otherwise, he would definitely not have asked such a question.","Ling Han frowned and said, \"I don’t like to repeat a question.\"","\"We are Lord True Dragon’s subordinates,\" Luo Qi hurriedly said.","’What?’","Ling Han faltered upon hearing this. True Dragon?","Hadn’t the True Dragon died long ago?","In this instant, Ling Han truly wished that the little azure dragon had come with him. Who knew what expression he would have when he found out that his old man had come back to life.","His first reaction was that these two people were lying.","When he had entered into the True Dragon Abyss, the True Dragon had entrusted his son into his guardianship, and that was how he had obtained the True Dragon’s Body Art.","Now, he was told that the True Dragon hadn’t died?","How was this possible!","\"Hehe, compared to repeating questions, I hate it even more when others lie to me!\" Ling Han shot out a punch, and Luo Qi was instantly blasted into smithereens.","This caused Chu Tang to shiver in fear. When he saw Ling Han turn his gaze over, he hurriedly said, \"We are really the subordinates of Lord True Dragon, and there is definitely nothing false about it.\"","Ling Han frowned upon hearing this. He had already killed one person, so why was this person still replying in this manner?","Could it be that what he said was true?","How was this possible?","The True Dragon was definitely dead.","’Little azure dragon, how does it feel to suddenly have a father?’","But looking at how the other was breaking out in a cold sweat from shock, it did not seem like he was lying.","Moreover, was the character they were subordinate to some great secret that they had to protect with their lives?","Ling Han asked again, and Chu Tang answered honestly.","As far as Chu Tang knew, there were a total of 36 Great Emperors in the Primitive Abyss. Each of them was suppressing an area, forbidding any outsider from entering into the depths of the Primitive Abyss.","36 Great Emperors?","Aside from the True Dragon, there was also the True Phoenix, the Black Tortoise, the Vermillion Bird and so on. They were all Ancient Beasts, and were the first living beings to appear when heaven and earth was first born, and it was only at that time that Great Emperors could coexist.","Of course, there were also the Lords of Death, but none of them could make a move easily. This must be the restriction of heaven and earth.","Now, he was told that the first generation Divine Beasts had not died, and all of them were in the Primitive Abyss. How could he believe this?","Furthermore, countless billions of years had passed, so shouldn’t they have died of old age long ago?","What in the world was going on?","Hold on, Buddha Doga had entered into the Primitive Abyss before. Then, if there were thirty-six Divine Beasts at that time, would Buddha Doga not have told him?","Thus, this had only happened after the first life of Buddha Doga.","Ling Han was completely baffled. Thirty-six Divine Beasts had appeared all of a sudden, and they were all the earliest Ancestral Kings, so he did not know what kind of expression he should have.","In his eyes, this was completely unrealistic, but this Chu Tang did not look like he was lying at all.","Then what was going on here?","Ling Han felt that it was necessary to meet with Buddha Doga, so that the latter would also know about this."]},{"number":4715,"title":"Chapter 4715: Going deep","paragraphs":["After putting on a \"Bronze\" Battle Armor, Ling Han brought Chu Tang with him and left the Primitive Abyss.","With this Battle Armor, his speed instantly soared.","This wasn’t as impressive as the Silver Battle Armor, but it still allowed Ling Han to display the speed that he had when he was a Sect Master.","However, when he was in the level of Sect Master, his speed was comparable to the level of Venerate Tier. Thus, his speed was really very fast.","This Battle Armor was resistant to gravity, so Ling Han was able to easily break free from the gravitational pull of this land. He flew back into the abyss and returned the way he had come.","After exiting the abyss, Ling Han released his divine sense, which instantly spread out like an ocean, as far as the eye could see.","It wasn’t long before he located Buddha Doga.","This Pseudo-Emperor was presently sitting cross-legged in space, the aura on his body fluctuating. Obviously, he had expended a great amount of Imperial Source previously, and had not recovered yet.","Similar to using the holy flame, the Imperial Source would decrease with each use, and was considered a consumable item. Thus, Buddha Doga wasn’t trying to heal the Imperial Source, but rather trying to recover from the damage caused by burning Imperial Source.","A Pseudo-Emperor was a Pseudo-Emperor. Even under in such a state, he sill immediately detected Ling Han’s divine sense. With a single step, he had already appeared in front of Ling Han.","Yi?","When he saw how Ling Han was wearing a strange suit of armor, and there was even a person in Ling Han’s grip, even this mighty figure from the ancient times was astonished.","What the hell?","If it had to be said that Ling Han had made a Battle Armor for himself out of boredom — though it was made of stone and was extremely trashy, why would there suddenly be another person?","He could tell with a single glance that this was a Saint.","What was going on here? There were actually other Saints in the Primitive Abyss?","However... that was impossible. How could a Saint possibly resist the dangers of the Primitive Abyss? Merely that gravity field was enough to crush a Saint into dust.","Only a freak like Ling Han could barely move around there. Don’t tell him that this kind of monster had appeared again!","Hold on!","Buddha Doga stared at the Battle Armor in disbelief. Although it was pitifully rubbish, it radiated with a unique aura.","Genesis Substance!","He revealed a shocked expression. This Battle Armor was actually forged from Genesis Substance?","Ling Han looked at Buddha Doga’s expression in satisfaction. After all, he couldn’t be the only one who was stunned.","Chu Tang was also stunned when he saw Buddha Doga. This was because he could sense a faint imperial might radiating from Buddha Doga’s body.","This was a Great Emperor.","This was far too terrifying. This was a Great Emperor!","\"This person... comes from the Primitive Abyss?\" Buddha Doga asked.","Ling Han nodded, and related all the information that he had found out from Chu Tang.","The first reaction of Buddha Doga was disbelief. However, looking at the Battle Armor on Ling Han’s body, as well as Chu Tang, he couldn’t help but feel doubt.","\"The Divine Beasts from the ancient era are all still alive?\" Even this Pseudo-Emperor was shocked. This news was really too shocking.","Ling Han shook his head, \"I don’t know about other things, but in the case of the True Dragon, it has definitely died.\"","\"My Lord True Dragon is still alive and well!\" Chu Tang couldn’t help but interrupt. You guys can’t treat him like a dead man.","Emperors were invincible in the world, and their majesty was naturally deeply ingrained in everyone’s hearts.","\"We can only enter there and get to the bottom of this,\" Buddha Doga said. His voice was resolute, and it was clear that he had made up his mind.","If such a mighty figure made up his mind, there was definitely no one that could change his mind.","Ling Han nodded. He knocked Chu Tang unconscious with a tap of his finger, then removed the Battle Armor from his body, handing it over to Buddha Doga.","Even if Buddha Doga was a Pseudo-Emperor, wearing this Battle Armor would still be somewhat helpful, even if the assistance it could provide was extremely minuscule.","After all, the Primitive Abyss could even kill the Great Emperor.","This also led to a problem. The Primitive Abyss was obviously so dangerous, but now, not only were there thirty-six Divine Beasts keeping watch, they had even established their own forces?","Extremely strange!","They entered the Primitive Abyss and headed towards the area of chaos.","When they passed through the Primal Chaos, it was as if they were walking in mud. It was incredibly difficult, and this was still because the Battle Armor on them had helped, dispelling a portion of the resistance. Otherwise, it would be even more difficult.","It didn’t matter to Buddha Doga, but it was extremely likely that Ling Han wouldn’t be able to pass through it.","After the two of them entered, they saw that this was actually very similar to the outer area. It was just an empty land, and there was nothing here.","\"Let’s go.\"","The two of them advanced, heading into the depths.","They had not walked too far, when an ocean appeared ahead of them, but when Ling Han and Buddha Doga came closer, they saw that the ocean had actually dried up in an instant. A tall mountain broke out of the ground, and lay there.","However, it was only an instant, and the tall mountain crumbled, turning into hills, and then into a plain, nurturing all life.","It was still an instant, and everything was destroyed, turning into a barren land.","\"What’s this?\" Ling Han wore a stunned expression as he looked at Buddha Doga.","Buddha Doga nodded and said, \"In this unique region, time flows indescribably fast. If we enter, we’ll be turned into bones before we can even walk out.\"","Yet Ling Han’s eyes lit up, \"Then from here, can I cultivate Regulations of Time?\"","This was too awesome. Even if it was the Great Emperor, so what? There was a limit to his lifespan. With a single strike from the Regulations of Time, time would instantly accelerate millions and millions of times, and it was guaranteed that the Great Emperor would also die.","Buddha Doga couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself, saying, \"Theoretically, yes. However, even if you have mastered it, it can’t possibly take effect on Pseudo-Emperor or Great Emperor, because people like us can already resist the abnormal flow of time.\"","The Saint’s body could absorb Regulations, while the Great Emperor’s body was self-contained. Thus, it was impossible to use Regulations on the Great Emperor.","Only the Dao of Heaven and Earth could suppress the Great Emperor, allowing the Great Emperor to age normally.","However, this place was the Primitive Abyss. There was no Regulations, but it was the birthplace of the Dao of Heaven and Earth. Thus, even if Buddha Doga entered into the area ahead of them, it was guaranteed that he would immediately age, die, and turn into a skeleton.","The Primitive Abyss was a land of death that could kill even Great Emperors.","For the so-called Twelve Lands of Death, the true danger lay in the Great Emperors inside.","The two of them circled around, but this area was very big. Furthermore, there were times when it was expanding, and there were times when it was shrinking. That would be even more dangerous. They had to stay far away, to avoid being suddenly dragged in. If that really happened, they would not even know how they died.","This detour was naturally time-consuming, and in this place, even the speed of a Pseudo-Emperor would not be much faster.","After half a year, they finally circled around this area, and the area ahead of them was finally considered safe.","However, they had not advanced for too long, when they saw endless flames surging, turning into a storm that surged madly in their direction.","Buddha Doga’s expression changed drastically. He immediately grabbed Ling Han and turned around to leave.","Hiss!","Ling Han also gritted his teeth. This storm of flames was too terrifying. He had a feeling that if he was swept up in it, it was guaranteed that his only fate would be death.","He looked closely with his eye technique, and saw that there was clearly not the sligthest bit of Regulations in these flames, yet they were extremely strong.","Why were these flames so terrifying?"]},{"number":4716,"title":"Chapter 4716: The True Dragon Emperor?","paragraphs":["He brought Ling Han along with him as he ran madly, and this run actually lasted as long as half a year. Only then did Buddha Doga finally stop.","In the distance, the speed of the firestorm finally slowed down, and it slowly dissipated.","Hiss, Ling Han gritted his teeth.","With the speed of a Pseudo-Emperor, he still had to run madly for half a year. Just how terrifying was this place?","\"What flames are these?\" Ling Han asked. There was clearly not the slightest bit of Regulations, yet they were still chillingly strong.","Buddha Doga pondered for a moment, then said, \"This is the Source Power of heaven and earth. I’m not sure either.\"","\"Then what about now?\" Ling Han didn’t linger on this matter. At present, he wasn’t even qualified to grasp Nine Star Regulations, what more Source Power?","Cultivation was a gradual process.","\"Let’s continue forward.\"","The two of them continued forward. After the storm of flames swept over, peace returned. Because the ground had been shrunk countless times over, every grain of sand was the weight of a planet. Thus, even if this kind of flame burned over, it would only leave behind a charred spot, and did not cause too much damage.","Yet Ling Han frowned. That was because when he had walked here for the first time, he had not seen the charred ground.","He looked at Buddha Doga, and Buddha Doga nodded, and said, \"There’s not only firestorms here. There are also other natural disasters.\"","Thus, passing through this area was not only time-consuming, but also dependent on luck.","If one was unlucky, they might have to circle around for a few hundred years.","True enough, merely two months later, Ling Han and Buddha Doga hadn’t even reached the finishing line they had the last time, when they saw meteorites raining down from the skies.","Peng, peng, peng! This was too terrifying. Every single one of them crashed down, and grooves appeared in the ground. They were as wide as thirty meters.","Ling Han was astonished upon seeing this. One had to realize that even if he unleashed his full strength, he could only create a three-meter-wide crater with each punch. Just what kind of concept was a 30-meter-wide crater?","Was it destructive power on the level of Pseudo-Emperor? Or even Great Emperor-level in fact?","This meteorite rain was also sweeping towards them from ahead. Thus, there was nothing else that could be done. Ling Han and Buddha Doga could only retreat.","Fortunately, the meteorite rain wasn’t advancing at a fast speed, allowing them to calmly retreat.","The problem was that this was too slow.","If it was not for the fact that time passed quickly here, and when a hundred years had passed, only a year would have passed outside, Ling Han would really die of anxiety.","This retreat actually lasted as long as three years.","The meteorite rain finally stopped, and Ling Han and Buddha Doga advanced again.","Faced with the might of heaven and earth, Ling Han didn’t even consider using the Clear Bamboo Sword or the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to block it.","It should be known that even a Great Emperor could possibly die here, so the Imperial Weapon was really not all that impressive.","They advanced. Two months, half a year, eight months, and this time, their luck actually improved. They did not encounter any more natural storms.","After walking for another two years, a city shockingly appeared ahead of them.","From afar, it looked like a dragon’s head, exuding a powerful dominance.","This!","It really couldn’t be the True Dragon Great Emperor, right?","Ling Han was also slightly moved, but he had clearly confirmed that the True Dragon was really dead.","Buddha Doga didn’t advance rashly. Instead, he released his divine sense towards the city.","Boom!","In just an instant, an imposing and domineering aura arrived with a bang. It was extremely cold and emotionless.","\"Who are you, little brat?\" A thought exploded in the minds of Ling Han and Buddha Doga.","Ling Han instantly spat out blood from all his apertures, and almost fainted. Thankfully, there was still a beam of light of great dao in his mind, which allowed him to just barely maintain consciousness.","Meanwhile, Buddha Doga’s expression wasn’t any better. His face was as white as a sheet.","Boom!","Right at this moment, a claw suddenly stretched out from the city ahead of them.","Five claws, golden.","This was... a dragon’s claw!","Ling Han and the little azure dragon had accompanied each other for so long, so he naturally knew what the claws of the Dragon Race were like.","True Dragon?","Hey, hey, hey, is this for real?","However, there was no time for him to mull over this. Buddha Doga grabbed him, turned around, and fled.","Fighting with a Great Emperor?","Hehe.","Boom! It was clear that the Great Emperor of the Dragon Race hadn’t appeared. However, when he extended his claw, it was as if it were a boundless realm that was drawing closer and closer.","\"Here!\" Ling Han took out the Clear Bamboo Sword and handed it over to Buddha Doga.","Buddha Doga caught the sword, and directly slashed out with his sword.","He was presently unable to awaken the Clear Bamboo Sword. However, Pseudo-Emperor was extremely strong in the first place, and added with the might of the Origin Gold, he could still just barely manage to match a Great Emperor.","Shua, this strike landed on the dragon claw, and instantly, a thin mark was left behind. However, Buddha Doga was directly sent flying, throwing up blood continuously.","It was not just him. Even Ling Han was throwing up blood madly. He had only been touched a little by the Imperial Might, but the Imperial Might was really too strong.","It was not that he had not taken a blow froma Great Emperor before. Though that was under the prerequisite of having awakened the Clear Bamboo Sword, he had a feeling that the might of this attack from the dragon claw was superior to the Lord of Death.","Was that possible?","To become a Great Emperor, who would be weaker than the other?","Unless... the Lord of Death hadn’t unleashed his full strength at that time.","True, against a mere Saint like him, was there any need for him to unleash his full strength?","Buddha Doga didn’t stop at all, continuing to run madly with Ling Han in tow.","Behind them, Imperial Might spread out, and an azure dragon dashed out of the city. Travelling on clouds and mists, it was presently rapidly chasing after them.","It was too fast; this was a genuine Great Emperor!","F***, the True Dragon really didn’t die?","The Imperial Clans could not produce a Great Emperor. This was like a curse from heaven and earth. Thus, Ling Han definitely did not think that this was any child of the True Dragon, but the True Dragon itself.","He was a little confused. This had completely disturbed his cognition.","Buddha Doga quickly familiarized himself with the Clear Bamboo Sword’s usage. He struck again, and this time, its might was terrifying. Imperial might spread out, as if that supreme empress had come back to life.","Boom!","The True Dragon moved, but was blocked. However, with how powerful the Great Emperor was, he immediately pursued again.","Meanwhile, Buddha Doga continued to charge forward as he slashed his sword. Relying on the might of the Imperial Weapon, he could still hold on for the time being. However, he definitely couldn’t hold on for too long.","The Imperial Weapon was only a weapon forged by a Great Emperor, so how could it possibly compare to a true Great Emperor?","What could they do?","They were being hunted down by a Great Emperor, a living Great Emperor!","Ling Han also activated the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to dissipate a portion of the aftermath of the Imperial Might. After all, this was also Origin Gold, and he was the most powerful Saint, so dissipating a portion of the aftermath shouldn’t be a problem.","This run took three days.","Boom!","A wave of water suddenly gushed out from the ground, and it was as wide as could be. Then, it separated into front and back, which just happened to separate the True Dragon Emperor, Buddha Doga, and Ling Han.","This... was life-saving!","This place was incredibly dangerous, and even a Great Emperor had to be extremely careful. Otherwise, it was extremely likely that he would be buried here.","The wave crashed down, and the True Dragon Emperor was also forced to stop. He then turned around and left.","\"Humph!\" The Great Emperor’s will surged, but they did not feel any dissatisfaction.","A mere Pseudo-Emperor and Saint, so what if he couldn’t kill them? The next time he encountered them, he would still be able to easily kill them.","Ling Han and Buddha Doga ran madly. As they ran, another half year’s time passed, and only then did the waves behind them calm down. What was originally a desolate plain had turned into a great sea.","This was truly a strange place.","\"Let’s leave first,\" Buddha Doga said."]},{"number":4717,"title":"Chapter 4717: Return","paragraphs":["Buddha Doga brought Ling Han away from the Primitive Abyss.","This place was no longer safe. A Great Emperor had targeted them, so aside from running, was there any other option?","\"Inside the Primitive Abyss, there really is a secret to immortality!\" Ling Han said. That True Dragon Emperor was clearly the first generation True Dragon.","However, he was also a little puzzled. Compared to the True Dragon’s divine sense that he had come into contact with, this True Dragon Great Emperor seemed to be slightly different.","\"I don’t know if there’s a secret to immortality, but there something very strange about that Great Emperor,\" Buddha Doga said after a moment of thought.","In this aspect, Buddha Doga had a very strong say, because not only was he a Pseudo-Emperor, he even had a fellow disciple that had become a Great Emperor.","\"Oh?\" Ling Han was curious.","\"It’s very strange,\" Buddha Doga continued. \"It clearly possesses the Imperial Might, yet it seems to be a little lacking. Compared to a true Great Emperor... it’s weaker!\"","Yi, what kind of existence was that?","Pseudo-Emperor?","Impossible, Buddha Doga was a Pseudo-Emperor, but in front of the True Dragon Great Emperor, he couldn’t fight back at all.","Thus, that being was definitely a Great Emperor.","However, this was indeed strange.","When Buddha Doga entered the Primitive Abyss for the first time, it was still completely desolate and lifeless. Now, however, a city had actually been built, with a Great Emperor standing guard.","Thus, this city must have been built after the first life of Buddha Doga.","But the crux of the matter lay here.","What era did the True Dragon belong to?","The primitive time when the heaven and earth first formed was indescribably far away.","Why had an existence that should have died countless years before Buddha Doga appeared after the latter?","A second life after so many eras?","Impossible!","A Great Emperor who had obtained a fortuitous encounter in the Primitive Abyss could live a third life, but this must be continuous.","The Great Emperor was too strong. No Regulations or treasures could suppress him. This also included the lifespan of a Great Emperor and his soul.","Thus, there was no possibility that he would be sealed for how many years, and then live a second life.","Could it be that it, like the Lords of Death, had relied on some kind of secret technique to live for countless years, and then appeared again in recent times?","This was indeed possible.","However, unlike the Lords of Death, the True Dragon Emperor could clearly attack without any reservations.","Moreover, according to Chu Tang and Luo Qi, the 36 Divine Beasts guarded the passage to the core of the Primitive Abyss, not allowing anyone to pass. Why was that?","Ling Han and Buddha Doga exchanged looks. They discussed endlessly, but the more they discussed, the more troubled they became.","This didn’t make sense. This didn’t make sense at all.","The more they knew, the more confused they became.","\"This is truly a chaotic world!\" Buddha Doga said with a deep frown.","The Twelve Lands of Death were already troublesome enough, and now there were thirty-six ancient Divine Beasts?","Though none of them had appeared yet, once they left the Primitive Abyss, just how colossal would the effects be?","Because of this, the structure of the world would be changed and reforged.","What they knew now was that in the Primitive Abyss, there was definitely the Great Emperor of the Dragon Race, the first generation True Dragon. However, it was slightly different from the first generation True Dragon. Furthermore, in terms of battle prowess, the former was considerably weaker.","Was this the key?","Buddha Doga decided to bring Ling Han back with him. This was because the Primitive Abyss was far too dangerous at this moment, so much so that they had attracted the attention of a Great Emperor. That being the case, how could they still dare to search for Genesis Substance inside peacefully?","It should be known that the outer circle was relatively safe, so wasn’t it even safer for the Great Emperor?","Without terrifying calamities such as firestorms, meteorites, and so on, how could they block the attack of a Great Emperor?","Thus, they could only leave now. No matter what, they had to avoid the limelight.","It should be known that one year in the outside world was equivalent to a hundred years in the Primitive Abyss. Thus, if they came back after a few hundred years, that True Dragon Great Emperor probably wouldn’t keep them constantly in his mind.","After all, in the eyes of the Great Emperor, they were all ants.","The two of them returned. This time, Buddha Doga didn’t burn the Imperial Source, because there was no need to rush.","A Pseudo-Emperor’s speed was fast, but it still took them 200 years to finally return to the part of the universe that Ling Han was familiar with.","Buddha Doga immediately left. He was going to contact a few people and inform them about the unforeseen event that had happened to the Primitive Abyss.","Ling Han knew that Qian Haoyang was definitely one, but Buddha Doga didn’t say \"one\".","Could it be that there were other Pseudo-Emperors?","However, Buddha Doga left in a hurry, not giving Ling Han time to ask questions. Ling Han could only suppress his doubts first, and begin to locate the Four Origin Planet.","Previously, he had set up formations on the Four Origin Planet, which could cut off destiny to a limited extent. If the Great Emperor made a prediction, it would definitely not be difficult, but he would have to pay a certain price.","Under normal circumstances, a Great Emperor would not be concerned at all, but for the Lords of Death, they would have to consider carefully.","As the master of the formation, it just happened to be the other way around, so it was even easier for him to sense it.","It wasn’t long before he located it. He then tore open space and traveled through the Void for a while. When he rushed out again, Four Origin Planet was already within sight.","His appearance instantly caused the empress and the others to sigh in relief.","They did indeed know that Ling Han had gone to the Donglin Planet. However, there was suddenly no news from the two of them. Moreover, it had been a whole 200 years, so how could they not be worried?","Ling Han gathered everyone over, and related his experiences over the past 200 years.","In truth, he had spent 200 years on his return. The true time he had spent in the Primitive Abyss was only 16 years. However, the flow of time was different, and he had spent more than 1600 years there.","Hearing Ling Han’s words, everyone was dumbfounded.","This!","The Lords of Death appeared out of nowhere and suppressed the universe, unmatched. This big problem was still yet to be resolved, and now there were 36 Divine Beasts?","No wonder Empress Qingzhu had foreseen such a terrifying future— 48 Great Emperors!","\"My father... is actually in the Primitive Abyss?\" The little azure dragon was so shocked that it couldn’t even close its mouth.","\"Impossible!\" He could not believe it, \"My father has already died!\"","Though he too hoped that the True Dragon was still alive, this was something that he had sensed from inside his egg shell. It was a connection through their bloodline, so it was even more impossible that it could be a deception.","Thus, he definitely couldn’t tolerate someone impersonating the True Dragon.","Ling Han also frowned, and said, \"That is indeed a Great Emperor. Even Buddha Doga is completely no match for him. Furthermore, for someone who can become a Great Emperor, is there any need to impersonate another?\"","Emperor meant the strongest in the world, so what was the significance of impersonating someone else?","\"No, my father has definitely died,\" the little azure dragon said in agitation. \"The bloodline connection definitely can’t be faked. Even if I’m not born yet, I can still clearly sense that my father’s bloodline has dried up and has assimilated with heaven and earth.\"","This guy didn’t even use \"Grandpa Dragon\" anymore, which showed how excited he was.","Indeed, having someone else impersonating his old man, anyone would be stomping their feet in fury, what more when it was a True Dragon. That had been the strongest Divine Beast in the past, and that could be a source of pride for the little azure dragon.","Then, what exactly was going on?","Ling Han suddenly recalled that Buddha Doga had said that the True Dragon Great Emperor was relatively weak, and was clearly inferior to Buddha Ah Han.","What did this mean?"]},{"number":4718,"title":"Chapter 4718: Vicious reputation","paragraphs":["Ling Han returned. For the moment, he couldn’t go to the Primitive Abyss anymore. What was the point?","He needed to increase his cultivation level and reach the limit of Silent Destruction Tier. Then, he would break through to the level of Pseudo-Emperor and later, become a Great Emperor to calm the darkness.","However, without the Genesis Substance, he could only rely on the supremely valuable medicine to speed up his cultivation. This was too slow.","Ling Han first concocted alchemical pills on the Four Origin Planet. He had squeezed out a great many treasures from the various Imperial Clans. Though they were ineffective on him, they could be used on others.","As a large number of alchemical pills were concocted, the cultivation levels of Lin Luo, Zhou Heng and the others were all rapidly improving.","To them, their natural talent was not too bad. They were only missing out on a bit of fated opportunity.","After all, they weren’t the masters of Genesis World.","Especially Lin Luo. His natural talent in cultivation was extremely shocking, and he had long since cultivated to the peak stage of Venerate Tier a good few years ago. After obtaining Ling Han’s alchemical pills, he had completely stabilized his cultivation level, and began seclusion, attempting to break through to Saint Tier.","Next, the Four Origin Planet would welcome a wave of breakthroughs.","Zhou Heng, Chu Hao, and the others had all reached the peak stage of Fourth Extreme. They were now qualified to attempt breaking through to the Saint Tier.","Ling Han didn’t know how many of them could ignite the holy flame with their own power, but for the moment, it was impossible to count on the power of belief. Four Origin Planet only had so many living beings, and it wasn’t enough to support any one of them to ignite the holy flame.","However, though it was difficult to become a Saint now, once he succeeded, his battle prowess would also be considerably stronger than the average Saint.","Ling Han was filled with anticipation. By now, though Saints no longer had much effect on the overall situation of heaven and earth, now that they had become Saints, they would at least have the ability to protect themselves.","After enjoying tender intimacy for a few years with the empress, Chi Menghan, and the others, Ling Han couldn’t sit still any longer.","Actually, an ordinary life was what he yearned for, but for this kind of ordinary life, he had to run around and put his life on the line first.","How could he rapidly increase his cultivation level?","This was ultimately a huge dilemma that hung above Ling Han’s head.","The responsibility on his shoulders was too heavy. To say nothing else, merely for the sake of Old Man Ge’s sacrifice, he too wanted to become a Great Emperor as soon as possible, and suppress the world.","However, where could he go now?","The various Imperial Clans?","He had already gone to those that he could find, and there were still some that had not exposed the location of the ancestral planets all this while. Now, it was even more impossible to find them.","Then, should he go to the Netherworld?","Ling Han guessed that there might also be great opportunities there.","Though the Netherworld had no life force, and was the complete opposite of the Living Realm, things would definitely go the other way when they reached the extreme. For example, wasn’t it theoretically impossible for any living creature to survive in the Primitive Abyss? However, there were Genesis-level Great Herbs there.","Perhaps the Netherworld didn’t possess such Great Herbs, but he was only a Saint, so he didn’t necessarily need such a precious Celestial medicine.","’Fine, I’ll go to the Netherworld and kill some Yin souls while I’m at it. I’ve been away for 200 years, so the Skeleton Saint Tool should be arrogant and domineering again. No one can stop it, right?’","Ling Han didn’t bring the empress and the others with him. After all, who knew if another Lord of Death would appear?","Though his present strength had soared greatly, it was still far from enough against a Great Emperor.","Right now, the Yin souls had already occupied about 30% of the planets in the universe. Their main purpose was to transform the territories that they occupied into the Netherworld. This would take too long. Otherwise, with the battle prowess of the Skeleton Saint Tool, it would be invincible.","Ling Han casually arrived at a planet that had been taken over. The aura of life emanating from his entire body was surging, and it was as dazzling as the sun.","Yin souls instantly surged over. To them, Ling Han’s blood and flesh was a supreme delicacy.","The flesh and blood of living spirits from the Ling Han were their instinctive desires, and ordinary Yin souls didn’t have intelligence. Driven by their instincts, they didn’t even consider Ling Han’s abilities as they pounced over.","All of them scrambled over one another, as if those who were a step slower would not be able to snatch Ling Han’s flesh and blood.","With a thought from Ling Han, weng, a shockwave immediately swept through the entire planet, and all the Yin souls were instantly turned into dust.","Then, he arrived at the second planet, and still, with a single thought, he had instantly dealt with all the Yin souls.","It wasn’t long before he cleared a galaxy and revived the sun.","After doing all this, he smiled slightly.","This was what a Saint was.","Previously, he had encountered opponents that were too strong. They were either the Skeleton Saint Tool, the Lord of Death or an ancient Divine Beast, which made him feel very lacking in confidence.","It should be known that if time was reversed by a few hundred years, a Saint would be an existence at the pinnacle of this world, and Ling Han was the strongest Saint in history. He should be invincible.","Sigh, who asked him to be born in such a chaotic world?","With a flash, he headed to the next galaxy.","But this time, he had just conquered three galaxies, when he sensed that the Void had been torn open, and a powerful aura was spreading out.","Saints had come. En, there was more than one.","Ling Han looked over, and there were a total of three Yin Saints coming out of the Void.","However, when these three Yin Saints saw Ling Han, their expressions instantly changed drastically. Even if they were only in the form of souls, a drastic change in expression could still be seen from them.","How could they not be shocked?","This was Ling Han.","The number one Saint of all eternity!","They hurriedly turned around and fled, once again tearing a rip into space, and threw themselves in.","At this, they finally breathed a sigh of relief. Thankfully, they had escaped from the hands of this bringer of misfortune.","\"Hehe, leaving right after arriving, aren’t you giving me too little face?\" Ling Han’s voice rang out by their ears.","What!","The three Yin Saints were all astonished. When had Ling Han caught up to them?","What kind of speed was this?","It should be known that they too were Saints.","The number one Saint of all eternity, this was the strongest Saint in history.","Ling Han stretched out a hand to grab them, and the three Yin Saints were immediately forcibly pulled back.","\"You, what do you want to do?\" the three Yin Saints asked in trembling voices. Of course, they were all communicating through divine sense.","At such a close distance, they could clearly feel Ling Han’s aura of life that was as majestic as the sun. There was no need for him to make a move at all. Merely this aura of life was enough to destroy their spirits.","Yin and Yang were opposites. This was inherent and fundamental.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and with a tremor of his divine sense, the three Yin Saints all fainted.","He didn’t kill them, not because he was benevolent, but because he wanted to leave the Yin Saints to the empress and the others.","—His strength was too strong. With the same rewards from heaven and earth, what he received would be useless, but if it was obtained by the empress and the others, the effects would be completely different.","Thus, in Ling Han’s eyes, this was equivalent to Great Herbs beneficial for cultivation, so he naturally couldn’t waste it.","Using his divine sense as a lock, he strung the three Yin Saints together, dragging them behind him. Then, he continued to head to other planets.","Light the sun, and once again illuminate these dark galaxies.","After another while, a spatial fluctuation spread out. This time, nine Yin Saints had come.","\"Not good, it’s that bringer of misfortune, Ling Han!\"","\"Run!\"","But this time, they had not even torn open space, when they were knocked unconscious by a single thought from Ling Han.","\"Invigorating, this is what an elite should be like,\" Ling Han said with a smile. Then, he continued onto his own business.","He was going to wait for those Imperial Sons from the Lands of Death to arrive, and then take advantage of the opening to harvest another batch. Of course, the Skeleton Saint Tool was his main target. As long as he could get rid of the Skeleton Saint Tool, the invasion of the Netherworld would be greatly slowed down."]},{"number":4719,"title":"Chapter 4719: String of Yin Saints","paragraphs":["Another half a day later, the third batch of Yin Saints arrived.","\"Ling Han!\"","\"Run!\"","Their reaction was the same. When they saw Ling Han, they immediately paled in shock. Then, they turned around and ran quickly.","Of course, they definitely wouldn’t be able to escape. They could only be suppressed by Ling Han.","However, this also made Ling Han very displeased.","Was his reputation really that bad?","Sigh, he was very unaccustomed to having no one by his side to answer him. Otherwise, the large black dog would point out righteously, \"Yes, you are that kind of person!\"","\"If you want to show off, it’s still better to have Old Black here. He can deliver the greatest blow to your opponent.\"","Ling Han murmured to himself. With his continuous efforts, the surrounding galaxies had already lit up, area by area. The sun had revived, and was exuding sunlight that had not been seen for a long time.","After 10 days, Ling Han had already \"captured\" close to 100 Yin Saints. They were all strung together like kites by his power of belief, floating behind him.","\"En, there are a little too many of them. Let’s go back first.\" Ling Han thought for a moment, then tore a rip into space. Taking these Yin Saints with him, he first returned to the Four Origin Planet, where he converted them into cultivation resources for the empress and the others.","Xiu, he sank into the Void. Space closed, creating a slight ripple.","When these ripples were about to disperse completely, it was visible that in the space not too far away, space had suddenly torn open, and a considerable number of figures had walked out.","—If Ling Han was here, he would discover that these were not Yin Saints, but rather living people.","The Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters of the Lands of Death.","Their improvement was impressive, and even the weakest had reached Five Stars, but their battle prowess naturally far surpassed Five Star Saints. With a dozen over of them together, they formed a terrifying suppression.","\"He just left,\" Li Dangping said. He sensed for a while, and the ripples caused by the shattering of space had already passed. He couldn’t get any more information.","\"Is it Ding Shu, or Origin?\"","\"Or Heaven Crushing, or Jing Haoran!\"","These Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters of the Lands of Death were all guessing. By now, the only ones who truly had the ability to resist were Ding Shu and the other Genesis World rulers.","Ling Han selflessly taught the Destructive Energy to them, allowing their ability to resist Yin souls to reach its strongest. As long as they moved, no Yin Saint would be able to withstand a single strike. They could only rely on the Skeleton Saint Tool to suppress them.","However, if a Saint wanted to flee, how could he be stopped?","Of course, this was unless they had long since set up an inescapable net, and waited for them to enter the trap before killing them.","Even so, it was still unknown whether they could be killed or not.","Thus, Saints were extremely difficult to kill.","None of them suspected Ling Han, because Ling Han had already disappeared for too long, as if he had disappeared from this world.","\"Summon Yin souls to come and reoccupy these planets.\"","\"Let’s go and extinguish the sun again.\"","These Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters began to assign missions, turning the Living Realm into Netherworld. This concerned the great plans of the Lords of Death.","Meanwhile, Ling Han was far too powerful. He had arrived on the Four Origin Planet in just half a day’s time.","Boom, saintly might spread out.","Even if the abilities of the Yin Saints were much weaker, Saints were still Saints. Moreover, there were over a hundred Yin Saints here. Even if they were unconscious, there would still be a sliver of saintly might seeping out, so how terrifying would all of them be together?","Instantly, Brother Monkey and the others rushed out, but when they saw a large number of Yin Saints being skewered by Ling Han like candied hawthorn, their expressions became strange.","This... was indeed very shocking.","\"Come, let’s share,\" Ling Han said with a smile. Killing Yin souls could obtain rewards from heaven and earth, and the rewards obtained from killing Yin Saints were even greater.","They could even be divided like this?","Everyone was gritting their teeth. Only Ling Han would have such extravagance, capturing a bunch of Yin Saints to give them the rewards of heaven and earth.","However, this was really a good thing. The rewards from heaven and earth were different from any Celestial medicine, safe and without side effects, so it was worth it.","After everyone had shared the spoils, they began to slaughter the Yin souls.","So what if it was Yin Saints? They were being suppressed by Ling Han, and could not resist at all.","With such a large amount of nutrition, Saints like Brother Monkey, the empress and the others did not have any obvious improvement, but for those below Saint-level, every single one of them had improved greatly.","It could be foreseen that not too long after, the Four Origin Planet would welcome a wave of breakthroughs of Saints.","\"Little Han, we’re going too.\"","\"That’s right, let’s fight together.\"","The large black dog, little azure dragon and the others were all howling. They constantly stayed on the Four Origin Planet to cultivate, and were very bored.","Ling Han thought for a moment, then nodded, \"All right.\"","They were all Saints, so they could flee if they couldn’t defeat the enemy. If they truly came across a Great Emperor, he could activate the Imperial Weapon to resist and at that time, he could also provide cover for their retreat.","There were crises, but they mostly could be resolved. Furthermore, with this kind of pressure, cultivation would become faster.","\"Let’s go!\"","Ling Han tore a rip into space, and led everyone on their way.","Not too long later, they appeared out of thin air, and arrived in a dark galaxy.","Oh, the sun had been extinguished again.","If the sun could speak, it would definitely be complaining endlessly.","—You guys extinguish me one moment, and ignite me the next. Do you really think I’m a candle?","Boom! They were all Saints, so their saintly might naturally spread into the surroundings.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Immediately, multiple figures appeared. They were all Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters from the Lands of Death.","\"Little Han, it’s time to show off,\" the large black dog immediately said.","Sure enough, the large black dog knew him best.","They practically... had the same tastes.","With a thought from Ling Han, his appearance immediately changed.","\"Humph, so it’s you guys!\" Lu Xun said coldly, \"I really don’t know where you got your courage from, to actually dare to come over!\"","With how weak the Living Realm was, they could only snipe once and then change locations. Thus, for the people of the line of Nine Suns Holy Land still dared to come over, this made him very confused.","\"We have big d*cks, so we have nothing to fear!\" the large black dog said.","\"We’re not as thin as earthworms like you!\" the little azure dragon also immediately said.","Peng! Peng! Peng! Peng!","However, without waiting for Lu Xun to make a move, these two bad-mouthed guys were immediately thrashed by Hu Niu and Chi Menghan.","This!","Lu Xun’s expression was livid. He was the dignified Imperial Son of the ancient times, and had once commanded an era. Yet now, he was actually being toyed with like a monkey?","\"You guys have gone too far!\" he said in a baleful voice.","\"B@stard son, come fight me if you’re dissatisfied!\" the large black dog provoked.","\"You’re seeking death!\" Lu Xun strode out. He was completely unafraid of the large black dog and the other Saints. Only Brother Monkey could make him feel slight wariness. When the line of the Battle Saint Emperor fought, he was a maniac, but the more he fought, the stronger he became, and the more crazy he became.","Thus, if the large black dog and the others were were willing to battle, he would naturally be more than happy to oblige. This would give him a chance to massacre them.","\"That um... Little Han, I’ll give you a chance. Go, kill this guy for Grandpa Dog,\" the large black dog pointed at Ling Han and said very casually.","\"Yes, Grandpa Dog,\" Ling Han said respectfully. He and the large black dog were the best partners.","Seeing that the large black dog didn’t dare to fight, Lu Xun couldn’t help but humph. However, when his eyes swept over Ling Han, he revealed a hint of surprise.","A red holy flame, a Two Star Saint.","Strange, when did a Two Star Saint appear from the Four Origin Planet?"]},{"number":4720,"title":"Chapter 4720: Might of the Battle Armor","paragraphs":["In this era, only Saints could be active on the world stage. The others were all mediocre, and could only be blasted into dust.","However, even if a large number of Yin souls could help one rapidly increase his cultivation level, becoming a Saint was still not a simple matter.","By now, the power of belief could no longer be gathered. He could only rely on his own comprehension of the Regulations of heaven and earth to ignite the holy flame. This was really, really too difficult. There were really not many people that could do it.","Thus, the sudden appearance of a Two Star Saint from the Nine Suns Holy Land made Lu Xun feel very curious.","Could it be Ling Han?","This thought flashed through his mind, but he immediately shook his head.","Firstly, Ling Han had already disappeared for more than two hundred years, so how could he suddenly appear?","Secondly, with how freakish Ling Han was, how could he not have improved after so many years, and still be stuck at the level of Two Star Saint?","Although he didn’t want to praise Ling Han, he had to admit that Ling Han’s talent was too terrifying. 200 years was enough time for him to advance to the next level.","Thus, this person was definitely not Ling Han.","The red-colored holy flame could be seen with a single glance.","However, he had only seen one part of it, and not the other part. That was because if Ling Han’s holy flame was released from his mind, it would be even larger than a house. At that time, he would definitely change his mind.","\"Who are you?\" Lu Xun asked calmly.","Ling Han thought for a moment, then said, \"My surname is Tu, and others call me Imperial Son.\"","Slaughtering Imperial <anno data-annotation-id=\"07a52705-b759-4711-8789-79b6fc87f34e\" data-title=\"Son\">Son 1 </anno>?","Hiss, do you take me for an idiot?","\"You’re seeking death!\" He immediately charged over. However, before Ling Han could make a move, he saw the staff sweep out, and Brother Monkey had already stood in front of Ling Han, launching an attack at Lu Xun.","In these two hundred plus years, Brother Monkey had been battling with Yin souls, and had obtained countless rewards from heaven and earth. By now, he was already a Four-Star Saint.","The staff struck out, its might terrifying.","Ling Han was rendered speechless. Sigh, Brother Monkey was really too bellicose.","However, since Brother Monkey had made a move, it would not be proper for him to interfere either. He could only step back slightly.","Er, he had not succeeded in showing off.","On the other side, Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters from the Lands of Death, such as Tong Ming,Wu Xingtong and the others were in no rush to make a move. As they saw it, Brother Monkey was the strongest Saint of Four Origin Planet. They only had to defeat Brother Monkey, and these people’s fighting spirit would collapse. They would not be able to withstand a single blow.","Of course, even if they attacked now, those people on the other side would still be unable to withstand a single blow.","Fight, fight, fight. In terms of cultivation level, Brother Monkey was inferior to Lu Xun, and his natural talent was also inferior. Logically speaking, he should have lost very soon.","However, the members of the line of the Battle Saint Emperor became stronger and crazier as they fought. Brother Monkey’s viciousness boiled, turning into blazing fighting spirit, and his battle prowess actually increased inconceivably.","He fought Lu Xun to a tie.","\"As expected of the line of the Battle Saint Emperor.\"","\"In the past, when the Battle Saint Emperor hadn’t become Emperor yet, his natural talent wasn’t the strongest. However, he forcibly defeated all the Saints of that era, and became a Pseudo-Emperor, and finally attaining Dao.\"","\"This belief that the more you fight, the stronger you become is engraved in the bones of the line of the Battle Saint Emperor.\"","\"However, this monkey should also be one of the strongest. He really has the domineering aura of the Battle Saint Emperor from years ago.\"","The Imperial Sons discussed spiritedly, but were not moved.","Brother Monkey’s strength was forcefully released by activating his life force. Furthermore, it seemed like only the line of the Battle Saint Emperor could do this in this world. However, this kind of strength ultimately could not be maintained for long.","In a prolonged battle, Lu Xun would definitely win.","\"Brother Monkey, wear this Battle Armor.\" Ling Han tossed the bronze Battle Armor over to Brother Monkey.","The gulf between their cultivation levels was far too great. In the first place, this wasn’t a fair battle, so Ling Han had no option but to help Brother Monkey cheat.","Brother Monkey didn’t act coy and accepted the Battle Armor.","Pu!","Seeing the Battle Armor made of stone, Lu Xun and the others all looked disdainful.","’Just how poor are you people?’","Although a large number of planets had fallen, causing precious materials to be difficult to obtain, it wasn’t to the extent that they would use rocks to forge Battle Armors, right?","This was definitely rock, and every Imperial Son could guarantee this with their heads.","\"Pu!\"","\"Hahaha!\"","On the side of the Lands of Death, the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters all laughed loudly, unable to control themselves no matter what.","This was too hilarious. Just how poor were you people, to take out this kind of Battle Armor?","Was that Two Star Saint a joker?","\"I wish Brother Monkey victory!\" The large black dog immediately applauded.","The little azure dragon replied, \"Brother Monkey, beat that guy up!\"","\"Humph, humph.\" The perverted pig snorted in response. For some reason, it was born displeased with Brother Monkey. It kept feeling as if it had been bullied by this monkey in its last life.","The little red bird placed a hand on her forehead. These unreliable guys. She was clearly so beautiful and dignified, so why had she gotten together with them?","Brother Monkey put on the Battle Armor, then waved the staff and placed it on his shoulder. Then, he cocked his head and said, \"Don’t say that Old Sun is bullying you. I won’t use the staff!\"","His strongest technique was released through using the staff. Now that he would not use the staff, it was equivalent to severing his own arms.","Lu Xun couldn’t help but laugh in anger. Where did you get such courage from?","’Do you really think that you’re invincible just because you’re wearing a stone armor?’","How naive was this?","\"Humph, then let this Imperial Son wake you up from your dreams!\" Lu Xun waved his hands, and instantly, endless flaming arrows flew out, shooting towards Brother Monkey. Every feather arrow was wrapped with eight stars Regulations, and their destructive power was incredibly terrifying.","Brother Monkey was unafraid, and directly faced the arrows head-on, charging towards Lu Xun.","\"How preposterous!\" Lu Xun sneered. In his eyes, this was completely suicide.","However, the following scene caused his eyes to pop out of his head.","Brother Monkey advanced fiercely all the way. Whatever feather arrow shot over, it was immediately sent flying.","What!","F***!","Not only him, but Yang Yihuan and the others were also the same. They all stuck out their tongues, their mouths big enough to fit a few eggs.","This, this, this, this!","Heavens, could it be that what they saw was an illusion?","At this time, Brother Monkey had already charged over. With Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, how fast was his speed?","He threw a punch at Lu Xun.","Though Lu Xun paled in shock, as the son of a Great Emperor, just how astonishing was his battle instincts?","Boom, he also replied with a punch of his own.","He was still very domineering. Whether it was in terms of cultivation level or natural talent in cultivation, he was completely superior to Brother Monkey. Thus, in this attack, Brother Monkey was only asking for trouble.","The two fists crashed into one another, instantly causing a stormy wave. The might of Saint Tier was too frightening. Light exploded, and Regulations surged into the skies, greatly affecting visibility.","Then, a figure fell out of the brilliance.","It was... Lu Xun!","Yang Yihuan and the others were all astounded. How was this possible?","Though Lu Xun was not the strongest elite among them, as a Five Star Saint, he would have fifteen stars of battle prowess under normal conditions, and if he used any more ultimate moves, his battle prowess could completely charge up to eighteen stars.","On the other hand, Brother Monkey was only a Four-Star Saint, and his conventional battle prowess was only eight stars. Even if the line of the Battle Saint Emperor could release a super-strong battle prowess, it shouldn’t be exaggerated to this extent, right?","How could it be!","They turned to look at the Battle Armor on Brother Monkey. Was it because of this?","B-but that really was made of stone, though it was exuding a bronze-coloured light.","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">’Tu’ means slaughtering in Chinese.</annotations>"]},{"number":4721,"title":"Chapter 4721: Terrifying physique","paragraphs":["Ling Han laughed loudly, \"Do you guys really want to complain? It’s fine. If you want to complain, go ahead.\"","Yang Yihuan and the others really wanted to complain, but they were even more stunned now. If it really was this Battle Armor that was taking effect, then this was too amazing, wasn’t it?","How could there be such an amazing Battle Armor in this world?","Brother Monkey didn’t care. With a sharp shout, he chased after Lu Xun.","Although the Bronze Battle Armor couldn’t compare to the Silver Battle Armor, it was similarly made from the compressed rocks of the Primitive Abyss. One grain of sand was comparable to a star, so how hard would this Battle Armor be?","What kind of attack could penetrate it?","Of course, if that was all, the shockwave would still be able to injure Brother Monkey. However, there was also Genesis Substance in the Battle Armor, and this was what truly had a decisive effect.","With the boost from this Battle Armor, Brother Monkey’s defense was invincible, and his battle prowess was greatly boosted again. It was truly terrifying.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","It was only Brother Monkey that was attacking madly. Lu Xun did not have the ability to fight back at all — even if he did, it was useless. He could not break through the Battle Armor at all.","This stunned Yang Yihuan and the others. What kind of Battle Armor was this? That was too terrifying, wasn’t it?","Who would have thought that the Four Origin Planet would actually possess such a treasure?","Hiss, even if the Skeleton Saint Tool attacked, could it break through the defenses?","These Imperial Sons were all doubtful, and did not have the slightest bit of confidence.","The large black dog and little azure dragon felt that it was a pity. There was only one such Battle Armor—the other was in the hands of Buddha Doga. Otherwise, they would also be able to show off now.","If a dog (dragon) didn’t show off in life, what difference did it have with a salted fish?","\"Tsk, those trash over there, does anyone dare to battle Grandpa Dog’s lackey?\" The large black dog could only find another way to show off. He placed his arm around Ling Han’s shoulder, \"If anyone can take ten moves from Grandpa Dog’s lackey, Grandpa Dog will take him as my grandson.\"","These words!","Yang Yihuan and the others were all furious. This dog’s mouth was really too despicable.","How strange. Being able to become a Saint, how could he not have any bit of culture?","Is it because you are the most despicable character and so became a Saint?","\"I’m going to kill this mutt. We’ll all have a dog meat feast later!\" Tong Ming walked over in a dignified manner.","\"All right,\" the Imperial Sons all replied with a smile. The flesh and blood of Saint-level Demonic Beasts were extremely nutritious, and would also be of some help to them.","\"F***, they want to eat Grandpa Dog’s meat? Little Han, er, Ah Tu, beat them to death for Grandpa Dog!\" The large black dog flew into a thunderous rage, and swatted out a paw at Ling Han.","\"You won’t do it yourself?\" Ling Han turned around and asked. Furthermore, what exactly should my name be?","\"Shouldn’t lackeys be working for their Big Brother at this time?\" The large black dog naturally wouldn’t participate in the battle. Firstly, his cultivation level was lower, and secondly, the opponent was an ancient Imperial Son, whose natural talent in martial arts overwhelmed him.","Thus, it was naturally best to munch on sunflower seeds, clap and watch the show.","Ling Han shook his head, then looked towards Tong Ming, \"You are too weak. Go and call a few more people over.\"","\"Haha, how boastful of you!\" Tong Ming sneered. \"Do you think you’re Ling Han?\"","Now, Ling Han had already stabilized his position as the strongest Saint in all eternity. Even the ancient Imperial Sons had to admit that this guy was more freakishly awesome.","Er, should he be happy or displeased now?","Would this become a joke in the future?","Ling Han pinched his nose and said, \"Fine, you go ahead then.\"","\"You’re all brimming with confidence!\" Tong Ming said as he launched an attack at Ling Han.","Pa!","Ling Han casually delivered a palm strike, and Tong Ming instantly collapsed, his body floating in the pitch-black space.","’F*ck!’","In this instant, all the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters wanted to curse madly. That was Tong Ming, and he had actually been knocked unconscious with a single palm strike?","Who could believe this?","\"You, you are Ling Han!\" All the Imperial Sons exclaimed in trembling voices.","Aside from Ling Han, no one else could be so freakish.","Ling Han sighed. At first, he had wanted to pretend to be a pig to eat a tiger, and pretend for a while longer, but now? His identity was immediately exposed.","It seemed that no matter how he changed his appearance and identity, his persona would soon collapse.","What was off?","—If those Imperial Sons of the Lands of Death knew what he was thinking, they would definitely complain madly, ’Your battle prowess! Aside from you, who else would possess this kind of battle prowess? Don’t you have the slightest idea?’","Ling Han shook his head resolutely, \"I am not Ling Han. You have mistaken me for someone else!\"","His alias couldn’t collapse so quickly!","All the Imperial Sons were speechless. The proof was so obvious, and you actually still want to deny it?","\"Ling Han, you have finally returned!\" Li Dangping said calmly. Though Ling Han was indeed very strong, he was still a Two Star Saint, after all. He seemed to be stuck on this threshold, and had not improved in the slightest.","Thus, if they, the great Imperial Sons, joined forces, it would not be difficult for them to match Ling Han.","\"Where did you get this Battle Armor from?\"","In comparison, he was even more curious about this.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, \"If you defeat me, I’ll tell you.\"","The Imperial Sons all exchanged a glance before stepping forward.","In a one-on-one battle, any one of them had to admit that they were definitely no match for Ling Han. Thus, the dignified ancient Imperial Sons actually had to join forces to face the enemy, yet this was a move that they had no choice but to make.","Ling Han stood, arms crossed behind his back. In theory, he was a Two Star Saint, but in truth, he had grasped 38 Regulations, which was who knew how much more than a Nine-Star Saint.","Thus, even against the Skeleton Saint Tool, he could still put up a fight. Moreover, this was under the condition that he didn’t use the light of the great dao, the Seed of the Holy Flame, or the Destructive Energy.","As for the Imperial Sons? Heh, they could only be a snack for him.","\"How arrogant!\" The Imperial Sons of the Lands of Death all gritted their teeth, their expressions filled with displeasure. Only Feng Miaoling showed an expression of admiration. This was the man that she had her eye on. He was so dominating.","Unfortunately, they were on opposite sites, so what could she do to get Ling Han over to her side?","It was unknown who was the first to move, but the Imperial Sons of the Lands of Death all charged over. They all drew their Saint Tools, and attacked Ling Han madly.","They were completely outmatched in a one-on-one battle, so they could only place their hopes on overwhelming Ling Han with numbers.","There were over a dozen Imperial Sons here, and even the weakest among them was a Five-Star Saint. Add to that the Saint Tool, and there was no way that they would not be able to stand against that greatest freak of all eternity.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","A dozen over attacks landed on Ling Han almost at the same time, but Ling Han still had his hands behind his back. He had absolutely no intention of fighting back or even actually parrying.","This!","All the Imperial Sons smirked coldly. This was too arrogant, to actually dare to take their attacks head-on.","It should be known that if they unleashed their full power, even the weakest of them would have battle prowess of eighteen stars, and the strongest of them had even surpassed twenty stars. With so many attacks attacking him at the same time, even if he did not die, he would be crippled, what more when he was facing these attacks head-on?","’Die!’","Soon, the brilliance dispersed, and Ling Han was seen standing proudly, as straight as a spear. Aside from the fact that his clothes were slightly torn, what injury did he have in the slightest?","This!","What kind of physique do you have, freak!","\"This bullsh*t, Grandpa Dog will give you nine points. I’m afraid that you’ll be too proud if I give you an extra point,\" the large black dog said from the sidelines.","\"Grandpa Dragon gives you 10 points. I’m not afraid that you will become arrogant from it,\" the little azure dragon giggled.","Meanwhile, the Imperial Sons were all dumbfounded with shock, completely rendered speechless.","This was f*cking hopeless."]},{"number":4722,"title":"Chapter 4722: Ling Han’s Might","paragraphs":["With so many Imperial Sons, no matter how weak they were, they still possessed eighteen stars of battle prowess. With their combined attacks, they were actually unable to cause even a slight injury to Ling Han.","F***, what was the point of continuing the battle?","Are you a Skeleton Saint Tool, built from Saintly Material?","Meanwhile, Ling Han looked down and said, \"You guys damaged my clothes, so you have to pay compensation.\"","Compensate your sister!","The Imperial Sons exchanged looks before turning around to flee.","They were no match for him. This guy was too freakish.","Ling Han sighed, stretched out a hand and pressed down, \"What I hate the most is when someone owes me something and doesn’t pay me back.\"","Weng, a terrifying pressure descended, and those dozen over Imperial Sons were actually forcibly trapped.","This was too terrifying.","It should be known that Saints were hard to kill. If he wanted to flee, even if their opponent activated the Imperial Weapon, it would still be very difficult to hit him.","And among these ancient Imperial Sons, which one of them was not one of the strongest Saints of their era?","They fled at the first instant, and were actually still trapped by Ling Han?","’Holy f*ck! Are you really a Saint?’","On the other side, Lu Xun’s face had already turned green from watching. How could he dare to continue fighting? He hurriedly turned around and fled.","Though he was battling fiercely with Brother Monkey, because he was too far away from Ling Han, it was easier for him to escape.","After all, if the Saint wanted to flee, it would be extremely difficult to catch up to him.","He tore a rip into the Void and left, not daring to even turn around.","Ling Han did not take it to heart either. He merely looked smilingly at those Imperial Sons, and asked, \"Now, are you guys going to pay or not?\"","\"We will!\" these Imperial Sons said in unison. In comparison, it was naturally their lives that were more important.","\"All right, give me a Saint-level Great Herb each,\" Ling Han said.","’F*ck! Why don’t you go commit robbery instead?’","’We’ve only damaged your clothes, yet you’re actually demanding a Saint-level Great Herb as compensation? And it has to one from each person at that?’","Ling Han smiled again, \"So what if I am committing robbery? Do you have the right to resist?\"","All the Imperial Sons were instantly rendered speechless. This gap in strength was really too wide.","Though Ling Han was still a Saint, in terms of battle prowess, he was probably a Pseudo-Emperor — even if he was inferior, the gap was not too big.","And this was still a Two Star Saint?","Who was he trying to fool?","Ling Han smiled, \"My patience is limited. If you guys don’t hand over the Saint-level Great Herb within a count of ten, I can only blast you guys into dust.\"","\"Even if we promise you, we can’t possibly hand it over in such a short period of time,\" Tong Ming hurriedly said. Wise men don’t fight when the odds are against them. They were the sons of Great Emperors, and had boundless future prospects. Dying for the sake of a Saint-level Great Herb was really not worth it.","But the problem was, how could they possibly bring such a Great Herb with them?","\"It’s fine. I’ll allow you to contact someone. As long as you hand over what I want, I’ll let you live,\" Ling Han said.","The Imperial Sons were exasperated, and could only start to contact.","The Chang Clan’s Galaxy Network was now serving them.","In a short while, the Void cracked open, and groups of tall warriors walked out, exuding a cold aura.","The Skeleton Saint Tools!","Lu Xun had also appeared. It was he who had called for reinforcements.","This time, he was no longer panicking. Instead, he was filled with confidence.","Ling Han was indeed strong. 200 years ago, he could even match three or four Skeleton Saint Tools, but that was about it.","And now, he had mobilized 50 Skeleton Saint Tools. Just how terrifying was this crushing power?","\"Ling Han, hand them over, and I can spare your life,\" Lu Xun said calmly. This was a calmness that came from having everything under control.","Ling Han looked at the large black dog, and said, \"Am I the type to swallow my grievances after suffering a loss?\"","\"Of course not,\" the large black dog replied with a smile.","\"Then what should be done to those who threaten me?\" Ling Han asked again.","\"Of course, we have to fight. We have to defeat all of them,\" the large black dog continued.","Ling Han nodded, and said to Lu Xun, \"You heard it, right?\"","Even at this point, you still dare to show off?","\"Don’t think that I will spare you for fear of harming the hostages!\" Lu Xun said balefully, \"The priority of killing you has been raised to the highest level, and according to the original words, ’eliminate at all costs’!\"","Heh, those Great Emperors in the Lands of Death really had a high opinion of him.","It was no wonder. Previously, two ancient Great Emperors had moved, though there was a boundless distance separating them, and had even caused Old Man Ge to die as a result.","Thinking of this, Ling Han’s eyes involuntarily became cold, and killing intent rose up in him.","\"Old Black, kill the hostages for me!\" he said.","\"Yi, you don’t want the Great Herbs anymore?\" The large black dog felt a little heartache.","\"I don’t want it anymore!\" Ling Han said decisively.","\"All right!\" The large black dog nodded, and was just about to make a move.","\"Stop!\" Lu Xun roared. \"Go! Go!\"","Boom, the 50 Skeleton Saint Tools immediately flew out, blasting towards Ling Han, the large black dog and the others.","Ling Han humphed and stepped forward.","He threw a punch with all his might.","The Skeleton Saint Tools didn’t possess any intelligence, and they only knew how to battle. Moreover, they were incredibly powerful to begin with, so they weren’t afraid of any attack. Thus, how could they dodge a head-on attack?","Of course, it was a battle of strength against strength.","Peng!","The two fists instantly crashed into each other. A frightening power surged, and Regulations flashed madly.","When the light dissipated, everyone shockingly discovered that not only had Ling Han not been sent flying, he was instead standing proudly where he had been.","On the other hand, the Skeleton Saint Tool hadn’t retreated either. However, its right arm had been obliterated all the way to its shoulder!","Heavens!","This was only a single strike.","Just how powerful was Ling Han’s might?","Neither side retreated, which meant that Ling Han and the Skeleton Saint Tool were already on the same level in terms of power, but their destructive power... was on two completely different levels.","This was only natural. Ling Han had used the light of the great dao and the Destructive Energy. The only thing he hadn’t used was the holy flame. Just how powerful was this destructive power?","Capable of destroying the heavens and earth!","However, the Skeleton Saint Tool was also extremely domineering. Though only one side of its body was left, its battle instincts did not decrease in the slightest. It sent out another palm strike, blasting towards Ling Han.","Peng!","Ling Han brandished his fists to parry this attack. In just a short while, this Skeleton Saint Tool had lost another half of its body, leaving behind only its head, broken upper body, and two legs.","However, this wasn’t a living being at all. It didn’t feel any pain, nor did it have any fear of death. It raised a foot and ruthlessly stomped down on Ling Han. Endless saintly might diffused into the surroundings.","\"Humph!\" Ling Han threw another punch. Peng! The Skeleton Saint Tool completely fell apart.","Hiss!","Seeing this scene, everyone was speechless, their scalps numb.","It was as if they had seen a ghost.","Just how terrifying was the Skeleton Saint Tool?","Even the Imperial Weapon could only force it to retreat, and was unable to shatter it. Now, however, it had been forcefully destroyed by Ling Han.","Didn’t this mean that Ling Han’s battle prowess had actually surpassed the Imperial Weapon?","No, everyone shook their heads again. Ling Han was indeed extraordinary, but he was not as terrifying as this.","In terms of battle prowess, Ling Han was actually more or less the same as the Skeleton Saint Tool. However, this guy had mastered some kind of energy, and its destructive power was too terrifying. It could easily destroy the Saintly Material.","This was natural. At that time, with a punch from Ling Han, a hole had been created in the ground of the Primitive Abyss. What kind of concept was that?"]},{"number":4723,"title":"Chapter 4723: Blasted apart","paragraphs":["To say nothing of the Imperial Sons, even the empress and the others were astounded.","They already knew how awesome Ling Han was. After returning from the Primitive Abyss, Ling Han’s abilities had definitely soared. However, he had destroyed a Skeleton Saint Tool with just a few punches?","This still far exceeded their understanding.","They had to be seeing things. How could he possibly be so strong?","Meanwhile, Lu Xun was about to go crazy.","He couldn’t believe his eyes at all. How could a measly Two Star Saint Saint be this powerful?","It should be known that when so many Imperial Clans had attacked it with their Imperial Weapons, the Skeleton Saint Tool had still remained unmoved.","Why?","This was because the Skeleton Saint Tool had used a very unique technique. It could distribute the attacks that it received onto every part of its body.","Thus, with how powerful the Saint Tool was, how could several hundred Saint Tools not be able to share the blow delivered by the equivalent of a Great Emperor?","However, Ling Han destroyed the Skeleton Saint Tool with a single punch.","This guy’s strength was actually stronger than the Imperial Weapon?","No, no, no, that was definitely impossible.","How could a mere Two Star Saint surpass the Imperial Weapon in terms of battle prowess?","If it had been the attack of an Imperial Weapon, the Skeleton Saint Tool would have been sent flying far, far away, and it would not have been like now. With a single punch from Ling Han, the Skeleton Saint Tool did not retreat even half a step.","It could only be said that Ling Han had mastered some kind of secret technique, which endlessly increased his destructive power.","Hiss, was this the reason why this person had disappeared for more than two hundred years?","At this moment, Lu Xun also wished that he had disappeared for 200 years, and had similarly experienced this kind of fortuitous encounter.","Boom!","However, the Skeleton Saint Tools didn’t show any signs of fear. The remaining continued to charge toward Ling Han.","This was their strength, but at the same time, it was also their weakness.","Lu Xun thought for a moment, but did not stop them.","Ling Han’s attacks were powerful, yet this didn’t mean that his defenses were also strong. Perhaps he would be blasted into smithereens by the combined attacks of 10 or 20 Skeleton Saint Tools?","He would only have paid the price of a few Skeleton Saint Tools to kill this greatest freak of all eternity, so it was naturally worth it.","Ling Han released a battle cry, and charged towards the Skeleton Saint Tools. Peng, peng, peng! He brandished his fists repeatedly, and the Destructive Energy fused with the light of the great dao, turning into an incredibly terrifying destructive power.","Peng, peng, peng. He was using the method of trading injury for injury, while he himself was charging around madly, only pursuing the efficiency of slaughter. This naturally caused his defenses to become too horrible to look at, and he was continuously struck by the attacks of the Skeleton Saint Tools.","What kind of concept was this?","Each Skeleton Saint Tool was equivalent to a combination of several hundred Saint Tools. Just how terrifying was it to have so many Saint Tools attacking at the same time?","However, when these attacks landed on Ling Han, they did not even cause the slightest ripple.","It was as if... he was a piece of Origin Gold.","F***!","Lu Xun wanted to grab his head and exclaim in shock. How could there be such a freak?","Generally speaking, if one’s attack power was strong, their defense would definitely be weaker. They were human, after all. They would definitely have their strengths and weaknesses.","However, this kind of logic was completely ineffective in front of Ling Han. Both his offensive and defensive abilities were inconceivably strong. What could they do?","\"Retreat! Retreat!\" Lu Xun hurriedly sent out a signal for the Skeleton Saint Tools to retreat. Otherwise, this would completely be delivering itself up to die.","Could it be that only the Great Emperors would be able to deal with this guy now?","Damn it, the Lords of Death couldn’t make a move so easily. The time wasn’t right yet. Otherwise, to be targeted by a Great Emperor, he would definitely die.","Could it be that they really could only watch helplessly as this guy rose up and became the greatest threat?","Xiu, xiu, xiu! 41 Skeleton Saint Tools flew back, and as for the remaining eight... Ling Han had detained them. With a single punch, they had lost half their bodies, and it was impossible for them to return.","What could they do? What could they do?","Lu Xun felt a chill all over his body. A dozen over Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters had fallen into Ling Han’s hands, and this guy was really going to kill them.","Though the Lords of Death had already prioritized killing Ling Han, those were the sons and daughters of the Great Emperors. If they really died, it was hard to guarantee that the Great Emperors would not go berserk.","Right now, the Living Realm’s transformation into the Netherworld had already reached a critical stage. If something went wrong at this moment... it was possible that millions upon millions of years of preparation would be ruined.","\"Ling Han, we can talk things over peacefully!\" he hurriedly said.","Ling Han smiled calmly, \"You want the lives of these Imperial Sons? Fine, then have those Lords of Death commit suicide, and I will let them go!\"","Lu Xun was furious. Wasn’t this making things difficult for him?","To have the Lords of Death commit suicide?","How was this possible!","\"Change your request!\" he called out loudly.","Ling Han stared fixedly at Lu Xun, \"What right do you have to negotiate with me?\"","Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was unleashed, and he charged at Lu Xun. In a flash, he had already arrived less than 300 meters away from him.","\"Block him!\" Lu Xun exclaimed in shock.","The Skeleton Saint Tools all charged toward Ling Han.","\"Trash!\" Ling Han roared as he unleashed a barrage of attacks. The Skeleton Saint Tools that blocked his path all started to lose limbs. They could only use their bodies to slow him down.","Ling Han penetrated deeply, as if he had entered into an uninhabited land.","It was not that the Skeleton Saint Tools couldn’t withstand a single blow from Ling Han, but they could only slow him down slightly.","In terms of destructive power alone, even a Pseudo-Emperor couldn’t compare to Ling Han.","Lu Xun was so scared that cold sweat was dripping down his forehead. He hurriedly tore a rip into space, wanting to escape from this place.","Weng, right at this moment, a terrifying aura surged over, and a sea of blood suddenly appeared in space.","One of the Twelve Lands of Death!","Hiss, a Lord of Death had arrived.","Ling Han immediately looked solemn. No matter how awesome he was, he could not compare to the Great Emperor. Previously, in the Primitive Abyss, the True Dragon Great Emperor tier had overwhelmed him and Buddha Doga completely.","—According to Buddha Doga, there was still a very big problem with this kind of Great Emperor. His battle prowess was not complete.","\"Let them go!\" A cold voice rang out, completely emotionless.","This was actually a female Great Emperor!","The ruler of the sea of blood was actually an empress?","In history, there were pitifully few female Ancestral Kings. However, those that could become Great Emperor were even stronger than other Great Emperors, because if the female cultivators wanted to stand out, the price they had to pay would definitely be greater.","Ling Han smiled calmly, \"What if I say no?\"","Hiss, how dare he!","Seeing this scene, everyone felt rueful. Ling Han had already grown to the point of being able to contend with the Great Emperor?","However, the empress and the others immediately received a message through divine sense from Ling Han, telling them to flee as soon as possible.","F***, this was a Great Emperor, who could easily teach them a lesson.","Everyone tore a rip into the Void and left, and Ling Han did not make a move to kill Di Wuji and the others. His meaning was very clear. It was equivalent to exchanging hostages.","Of course, Ling Han could also use the Clear Bamboo Sword to take a gamble, and see if he could not only escort the empress and the others away, but also kill Di Wuji and the others.","However, those people were all the people he cared about the most, after all. Ling Han wanted stability even more.","Most importantly, he did not take Di Wuji and the others to heart at all.","So what if they were still alive? Could they pose a threat to him?","Right now, only the Great Emperor was worthy of his notice."]},{"number":4724,"title":"Chapter 4724: Greatest Crisis?","paragraphs":["There were no ripples in the sea of blood, as if it had tacitly approved of Ling Han’s actions.","The Great Emperor would actually compromise?","There was nothing that could be done. The Lords of Death couldn’t make a move easily. Otherwise, with the pride of the Great Emperor, who would they negotiate with?","After everyone had left, Ling Han also released those Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters of the Lands of Death.","Di Wuji and the others all wore dark expressions, their expressions incredibly ugly.","This was a great humiliation!","Which of them was not the son and daughter of a Great Emperor? Who could match them in the same cultivation level?","But now? They had been forcefully conquered by someone whose cultivation level was weaker than theirs, and they were a group of ancient prodigies at that.","How humiliating. With such a defeat, what right did they have to contest for the throne?","At this moment, the sea of blood slowly moved, turning into a human face. However, blood-red seawater dripped endlessly, making this human face appear extremely terrifying.","\"If you want, you can become the 13th Lord of Death.\" The face spoke, and said something that was enough to shake the universe.","The thirteenth Lord of Death!","Wouldn’t that mean that he would be on an equal footing with the Great Emperors?","Lu Xun, Di Wuji and the others were all shocked. They had not thought that the ruler of the sea of blood would actually have such a high opinion of Ling Han.","Ling Han didn’t hesitate at all. He shook his head, and said, \"I can’t watch as people die!\"","Hiss, this guy actually refused such an invitation!","Even though Di Wuji and the others were furious at Ling Han for not appreciating the show of goodwill, they couldn’t help but admire Ling Han’s courage.","Throughout history, who would dare refuse a Great Emperor directly?","Yet the ruler of the Blood Sea was not angered. Instead, she stated calmly, \"You know nothing about this world!\"","\"Hehe.\" Ling Han chuckled. When he had been in Genesis World, Extermination had also looked very awesome. In the end, hadn’t it still been beaten up?","\"Even if we don’t make a move, this world will ultimately be destroyed, so it would be better to help us,\" the ruler of the Blood Sea said.","’What do you mean?’","Even without the chaos caused by the Twelve Lands of Death, would the universe still be destroyed?","Ling Han believed her. With the temperament of the Great Emperor, there was no need to trick him. Thus, these words were believable.","However, would the world ultimately walk towards destruction?","Could it be related to the existence of the Primitive Abyss?","It should be known that there were 36 primitive Divine Beasts there, and all of them were Great Emperor-level Divine Beasts. Once they appeared and caused harm, they were even more terrifying than the Twelve Lands of Death.","However, since the birth of heaven and earth, it had already been an era when all the Divine Beasts had gathered together. If it was said that they would destroy the heaven and earth, what need was there for them to drag it out until now?","Moreover, Buddha Doga had also said that the True Dragon Emperor’s strength was clearly inferior to his understanding of Great Emperors.","The little azure dragon concluded that the first generation True Dragon had definitely died.","Thus, at this moment, Ling Han’s mind was in a mess.","Heh, since he couldn’t figure it out, why didn’t he just ask directly?","\"Why do you say that?\" Ling Han said to the face in the sea of blood. Even though this face was terrifying, upon closer look, it had an indescribably exquisite beauty.","The blood-colored face opened its mouth, and said, \"You should know how this world came to be.\"","\"Yes.\" Ling Han nodded.","In the past, there was no such thing as heaven and earth. There was only a single dot, or rather a sphere. Then, a crack appeared on the sphere, and endless matter gushed out. It was also expanding endlessly, forming the current universe.","This crack was the present Primitive Abyss, and it contained the most fundamental force and secrets of the heaven and earth.","\"After the creation of heaven and earth, this universe has continued to expand,\" the ruler of the Blood Sea continued, \"However, this expansion is about to end.\"","\"If it ends, then it ends,\" Ling Han said. What effect would this have?","With the current size of the universe, it was enough to allow millions and millions of living beings to live.","Even Saints wouldn’t be able to travel from one end of the universe to the other.","Wasn’t it big enough?","\"Naive!\" the ruler of the Blood Sea stated calmly.","In this world, only a Great Emperor could reprimand Ling Han like this.","Ling Han was not angered. There must be a reason why these Great Emperors lived in such a \"sneaky\" manner, and did not hesitate to bear such infamy. Now, it was very possible that the ruler of the Blood Sea would reveal the truth for him, so he was willing to listen.","\"The end of life is death, and the end of death... is rebirth.\" The ruler of the Blood Sea said something that seemed completely unrelated.","Yet Ling Han frowned, \"What you mean is that after the universe has expanded to its limit, it would shrink next?\"","Hiss!","\"That’s right.\" The ruler of the Blood Sea nodded, \"It would go back to wherever it came from. What happened in the beginning would also happen in the end.\"","According to the words of this Empress, the universe would ultimately return to become a point?","Then, millions and millions of living beings would all be exterminated.","It should be known that even in the Primitive Abyss, that terrifying gravity field was enough to make the body of a Saint collapse, not leaving behind even the slightest bit of bone scraps.","Then, what if it was further compressed to a point?","Could a Great Emperor... also withstand it?","At that time, it would be the end of the world.","Thus, the ruler of the sea of blood had said that this world would eventually be destroyed.","If the theory about the universe expanding and shrinking was true, then this day would indeed come.","\"Is this the reason why you people are wreaking havoc in the world?\" Ling Han raised his voice and said, \"From the moment the universe was born until now, it has experienced who knows how many years, and even if there comes a day that it will walk towards death, that would only happen countless years later.\"","\"What right do you have to decide the fate of millions and millions of living beings?\"","The ruler of the Blood Sea shook her head, \"An ant is an ant, after all. He would only use his own vision to observe.\"","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head, and he said, \"Do you know that in the Primitive Abyss, there are now 36 Divine Beasts that have been revived?\"","The ruler of the Blood Sea scoffed, \"The Great Emperors have died, and have merged with the heaven and earth, so how could they possibly come back to life!\"","In her eyes, Ling Han had just spouted a bunch of bullsh*t.","Yi?","Ling Han was only trying to bluff the ruler of the Blood Sea, wanting to know what relation the Twelve Lands of Death had with the Divine Beasts in the Primitive Abyss, but the result stunned him.","The Twelve Lords of Death actually didn’t know about the True Dragon Emperor and the others?","True, Buddha Doga had also been to the Primitive Abyss, but it was still only when he had gotten the news from Ling Han that he discovered the shocking change in events.","The Primitive Abyss was a forbidden area for Great Emperors. Which Great Emperor would go there for no reason?","Although the Twelve Lands of Death’s leaders obtained secret techniques there and obtained immortality in a strange way, they obviously didn’t go there again in the future.","It could be imagined. Just look at them now, it was not easy for them to make a move at all, which showed just how great a restriction this kind of \"immortality\" would have.","So, why would they go to the Primitive Abyss?","To die?","Then, the Divine Beasts in the Primitive Abyss had no relation with the Twelve Lands of Death?","Ling Han instantly felt a headache coming on. There were actually two Great Emperor-level forces, and each force had more than ten Great Emperors.","F***, what kind of world was this!","\"You can go to the Primitive Abyss and take a look. You’ll naturally know if I’m right or not,\" Ling Han said calmly. If he could incite these two Great Emperor-level forces to war, that would be great."]},{"number":4725,"title":"Chapter 4725: Returning to the Battle God Palace","paragraphs":["The ruler of the Blood Sea humphed, \"Looks like you cannot be of any use to us!\"","Boom! The sea of blood boiled, and innumerable corpses of Saints instantly rushed out, pouncing towards Ling Han. It was as if a rain of Saints had suddenly fallen, covering heaven and earth.","Was this a fight at the slightest disagreement?","Ling Han was unafraid. As long as the Great Emperor didn’t make a move personally, he wasn’t afraid of anyone.","He casually threw punches and kicks. What Saint corpses? This was completely incomparable to the Skeleton Saint Tool. They were sent flying with a single strike from him, and exploded. They didn’t even have the chance to return.","As the saying went, an abundance of ants could bite an elephant to death, but if this elephant was made from the Origin Gold, then no matter how many ants bit it, what was the use?","His figure was instantly engulfed by the sea of Saint corpses. However, numerous figures were sent flying and blasted into bits. They were completely unable to suppress him.","Ling Han’s strength had already reached a level that numbers could not be depended on to kill him.","The ruler of the Blood Sea didn’t issue any command, and the corpses of the Saints suddenly retreated. Then, the blood sea boiled, and a large hand formed, slapping towards Ling Han.","This time was completely different. Imperial might spread out, so terrifying that it could not be described.","Even Ling Han didn’t dare to face this attack head-on. If the Great Emperor attacked, his only option would be to flee.","He was done playing.","He activated the Clear Bamboo Sword, and slashed out at this giant hand.","Peng!","The sword slashed down, and the large hand was immediately severed into two halves. When the Clear Bamboo Sword revived, it was equivalent to the appearance of a Great Emperor, so how terrifying was its attack power?","Right now, Ling Han’s physique was countless times more powerful than before. Thus, he was able to withstand the shockwaves.","Otherwise, so what if he was protected by the Imperial Weapon? Under the shockwaves of three or two strikes, he could still be killed.","However, monstrous bloody hands stretched out one after another from the sea of blood, striking out at Ling Han.","How was he supposed to block this?","Ling Han gritted his teeth. A Great Emperor was indeed a Great Emperor. She was not something that an Imperial Weapon could compare to at all.","The Imperial Weapon could indeed block the attack of the Great Emperor, but it would only be a matter of one or two moves at most. To face it head-on?","Forget it, he’d better wash up and sleep.","Ling Han hurriedly fled. Phoenix Wings Divine Flightwas unleashed, and his speed was astonishingly fast. Furthermore, with the Imperial Weapon bringing up the rear, even the attack of a Great Emperor could be dispersed.","At least while the Clear Bamboo Sword was revived, Ling Han was unafraid of any life-threatening dangers.","Of course, if he turned around and confronted the ruler of the Blood Sea head-on, it would be a different story.","Thankfully, the ruler of the Blood Sea was unable to use her full strength, or rather, was unwilling to use her full strength. Thus, Ling Han still managed to escape from the siege.","He turned around to look. If he had had that kind of strength in the past, Old Man Ge would not have died in battle.","He then tore a rip into space and returned to the Four Origin Planet.","Seeing Ling Han return, everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","That was facing the Great Emperor directly. The last time this had happened, a Pseudo-Emperor had been sacrificed. Right until they saw Ling Han return, and only then did they feel as if a heavy burden had been lifted from their shoulders.","Afterward, Ling Han didn’t move again. Instead, he focused on pushing Four Origin Planet toward the edge of the universe.","The Lords of Death were already targeting him, and they were even willing to attack to a certain extent. Thus, he had to be careful. If the Lords of Death attacked him together, even he would be in trouble.","When things calmed down, Ling Han was also pondering over the words of the ruler of the sea of blood.","The expansion of the universe was about to end, and then it would enter into a stage of collapse?","In that case, the Lords of Death had chosen this time to appear, so it was definitely this era that could bring them great fortune.","It must be true immortality.","\"In the Living Realm, the truth is hard to find, but if I go to the Netherworld, I might be able to gain something.\"","Ling Han decided to go to the Netherworld. This was something that he had decided on a long time ago.","He had not set out yet, when good news greeted him successively on the Four Origin Planet.","Lin Luo, Zhou Heng, Chu Hao and the other elites who had come from Genesis World all broke through to Saint Tier, instilling powerful strength into Four Origin Planet.","Now, in terms of Saint-level power alone, even the Imperial Clans couldn’t compare to Four Origin Planet.","Ling Han was very gratified. The more Saints there were, the safer Four Origin Planet would be.","He set out with a light heart, and began to search for the entrance to the Netherworld.","This time, the little azure dragon and the large black dog both requested to go with them. They had already become Saints, so if they didn’t go out and show off, wouldn’t it be like wearing embroidered clothes at night, where they had no audience to admire them?","This was out of character for them.","So be it.","The perverted pig naturally wouldn’t participate in such matters. Instead, he wanted to mingle with the beauties and be as lazy as possible.","However, where was the entrance to the Netherworld?","By now, the layout of the Living Realm had already been disturbed. There were too many areas that had been transformed by the Netherworld, and even Saints were unable to sense the situation there. It was as if they were headless chickens.","Previously, it didn’t matter. In any case, they would be fighting wherever they went, and there was no need for them to choose a location at all. However, it was different now. They needed to locate the entrance to the Netherworld.","Thus, the three of them began their search.","This search took half a year’s time, and it could be said that it was extremely boring during this time. The three of them could only insult each other to increase their strength in verbal battles.","In this aspect, it was still the large black dog that was slightly superior. He was completely capable of matching the \"united forces\" of Ling Han and the little azure dragon.","The number one despicable Saint of all eternity, he truly lived up to his name.","\"Yi?\" Ling Han suddenly faltered. He sensed a fluctuation of life force.","Could it be that he had discovered a dangerous place, or could it be that it was an Imperial Clan that had \"rebelled\" such as the Chang Clan, the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan, and so on?","If he really encountered it, he would take the chance to make some money.","How well coordinated were the three of them? After exchanging a glance, they didn’t even need to say a word. They all retracted their auras, and then followed the fluctuation of the life force.","A planet appeared ahead of them. It was purple-red in colour.","Ling Han suddenly felt a sense of familiarity. It was as if he had been here before.","They passed through the protective barrier around the planet and arrived on the planet.","\"Er!\" Ling Han recognized it. This was... the Battle God Palace!","By a freak combination of circumstances, he didn’t find the entrance to the Netherworld. Instead, he found the Battle God Palace.","If this were in the past, the planet where the Battle God Palace was located would be surrounded by fog, and even the Imperial Clans would not be able to find it. However, there was no need for that now.","The Battle God Palace had already made it clear that they belonged to one of the Lands of Death.","Hence, after the universe was transformed into the Netherworld, there was completely no need for them to hide any longer.","—Who would dare charge into an area that had been transformed into the Netherworld, and make things difficult for the Battle God Palace?","Moreover, this was still extremely difficult to find.","\"This is heaven’s will!\" Ling Han said with a smile.","\"Little Han, you failed to show off last time, so you must succeed this time!\" the large black dog immediately declared.","\"That’s right. Showing off is the most important.\" The little azure dragon also nodded.","Ling Han’s forehead was covered with cold sweat. Why did these two guys place so much importance on showing off?","Apart from showing off, couldn’t one have some aspirations in life?","Forget it. What life did they have? It was either a dog’s life or a dragon’s life.","Just let them be.","The three of them advanced. Then, their appearances all changed. At least, at a glance, it was impossible to distinguish their identities.","Ling Han walked with ease, bringing the little azure dragon and the large black dog to the Blood Tower.","This was the tower of inheritance of the Battle God Palace."]},{"number":4726,"title":"Chapter 4726: Sweeping aside all opposition","paragraphs":["Ling Han and his group walked all the way over, avoiding all the sentry posts, and only then did they appear.","On the one hand, it was also because the Battle God Palace didn’t have any intention to keep a tight guard at all. Was it still possible for foreign enemies to appear here?","Thus, their defenses were naturally relaxed.","\"Who are you people?\" This Blood Tower naturally had an elite keeping watch, and when he discovered Ling Han and the others, he immediately opened his mouth to question them.","\"You murderers, I’ve finally found you today!\" The large black dog’s expression was filled with fury, as if he was bearing the responsibility to seek revenge for the death of his father. \"You killed the family of us brothers. How pitiful. At that time, our father was only a three-year-old toddler, yet he was killed by you!\"","When the elite on the other side heard this, he couldn’t help but feel dumbfounded.","When your entire family was destroyed, your father was only three years old? Then how were you three brothers born?","Your father was too powerful, wasn’t he, to have three children at three years old?","There were so many points that he could criticize about this excuse.","\"Don’t spout nonsense. Who exactly are you people?\" That elite asked. He was a Venerate.","\"I’m Hu Da, this is my Second Brother, Hu Er, and this is my Third Brother, Hu San.\" The large black dog pointed at Ling Han and the little azure dragon respectively, and said, \"You guys killed our entire family, and today, we three brothers are going to slaughter all of you.\"","Seeing the large black dog repeatedly emphasize this point, that elite was also slightly undecided.","These three people... were they really here to take revenge?","After all, the Battle God Palace had killed countless people before, so it wouldn’t be strange no matter how many enemies they had.","However, the fact that they had come meant that the three of them still had some strength.","Xiu, at this moment, someone just happened to come out of the Blood Tower. It was a middle-aged man in his forties. He looked ordinary, and would not attract the slightest attention.","However, he was a Spirit Transformation True Lord.","\"Yang Shisi, kill them,\" the Venerate commanded.","The middle-aged man couldn’t even be bothered to ask about the origins of Ling Han and the others. His figure immediately flashed, and he hid in the shadows.","Strange Shadow Steps.","Shua, he suddenly appeared behind the large black dog, then delivered a swift slash with his sword.","Sword light flashed, fully displaying its viciousness.","The large black dog pretended to be flustered, and began a fierce battle with the middle-aged man, trying his best to maintain a tie.","If a Saint wanted to disguise himself, so how could a Venerate see through him?","Thus, the Venerate Tier elite guarding the Blood Tower sneered. With such measly strength, he actually dared to come to the Battle God Palace for revenge?","Go accompany your father.","However, when he recalled what the large black dog said about a three-year-old father who had died, he began to grit his teeth again. What kind of people were these three?","The large black dog \"expended much effort\" before finally defeating the middle-aged man. His face was filled with lofty arrogance as he said, \"Anyone else? Anyone else? I want to fight ten of you alone!\"","Just look at how smug you are.","At this moment, many assassins from the Battle God Palace had already rushed over. After all, this commotion was not small.","That Venerate Tier originally wanted to make a move and take down Ling Han and the others, but it was rare for a Spiritual Transformation Tier \"elite\" to appear, so he decided not to make a move first, and nurture the actual combat standards of the disciples.","As long as he was here, it was impossible for anyone to die.","Thus, another assassin immediately stepped out. Though they were both Spiritual Transformation Tier, his abilities were slightly superior than the one from before.","\"Let me!\" the little azure dragon shouted.","\"Don’t fight with me!\" The large black dog hurriedly blocked the little azure dragon behind him. There were so few chances to show off now, so he naturally couldn’t let go of every opportunity.","\"I’ll go!\"","\"I’ll go!\"","The two of them argued endlessly, which enraged the assassin. ’You guys are looking down on me too much, aren’t you?’","He quietly hid in the shadows, wanting to take advantage of the opening to launch a sneak attack.","Shua, that assassin suddenly appeared, and struck out with his sword.","Though this strike was aimed at the large black dog, it was very powerful. It was clearly meant to cut the large black dog in half, and then kill the little azure dragon as well.","\"Get lost!\"","The little azure dragon and the large black dog shot out punches at the same time, striking the assassin’s face.","Peng! The assassin immediately stumbled back in retreat. He wavered unsteadily, and it was as if he were drunk.","\"You people... are so despicable!\" He collapsed loudly, his face filled with grief and indignation.","This was no argument. They were clearly using this as bait.","Too despicable, too shameless.","Meanwhile, the large black dog and little azure dragon giggled, revealing their despicable nature.","Ling Han placed his hand on his forehead. If the old True Dragon revived and saw his only son like this, would he regret having him in the past?","However, their \"despicableness\" also enraged those assassins.","Xiu, xiu, two people appeared at the same time, sinking into the shadows.","Then, they charged out together, but they actually appeared behind Ling Han.","This was really unexpected.","However, what greeted them was Ling Han’s iron fist.","Peng, this was not aimed directly at them at all, but the wind created by the punch was too terrifying. Instantly, the two of them were sent flying, and then passed out on the ground.","The Venerate Tier elite frowned. Something didn’t seem right.","Just now, when Ling Han had made his move, he actually discovered that he actually did not have the chance to interfere.","With a wave of his hand, the two of them collapsed. The entire process was done in one go, so how could he have the chance to interfere?","Hiss, this was a little strange.","\"Attack together!\" he commanded.","Immediately, all the assassins fled into the shadows. Only when they were right behind Ling Han and the others did they appear and launch a fatal attack.","But in front of Ling Han and the others, what was this worth?","However, the large black dog was still shouting, \"So powerful! You almost injured me severely! Aiyo, this strike was so fierce, and almost sliced off my leg! F*ck, which b@stard actually dared to poke my behind?\"","This rendered the assassins speechless. Their attacks were still a million miles away from this guy. Was there any need to be display such shock?","How could there be such a despicable person?","’You clearly have boundless energy, yet you still insist on putting on an act. How unbelievable!’","With a slight exert of force from Ling Han and the others, all the assassins fell to the ground.","\"You... where have you come from?\" The Venerate Tier assassin couldn’t sit still any longer. He appeared from the Blood Tower, and at the same time, he also sent out a signal to gather the other elites.","In fact, even the Killing Saint had been notified.","He kept feeling that these three people were strange.","\"Grandpa is here for revenge!\" The large black dog charged out, charging towards that Venerate Tier elite.","\"Humph!\" That Venerate Tier smirked coldly, and delivered a palm strike at the large black dog.","The large black dog bawled loudly, battling fiercely with that Venerate Tier elite.","The more people there were, the stronger his desire to perform. He could not stop at all.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! More Venerates arrived, and when they discovered that the large black dog was actually capable of matching Venerate Tier, they all looked surprised.","Where had these three elites come from?","The large black dog spent a lot of effort before finally defeating his opponent.","It laughed loudly, proud and insufferably arrogant.","\"Battle God Palace, I’m going to destroy all of you today!\"","\"How arrogant!\" One of the Venerates of Slaughter couldn’t help but make a move. He was slightly stronger than the Venerate from before, and he was also using a thick saber. As he slashed out, he was filled with dominance.","\"If the tiger doesn’t unleash its might, do you think I’m the Four-Legged Snake?\" The large black dog increased its attacks, and soon killed that Venerate of Slaughter.","This!","The members of the Battle God Palace all looked stunned. These three people... did not come with good intentions."]},{"number":4727,"title":"Chapter 4727: The Top Despicable Saint","paragraphs":["The little azure dragon was extremely displeased. This big black dog kept trying to smear his reputation in various ways.","\"Despicable dog!\" he muttered.","On their side, they were very relaxed, while on the side of the Battle God Palace, there was complete chaos.","Too strong!","And this was only one of them. If all three of them were so strong... Thankfully, the old Killing Saint had already been summoned.","\"Who else is there?\" the large black dog asked arrogantly. Even if he had taken human form, he still exuded a strong air of vulgarity, and anyone who saw him would want to beat him up.","\"Humph, to dare come to our Battle God Palace and act so arrogant, how outrageously bold!\" Another Venerate Tier moved, charging towards the large black dog. He delivered a palm strike, and xiu, xiu, xiu, boundless black mist rose up.","Seeing this person move, everyone looked relieved.","This was one of their three Vice Palace Leaders.","The Battle God Palace did not have the a Palace Leader. That old Killing Saint merely considered himself a grand elder, and the position of Palace Leader had always been vacant. It was not just for this term, but rather for all the generations.","Thus, those who could become Vice Palace Leaders were naturally extremely awesome.","The large black dog unleashed a kick. Peng! The Vice Palace Leader exploded into a cloud of blood and flesh.","This!","The members of the Battle God Palace were all astounded. He had destroyed an eight-star Venerate Tier elite with a single kick?","Was this something that a Venerate could do?","\"A Saint!\" they exclaimed in a trembling voice.","Ling Han pursed his lips. These people were really ignorant and ill-informed. It should be known that when he had been at the Fourth Extreme, he had even actually kicked a Saint to burst. But because they were ignorant, they had actually guessed correctly.","The large black dog laughed loudly, \"That’s right, I am a Saint!\"","There was actually a Saint with this kind of bearing in this world?","The members of the Battle God Palace exchanged looks, all of them filled with disbelief.","This kind of despicable guy could also become a Saint, so why couldn’t they all become Saints?","The large black dog flew into a thunderous rage, \"What kind of expression is that? Grandpa Dog will beat you all to burst!\"","The old black dog couldn’t tolerate this. Why did they all look like they had seen a pervert?","Was it that kind of dog?","It cried out loudly, and charged out. Instantly, it was a scene of complete chaos.","The little azure dragon laughed at his misfortune. \"Don’t you have any idea just how freakish you are?\"","\"Grandpa Dog is about to die from fury!\" The large black dog was invincible as it unleashed its murderous aura.","This caused the members of the Battle God Palace to feel grief and indignation. It was clear that they were the real victims here. You didn’t experience the slightest loss at all, so why do you still look like you are the victim?","They couldn’t be bullied like this.","They wanted to put their lives on the line, but a head-on confrontation was not their forte. Furthermore, the gap in cultivation level was really too wide. If they rushed forwards, they would only be delivering themselves up to die.","Just as the large black dog was killing to his heart’s content, shua, a majestic light suddenly appeared behind him, slashing down rapidly.","This attack was meant to sever the large black dog’s neck.","\"Haha, how mischievous!\" The large black dog suddenly spun around, and then shot out a palm strike. The light of Regulations surged.","Peng!","In this exchange of blows, that majestic light immediately crumbled. Then, they saw that this was actually a young man, holding a sword in his hand.","There was a stunned expression on his face, as if he found it strange that his attack had not succeeded.","\"Young Master!\" When they saw this young man, everyone from the Battle God Palace blurted out, appearing to be very excited.","They knew that the old Killing Saint had appointed a Young Palace Leader, and they had also seen that young man before. However, they had never imagined that this young man was actually a Saint!","No wonder the old Killing Saint favored him and promoted him to become the Young Palace Leader.","Previously, they had indeed been unconvinced. However, because of the authority of the old Killing Saint, they had not dared to object, but now, they were completely convinced.","Furthermore, at this kind of critical moment, the Young Palace Leader stepped out bravely, saving them from the critical situation... f***!","They had not even finished this thought, when they saw that this saviour was being suppressed by the large black dog, completely unable to fight back.","This!","Their Young Palace Leader was indeed strong, but not as strong as that freak.","Weng, a frightening killing intent swept out, and an old man slowly walked out, holding two daggers in his hands. One was black and the other was white, exuding a powerful aura, which was incredibly terrifying.","This was the old Killing Saint of the Battle God Palace, and those two daggers were the Saint Tools of the Battle God Palace, passed down from the primitive times. Under the control of a Saint, this could even unleash might above fifteen stars.","Only at this moment did everyone finally heave a sigh of relief.","The old Killing Saint was their stabilizing force. With his help, there was nothing that could not be resolved.","\"Who are you guys?\" The old Killing Saint’s eyes roamed over Ling Han and the others, but under the effects of the Soul Forming Technique, he couldn’t see anything off. After all, Ling Han and the others were also Saints.","A Saint’s body accommodated Regulations, and assimilated with the heaven and earth. If he did not want you to see through him, you would definitely not be able to.","...Unless he possessed something like an eye technique.","The large black dog stepped on the head of the Young Palace Leader, and said proudly, \"My surname is Gou, and my given name is Daren.\"","Yi, didn’t you previously say your name was Hu Da? That was practically nonsense!","Also, Gou Daren? Lord Dog?","The members of the Battle God Palace all exchanged looks. They had never seen such self-deprecating behavior, comparing himself to a dog.","Hiss, how shameless would a Saint have to be to bear to lose face like this?","The large black dog’s strength wasn’t astounding to them, but his shamelessness filled them with deep veneration.","The old Killing Saint humphed lightly, and said, \"Stop playing the fool. Since you’re a Saint, why don’t you conduct yourself with dignity?\"","Saints were invincible no matter where they were. Even if they went to the Imperial Clan, they would still be received with high standards.","But this Saint in front of him was really too unreserved... he was practically shameless!","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, \"Haven’t you people from the Battle God Palace been hunting me all this while? Now, I’m here!\"","En, what did that mean?","Everyone looked at Ling Han. This guy suddenly stole the limelight, but the words that came out of his mouth stunned everyone.","The large black dog laughed loudly, \"Is there anyone that is on the list of people to be killed from your Battle God Palace, but your have never managed to kill him?\"","\"Ling Han!\" Instantly, a great many people exclaimed.","\"That’s right, this is our Little Han.\" The large black dog revealed his true appearance. The iron underwear was still his trademark, shining brightly.","Now, it had already traded this for Saintly Material, and its ultimate goal was Origin Gold!","It would be a pair of underpants that had been forged from Origin Gold. There should only be one pair of such underpants in this world, right?","The mighty name of the large black dog would definitely be known throughout the world because of this.","The Great Emperor could die, but the Imperial Weapon would exist forever!","Of course, the idea had already been outvoted by Ling Han and the little azure dragon. With its despicable ways, it didn’t need any Imperial Weapon-level underpants. Right now, it was already despicable enough to move the world.","The large black dog transformed back into its original form, and so did the little azure dragon. Only Ling Han hadn’t transformed back into his original form yet.","He smiled faintly, his appearance gradually changing.","This time, even that old Killing Saint had become cautious.","According to the information obtained, Ling Han was the greatest prodigy of all eternity. Once this kind of prodigy became a Saint, just how terrifying would his abilities be?","—The level of the Battle God Palace was relatively low, so no one, including the old Killing Saint, knew of Ling Han’s recent outstanding battle merits. He had even managed to escape when the Great Emperor made a move.","If they had known, they would probably be trembling in fear and panic by now."]},{"number":4728,"title":"Chapter 4728: Plunder","paragraphs":["As the saying goes, the ignorant have no fear.","Because they didn’t know Ling Han’s terrifying battle merits, the members of the Battle God Palace were all filled with confidence.","With the old Killing Saint standing guard, they were extremely calm.","Hehe, you actually dared to take the initiative to come here to die, then we shall oblige you!","Though the old Killing Saint was only an eight-star Saint, with the addition of two Saint Tools, his battle prowess would reach the height of an eighteen-star Saint. How could it be that he would not be able to deal with a mere three newly advanced Saints?","They must have been newly advanced; just how many years had it been?","These people were all filled with confidence, waiting for the scene of Ling Han and the others being killed to appear.","The old Killing Saint Saint was extremely displeased. This Young Palace Leader was sent over by the Void Imperial Clan, and he was a member of the Wu Clan. Now, however, he was being stepped on by a despicable dog right under his nose. Just how would the Wu Clan view him?","He was still hoping that the Lord of Death would obtain the great heaven-defying opportunity, and then be able to give him a little bit. At the very least, he would be able to break through to become a Nine-Star Saint, and stand at the pinnacle of Saints. He would also be very satisfied.","But now?","\"You all deserve to die!\" the old Killing Saint said balefully. The two daggers in his hands lit up, one black and one white.","Ling Han crooked a finger at him, \"Come!\"","Shua, the old Killing Saint suddenly leaped out in a slash, but just as he was about to appear in front of Ling Han, he suddenly disappeared.","Strange Shadow Steps!","\"This is the true essence of Strange Shadow Steps!\"","\"Shadowless and formless.\"","\"Only the grand elder can grasp the Strange Shadow Steps to such a high level!\"","Everyone gasped in amazement. Everyone had similarly learnt the Strange Shadow Steps, but the comparison of mastery could infuriate them to death.","Ling Han smiled, took a step, and his figure also disappeared.","\"S-Strange Shadow Steps!\" Everyone was shocked. How could Ling Han also use the Strange Shadow Steps?","Could it be that they were on the same side?","Peng!","A figure was suddenly beaten out of the shadows, staggering.","Not Ling Han, but the old Killing Saint!","How was this possible!","Everyone was numb with shock. That was the old Killing Saint. How many years had he been immersed in the art of Strange Shadow Steps?","However, in a battle of Strange Shadow Steps, the old Killing Saint was actually no match for Ling Han?","Heavens!","Ling Han also appeared, and shot out a punch at the old Killing Saint.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Under his barrage of attacks, the old Killing Saint was completely unable to fight back, and could only be beaten madly.","Everyone was in despair, but in this kind of desperate situation, not only did they not want to beg for mercy, their killing intent instead surged.","That was because when they had first entered into the Battle God Palace, they had all been brainwashed in the Blood Tower. Aside from slaughter, there was no room for anything else.","Ling Han shook his head. With a thought, peng, peng, peng, everyone’s bodies tilted, and they collapsed to the ground, dead.","Right now, only the old Killing Saint and the Young Palace Leader were still alive.","The old Killing Saint looked at Ling Han, gritted his teeth, and said, \"Don’t be too smug. The Battle God Palace has originated from the Void Imperial Clan, and as long as the Imperial Clan is not destroyed, the Battle God Palace will ultimately reappear!\"","Ling Han smiled and said, \"Then I’ll destroy the Imperial Clan!\"","\"How boastful!\" That Young Palace Leader spoke up, \"Do you know what the Imperial Clan signifies? Our Wu Clan is not a low-level Imperial Clan that only has the Imperial Weapon, but rather a real Imperial Clan that has a Great Emperor to oversee things!\"","His face was filled with pride. When he spoke of the Wu Clan, that kind of pride was engraved in his bones.","Pa!","The large black dog’s paw stomped down, crushing the head of the Young Palace Leader into the ground.","\"You people have gone too far!\" That Young Palace Leader pulled his head out of the ground, his hair disheveled. Because the physique of a Saint was strong, this was not the slightest bit harmful to him, but to be treated like this, what face would he have left?","The large black dog snickered, and said to Ling Han, \"Looks like this guy has stayed here for quite a number of years, and actually doesn’t know who you are, Little Han.\"","If this person was well-informed, he would definitely not be so arrogant.","With how freakish Ling Han was, even the Lords of Death didn’t hesitate to make a move, wanting to kill Ling Han before he became Emperor, which showed just how great a threat Ling Han posed.","Ling Han shook his head. Before becoming a Saint, he had always wanted to sweep aside all opposition in the Battle God Palace. However, when he truly succeeded, he felt that it was boring.","This was because he was far too powerful at this moment. It was as if he were a bully.","However, there was no way he would let the Battle God Palace off the hook. After all, this was the most notorious force in history, and everyone had the right to kill them.","Ling Han snapped his fingers. Pa, pa! The heads of the old Killing Saint and the Young Palace Leader exploded at the same time. Their minds were also obliterated. They were as dead as could be.","\"Sigh, I haven’t shown off to my heart’s content yet.\" The large black dog felt dissatisfied.","The invasion of this Netherworld was really too untimely. Otherwise, now that it had become a Saint, it could show off all over the world.","\"It’s like wearing embroidered clothes at night,\" the little azure dragon also sighed.","\"Come, let’s go and raid the Battle God Palace,\" Ling Han said.","Instantly, the large black dog and little azure dragon felt energized. Aside from showing off, this was also one of their hobbies.","However, when they had completely emptied out the reserves of the Battle God Palace, they were all very disappointed.","It should be known that the Battle God Palace had existed for countless billions of years, and what they did was the illegal business of killing people. Merely in terms of accumulating wealth, they should only be inferior to the Chang Clan.","However, the gains of Ling Han and the others were pitifully small.","Even if the Battle God Palace wanted to nurture new disciples and expended some resources, they shouldn’t have expended so much, right?","\"It’s probably taken by the Void Imperial Clan,\" Ling Han deduced.","That Young Palace Leader was obviously a member of the Wu Clan. Since the Wu Clan had already stretched out their hand, it wouldn’t be strange for them to empty the accumulated wealth of the Battle God Palace.","After all, the Battle God Palace existed for the purpose of serving the Wu Clan.","\"Sigh, it wasn’t easy for us to conquer a force with deep roots, yet our gains are so little. This is really hard to accept,\" the large black dog said hatefully.","\"Come, let’s go to the Void Imperial Clan!\" the little azure dragon howled.","Ling Han and the large black dog did not speak, and merely stared at him.","\"Er, why do you guys look at Grandpa Dragon like you’re looking at an idiot?\" the little azure dragon said in displeasure.","\"Hehe, if you want to go to the Void Imperial Clan, you can do as you like. We won’t be accompanying you. After 80 to 100 years, we’ll collect your corpse. If you still have a corpse by then,\" the large black dog said.","The little azure dragon wanted to put on a brave front, but if it went to a place guarded by a Great Emperor, would it be able to come back alive?","In the past, Ling Han had managed to charge back from Buddhist Land because Ah Han had only revived the Imperial Weapon.","If the Great Emperor became serious, who would be able to survive?","Probably only a freak like Ling Han could do it, but there was only one such freak in the world.","\"Forget it, let’s go to the Netherworld.\" The little azure dragon found a way out for itself.","They continued to set out, searching all over the world for the entrance to the Netherworld.","Actually, in the Living Realm,, there were a great many entrances into the Netherworld. The only difference was the size of these entrances, as well as the locations they appeared in the Netherworld.","The largest entrance was naturally in the Mountain Sea Heaven. At that time, the Yin souls had invaded from there.","However, it wasn’t an easy task to find the Mountain Sea Heaven. Most of the stars had already been transformed into the Netherworld environment, so they didn’t belong to the Living Realm. Thus, Saints wouldn’t be able to sense them even if they were imbued with Regulations.","That was because the Regulations were different.","After 17 years, Ling Han and the others finally found the Mountain Sea Heaven."]},{"number":4729,"title":"Chapter 4729: The Great Emperor’s Palace in the Netherworld","paragraphs":["At this moment, in the Mountain Sea Heaven, there was still a large number of Yin souls appearing endlessly.","This seemed to be the Netherworld’s base camp here. Countless Yin souls would enter the Living Realm from here onwards, and then head to the front lines, having the effect of assimilating the Living Realm into the Netherworld.","This was also their only use. The true propulsive force was the Skeleton Saint Tool, and even the Yin Saints were only sidekicks.","\"Let’s make a big fuss!\" Ling Han said with a smile, extremely bold.","\"All right!\"","The three of them charged out together. The might of a Saint was completely recealed, exuding a majestic light in the darkness. That was the flame of life, and also the holy flame of a Saint.","Boom!","Wherever the three of them went, the Yin souls would evaporate, and instantly disappear without a trace.","They did not encounter any decent resistance at all. All the Skeleton Saint Tools were at the front lines, and even if there was the Yin Saints standing guard here, how could they be a match for Ling Han and the others?","In just half a day, the Mountain Sea Heaven was emptied.","\"Sigh, if only we had that kind of strength a few hundred years ago,\" the large black dog sighed. In that case, the Yin souls would not be able to take the first step of invading.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"If that’s really the case, the Skeleton Saint Tools and the Lords of Death will probably appear in advance as well.\"","Even if Ling Han could now match, or even destroy, the Skeleton Saint Tool, so what? The Lords of Death were the true root of the issue.","The problem was, those were all Great Emperors, and all of them had suppressed an era. Without becoming the strongest of this era, how could he possibly be a match for them?","\"Let’s go.\"","The three of them entered the Netherworld through the entrance of the Mountain Sea Heaven.","After the Living Realm began transforming into the Netherworld, Ling Han and the others had essentially entered the Netherworld in advance. Thus, they didn’t feel much difference now.","There were still differences. Ling Han discovered that there were also Regulations here, but he could not understand them, nor could he use them.","This was the reverse of the Regulations that he had grasped. If he wanted to grasp the Regulations here, he would first have to give up the Regulations of the Living Realm that he had grasped.","He could only choose one of the two options, and could not possibly take both.","Ling Han could only give up on the idea of cultivating the Regulations of the Netherworld. He, the large black dog, and the little azure dragon began to streak across this vast land.","The Netherworld was different from the Living Realm. It didn’t have any stars, and it was just a vast and boundless continent.","After running for a long time, Ling Han and the others decided to move separately.","The Netherworld was really too big.","How would they contact one another?","Through life tokens. If one discovered anything, he would just kill the mosquitoes and flies. Although there were few Spatial Spirit Tools that could store life, they weren’t rare. However, how much space would one need to store flies and mosquitoes?","The three of them separated, and headed in different directions.","Ling Han used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. In this place, he had no scruples.","’Die!’","As the wings of fire swept past, any Yin soul would immediately turn into ash. However, this was the Netherworld, so killing Yin souls would not be rewarded by heaven and earth.","Ling Han was no longer interested in this little bit of reward. He went straight on ahead. Even if he didn’t discover anything, he still wanted to see if there was an end to this Netherworld.","Would there also be a corresponding Primitive Abyss here?","He also had another motive, and that was to find one or two Saint-level Great Herbs, which could help him rapidly increase his cultivation level. However, after thirty years, he had gained nothing.","Yi?","He was startled. A palace had actually appeared ahead of him!","This, a structure had actually appeared in the Netherworld?","At least, after entering the Netherworld so many times, Ling Han still hadn’t discovered any Yin soul living in the buildings.","—They were all just souls, and did not have a physical body, so what need was there for them to eat, drink, and poop?","A thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind, and he felt that he might have discovered something.","He carefully advanced, fearing that there was another terrifying existence within.","Now that dead Great Emperors would also appear, Saints were really not safe.","He sensed for a while, but did not discover any signs of life in the palace.","Er, were those Lords of Death humans or ghosts?","Ling Han wasn’t sure either. Although he had been hunted down by this kind of existence several times, a real face-to-face situation had never happened before.","Thus, he didn’t know either.","In that case, he could not be careless even if he could not sense any signs of life.","Ling Han arrived before the palace, only to see a stone statue that measured 300 meters in height. Although some forces in the Ling Han would forge statues that measured 3000 meters, 30000 meters, or even higher, this stone statue was completely different.","It was as if it had a life of its own, exuding a terrifying pressure.","Ling Han looked on in astonishment.","He had seen this \"person\" before.","The ruler of the sea of blood!","Though the ruler of the Blood Sea had only revealed a face that was formed from seawater at the time, there were a lot of similarities with this stone statue.","Moreover, the aura that they exuded was also very similar.","That’s right, this was definitely that fallen Empress.","Ling Han looked up at the stone statue in awe. Even though he knew that this was a Fallen Great Emperor, he still couldn’t help but admire her mighty and sea-like aura.","At the very least, the Great Emperor’s achievements in cultivation were truly admirable.","He couldn’t help but ask himself honestly. If he became a Great Emperor himself, and had the chance to live forever in front of him, would he be unable to withstand the temptation, and turn his back on the whole world?","Ling Han pondered for a moment. This was truly a difficult choice.","However, if he was the only one who could achieve immortality, then he would rather not.","Being alone through the ages, no matter how strong one’s spirit was, he would still collapse.","\"However, what if I can grant immortality to those close to me?\" Ling Han smiled bitterly. This kind of temptation was really too great. Even he would be tempted, right?","Ling Han sat down in a cross-legged position. Though this was only a mere hypothesis, it was very crucial. It concerned Ling Han’s beliefs, and would shake the foundations of his cultivation.","Without a clear mind, how could he cultivate?","After a while, Ling Han’s expression became determined.","Birth, old age, sickness and death, the laws of heaven and earth.","Just like how he had reprimanded the Lords of Death and the others, who had the right to deprive others of their right to live?","Seeking immortality? Sure, but it couldn’t be built on depriving others of their survival.","Ling Han opened his eyes. At this moment, he no longer hesitated, his heart as firm as iron.","He stood up and headed into the palace.","After arriving at a very spacious plaza, Ling Han entered the palace. However, he immediately discovered that the palace had been severely damaged.","The resting place of a powerful Great Emperor had actually been destroyed?","This was definitely not the corrosion of time, but had rather been damaged by someone.","This was truly inconceivable. Who dared to damage the residence of the Great Emperor?","He touched the broken wall, and squeezed his fingers. To his shock, he discovered that this brick was extremely hard. He actually couldn’t damage it.","Hiss, it should be known, just how strong was his present battle prowess?","Even if he didn’t use Destructive Energy and light of great dao, his battle prowess should still be able to sweep aside all Saints.","Boom, his hand was enshrouded in the light of Destructive Energy and great dao. Then, a crisp sound rang out, and the brick finally shattered.","Ling Han was even more astonished. In terms of destructive power alone, even the revival of the Imperial Weapon couldn’t compare to him.","Then, who had destroyed this place?","Another Great Emperor?"]},{"number":4730,"title":"Chapter 4730: The Fall of the Great Emperor","paragraphs":["Ling Han walked a few more steps, and suddenly discovered that there were a few lines of words on the ground. At first, they were very neat, but as time went on, they became more and more messy.","These words... were the Imperial Language!","It was said that after breaking through to the level of Great Emperor, comprehending the Dao of Heaven and Earth would form a unique language, and only the Great Emperor would be able to grasp it. Hence, it was called the Imperial Language.","Ling Han didn’t understand the Imperial Language, but he could sense the majestic aura of these words. It was as if they could condense the essence of heaven and earth, and contained a powerful vitality.","This should be very important.","The Great Emperor’s palace had been destroyed, yet there were still a few lines of words left behind. Ling Han refused to believe that this wasn’t left behind by the person who had destroyed it.","Was it another Great Emperor?","Ling Han stretched out a hand and placed it on the words. Instantly, a frightening murderous aura assailed him, as if a Great Emperor was staring at him.","\"Humph!\" Ling Han focused on guarding his spirit. So what if it was a Great Emperor? In terms of consciousness, he was unafraid of even a Great Emperor.","After enduring this terrifying murderous aura, scenes suddenly appeared in Ling Han’s mind.","This was an Empress, a peerless beauty. It was she who had moved, and destroyed this palace.","Er!","Ling Han was astonished. This was because the Empress was clearly the stone statue that had been erected on the plaza. In other words, the Empress had destroyed this palace herself?","Was she an idiot?","Ling Han saw that this Empress seemed to be hesitating, and made a difficult decision.","It was precisely because this decision was too difficult to make, that this Empress moved in her irritation, and destroyed her own bedroom.","\"Since you’ve already made your choice, and have already reached this stage, why are you still hesitating?\" the Empress murmured to herself.","Was this a change in the Empress’s mentality that was on the verge of falling?","Being able to become a Great Emperor, his breadth of mind was definitely outstanding. How could she possibly fall so easily?","Thus, they would definitely have to go through a difficult mental journey.","Ling Han very much wanted to know the reason. Immortality?","If she wanted immortality, she could also go to the Primitive Abyss. Although it was extremely dangerous, at least her Dao Heart wouldn’t be tortured. Otherwise, if she massacred the world for her personal gain, her Dao Heart would probably be unstable.","Thus, the pursuit of the Lords of Death should have surpassed the pursuit of immortality.","The scene was still circulating, and the Empress continued to pace around. In the end, her expression became stern, and using her fingers like a pen, she began to write on the ground.","She had not used any Regulations at all, but wherever her fingers touched, the ground was like it was made of tofu, easily leaving marks.","This was the true might of a Great Emperor.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel shocked. In comparison, although a Lord of Death also attacked him previously, its might was completely incomparable.","No wonder Buddha Doga had said that the True Dragon Emperor in the Primitive Abyss was a bit strange, and didn’t match the true strength of the Great Emperor Abyss.","That was indeed the case.","The problem was, he couldn’t understand it.","Though Ling Han had seen the Empress self-destruct her palace, and was making an important decision, he was completely unclear what exactly this was.","In the image, when the empress put away her \"pen\", her expression had also calmed down. Her expression was filled with determination, and there was no longer the slightest bit of hesitation.","It was as if she had fused all her negative emotions into these words through the method of leaving a letter, completely severing herself from these words.","However, the scene that followed caused Ling Han’s hair to stand on end.","That was because the Empress had sat down in a cross-legged position, and her vitality was continuously seeping out of her body. Not too long after, her stunning beauty had completely disappeared, and she had become a dried corpse.","Had she committed suicide?","However, the following scene stunned Ling Han. The Empress’s corpse was continuously absorbing the Regulations of the Netherworld, and not long after, her corpse became plump.","Hu, her eyes suddenly snapped open. Her gaze actually pierced through time, and landed on Ling Han.","\"Hiss!\" Ling Han instantly took a few steps back. He felt a sharp pain in his eyes, as if he had gone blind.","This was the power of a Great Emperor. Even after countless years, it could still cause such a blow.","Ling Han composed himself. After a while, his vision finally returned to normal, but he still felt a sharp pain.","He recalled the last scene. The Empress’s eyes were no longer like normal people’s, but as dark as ghost flames.","Was this the secret of \"immortality\" of the Lords of Death?","In truth... they were all dead!","Originally, when the Great Emperor died, his soul would be assimilated by the heaven and earth. It would be impossible for him to appear in the Netherworld, and he would not have the chance to possess a corpse and be reborn.","However, that Empress had used a secret technique to directly transform herself into a Yin soul. Furthermore, she had also possessed her own body.","Hence, the battle prowess of the present Lords of Death couldn’t compare to their prime, because they were actually all Yin souls?","It shouldn’t be so simple.","Now that they had become the strongest Yin soul, the Lords of Death could naturally command the Netherworld, but what the hell were the sea of Saint corpses?","This should be the \"fated opportunity\" that the Lords of Death had obtained in the Primitive Abyss, bestowing them with some special abilities.","Ling Han searched again, but this palace was empty, and he did not find anything else.","He left the palace, and continued to search for opportunities.","Unfortunately, the Netherworld really did not produce Celestial medicines, or treasures that could increase one’s cultivation level. It seemed like it was only the place where Yin souls lived.","Ling Han discovered another place that he suspected was the \"revival point\" of the Lords of Death. There was still Imperial Might permeating from it, yet it was also eerie and menacing, completely different from ordinary Imperial Might.","When he found nothing else, Ling Han sent a signal to the little azure dragon and the large black dog, signaling for them to return.","After they met up, they didn’t take the Mountain Sea Heaven’s exit.","Who knew if there were any Lords of Death standing guard, waiting for them?","In any case, there was more than one exit. They searched for a while, and then exited the Netherworld.","Ling Han talked about his discoveries, and the large black dog and little azure dragon also found similar places, but only the Empress of the sea of blood had left behind a palace.","Perhaps, it had something to do with the fact that this person was a woman.","Clearly, the 12 Lords of Death had all completed their \"transformation\" in the Netherworld. What Ling Han cared about was why it was 12.","Was it that only the 12 ancient Great Emperors had chosen to walk this path, or could it be that this path could only be walked by the 12 Great Emperors, and every single one of them could obtain a great opportunity?","This... could only be known by the Lords of Death.","\"Actually, there’s a way,\" the large black dog said with a serious expression.","Ling Han sighed, \"Every time I see you being so serious, I feel a sense of foreboding. Though I clearly know that there is an 80% chance that your idea is unreliable, I still want to hear it.\"","\"If you manage to court that Empress in the sea of blood, then wouldn’t you know everything!\" the large black dog said with a smile.","As expected!","Why did he have fantasies about this despicable dog that he shouldn’t have?","What good ideas could it come up with?","They were definitely all rancid!","\"That’s a good idea!\" The little azure dragon egged on from the sidelines. \"Little Han, go court her!\"","\"Get lost!\" Ling Han sent these two unreliable guys flying with a kick, heading towards Four Origin Planet.","They returned to the Four Origin Planet. They hadn’t even sat down properly, yet they were greeted by a noisy crowd.","\"What’s going on?\" Ling Han gritted his teeth. It looked like something incredible had happened."]},{"number":4731,"title":"Chapter 4731: Message from the Pseudo-Emperor","paragraphs":["\"Three months ago, a streak of golden light suddenly illuminated the galaxy, its speed extraordinarily fast,\" the empress said. \"The three Pseudo-Emperors, Buddha Doga, Qian Yanghao and Xia Houping all moved, wanting to capture it, but none of them succeeded.\"","What, Pseudo-Emperors actually couldn’t succeed after making a move?","Additionally—","\"Xia Houping?\" Ling Han was surprised. How had another Pseudo-Emperor appeared?","\"Not long ago, the three Pseudo-Emperors had come to visit, but you weren’t present,\" Chi Menghan said. \"And Lord Xia Houping said that he has once met you before.\"","\"Met me before?\" Ling Han was stunned. He had actually seen a Pseudo-Emperor without even knowing it?","He immediately searched through his mind to see if any one could match that description.","After a while, he asked, \"Is that Lord the woodcutter that I met by chance previously?\"","\"Haha, Niu’s Ling Han is indeed clever!\" Hu Niu suddenly jumped up, and shouted at everyone, \"How about it? Niu’s guess is still the most accurate. Niu’s Ling Han will definitely be able to guess, and he succeeded at the first attempt!\"","Everyone smiled faintly. Hu Niu was still that Hu Niu. She had been like this when she was young, and she was still like this now that she had grown up. She had been like this when she was a Heavenly Venerate, and she was still like this when she was a Saint.","Though there were times when she was bold and rash, this kind of personality was really something that others could not help but want to dote on her.","Meanwhile, Ling Han smacked his lips. He had never thought that the woodcutter he had met by chance would actually be a Pseudo-Emperor. Before this, he had always thought that the latter was a Saint.","No wonder Buddha Doga had said that he would discuss with \"them\". If it was only Qian Yanghao, how could it possibly be \"them\"?","\"How is this golden light now?\" Ling Han asked.","\"It’s still flying in space,\" the empress continued. \"According to the deductions of the three Pseudo-Emperors, this golden light comes from the Primitive Abyss. It has the unique aura of that place.\"","The unique aura of the Primitive Abyss... Genesis Substance?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel moved. If he could obtain this golden light, his cultivation level would definitely increase rapidly.","\"Do you want to know what that is?\" Chi Menghan asked with a smile, a hint of mischief in her voice.","Ling Han’s heart fluttered. This beautiful wife of his had also learnt to tempt him now. This was really too embarrassing. He actually couldn’t control himself.","\"What? What?\" the large black dog asked greedily.","If he wasn’t greedy, then he wouldn’t be the large black dog.","Chi Menghan didn’t \"tease\" Ling Han anymore. After all, her husband’s gaze made her a little... uncontrolled, and she hurriedly said, \"The three Pseudo-Emperors deduced that is the Natural-born Gold Spirit!\"","Natural-born Gold Spirit!","Yi, what did this have to do with Natural-born Stone Spirit?","The Natural-born Stone Spirit could be forged into one’s doppelganger, and its battle prowess could even soar to Pseudo-Emperor-level. Moreover, with the Stone Spirit’s powerful defense, it wouldn’t be killed even by the Imperial Weapon. It could be said that there was no way to break through its defenses.","What the hell was a Natural-born Gold Spirit?","However, when he thought of the Natural-born Stone Spirit, Ling Han couldn’t help but think of Ge Qianqiu. He had met Old Man Ge at the place where the Natural-born Stone Spirit was nurtured. At the time, he had only thought that the latter was a low-key Saint.","His expression turned to grief, and he was no longer in the mood for anything.","\"According to Buddha Doga, Natural-born Gold Spirit is the same as Natural-born Stone Spirit. It can be refined to become a Pseudo-Emperor-level doppelganger.\" Chi Menghan continued, \"However, Natural-born Stone Spirit is more inclined towards defense, while Natural-born Gold Spirit is more inclined towards attack.\"","Among the Five Elements, earth represented thickness and defense, while gold represented sharpness and attack.","\"Now, it is not only the three Pseudo-Emperors that are searching for this Natural-born Gold Spirit. Even the various great Imperial Clan and those on the side of the Netherworld are doing the same,\" the empress continued. \"However, the Natural-born Gold Spirit is too fast. As of now, no force has succeeded in capturing it yet.\"","Ling Han was shocked, and pulled himself out of his grief.","The great Imperial Clans were searching for the Natural-born Gold Spirit. This was understandable, because as long as their Imperial Son refined it into a doppelganger, then not only would it add a being with Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess to their side, they could even use the Natural-born Gold Spirit to appreciate the Great Emperor-level Regulations.","In that way, they would be able to snatch the first opportunity in the competition for the throne.","The Netherworld’s side also had a very good reason for wanting to snatch the Natural-born Gold Spirit. Firstly, they also had Imperial Son-level characters, and secondly, if a Pseudo-Emperor appeared, they would be able to decrease the number of times the Lords of Death would have to make a move personally.","Though there was no direct evidence, everyone could guess by now that the Lords of Death couldn’t make a move casually, or there would definitely be serious future trouble.","Thus, if the Netherworld’s side had a Pseudo-Emperor, and it was forged from the Natural-born Gold Spirit that had incredibly powerful attack at that, it was sure that Buddha Doga and the others would have tremendous headaches.","Thus, even if the Living Realm army obtained the Natural-born Gold Spirit, they wouldn’t be able to change the situation of being beaten. However, they definitely couldn’t allow the Natural-born Gold Spirit to fall into the hands of the Netherworld.","—Even if it meant destroying it.","\"Then let’s go and search as well!\" Ling Han immediately said.","\"The three Pseudo-Emperors have left a message. Once the Natural-born Gold Spirit stops, they will immediately send a message,\" Chi Menghan said.","Fine then.","Ling Han, the large black dog, and the little azure dragon rested first. After all, they had been in the Netherworld for so many years, and had always been separated from the heaven and earth of the Living Realm. They needed to replenish their power of Regulation.","Boom!","Seven days later, an astonishing aura suddenly exploded from Ling Han’s body. An orange-colored pillar of light shot into the sky, dazzling the universe.","He had broken through!","A Three Star Saint.","Er, in terms of the color of the holy flame, he was indeed a three-star Saint. However, in terms of breaking through, he should be a five-star Saint, but in terms of the number of Regulations, he had far surpassed a nine-star Saint.","\"Unfortunately, I am still unable to sense the Nine Star Regulations. Otherwise, even if I could not become the strongest Great Emperor, if I could become a Great Emperor in advance, I would still be able to resist a Lord of Death.\"","Ling Han shook his head. At this moment, he was no longer purely pursuing his own strength. Instead, he was more concerned about the lives of the people in the world.","Ge Qianqiu’s sacrifice touched him too deeply.","Ling Han familiarized himself with his own power. The number of Regulations he had grasped now had reached as many as 43, but that was still less than half the limit of 99.","\"If I cultivate Regulations normally, even if freaks like me can grasp five Regulations every time I break through to the next star-level, at most, I can only grasp 60 Regulations when I reach the level of Nine Star Saint.\"","\"When a Great Emperor was a Saint, there most likely weren’t any Pseudo-Emperors that brought them to the Primitive Abyss, and even if there were, their physique would not be able to withstand the extreme gravity there.\"","\"Hence, even if a Great Emperor is freakish, and every time he advances one star in Saint Tier, even if he can grasp four eight-star Regulations, the limit would only be thirty-six flashes.\"","\"In this sense, I’ve already far surpassed the Great Emperors of the past.\"","This was also why Ling Han had the confidence to attempt breaking through to Great Emperor-level now. Even if he had not reached his limits yet, as long as he became a Great Emperor, he would definitely be stronger than those Great Emperors of previous eras.","The large black dog and little azure dragon also broke through one after another. Looks like training in the Netherworld would also be of great help in improving their cultivation level.","In the Netherworld, they had to constantly resist the invasion of the Regulations of the Netherworld, and guard against being assimilated by the Regulations of the Netherworld. Under this accumulation, they finally managed to break through smoothly.","Moreover, Ling Han had also immersed himself in the Primitive Abyss for over 200 years."]},{"number":4732,"title":"Chapter 4732: Divine Beast Graveyard","paragraphs":["However, this kind of thing could not be repeated. The heaven and earth would not allow a cultivator to cheat like this, and easily break through to Saint Tier consecutively.","Once was already good enough.","If he wanted to become the truly strongest Saint, he would definitely have to go to the Primitive Abyss and continue to obtain Genesis Substance. Without allowing his body to experience Silent Destruction, he would have to grasp even more Regulations.","Otherwise, after Silent Destruction nine times, his body would reach its limit, and then he would directly fuse with heaven and earth, which was equivalent to suicide.","Even someone as strong as Ling Han could not possibly change this kind of fate. Thus, if he wanted to grasp 99 Regulationswhen he was a Saint, he would have to obtain even more Genesis Substance, and could only go to the Primitive Abyss to obtain this.","Ling Han was already prepared. When the matter of the Natural-born Gold Spirit was over, he would ask Buddha Doga to take him to the Primitive Abyss again.","Of course, it was not the kind of trip that would require him to burn the Imperial Source, but rather take two hundred years to make another trip.","In any case, while he was on the road, he could also appreciate the Regulations, and would not waste any time.","After waiting for several days, news came from Buddha Doga that the Natural-born Gold Spirit had stopped. However, it had actually fallen into a land of peril.","It wasn’t like the Twelve Lands of Death, where a Fallen Great Emperor was standing guard. Instead, it was a true land of peril, and it was naturally formed.","This place was called the \"Divine Beast Graveyard\".","That’s right, it was the Divine Beasts that had appeared in the first batch when the heaven and earth was first created. There were a considerable number of them that had come here in the last moments of their lives, and died.","From then onwards, Imperial Might spread out, turning that place into a land of death. Even Saints would have to be extremely careful when entering, and they could be killed at any time.","And with the suppression of the Imperial Might, there was not much production of treasures there either. Thus, there was naturally even less meaning to venture in.","For a long time, that place was the most dangerous place in the universe, and no one had ever entered.","Only an idiot would go.","But now, the Natural-born Gold Spirit actually chose that place in the end.","It could not be helped. Even if it was dangerous, they had to go.","The most important thing now was definitely not to allow the Netherworld to obtain this Natural-born Gold Spirit.","Ling Han and the others set off.","Now, this was a team that was completely made up of Saints. Aside from the iron trio of Ling Han, the large black dog and the little azure dragon, there was also Brother Monkey, the empress, Hu Niu, Chi Menghan, Lin Luo, Zhou Heng, and so on.","Even someone as powerful as the Imperial Clans could not possibly produce so many Saints in one go.","If Ling Han became Emperor, he would definitely be able to establish the strongest Imperial Clan in history. They would definitely be peerless.","The Divine Beast Graveyard was still within the jurisdiction of the Living Realm. This was a good thing. At least, if they were fighting with the Netherworld, they would have the home ground advantage, and there was no need for them to worry that as they fought, the Regulations in their bodies would all be used up.","Very quickly, they arrived at their destination.","Actually, this was a star. From afar, it looked like a golden orb, and was not dangerous at all. On the contrary, it was quite pleasing to the eye.","However, when they got closer, they discovered that the aura here was too terrifying. It had taken solid form, as if it was a supreme God Tool.","It could be seen that the periphery of this planet was covered with all kinds of shards. They were made out of metal, wood, and even broken corpses.","This was because some warships had accidentally passed by here, and the result was naturally their ship being destroyed and their people dying.","There was no sign of life on the dead planet.","\"This star contains a large amount of metal. No wonder the Natural-born Gold Spirit ultimately chose this place.\"","\"Be careful.\"","They descended towards the planet, not daring to be too fast. The aura here was too chaotic, and the destructive power was too terrifying.","Perhaps, only Ling Han could be unafraid.","His current physique was probably even tougher than a Pseudo-Emperor. If it was just resisting this kind of Great Emperor-level aura, he still had a lot of confidence in doing it.","After a long time, they finally landed on the ground.","This was indeed a star with extremely high metal content. At a glance, it was completely plated with gold. It was dazzling with golden light, practically blinding one’s eyes.","The large black dog lowered his head to look at the iron underwear on his body, then showed a hint of pride.","This planet was not as eye-catching as it was.","Peng!","Everyone sent the large black dog flying with a kick.","F***, this guy was really too vulgar.","\"Why are you kicking Grandpa Dog?\" The large black dog was still wearing a dumbfounded expression.","The little azure dragon placed a hand on its forehead and said, \"Grandpa Dragon is too embarrassed to be with you in the future!\"","\"Four-Legged Snake, are you looking for a beating?\" The large black dog was furious, and immediately charged over.","The two unreliable guys fought fiercely, but they were naturally just playing around. They would not get serious.","However, the battle between the two of them caused quite a commotion. Three people quickly approached from the distance.","A smile spread across Ling Han’s face. These were the three Saints from the Saintly Heaven Imperial Clan. One was Luo Yang, the son of the Great Emperor, the second was an old Nine Star Saint, and the third was also an old Saint, but his cultivation level was slightly weaker, being only a Six Star Saint.","He did not become enemies with the Saintly Heavenly Imperial Clan. On the contrary, they had previously formed an alliance, so his expression was naturally gentle.","\"Ling Han, several hundred years have already passed since we last parted,\" Luo Yang said. Although he was only a Seven Star Saint at this moment, his identity as the son of a Great Emperor was clear for all to see. He was the ancestor of the other two Saints for who knew how many generations.","Moreover, though his cultivation level was slightly inferior, in terms of battle prowess, it was definitely him that was stronger.","Thus, when he spoke on behalf of the Saintly Heavenly Imperial Clan, the other two Saints felt that this was only natural.","Ling Han nodded, \"Brother Luo’s improvement is obvious, congratulations.\"","\"It can’t compare to the line of the Nine Suns Saint!\" Luo Yang exclaimed ruefully. Just look, just how many Saints were there?","Although the strongest among them, Brother Monkey was only a five-star Saint, it couldn’t hold up to the fact that his power was still astonishing.","—Those that could become Saints in this era basically depended on their own comprehension of Regulations, and could not draw on the power of belief. Thus, those that could become Saints were all prodigies among prodigies. No matter what, they would be able to charge up to five stars in future.","How could such a lineup not be astonishing!","However, it was a shame that the Netherworld had invaded, and the Lords of Death had also appeared out of nowhere. Thus, this dazzling lineup was nothing special in comparison.","Ling Han smiled, and said, \"Brother Luo and the others came early. Do you have any clues?\"","The two Saints from the Saintly Heaven Imperial Clan hurriedly signalled with their eyes. This meant that they definitely couldn’t say that if they obtained the Natural-born Gold Spirit, they could completely seize the opportunity to become Emperor.","Though Ling Han was the number one Saint of all eternity, who did not hope that it would be their Imperial Son that would become Emperor?","Yet Luo Yang acted as if he had not seen anything, and said, \"There are not many clues, and I would not be able to help Brother Ling too much.\"","Sigh... The two Saints couldn’t help but sigh.","Ling Han thought to himself. After all, he was the son of a Great Emperor, so his vision was different.","However, Luo Yang and the others had only arrived not too long ago, and had only searched a small area. At most, they could only rule out that area, and conclude that it was impossible that the Natural-born Gold Spirit was there.","This planet was filled with Imperial Might, which seriously interfered with divine sense. It was impossible to search with divine sense. Furthermore, no one dared to run around madly here, as they would similarly be pierced into bloody holes by the air formed by Imperial Might.","Ling Han tried to communicate with the ley lines, but discovered that this was a dead star. How could there be any ley lines?","They could only search inch by inch with their naked eyes."]},{"number":4733,"title":"Chapter 4733: Killing Lu Xun","paragraphs":["The group began a search.","They were all Saints, and searching together would be a waste of manpower. Thus, everyone moved separately.","Of course, they were all extremely careful. If they came across an Imperial Sons of the Land of Death, they would immediately flee if they were no match. They definitely couldn’t linger in battle.","In this place, no matter how strong a Saint was, they would not dare to use movement techniques to run madly. Thus, as long as they did not continue fighting, there would basically be no problems.","Ling Han walked with his hands clasped behind his back, and began to slowly speed up.","He wanted to give it a try and see how fast he could be in this kind of environment.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","As he sped up, the Imperial Might that permeated the air instantly transformed into a sharp blade that stabbed towards him.","However, his tough physique took effect, and the \"sharp swords\" that attacked him were instantly shattered one after another, and he only felt a slight numbness.","He could go even faster.","He sped up again, and finally, his tolerance had reached its limit. The sharp swords formed by Imperial Might posed a substantial threat to him.","At this kind of speed, he could probably hold on for three to five minutes.","This was equivalent to his speed when he was a Sect Master. In this kind of place... he was already unreasonably fast.","It could be said that even Buddha Doga and the other Pseudo-Emperors could not compare to him.","Ling Han could release his divine sense to a certain extent, covering an area of 0.5 km around him. He could guarantee that in this area, there would be something that slipped through the net.","\"Actually, if one were to resist the Imperial Might here, it would be beneficial for one to cultivate the Regulations.\" Ling Han murmured, \"However, there is not just a single Divine Beast’s corpse buried here. The aura is too heterogeneous, and if one stays here for too long, it would definitely be harmful.\"","He continued to advance. At this moment, he was already the most powerful Saint. Thus, he wouldn’t be afraid even if he came across the Skeleton Saint Tool. The only thing that could suppress him would be a Great Emperor.","’Hmm?’","Where he could see, a person had appeared ahead of him.","Lu Xun!","A fallen Imperial Son.","Ling Han couldn’t help but smile. Very good, very good. Previously, when Old Man Ge had died, it was because of the interference of the Golden Crow Great Emperor. Now that he had encountered the son of this fallen Great Emperor, he could first collect some interest for Old Man Ge.","If he was pleasantly surprised, then for Lu Xun, he was completely shocked.","Without another word, Lu Xun immediately turned around and fled.","In this place, even a Pseudo-Emperor couldn’t unleash his full speed. He was confident that he could escape.","However, he had only run a few steps, when he felt a weight on his shoulder, and his steps were actually forcefully stopped.","He was shocked to see a large hand resting on his shoulder!","It was Ling Han!","F***, when did this guy catch up to him?","It should be known that they had been about 5km away from each other previously. Even if that distance could be covered in the time that would take for a thought to form under normal circumstances, in this place, though it was not like a Divine Abyss, there was indeed a very, very far distance between them.","This was inconceivable. He had actually been caught up to so quickly.","How could Ling Han possibly be so fast?","’You’re only a Saint.’","Ling Han smiled and said, \"I’ll send you on your way first. In the future, I will send your father to accompany you in hel.\"","\"Ling Han, you dare to kill me?\" Lu Xun exclaimed in shock. \"My father is the Golden Crow Great Emperor. Do you want to become deadly enemies with a Great Emperor?\"","Ling Han couldn’t help but chuckle, and countered with a question of his own, \"Could it be that we are not deadly enemies now?\"","If it was just an invasion from the Twelve Lands of Death, then it was only a matter of position on both sides, but added with the death of Old Man Ge, it added another layer of personal enmity.","\"With a Great Emperor hunting you down, you will definitely not be able to escape death!\" Lu Xun still wanted to threaten him further.","\"Oh.\" Ling Han nodded, \"Do you have any other last words?\"","Lu Xun gritted his teeth. Boom! Golden flames suddenly exploded from his body, transforming into countless feather arrows that shot rapidly towards Ling Han.","This time, he was really going all out. He burned the holy flame, sparing no expense. Otherwise, his only fate would be death. In fact, the holy flame would still be taken away by Ling Han, and turned into nutrients for his cultivation.","Ling Han did not dodge, nor did he parry. He merely maintained his original posture, and allowed the tens of thousands of feather arrows to shoot towards him.","Peng, peng, peng! The holy flame and Regulations continued to explode on his body. However, he remained unscathed and motionless.","Lu Xun was so shocked that his eyes were about to pop out of his head. What kind of terrifying physique was this?","This was too terrifying. What kind of monster was this?","Ling Han did not speak any nonsense. A sliver of intent rushed out, and entered into Lu Xun’s mind.","What Great Emperor-level trump card? At present, it was completely unable to stop Ling Han. After all, a Great Emperor could not possibly casually create a Great Emperor-level trump card, and in the case of Saint-level, how could it possibly be a match for Ling Han?","Boom, Lu Xun’s mind was instantly shattered, and his eyes immediately lost focus, losing all luster.","His mind had been shattered, so he had naturally died on the spot.","Ling Han drew out Lu Xun’s holy flame, and immediately refined it.","Initially, he disdained from doing this. However, the situation now was too dire. He had to increase his cultivation level as soon as possible.","However, with a wave of the holy flame in his body, it immediately burned this ball of holy flame in Lu Xun’s body into dust, leaving behind only a sliver of essence, causing his holy flame to increase slightly.","This...","Ling Han couldn’t help but smile bitterly. The holy flame that he had ignited was too awesome. It was number one in all of history, but he had to pay a corresponding price for it. It was just that improving it would be too slow.","When other Saints devoured the holy flame, their cultivation level would soar. However, what about him?","Even a \"high quality\" holy flame like Lu Xun’s was pitifully little help to him.","\"If all the Saints in the universe gave me their holy flame, would it be able to help me advance another level?\" Ling Han shook his head. This really depressed him. He had one less method to quickly improve himself.","However, this was also good. Refining the holy flame of another would always give Ling Han a feeling of evil. Furthermore, it would definitely cause the holy flame to become heterogeneous, and affect his battle prowess.","Ling Han casually tossed Lu Xun’s corpse aside and continued to advance.","Killing Lu Xun could no longer cause any ripples in his emotions.","Now, he only had the Twelve Lands of Death in his eyes, as well as the thirty-six Divine Beasts of the Primitive Abyss. Their appearance was too strange.","Furthermore, since there was a Divine Beast Graveyard here, then where did the corresponding Divine Beasts from the Primitive Abyss come from?","Walking on this colossal star, since this was the tomb chosen by the Divine Beasts, it was naturally astonishingly huge. If one wanted to search every inch of land, it would take an astonishing amount of time.","What if the Natural-born Gold Spirit hid deep underground?","Then it would be even harder to find.","Ling Han suddenly had an idea. What if he could \"revive\" this star?","Once the star came back to life, the ley lines would be of use to him, and then it would be easier to search for the location of the Natural-born Gold Spirit.","This was not a bad idea.","Ling Han sat down cross-leggedly, and began to communicate with this star.","Even if reviving a planet would take an extremely long time, compared to walking around aimlessly, this was still more assured and reliable.","Ling Han’s consciousness continuously surged into the depths of the ground. There was also Imperial Might here, but it was not as violent as the surface, allowing his consciousness to penetrate deeper.","However, this still very quickly reached its limit, and was far from reaching the core of the planet.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before diving into the ground and charging toward the core.","However, though this underground layer was slightly weaker, the ground had been heavily tempered by the Imperial Might, so it was incredibly sturdy. Even if it couldn’t compare to the Primitive Abyss, it still had a great restriction on Ling Han.","Ling Han advanced with great difficulty."]},{"number":4734,"title":"Chapter 4734: Reviving a star","paragraphs":["Ling Han burrowed into the ground, and slowly ventured deeper.","If it was other people besides him, there was no one else that could do it.","The same was true for the Skeleton Saint Tool. In terms of destructive power alone, Ling Han was definitely the strongest beneath the level of Great Emperor.","The Destructive Energy and the light of great dao unleashed their might together, and he could even easily destroy the Saintly Material. What kind of concept was that?","Of course, this was incomparable to a Great Emperor.","Ling Han could see clearly from the memories of the Blood Sea Empress. She had easily carved words in the imperial palace, but what about him?","But now, Ling Han could guarantee that as long as a Lord of Death didn’t appear, no one could compare to his destructive power.","He cleared a path, and finally arrived at the core of the planet.","All right, let’s begin!","Ling Han sat down on his knees, beginning to revive this planet.","Boom! He unleashed his divine sense, which surged toward the core of the planet like a vast ocean.","This was a dead star. It had died a very, very long time ago.","Was it because of the Imperial Might?","Ling Han carefully sensed for a while, and thought that it was, but also wasn’t.","This star had indeed been killed by Emperor-level power. However, before this, there were a few other powers protecting this star. These were all Emperor-level powers.","One after another, the Divine Beasts that had died here did not destroy this star. On the contrary, before they died, they were still using their own power to protect it, but at some unknown time, another Emperor-level existence had arrived here, causing destruction.","Even after countless years had passed, there was still surplus of this destructive Emperor-level power. Furthermore, it was incredibly powerful.","Ling Han was now qualified to come into contact with the level of Great Emperor. He could say with certainty that this Imperial Might was stronger than the True Dragon Emperor in the Primitive Abyss, and stronger than the Lords of Death that had moved previously.","Of course, there was definitely something wrong with the True Dragon Emperor, and the Lords of Death couldn’t use their full strength either. Thus, Ling Han was still unable to make a direct judgement.","It could only be said that this Emperor-level existence was very strong.","Why did the Divine Beasts want to protect this planet, but why was there a Great Emperor that wanted to destroy it?","Divine Beast?","There were also \"revived\" Divine Beasts in the Primitive Abyss. What was the connection between them?","Perhaps, after resurrecting this star, he would be able to find out the answer, or a clue, from the memory of the star.","Ling Han dared to give it a try because there were also countless stars in the dimensions inside his body.","The two couldn’t be compared, but Ling Han felt that with his power, he might be able to nurture this star, and then rebuild it from its destroyed state.","He released his own power, and attempted to make the dimensions inside him resonate with this star.","This was a long attempt, but Ling Han didn’t think that it was a waste of time, because in this process, he had also deepened his comprehension of the Power of Dimension.","After coming out of the Genesis World, he rarely paid attention to his dimensions anymore. He only knew that they could help him break through, reaching one limit after another.","But compared with the great universe outside, everything inside him were too weak.","When Heavenly Venerates appeared, they were as powerless as a newborn infant. Any kind of Heavenly Venerable Tier-level Spirit Tool would be worth less than dirt in this great universe outside.","But now, when Ling Han discovered that he could accommodate the stars of the great universe, he had another thought.","Could he take out the dimensions in his body and turn them into a part of this universe?","It should be known that dimensions were actually even stronger than Heavenly Venerable Tier. If dimensions were taken out one after another, wouldn’t they be able to avoid being crushed into dust by the great universe?","Of course, after it was taken out, how the dimensions would develop would be another problem.","Ling Han was instantly distracted, but he quickly pulled himself back together.","This... he would consider it in the future. He had best think about how he was going to revive this planet.","Perhaps, even a Great Emperor would not be able to bring a star back to life, but because of the Genesis World in Ling Han’s body, it was possible for him to do so.","Of course, Ding Shu and the others could do the same. However, their battle prowess was inferior to Ling Han, so it was impossible for them to reach where the core was. Thus, this possibility was also ruled out.","Ling Han extracted the Power of Dimension from within his body and poured it into the core. At the same time, he also released the power of the stars in an attempt to resonate with this core.","Three months passed in a row, and the core was still lifeless, and there was no change at all.","However, Ling Han didn’t turn around and abandon it. Firstly, he believed that this would definitely take a long time, and secondly, this would allow him to have a deeper and deeper understanding of the use of the Power of Dimensions. It would still be greatly beneficial.","Another three months, another half year, and Ling Han continued to inject energy into the core. All of a sudden, he received a feedback signal. Though it was extremely weak, it had indeed happened.","He couldn’t help but feel energized. Was the willpower of the planet about to awaken?","Continue.","Ling Han continued to inject more energy. This time, he was still paying close attention to how the regeneration process of the planet was like.","Another half year passed, and the reaction of the star became more and more intense. However, for the moment, it was impossible for the star to be greatly improved. After all, after being in a state of \"death\" for such a long time, if it suddenly came back to life, it would still be severely injured, right?","Next, it was time for the planet to slowly awaken.","It didn’t matter. Since the star had been revived, the ley lines could definitely be used, just like the meridians of the human body. No matter how weak they were, they could still allow blood to flow.","He spread his consciousness through the ley lines, thereby allowing him to observe this entire planet.","He first saw Brother Monkey, the empress, and the others. Thankfully, all of them were fine, but now, there were also a great many Imperial Sons from the Lands of Death, and they even brought the Skeleton Saint Tools with them. They were invincible. If they encountered them, Brother Monkey and the others, as well as the great Imperial Clans, could only retreat.","For the moment... it wasn’t a big deal.","Ling Han decided to go out later and ruthlessly deal with those Skeleton Saint Tools. Right now, the most important thing was to find the location of the Natural-born Gold Spirit.","This was too important, and definitely could not fall into the hands of the Lands of Death.","Yi?","Ling Han determined a location. This place was permeated with a powerful imperial might, and where it was the densest on the entire planet.","Was this where the Divine Beasts had died?","Because the Imperial Might here was too strong, Ling Han’s consciousness could only sense this place, but could not glimpse the exact details. Thus, he decided to directly head over to take a look.","Star Steps was not applicable here, because the star had just awakened. The power of the ley lines was too fragile, and he could not arrive instantaneously.","Ling Han exited the core, and went to find the empress and the others first.","He could now contact the ley lines to locate everyone at any time. Thus, he didn’t spend too much time to find everyone.","Of course, he would not inform the other Imperial Clans. Instead of fighting over the Natural-born Gold Spirit, which would be unpleasant, it would be better not to let them know.","\"Little Han, hurry up and help Grandpa Dog get back his pride!\" When he found the large black dog, the large black dog’s iron underwear actually split open, \"There’s a pervert Sketon Saint Tool that actually wants to r@pe Grandpa Dog’s a**!\"","Er, you’re overthinking things, aren’t you? How could a Skeleton Saint Tool have this kind of fetish? It just happened to hit that place.","Ling Han shook his head, \"Let’s go find the Natural-born Gold Spirit first.\"","This was the most important thing at present."]},{"number":4735,"title":"Chapter 4735: Encountering Tong Ming again","paragraphs":["Ling Han didn’t find the three Pseudo-Emperors.","It wasn’t that Buddha Doga and the others hadn’t arrived, but rather that Pseudo-Emperors were too strong, and they had their own means to conceal their traces. And Ling Han wanted to use the weak ley lines to locate them?","How was this possible!","However, Ling Han didn’t need to worry about the three of them. As powerful as Pseudo-Emperors were, who could suppress them if a Great Emperor did not appear?","Ling Han led the way, bringing the others with him as they advanced.","Their speed wasn’t fast, but under the premise that they didn’t have to take a detour, it would only be a matter of time before they reached their destination.","When they found out about Ling Han’s grand feat of reviving the star, everyone was stunned.","Something like that was possible?","\"Going by that logic, as long as Little Han is still alive, even if the entire Living Realm is controlled by the Yin souls, we can still revive planet after planet, and take back the lost territory!\"","This was naturally the last resort, yet it left a path of retreat for the entire universe.","If Ling Han didn’t die, the Living Realm would not be destroyed.","’Hmm?’","Ling Han suddenly stopped in his tracks and looked in another direction.","\"What is it?\" the empress asked. With Ling Han’s personality, when he decided to do something, it was definitely impossible for him to retreat halfway. Thus, he must have discovered something.","Ling Han smiled, and looked towards the large black dog, \"Do you want revenge?\"","With how smart the large black dog was, he immediately asked, \"You discovered an Imperial Son of the Lands of Death?\"","Ling Han nodded in understanding.","\"Let’s go, let’s go, let’s f*ck him up!\" The large black dog looked at his slightly cracked iron underwear, and his expression immediately became one of grief and indignation.","Want to r@pe Grandpa Dog’s a**?","\"Hold on!\" The large black dog waved his hand again, \"All of you, don’t move. Grandpa Dog will go alone. It would be fine as long as Little Han secretly listens to Grandpa Dog’s commands, and attacks wherever I point and just protect Grandpa Dog.\"","After suffering such great humiliation, and almost being r@ped, the large black dog naturally wanted to exact revenge.","Was there any meaning to taking revenge and not showing off while he was at it?","Ling Han smiled. Though time was tight, the large black dog had suffered a great loss. If he did not allow it to take revenge, this guy would definitely not be able to think straight, and would continue to cause trouble.","Alright, it shouldn’t waste too much time.","The large black dog dashed out in a flash, running in the direction that Ling Han pointed at. His speed wasn’t fast, and if he was fast, that would be courting death.","It had not walked too far, when two people appeared ahead of it.","To say that there were two, it was actually not very appropriate, because one was indeed human, but in the case of the other, it was a skeletal monster as tall as three hundred meters.","An Imperial Son of the Lands of Death, Tong Ming, and a Skeleton Saint Tool.","After discovering the large black dog, Tong Ming couldn’t help but sneer.","It was this despicable dog.","If Ling Han’s potential threat to the Lands of Death was the greatest, the mouth of the large black dog was truly a magnet for trouble.","The number one despicable Saint of all eternity, he truly lived up to his name.","Tong Ming sneered, and said, \"Damn dog, you’re truly unlucky. You actually ran head-first into the hands of this Imperial Son!\" Tong Ming sneered. To say nothing of the fact that he still had the Skeleton Saint Tool by his side, even if he were alone, he would still have more than enough power to suppress this despicable dog.","Just how freakish was the son of a Great Emperor? He was only inferior to a freak like Ling Han.","The large black dog was filled with arrogance. He was confident now, so what did he have to fear?","\"Little Ming, did you forget to brush your teeth today, or did you eat sh*t? Why is your mouth so smelly?\"","Tong Ming was rendered speechless. ’Just how smelly is your own mouth? Don’t you have any estimates?’","He was actually making false accusations. As expected of the Despicable Saint.","He had the intention to kill the large black dog, so that Ling Han’s side would have one less \"great weapon\". After all, the large black dog’s verbal attacks were still quite threatening, as they could infuriate people and greatly affect their emotions.","Thus, he was in no rush to attack. Instead, he wanted to stabilize the large black dog first, while he had the Skeleton Saint Tool move behind the large black dog, cutting off his path of retreat.","Then, they would pincer attack from both sides, and the large black dog would definitely be killed.","He deliberately chatted idly with the large black dog, and the large black dog was also extremely cooperative, bickering with the latter. In any case, when it came to strength in this area, if it was ranked second, neither the little azure dragon nor Ling Han would dare claim to be first.","Though it had only been a few words, Tong Ming was still so furious that he almost exploded. Who asked him to speak to the large black dog?","However, the Skeleton Saint Tool had already moved into position for a pincer attack.","Very good, there was no need to tolerate this despicable dog any longer.","\"From today onwards, you are a dead dog,\" he announced.","\"Pei, Grandpa Dog won’t die today, and won’t die tomorrow either. Even after you die for a million years, Grandpa Dog will still be alive and well. Every year, Grandpa Dog will come to your grave to see you, take a piss, and fertilize the grass on your grave.\" How could the large black dog show weakness? He immediately returned the favor twice over.","Tong Ming grimaced upon hearing this. ’F*ck! If I speak too much, I’ll definitely suffer internal injuries!’","\"Die!\" He launched an attack at the large black dog.","Boom, his battle prowess was completely unleashed, turning into a Demonic Sunflower that soared into the skies. It stretched out its vines, and charged towards the large black dog.","The large black dog did not move to parry. Instead, he placed his two front paws behind his back, \"Humph, disperse!\"","As his words fell, with a bang, the Demonic Sunflower actually exploded.","Tong Ming was slightly depressed. This place was filled with the aura of Great Emperors and it had already solidified. Thus, when he attacked from afar, he would naturally come into contact with this aura of Great Emperors, and directly disintegrate his attack.","However, he was still a little confused. He had clearly tried his best to avoid it.","It was fine. If he missed with a single strike, he would just attack again. At present, he had completely taken the initiative.","Tong Ming unleashed another attack. It was still a Demonic Sunflower, and it shot toward the large black dog.","\"Heaven and earth have their own Dao, so how can it be disturbed!\" The large black dog was extremely forceful, and stretched out a paw, waving it lightly, \"Grandpa Dog commands to disperse!\"","Peng, the Demonic Sunflower exploded again.","’F*ck!’","Tong Ming’s eyes widened in shock. How could there be such a coincidence?","Just then, another streak of aura of Great Emperors had slightly veered off course. In the end, his attack had collided into it, and was naturally dispersed again.","But the problem was, why was it so coincidental?","Furthermore, this despicable dog was also taking things a bit too calmly. Could it be that he did not know that his strength was far superior to his? Furthermore, as a Saint, er, even if he was the greatest despicable Saint in history, he should have basic observation skills.","’Aren’t you curious where the Skeleton Saint Tool beside me went?’","He frowned. He couldn’t drag things out for too long.","Tong Ming closed in on him. He was going to close the distance between them before making his move. In that way, the aura of Great Emperors would no longer be a disturbance.","He strode forward, drawing closer and closer to the large black dog.","\"Humph, how could a piece of trash like you be able to imagine my might?\" The large black dog extended a paw, \"Kneel down!\"","\"Let—\" He had not even finished his words, when Tong Ming felt a terrifying power surge towards him, causing his legs to go out of control completely. With a pa, he knelt down.","W-what!","His tongue almost fell out of his mouth. The large black dog had such terrifying abilities?","F***, could it be that you are the true king of concealment?","He hurriedly sent out a signal to summon the Skeleton Saint Tool over. This was a deadly weapon that could sweep aside all the Saints in the world.","Yi?","Where was the Skeleton Saint Tool?","Why was there no response to his summons?","Just how powerful was the large black dog’s ability to read expressions? He immediately sneered, \"Still counting on that skeletal monster? Humph, do you think I don’t know that it has circled around to the back? I have dealt with it long ago.\""]},{"number":4736,"title":"Chapter 4736: Where are the Divine Beast corpses?","paragraphs":["Tong Ming definitely didn’t believe the large black dog’s words. However, the problem was that his connection with the Skeleton Saint Tool had indeed been severed.","Hiss, could it be that this despicable dog was really the hidden trump card of Ling Han’s team?","Actually, Ling Han was only a secondary carriage that had been pushed onto the stage to attract attention. The main force was this despicable dog?","No, no, no!","Tong Ming hurriedly said to himself, ’I must be overthinking things.’","With how terrifying Ling Han was, he was already the greatest freak in history. How could this guy be even more freakish?","Could it be?","He was suddenly startled, and looked around.","\"Sunflower boy, hurry up and return to your original form. I want to munch on a few sunflower seeds. En, it would be nice if they could be used to produce oil to cook dishes,\" the large black dog snickered.","’I’m a member of the Demonic Sunflower Race, and my father is a Great Emperor. Yet, you actually dare to tease me like this?’","Tong Ming took a deep breath, then said loudly, \"Ling Han, I know you’re here, so why hide?\"","After a loud shout, there was no reaction from the surroundings. It was completely silent.","\"Sunflower boy, you dare to look down on Grandpa Dog?\" The large black dog howled as he strode toward Tong Ming.","However, even if he looked very furious, his expression couldn’t hide its smugness. Just look at how light his four legs were.","Tong Ming wore an expression of grief and indignation. He was the son of a Great Emperor, and he was more so a six-star Saint. Now, however, he was actually kneeling before a despicable dog. If news of this spread, how could he face others?","Furthermore, with this kind of humiliation, he would definitely be left with a knot in his heart, so how was he supposed to break through to attain the imperial throne?","\"Who asked you to covet Grandpa Dog’s a**!\" The large black dog approached, and delivered a slap. Pa, it was crisp and loud, but it immediately bared its teeth, \"F***, is your skin as strong as the city wall? It’s really hard and thick!\"","Tong Ming only wanted to vomit blood. As the son of a Great Emperor, the resources he received were naturally incredibly astonishing. His physique was definitely quite awesome.","But the problem was, to cause pain to the hand that had slapped him, was this his f****** original intention when he had tempered his physique?","Furthermore, who would f****** covet your a*s?","Tong Ming believed that he had never cursed as much in the first half of his life as he did at this moment.","The large black dog’s ability to destroy one’s composure was definitely the highest of the highest grade.","\"Look, Grandpa Dog’s underpants have all been torn apart by you guys. You’re practically perverts!\" The large black dog pointed at his shiny iron underpants, then squirmed again, \"Even if Grandpa Dog agrees, you guys have to be gentler, understand!\"","Pu!","Tong Ming couldn’t help but throw up blood. He was kneeling in front of the large black dog, and it was already humiliating enough for him to be slapped by the latter. Now, he had to suffer such false accusations, and have such dirty water poured on his reputation?","It was already good enough that he had not died from fury.","The large black dog was extremely smug. His philosophy was to disgust others to death, and now he finally felt like he had gotten his revenge, which was incredibly satisfying.","\"Grandpa Dog will send you on your way!\" He stretched out a paw, and delivered a palm strike at Tong Ming.","Tong Ming wanted to resist, yet he couldn’t move at all.","So what if he was a six-star Saint? In a situation when he could not resist, how could he match another Saint?","Peng, with this strike, he actually did not die. Only a large bump had appeared on his forehead.","The toughness of his physique was also quite shocking.","After all, he was the son of a Great Emperor.","The large black dog started to pummel Tong Ming again. However, this only caused Tong Ming to suffer a few more bumps.","It bared its teeth, rubbed its paws, and cried out, \"Little Han, it’s better that you do it. This guy’s head is like it was made of Saintly Material, and this pounding is hurting Grandpa Dog’s paw.\"","Xiu, Ling Han’s figure appeared.","Tong Ming’s vision was already blurred, yet he still managed to witness this scene. Sure enough, and this was his last thought in his life. Peng! With a single strike from Ling Han, his spirit was obliterated.","The large black dog hurriedly went to capture Tong Ming’s holy flame. This was an enemy, so he had no scruples.","Ling Han didn’t stop him. He wouldn’t use this method to increase his cultivation level, but he wouldn’t stop the large black dog either.","Now that the whole universe was in great danger, everyone by his side needed to quickly become stronger.","After the large black dog refined Tong Ming’s holy flame, the two of them returned to the team and continued to advance.","However, though the large black dog had refined the holy flame of a six-star Saint, it had not allowed it to advance another step further, and break through to become a five-star Saint.","After all, this wasn’t something that he had cultivated himself. There was the problem of conversion rate, but no matter what, he was still the son of a Great Emperor, so his improvement was still obvious.","Afterwards, they did not encounter any other Imperial Sons from the other Lands of Death. Instead, they discovered a few Imperial Clans, but they circled around them in advance, and did not meet up with them.","Since they were allies, and the Natural-born Gold Spirit was something that could only be obtained by one party, it was best not to move together, to avoid damaging the harmony between them.","After walking for a few more days, they finally arrived at a hidden location.","This entrance really wasn’t too obvious. If Ling Han hadn’t sensed this place through the ley lines, he probably wouldn’t have come straight here. He would have to search the entire planet several times before he could discover this place.","Not long after entering, they immediately sensed that the might of Great Emperors had become stronger.","They were close to the Divine Beast Graveyard.","Everyone was a little excited. After all, not many people had seen a Great Emperor-level corpse before.","Only Hu Niu began to drool. If it was a Divine Beast, its meat should not be too bad, and should taste very delicious.","However, after so many years, would the texture become worse?","This made her feel very conflicted, and her pretty face wrinkled into a frown.","After another while, the great Imperial Might became considerably stronger.","Ling Han frowned, \"Something’s not right.\"","\"What’s wrong?\" everyone asked.","Ling Han pondered for a moment, \"The extent of the increase in pressure from this Imperial Might gives me a feeling of illogicality. Logically speaking, we have already travelled for so long, so the pressure from this Imperial Might should be so strong that a considerable number of people would not be able to advance further.\"","But in truth, though it was a little difficult for everyone to advance now, it was not too much of a burden.","\"Little Han, you’re a well-fed man who doesn’t know how hungry others are. Don’t you know that Grandpa Dog and the others are about to become as tired as pigs?\" the large black dog said with his tongue sticking out. This might was extremely terrifying, all right?","Ling Han smiled. He was only relating his own judgement.","\"There must be something strange going on here. Everyone, be careful.\" He led the way ahead.","After another long time, the path ahead of them suddenly opened up.","\"This is—\"","\"Divine Beast Graveyard?\"","When everyone saw this, they were all dumbfounded. This was not the Divine Beast Graveyard, but rather an empty plain, all right?","Could it be that this place was just a pretense, and the Divine Beast Graveyard was not here?","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"Here, here, here, and here. There are all clear signs of depression. Moreover, the Imperial Might is permeating into the surroundings, so even I find it extremely difficult to approach.\"","He paused, then continued, \"Thus, I can confirm that those Divine Beasts had indeed died here.\"","\"Then... what about the Divine Beast corpses?\" Everyone was completely confused.","Would the Divine Beast corpses disappear into thin air?","Or had the corpses turned into zombies?","Or had they encountered grave robbers?","Er, if they had been stolen, then what cultivation level did this culprit have?","At least, Pseudo-Emperor."]},{"number":4737,"title":"Chapter 4737: Arrival of Netherworld troops","paragraphs":["The scene before their eyes rendered them speechless.","They should have found the Divine Beast Graveyard, but where was the main thing?","Hu Niu was even more depressed. Did this mean that she would not be able to eat the Divine Beast meat that was promised? Niu was so disappointed.","Ling Han thought for a long time, then said, \"Could it be that this is related to the appearance of new Divine Beasts in the Primitive Abyss?\"","These Divine Beasts had come back to life, and had gone to the Primitive Abyss?","But that wasn’t right. The time for those new Divine Beasts from the Primitive Abyss to have appeared definitely wouldn’t have been too long. At least, it would be after the first life of Buddha Doga, and looking at this place, the passing of time left obvious traces. That definitely meant that no one had set foot here for tens of billions of years.","Though he did not know the exact times that changes had occured in this great universe, he was sure that it had far surpassed the first life of Buddha Doga.","Thus, the Divine Beast corses disappeared first, and the Buddha Doga appeared only after that.","This wasn’t right.","Could it be that the Divine Beasts that had previously revived were all focused on recuperating in the Primitive Abyss?","Ling Han felt that this world was becoming more and more confusing. There were too many things that could not be explained.","\"Yi, what’s this?\" the little azure dragon suddenly called out.","Everyone went over to take a look, and saw that there was a feather on the ground that was exuding a nine-coloured light. However, the light was not very bright, but if one stared closely, they would discover that this feather actually had the dense feeling that a star would have.","However, they couldn’t go too close. This was in a groove that a Divine Beast had left behind.","\"Left behind by a Divine Beast?\" Everyone guessed.","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower hovered above Ling Han’s head, and he continued forward.","When he entered into that groove, the Imperial Might turned directly into a sharp sword, that slashed out towards Ling Han. However, with the protection of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, the Imperial Might naturally could not pierce through. After all, this was only a remnant aura that had been left behind by a Divine Beast in the past.","Of course, this was also due to Ling Han’s strength. If it were any other Saint, they would definitely be sent flying.","Ling Han stretched out a hand to pick up that feather on the ground.","When the tip of his finger touched that feather, a majestic light flickered, turning into a massive Azure Phoenix that pounced towards Ling Han.","Peng!","This Azure Phoenix crashed into the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, instantly sending Ling Han flying along with the tower.","Ling Han fell heavily onto the ground, and that Azure Phoenix roared at the skies, turning into a soundwave that soared into space/.","At this moment, it was as if this Azure Phoenix had been revived, exuding the terrifying aura of a Great Emperor.","Everyone was stunned. A Great Emperor had come back to life?","Impossible. This was only a sliver of aura left behind on the feather. Perhaps, it had a sliver of the soul imprint of the Azure Phoenix, which allowed it to show its might.","However, this was only short-lived.","The problem was, even if this was only an instant of might, with how strong a Great Emperor was, wasn’t an instant enough to kill all of them?","The Azure Phoenix swept its eyes over the masses, and finally stopped on Ling Han. Xiu, it suddenly flew out, its figure rapidly shrinking, turning into a streak of light that rapidly pounced between Ling Han’s eyes.","This was too fast. Though the Azure Phoenix’s speed could not compare to the Phoenix, as a Divine Beast that was also a bird, it would not be much inferior either.","Thus, Ling Han didn’t even have the chance to block it. The streak of light had already disappeared.","\"Ling Han!\" Everyone hurriedly gathered around him.","\"It’s fine!\" Ling Han waved his hand, then an expression of shock appeared on his face, \"This is the Azure Phoenix Divine Beast transmitting images to me.\"","He closed his eyes, and used his heart to memorize.","This was only a feather, and it was left behind by the Azure Phoenix after its death, so its memory was naturally limited.","He had only seen a single scene. The Azure Phoenix Divine Beast, Black Tortoise Divine Beast, the Crimson Ape Divine Beast, and the other Divine Beasts were all resting here, but suddenly, a gigantic Divine Beast whose shape could not be described barged in.","The scene came to an abrupt stop at this point.","Ling Han frowned. He had never seen such a Divine Beast before.","Though after the first-generation Divine Beasts died, their children were no longer able to break through to Great Emperor-level, they would more or less have some descendants. It was just that their bloodline was impure, and their appearance would be slightly different from their ancestors.","However, Ling Han could guarantee that in later generations, there were definitely no ferocious beast or Demonic Beast that looked similar to the Divine Beast that he had just seen.","Putting aside the identity of this Divine Beast, why would the Azure Phoenix remember this scene?","At that time, the Azure Phoenix should have already died. Could it be that she had a premonition, and that was why she had left this backup plan?","Had this unknown Divine Beast barged in here and stolen the Divine Beast corpses?","What was he aiming for?","’Because they were delicious?’","F***, it wasn’t Hu Niu, that little girl.","And was this related to the appearance of the new Divine Beasts at the Primitive Abyss?","Ling Han felt that this was possible. The Primitive Abyss had existed since ancient times. Perhaps, some Divine Beasts had long since gone there to seek immortality.","He related the scene he had seen and his own deductions, which surprised everyone.","Stealing corpses, and stealing the corpses of Divine Beasts at that. This was something that only a Divine Beast that was similarly a Great Emperor-level existence could do. This was practically inconceivable.","Just look, generation after generation of Great Emperors had appeared in history. Who would dig up the graves of the ancestors of those Great Emperors before them?","What kind of Divine Beast was that? It was really too tasteless.","Combined with the Primitive Abyss, the disappearance of the Divine Beast corpses became even stranger.","Everyone was discussing intensely, and Ling Han sat down in a cross-legged position. He thought that the Natural-born Gold Spirit was very likely to be hidden here, so he wanted to try communicating.","He released his divine sense, which transformed into a net.","Ling Han swept it over and over again, yet he didn’t detect any fluctuation from the Natural-born Gold Spirit.","No.","Ling Han suddenly changed his mind. He activated the light of great dao in his mind, sweeping through the ground.","Yi?","He suddenly received a response, but it was very vague. It was like an infant that had just been born. It did not know how to speak at all, and only knew how to bawl.","Was it the Natural-born Gold Spirit?","Ling Han was instantly energized, and hurriedly continued to communicate with it, exuding a kind intent.","His light of great dao and Natural-born Gold Spirit had both originated from the Primitive Abyss, so it was very normal for them to resonate.","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. He was extremely patient.","Time continued to pass. The Natural-born Gold Spirit was like a small dog that had developed a dependence on him.","Boom!","Right at this moment, a terrifying sound rang out, and a large hole actually appeared in the skies, through which a Yin River flowed.","Hiss, the master of the Yin River!","In the Yin River, the Saint corpses were like fishesthat had been caught in a net, flickering and flopping. Meanwhile, Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters like Li Dangping, Feng Miaoling and the others all stepped on the Yin River as they arrived. There were also numerous Skeleton Saint Tools flying down.","The Netherworld army had arrived!","’This... What can I do?’","Though Ling Han alone could defeat the Skeleton Saint Tools and Imperial Sons, Imperial Daughters, wasn’t it obvious that the master of the Yin River was also here?","If the Great Emperor made a move, what else could Ling Han do aside from running?","\"Charge!\" At this moment, Li Dangping and the others all shouted loudly. They controlled the Skeleton Saint Tools to charge towards Ling Han and the others.","Ling Han humphed. If the Master of the Yin River didn’t make a move, what did he have to fear?","Boom!","He unleashed the Destructive Energy and the light of great dao. Now that a powerful enemy was bearing down on him, he had to give it his all.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","He alone could hold his own against an army of ten thousand."]},{"number":4738,"title":"Chapter 4738: Great Emperors battle","paragraphs":["Ling Han was like a pillar of support. No matter who attacked him, he would remain unmoved.","Brother Monkey and the others also pounced out one after another, battling fiercely with those Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters.","Both sides were going all out. Sooner or later, they would battle.","However, the side of the Netherworld was brimming with confidence. This was because they had a Great Emperor on standby.","However, this couldn’t change Ling Han’s domineering nature. He continued to push forward, and not only did he force the Skeleton Saint Tools to retreat, but he even destroyed many of them. Not only that, but he even ensured the safety of the empress and the others.","Boom!","Right at this moment, the skies shattered once more, and a massive claw stretched out, landing directly on the ground.","A terrifying Imperial Might spread out, boundlessly terrifying.","Hiss, a Great Emperor had moved!","Hold on.","Ling Han was surprised. This claw looked very familiar. ’F*ck, it’s that guy from the Primitive Abyss.’","The True Dragon Emperor!","F***, this guy actually chased after him?","That’s not right. If this Great Emperor wanted to pursue him, shouldn’t he have chased out after him long ago? Why would he be so late?","Moreover, this attack clearly wasn’t aimed at him, but... where the Natural-born Gold Spirit was located.","Not good, the True Dragon Emperor wasn’t here to hunt him down. Instead, he was targeting the Natural-born Gold Spirit.","However... the Great Emperor was invincible in the world, and it was obvious that the True Dragon Emperor wasn’t like the Lord of Death, who would have reservations when attacking. Thus, did this Great Emperor need a manifestation that was Pseudo-Emperor-level?","All of a sudden, Ling Han’s mind was filled with a myriad of thoughts. He had never thought that even an existence from the Primitive Abyss would interfere.","Yi, this might not be a bad thing. The Master of Yin River was also here for the Natural-born Gold Spirit. so he obviously couldn’t just stand by and watch as the Natural-born Gold Spirit was snatched away. He would definitely move to stop it.","It should be known that no matter which Great Emperor made a move, others would not have the right to interfere, but the clash between the two Great Emperors gave Ling Han a chance to pluck chestnuts out of the <anno data-annotation-id=\"f40bb8e3-59aa-4ac3-8b2c-975232794174\" data-title=\"fire\">fire 1 </anno>.","\"Humph!\" A cold humph rang out from the Yin River. Then, a large hand formed from the river water stretched out, and struck out at the True Dragon’s claw.","Boom!","The two Great Emperors exchanged blows through the air, and a terrifying imperial might instantly surged. No one could withstand it, and they hurriedly retreated.","Ling Han also drew the Clear Bamboo Sword, covering everyone’s retreat.","Of course, they couldn’t fight now. F*ck! Two Great Emperors were attacking, so who wanted to die so badly?","\"Impossible!\" the little azure dragon murmured. He sensed a powerful dragon’s presence, similar to his bloodline.","This was his father?","But the old True Dragon had clearly died!","\"No!\" The little azure dragon immediately revealed a fierce expression. \"This aura isn’t right. It’s obviously very similar to my father, but it’s definitely not my father!\"","He raised his voice, and shouted at the skies, \"You are definitely not the first generation True Dragon. Who exactly are you, and why are you impersonating my father!\"","Boom!","In the skies, a giant green dragon appeared, baring its fangs and brandishing its claws, exuding an incredibly powerful aura.","\"True Dragon!\"","\"How is this possible?!\"","Ling Han and the others weren’t the only ones who were stunned. The side of the Lands of Death were also stunned.","The True Dragon had long since died, so how could it possibly still be alive now?","Even if the first generation Divine Beasts had also obtained some kind of secret technique, how could it possibly appear in such a grand manner?","Just look at the Lords of Death and the others.","Why were they called the Lords of Death? That was because they were all hiding in the Lands of Death and could not easily appear.","However, this True Dragon was completely unreserved. Not only could it run around, but it also didn’t hold back at all.","What was going on?","\"I am the True Dragon, who dares to stop me?\" The giant green dragon released a vigorous and mighty voice, making a great many people want to kneel down.","This was both Imperial Might and dragon’s might.","\"How pretentious!\" the Master of the Yin Riversaid with a cold chuckle. Hua! Another large hand reached over and swatted at the True Dragon Emperor.","The True Dragon Emperor flew into a thunderous rage, brandishing his golden claws to greet the Master of the Yin River.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two Great Emperors exchanged blows, and there was absolutely nothing left for the others to do. Everyone retreated one after another. Even if it was only atching the battle from close quarters, that would be an action of courting death.","Ling Han covered for everyone’s retreat as he continued to communicate with the Natural-born Gold Spirit. He had to hurry. Otherwise, no matter which Great Emperor emerged victorious, they would still be able to capture the Natural-born Gold Spirit/","On the other side, the True Dragon Emperor faced off against the Master of the Yin River. As long as one wasn’t blind, one could tell with a single glance that the True Dragon Emperor was completely on the upper hand.","It couldn’t be helped. The master of the Yin River was only extracting the water of the Yin River, turning it into a fist, palm, or various God Tools. He himself hadn’t appeared, so how could he possibly be a match for another Great Emperor?","\"Little brat, you actually dare to stop me?\" The True Dragon Emperor released a majestic voice, as if he was an existence above the Nine Heavens. I am the great dao, and cannot be disobeyed.","\"You are definitely not the first generation True Dragon!\" The Master of Yin River said calmly, \"I don’t know how you came to be, but in front of a true Great Emperor, you are nothing but a clown.\"","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. Buddha Doga also said that there was something off with the True Dragon Emperor’s situation. It didn’t match the true Great Emperor, but even so, this still forced him and Buddha Doga to flee in panic.","From this, it could be seen that only a true Great Emperor would be able to treat him with such contempt.","\"Humph, you’re hiding yourself. You don’t dare to show yourself?\" The True Dragon Emperor charged toward the Yin River in an extremely domineering manner.","Boom! The Yin River surged, and Imperial Might soared into the sky.","This time, no one could see the battle situation.","The Imperial Sons on the side of the Lands of Death were all anxious. What if... the Master of the Yin River was defeated?","After all, there was also a Great Emperor on the other side.","Not long after, peng, a massive figure flew out of the Yin River.","It was the True Dragon Emperor.","However, his current appearance was a little terrible. A considerable number of scales had fallen off his body, and there were also a considerable number of wounds. Even his bones could be seen.","Had he lost or won?","Although he was injured, this didn’t mean that he had lost. After all, it was also possible that the master of the Yin River had been killed.","However, the following scene immediately revealed the truth.","Xiu, a human figure that was completely wrapped in black mist also rushed out of the Yin River, continuing to charge towards the True Dragon Emperor.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","This person was far too powerful, and he was even able to suppress the True Dragon Emperor. This showed just how domineering he was.","A Great Emperor stood high above the Nine Heavens, invincible in this world!","It was no wonder that Buddha Doga would say that there was something off about the True Dragon Emperor. Otherwise, what Great Emperor would be weaker than another? How could it be possible that it would be one-sided so quickly?","The master of the Yin River aggressively suppressed the True Dragon Emperor. The True Dragon Emperor’s disadvantage was fully displayed, and he was indeed far from being a match.","The little azure dragon looked very displeased. Though he already knew that this was definitely not the first generation True Dragon, his father, he still felt as if he had been slapped in the face when he saw one who was also of the Dragon Race, being suppressed so completely.","But no matter how displeased he was, so what?","As the Master of the Yin River shot out a strike, nine-star Regulations wrapped around him, mighty and domineering, like he was a god.","There was absolutely no way he could block this!","The True Dragon Emperor let out a muffled groan. He didn’t dare to continue fighting, and he immediately turned around to leave.","He had fled!","This caused everyone’s jaws to drop. In their impression, the Great Emperor was invincible, and there was actually a day when one would flee?","Meanwhile, the little azure dragon gritted its teeth. This was the shame of the Dragon Race.","In the next instant, the Master of the Yin River moved, grabbing out at the ground.","Boom, the ground split open, and a golden stone fetus was grabbed out.","Natural-born Gold Spirit!","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">This is a Chinese proverb that means to gain profit in risk.</annotations>"]},{"number":4739,"title":"Chapter 4739: Repeated appearance of Great Emperors","paragraphs":["In the end, the Natural-born Gold Spirit was still snatched away by the Lands of Death.","The large black dog and the others all wore expressions of regret. Now, the life of the Living Realm was going to be even more difficult.","Only Ling Han was an exception, because in the instant the Natural-born Gold Spirit was taken away, a thought or matter flew out of the Natural-born Gold Spirit and fused into his body.","For the moment, he hadn’t investigated it yet, because he was afraid that it would cause too much commotion and cause the Master of the Yin River to snatch it from him.","Now, it was time to flee.","\"Retreat!\" he commanded.","\"Humph!\" However, right at this moment, the Master of the Yin River moved, and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han.","Boom! The might of this strike soared sky-high, and Imperial Might blazed.","How was he supposed to block this?","The current battle prowess of the Master of the Yin River was probably already in its prime. Just now, he had easily defeated even the True Dragon Emperor. Just how strong was this battle prowess?","Ling Han hurriedly activated the Clear Bamboo Sword, and charged forward.","However, with this strike, the Clear Bamboo Sword was sent flying to the side. The attack of the Great Emperor was unstoppable, and was still descending down on Ling Han.","Was he done for?","Peng!","Three giant hands struck out at the same time, heading towards the master of the Yin River.","Boom, a terrifying shockwave reverberated, and the three giant hands immediately crumbled, but the attack of the Master of the Yin River was finally dispersed.","In the distance, three figures strode over.","Buddha Doga, Qian Yanghao, and... the old woodcutter, Xia Houping!","The Clear Bamboo Sword was still in the hands of Buddha Doga. It was clear that he had retrieved it when the Clear Bamboo Sword had been sent flying. This was because he knew the secret technique that controlled the Clear Bamboo Sword.","Hiss, the revival of the Imperial Weapon, along with the combined efforts of three Pseudo-Emperors only managed to block a single blow from the Master of the Yin River.","Impressive, this was really impressive. This was the true might of a Great Emperor!","Even if they were standing on opposing sides, everyone could not help but be impressed by the strength of the Master of the Yin River.","Now, the Master of the Yin River had obtained the Natural-born Gold Spirit, and as long as he refined it, he would be able to obtain another Pseudo-Emperor-level doppelganger. This was something that even Buddha Doga and the others would probably be extremely wary of.","\"Great Emperor Senluo!\" Xia Houping roared.","\"Xia Hou, you’re not dead yet?\" the Master of the Yin River asked calmly. He didn’t deny the name that Xia Houping had called him.","Alright, now they had found out the origins of a Lord of Death.","Great Emperor Senluo!","\"The three of you want to protect this brat?\" Great Emperor Senluo’s voice was still calm. That was the confidence of invincibility. Everything in this world was within his grasp.","\"That’s right,\" Buddha Doga said as he brandished the Clear Bamboo Sword.","Great Emperor Senluo laughed loudly, \"Since I have completely awakened, even if all of you join forces, how many moves can you block from me?\"","\"Enough to wear you down,\" Buddha Doga also said calmly.","Great Emperor Senluo was rendered speechless. He had destroyed his own life force, and his soul had transformed. In truth, he was no longer the invincible Great Emperor he had once been. Though he could awaken again, the time was extremely short.","Buddha Doga was right. If he made another move, though he could kill Buddha Doga and the other Pseudo-Emperors and Ling Han, he himself would have to pay a price that he couldn’t bear.","Having schemed for so long, yet all his efforts had come to nothing at this moment?","Of course not.","He only had to refine the Natural-born Gold Spirit into a doppelganger, and he would still be able to hunt down Ling Han.","\"Humph!\" With a wave of his hand, the Yin River surged, instantly sending Feng Miaoling and the other Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters away. Then, he took a deep breath, and instantly, the black mist that enshrouded him was sucked in, revealing a dried corpse.","This caused everyone to exclaim in shock. This was really too different from the image of the Great Emperor that they had in mind.","Only Ling Han was unmoved, because he had once witnessed the process of that Empress falling.","Great Emperor Senluo took another deep breath. This time, it was terrifying. A boundless suction force was generated.","Ling Han and the others could all feel their vitality draining away. In fact, even their souls were vibrating, as if they were about to be sucked out of their minds.","\"Go!\" Buddha Doga shouted loudly. He activated the Clear Bamboo Sword, severing the suction force of the oncoming attack. The other two Pseudo-Emperors tore a rip into the Void and pushed everyone inside.","In just an instant, Ling Han saw an endless stream of life essence surging towards Great Emperor Senluo, causing his shriveled body to immediately become enriched. A stalwart man appeared.","That aura was indescribably powerful!","Shua, the spatial fissure closed, and this Lord of Death could no longer be seen.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! On the other side, everyone came out of the Void one after another. They stood in space, and shockingly discovered that the surrounding stars had all become lifeless.","This wasn’t the territory of the Netherworld.","Great Emperor Senluo only took a deep breath. Even in such a far place, all life was still exterminated?","This was far too terrifying. This was the aura of a Great Emperor!","Everyone’s expressions were incredibly solemn. The Natural-born Gold Spirit had been obtained by a Lord of Death, which meant that the strength of the Netherworld would be greatly increased.","Though Ling Han had almost destroyed all the Skeleton Saint Tools, a Natural-born Gold Spirit could completely replace them. In fact, it would make the Netherworld even stronger.","It could be said that their trip had ended in a complete failure.","\"Don’t be in a rush,\" Ling Han said. He had also obtained something from the Natural-born Gold Spirit. This was perhaps the most important thing.","Everyone was confused. Things had already come to this, so how could they not be anxious?","However, because Ling Han didn’t tell them the truth, they could only think that Ling Han was comforting them.","There was still hope for them, and that was for Ling Han to become a Great Emperor!","As long as Ling Han could become a Great Emperor, he would be able to conquer the world, and become the Number One Emperor of All Eternity.","Ling Han merely smiled. After they returned to Four Origin Planet, Ling Han immediately went into seclusion to figure out what he had obtained.","This was a ball of light, but it was tightly sealed. He had not been able to open it previously.","On the way, he was unable to concentrate fully.","Now, he finally had enough time and absolute silence.","He activated his divine sense and observed the orb of light in his mind. He then started to analyze it carefully.","The progress was very slow. Though the thing wrapped around this ball of light did not have strong destructive power, it was extremely tough, and Ling Han had to expend a lot of effort.","However, no matter how slow the progress was, as long as there was improvement, it was a good thing.","After about half a month, Ling Han finally succeeded.","Instantly, a consciousness emerged from the ball of light, turning into a heavy voice.","\"If my deduction is correct, you must be the person who obtained the Origin Gold that I left behind.\"","F***!","Ling Han was instantly rendered speechless. This person was... the Great Emperor Wu Ya!","In history, it was not every Great Emperor that possessed an Imperial Weapon.","Some Great Emperors might have been unlucky, not being able to find the Origin Gold during their reign, but there were also some Great Emperors that had absolutely no intention of forging the Imperial Weapon. In fact, they didn’t even leave behind their inheritance.","However, only one Great Emperor obtained two pieces of Origin Gold.","This was none other than the Great Emperor Wu Ya.","However, the Great Emperor Wu Ya didn’t forge two Imperial Weapons, leaving behind an indestructible legend. Instead, he preserved the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning, and only then did it become the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower in Ling Han’s hands.","However, this was actually a scheme that the Great Emperor Wu Ya had laid out for millions and millions of years?","\"The world that we are in is presently facing a great danger of destruction. I am fighting bravely in the Primitive Abyss, and desperately need help. Hopefully, you will arrive very soon.\"","\"There’s also a piece of Metal of Creation sealed in your mind. It can help you forge the strongest Imperial Weapon!\""]},{"number":4740,"title":"Chapter 4740: Netherworld attacks","paragraphs":["Ling Han swept an eye over his body, and sure enough, after the ball of light disappeared, a piece of light golden metal was revealed. It didn’t look anything special, but gave Ling Han a feeling that it could create infinite possibilities.","This was the Metal of Creation?","What kind of strange name was that!","Ling Han couldn’t help but grumble. ’You’re a dignified Great Emperor, and it’s not like you’re incompetent in naming. Why didn’t you give it a nicer and simpler name?’","However, he immediately turned his attention back to the message that the Great Emperor Wu Ya had left behind. According to this Lord, the Primitive Abyss was presently experiencing an extremely urgent situation, which concerned the survival of the entire universe.","The problem was that it wasn’t peaceful outside either. The main goal of the Twelve Lands of Death was to destroy the Living Realm, which could similarly cause great loss of life.","Previously, he had still been hoping that the Great Emperors that had gone to the Primitive Abyss to search for an opportunity for immortality had not died, and would come out to help pacify the chaos caused by the Twelve Lands of Death. Now, it was obvious that they could not be counted on.","Hold on, he had to sort out this matter.","After entering the Primitive Abyss, the Great Emperor Wu Ya, the Battle Saint Emperor and the others had all obtained the fortune of immortality. This was a definite fact. Otherwise, after so many years, they would definitely have all died.","However, this kind of immortality should also have its limits, causing them to be unable to leave the Primitive Abyss.","—Perhaps, once they left, they would age rapidly, and then die.","Of course, there was also a second possibility, and that was there were terrifying enemies within the Primitive Abyss, forcing these Great Emperors to stay behind to fight.","If it was the latter, hiss, just how strong would their opponents have to be?","No wonder the Great Emperor Wu Ya’s tone was so solemn.","Additionally, the Great Emperor Wu Ya had already used the Natural-born Gold Spirit to summon reinforcements, which showed just how terrible the situation was in the Primitive Abyss.","It was not just Empress Qingzhu. The Great Emperor Wu Ya had also laid out his plans. Of course, it was even more so for the Twelve Lands of Death. They had all survived until this era.","Wasn’t it just the universe expanding to the extreme? Even if it immediately began to shrink, there would still be endless years until it returned to its original size. Why did the Great Emperors insist on contending in this era?","Ling Han sighed upon hearing this. Could it be that this Great Emperor Wu Ya couldn’t speak a little more?","What the hell were those thirty-six Divine Beasts?","They were definitely all Great Emperor-level, and were weaker than ordinary Great Emperor-level, so why was that?","Ling Han’s mind was a mess right now. The more he knew, the more confused he became.","\"Forget it!\"","\"I’ll go to the Primitive Abyss to increase my strength first, and just in time. I’ll see if I can go deep inside and meet with the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others. That way, I can get some answers.\"","They had no choice but to leave. The side of the Lands of Death had already obtained the Natural-born Gold Spirit, which could be refined into a Pseudo-Emperor doppelganger. How powerful would this be under the control of a Great Emperor?","Powerful to sweep aside all other Pseudo-Emperors?","In short, this was too terrifying.","Because the situation with the Primitive Abyss was also extremely tense, Ling Han didn’t spread the news about the Great Emperor Wu Ya. Instead, he only told Buddha Doga, Qian Yanghao, and Xia Houping.","After listening to Ling Han’s words, the three Pseudo-Emperors all wore grave expressions.","Even the side of the Primitive Abyss was screwed over?","With chaos both inside and outside, how could Pseudo-Emperors like them hold up?","\"In short, let’s go to Primitive Abyss first.\"","The three Pseudo-Emperors had also made up their minds, and formed a unified understanding.","After obtaining the Natural-born Gold Spirit, the Netherworld completely compensated for the inadequacy of the Skeleton Saint Tools being suppressed by Ling Han. It became unstoppable again.","\"I have to bring those Imperial Clans with me,\" Ling Han said.","Buddha Doga frowned and said, \"Although there are three Pseudo-Emperors now, it’s impossible to bring too many people.\"","\"What if I absorb all of those stars into my body?\" Ling Han asked with a smile.","This?","The three Pseudo-Emperors were all looking at Ling Han with strange expressions. This was really a monster.","\"Alright, we can give it a try,\" Qian Yanghao said with a nod. The more people they could bring with them, the more sparks of hope there would be.","However, before Ling Han could make a move, terrible news immediately came.","—The Natural-born Gold Spirit brought the Imperial Weapon and attacked, easily breaking through Thousand Bird Imperial Clan’s imperial formation, destroying the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan and Origin had died in battle!","Origin had died!","One of the rulers of Genesis World.","Ling Han immediately became suspicious. It was extremely likely that the Netherworld’s target wasn’t the Thousand Bird Imperial Clan, but rather Origin.","The Genesis World originated from the Divine Stone, and he was 99% sure that the Divine Stone came from the Primitive Abyss. In the era of Xuan Taiyu, this had once attracted the emergence of the Twelve Lords of Death, who combined forces to fight against Xuan Taiyu.","In the end, though Xuan Taiyu calmed the darkness, the Twelve Lords of Death also devoured a large amount of life essence in order to extend their lifespans, causing the entire North Heavenly Realm’s fortune to decline. After so many years, it still hadn’t recovered.","With how freakish he was, he would definitely arouse the suspicion of the Lords of Death. Perhaps the Lords of Death didn’t know what the Divine Stone represented, but with the sudden appearance of a supreme prodigy that surpassed the sons of the Great Emperors, it would be strange if he didn’t arouse suspicion.","Previously, he had been standing in front of them, concealing Ding Shu and the others, but now... the Lords of Death and the others might have discovered something.","Ling Han immediately set out to find Ding Shu and the others, wanting to pack them up and take them away.","He would definitely first go to the nearest place to him, which was the Ten Thousand Flower Imperial Clan Clan. This was where Ding Shu was staying.","Thankfully, the Ten Thousand Flower Imperial Clan was still very calm.","When Ling Han related the purpose of his visit, it caused the Ten Thousand Flower Imperial Clan to hesitate. To move their ancestral planet into Ling Han’s body?","That meant that with a single thought, Ling Han would be able to control the life and death of all of them.","However, did they have any other choice?","Ling Han started to contain the Ten Thousand Flower Planet. However, he immediately discovered that the Great Emperor Formation was releasing a powerful resistance, preventing him from doing so.","They had to shut down the Great Emperor Formation first.","This caused the Ten Thousand Flower Imperial Clan to feel conflicted for a very long time, right until news spread out that the Nine Purple Imperial Clan was also finished. Only then did they make up their minds and close the imperial formation.","The Nine Purple Imperial Clan... Heaven Crushing!","As expected, the eyes of the Lords of Death were set on Ding Shu and the others. They must have discovered that they had also come out of the Divine Stone.","Hold on, would these Lords of Death have even greater schemes, targeting the Genesis Worlds inside Origin and the others?","The fact that Ling Han had been able to grow to become as powerful as he was now was naturally thanks to his hard work, effort, and great opportunities. However, it could not be denied that the Genesis World had also played a very important role.","What if this was obtained by the Lords of Death?","Hiss!","Ling Han hurriedly stored the Ten Thousand Flower Planet into his body. Sure enough, without the imperial formation’s resistance, he could do it. However, as long as one carried the Imperial Weapon, Ling Han wouldn’t be able to store this person into his body.","In other words, the limit of what he could accommodate was below Great Emperor-level.","This was already astonishing enough.","This time, it was clear that the Ten Thousand Flower Planet was larger and had more living creatures, but Ling Han felt that it was easier than when he had taken in the Four Origin Planet.","It must be because his strength had increased.","Ling Han continued to search for the other Genesis World rulers.","At the next stop, he found Jing Haoran, which corresponded to the Flawless Imperial Clan. This time, it was much smoother for him. The bloody truth was there, and the son of the Great Emperor of the Flawless Imperial Clan immediately agreed to Ling Han’s suggestion.","However, when Ling Han headed to the next stop, he had just walked out of the Void, when he saw a golden human figure controlling a blood-coloured large umbrella, which wrapped around him, and he forcibly penetrated into a star.","Natural-born Gold Spirit!","Not good, he had come too late."]},{"number":4741,"title":"Chapter 4741: Escape","paragraphs":["Boom!","Under the attack of the Natural-born Gold Spirit, even the imperial formation couldn’t block it. He directly detonated the core of this planet, forming a terrifying shockwave. Under this attack, all beings below the level of Saint were naturally killed.","This was the might of a Pseudo-Emperor. So what if it was an Imperial Weapon? He could use the Imperial Weapon to resist the Imperial Formation, and directly blast apart the core of the planet himself.","The Natural-born Gold Spirit was extremely skilled in attack.","Right now, there were still some Saints who had managed to escape. Their eyes were wide with rage and grief.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over, and already located Shui Qingchang.","Shua, the Natural-born Gold Spirit attacked, aiming right for Shui Qingchang.","Shui Qingchang was indeed a ruler of the Genesis World. Although she was anxious, she didn’t panic, and she immediately raised her hands to counterattack.","However, no matter how strong she was, she was only a Five Star Saint, so how could she possibly be a match for a Pseudo-Emperor?","Even the present Ling Han was no match!","Just when she was about to be killed, weng, the Imperial Son of the Big Dipper Imperial Clan revived the Imperial Weapon and rushed over in time, blocking this fatal blow for her.","The Natural-born Gold Spirit as expressionless as it continued to attack with its Blood Parasol.","This was the Imperial Weapon that belonged to the Master of the Blood Sea.","In the hands of a Pseudo-Emperor, how long could the might of an Imperial Weapon last?","It would definitely last longer than in the hands of a Saint.","\"I’ll hold them back, you guys retreat first!\" Ling Han attacked, and the Clear Bamboo Sword appeared, greeting the Natural-born Gold Spirit.","The members of the Big Dipper Imperial Clan were overjoyed, and they hurriedly retreated to the back. After tearing a rip into the Void, they hurriedly retreated.","The killing intent of the Natural-born Gold Spirit instantly soared, and it ferociously charged at Ling Han.","Weng!","The two Imperial Weapons flew out of their hands and started to attack each other through the air.","F***, Ling Han had to face the Natural-born Gold Spirit, a Pseudo-Emperor, on his own?","Ling Han gritted his teeth. This was truly a difficult challenge.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Blinding golden light suddenly burst from Natural-born Gold Spirit’s body, transforming into a sky full of golden swords that shot towards Ling Han.","Hiss, within every streak of golden light, there was actually a sliver of Nine Star Regulations!","Even as strong as Ling Han was, he was presently unable to weave the eight-star Regulations together to match the nine-star Regulations. Otherwise, he would have long since been able to thrash a Pseudo-Emperor.","Thus, faced with the attack of the Nine Star Regulations, how was he supposed to block?","Taking it head-on?","He would definitely be blasted into smithereens.","Dodging?","The sky was filled with golden swords, so where could he dodge?","Boom, the golden swords shot down, releasing a terrifying sound that shook the universe.","However, after the golden light dispersed, a precious tower appeared where Ling Han was standing. It was exuding Primal Chaos Qi, with lightning flashing around it.","Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower!","\"Haha, you wouldn’t have thought, would you? I am a man who has two Imperial Weapons at the same time!\" Ling Han laughed loudly. Though the Pseudo-Emperor’s attack had not hit him directly, the terrifying shockwave of power still made him feel so bad that he wanted to throw up blood.","The Natural-born Gold Spirit didn’t speak, but xiu, xiu, xiu! Numerous weapons materialized around him... some weren’t even weapons, but rather jade vials, sunflowers, and the like.","’Holy f*ck!’","Ling Han gritted his teeth. These were all Imperial Weapons!","Gods, the Lords of Death actually gave their Imperial Weapons to this Natural-born Gold Spirit.","He understood now. This Natural-born Gold Spirit was definitely refined by the combined forces of the 12 Lords of Death. Thus, even though there was only one, it represented the willpower of the 12 Lords of Death.","Boom, aside from the Heavenly Net Blood Parasol that was battling fiercely with the Clear Bamboo Sword, the other 11 Imperial Weapons also came to life, exuding a terrifying imperial might.","For other Pseudo-Emperors, this was impossible.","There was no Pseudo-Emperor that could awaken more than one Imperial Weapon. However, the Natural-born Gold Spirit was different.","Firstly, he came from the Primitive Abyss and possessed unlimited possibilities. Secondly, the 12 Lords of Death had refined it so it possessed a sliver of their divine sense.","Thus, how much power would a Great Emperor have to expend if he wanted to revive his own Imperial Weapon?","It was practically zero, all right?","Thus, Ling Han saw such a terrifying scene. A mere Pseudo-Emperor was controlling twelve Imperial Weapons at the same time!","He cursed internally. How was he supposed to match this? Though the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower could be ranked among the top in terms of Origin Gold, it could not possibly exchange blows with eleven Imperial Weapons.","Moreover, wasn’t the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower only a Pseudo-Imperial Weapon?","Run!","Ling Han used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight and fled.","Behind him, the Natural-born Gold Spirit was hot on his heels. Its speed was actually not inferior to Ling Han at all.","Pseudo-Emperor!","And this was still because it had not burnt the Imperial Source. Otherwise, it would be even faster.","Hold on, did the Natural-born Gold Spirit have the Imperial Source? After all, he hadn’t truly cultivated.","Ling Han believed that the Natural-born Gold Spirit should not have the Imperial Source. Otherwise, for the sake of killing him, the greatest threat, it would be completely worth it even if the Natural-born Gold Spirit had to be expended.","One fled, while the other pursued. Ling Han used all his tricks, and fled for a whole three years’ time. Only then did he manage to throw off the Natural-born Gold Spirit and return to Four Origin Planet.","\"Let’s leave quickly!\"","Ling Han didn’t even bother to rest as he absorbed Four Origin Planet into his body. Then, he had Buddha Dog and the other Pseudo-Emperors bring them towards the Primitive Abyss.","Those who possessed Imperial Weapons couldn’t enter Ling Han’s body, but Buddha Doga and the others also had three Imperial Weapons, so bringing a few more people wouldn’t be a problem.","—Myriad Dao had also died; the Natural-born Gold Spirit was really too fast.","However, Ling Han also managed to save Ding Shu, Jing Haoran, and Shui Qingchang, even though the ancestral grounds of the Big Dipper Imperial Clan had been destroyed.","In this battle, it could be considered a tie. Ling Han did not lose to the Lords of Death.","On this trip to the Primitive Abyss, the Pseudo-Emperors naturally could not possibly burn their Imperial Source. Instead, they used their normal speed.","In this way, Ling Han wouldn’t need a Pseudo-Emperor to bring him along. His current speed was actually not inferior to a Pseudo-Emperor.","200 or so years later, they arrived at the Primitive Abyss.","Ling Han thought for a moment, then circled to the back of the Primitive Abyss. It was very, very far away, and only then did he release the three stars.","There was nothing else that could be done. Accommodating three planets at once, and having to experience a journey as long as two hundred years, this was also his limit. Otherwise, Ling Han could still bring other Imperial Clans.","Ding Shu, Jing Haoran and Shui Qingchang all volunteered. They too wanted to try to do the same as Ling Han, and see if they could absorb the stars into their bodies. If they succeeded, they would be able to act as vessels, and transport planets, with Buddha Doga and the others bringing them along.","Meanwhile, Ling Han drew out the Metal of Creation, planning to increase the might of the Imperial Weapon.","The logical choice was naturally to use it on the Clear Bamboo Sword.","In the first place, this was an Imperial Weapon. If he further upgraded it with the Metal of Creation, it was very likely that it would be able to suppress other Imperial Weapons.","However, Ling Han still felt that strengthening the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was better.","The Imperial Weapon alone couldn’t suppress the Lord of Death. After all, it wasn’t a true Great Emperor.","Thus, Ling Han was more accustomed to using his own Spirit Tool.","Moreover, hundreds of millions of years ago, the Great Emperor Wu Ya had left behind the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning, and now he had delivered the Metal of Creation to his hands. Wasn’t this a hint?","He decided to use it on the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","Ling Han pressed the Metal of Creation onto the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Then, following the method taught to him by the Great Emperor Wu Ya, he had the Origin Gold absorb the Metal of Creation.","Yi, Ling Han discovered that rather than saying that the Origin Gold was absorbing it, it would be better to say that the Metal of Creation was actively channeling, tempering the Origin Gold.","In a short while, the Metal of Creation had completely assimilated into the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower."]},{"number":4742,"title":"Chapter 4742: Entering the city","paragraphs":["Origin Gold was the sturdiest thing in the world, and even the Great Emperor couldn’t damage it.","Thus, the Origin Gold could only be burned in the strongest flames in the world. After burning to a certain extent, it could be molded into any form.","But it should be known that adamantine and the like had to be hammered over and over again to be able to reach the requirements of hardness and sharpness.","The Origin Gold was naturally different. It itself was the strongest material in the world, so it was definitely pure.","However, no matter how pure it was, there would still be a trace of impurity, which would affect its might.","Now, the Metal of Creation’s effect was to expel these impurities. Although it didn’t completely transform the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, its might definitely increased a bit.","\"I have a feeling that as long as I have enough Metal of Creation, I can completely increase the quality of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower!\"","However, even the Great Emperor Wu Ya could only give out this little bit. Furthermore, it was only this little bit, but its value was even higher than the Natural-born Gold Spirit!","Which was more important was actually dependent on the individual.","For Saints, it would definitely be the Natural-born Gold Spirit that was better. That represented creating a Pseudo-Emperor-level doppelganger.","But for a Great Emperor, they themselves were already strong enough, and no longer needed a Pseudo-Emperor-level doppelganger. Then, it would definitely be the Metal of Creation that was even better.","\"Inside the Primitive Abyss, there must be more Metal of Creation.\"","\"Great Emperor Wu Ya is reminding me that I can continue to strengthen the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower in the Primitive Abyss.\"","\"In the outside world, it would really be very difficult for me to further improve my cultivation level. Furthermore, after nine times of Silent Destruction, even if I have cultivated to the pinnacle of Saint Tier, I would not be able to reach the height of 99 eight-star Regulations.\"","Ling Han went to discuss the details of entering the Primitive Abyss with Buddha Doga and the others.","Now that they had two Bronze Battle Armors, they could both increase their safety and conceal their identities, giving them the chance to sneak in.","In the end, it was still decided that Ling Han and Buddha Doga would enter and seize the opportunity to obtain more Bronze Battle Armors. This way, the others would also be able to withstand the gravity inside the Primitive Abyss.","Since they had already made their decision, there was no need for any further delays. Ling Han and Buddha Doga immediately set out.","They entered the Primitive Abyss and remained silent all the way.","More than a month later, they entered the core area that was enshrouded by the Primal Chaos.","They had already come here once, so they were naturally familiar with this place.","However, the harsh environment here would not change just because they had come more often. Things like monstrous flames, meteorite showers, super waves really came in one wave after another.","So what if one as strong as a Pseudo-Emperor? Faced with such a situation, even they could only wait.","To say nothing of them, even the True Dragon Emperor from before had been stopped by the natural disasters. Otherwise, Ling Han and Buddha Doga might not have been able to come out.","This dawdling took more than twenty years.","Thankfully, time passed quickly here. In the outside world, not even a year had passed.","Finally, Dragon Head City appeared ahead of them.","This time, neither Ling Han nor Buddha Doga sent out their divine sense as a probe. Instead, they directly approached.","Of course, they had also changed their appearance.","It wasn’t long before they arrived before the city gates. The city gates were open, and the people inside didn’t even ask.","\"Chu Tang, where have you all been all these years?\" After entering the city, someone finally asked.","Ling Han shockingly discovered that in this city, the gravity was surprisingly small, reaching the conditions for habitation.","He coughed, and said, \"I was unlucky. In order to avoid the storms of heaven and earth, I was forced to hide in a dead end valley. It wasn’t easy for me to escape.\"","\"All right, hurry up and go back — oh, your wives seem to have all died, so go and collect another.\"","Er, what was going on here?","Ling Han and Buddha Doga didn’t ask any more questions, fearing that they would arouse suspicion. The two of them walked on the streets of the city and carefully observed the surroundings.","If they hadn’t come in from the Primitive Abyss, they would really find it hard to believe that such an ordinary-looking city would actually be located in the most dangerous place in the universe.","All the buildings here were very simple and crude. It could be imagined. After all, this was the Primitive Abyss, which was too barren.","What Ling Han was curious about was how did the people here cultivate?","They couldn’t all hope for Genesis Substance, right?","There was definitely pitifully little Genesis Substance. Otherwise, there was no way that even the disciples of a Great Emperor would come out to search for it.","Speaking of the disciples of a Great Emperor, Wang Zhe was most likely not the only one in this Dragon Head City. This was because Chu Tang called them the Ninth King.","Then, going upwards, there should still be First King all the way to Eighth King.","Strange.","Ling Han and Buddha Doga started to investigate separately. They would meet at the promised location every three days to exchange information.","The aura of the True Dragon Emperor had not appeared all this while. He had probably been crippled by Great Emperor Senluo, and needed a long time to recover and recuperate.","Thus, this was a good opportunity for Ling Han and Buddha Doga to become active.","After three days, Ling Han also gained some understanding of this city.","There was actually a medicinal field planted in this city, and it was precisely this medicinal field that ensured the supply of cultivation resources in the city.","Ling Han took a look. Though the Celestial medicines in the medicinal field were not top grade, they were still six or seven stars, at least. Thus, they could completely satisfy the cultivation needs of the few people in the city.","Suspicions also appeared. Going by his deductions, the population in the city should be far from reaching the number that it should have. Then, where had these people gone?","He met up with Buddha Doga, then discussed for a while, and decided to focus the investigation on the missing population.","The two of them passed their days. In this city, those who could obtain Battle Armors were all mighty figures. Even if it was Bronze Battle Armor-level, it was still incredible.","True, Saints were all mighty figures. Wherever they went, wouldn’t they be a mighty figure?","The True Dragon Emperor didn’t appear, and neither did those disciples of the True Dragon Emperor. After waiting for seven days, Ling Han and Buddha Doga finally saw a large number of people enter the city.","These people were all dressed in ragged clothing, as if they were refugees.","Ling Han and Buddha Doga were just wondering what these people had gone out of the city for, when they were quickly notified to escort the miners into the mountains on the second day.","Yi, miners?","Then, what were they mining?","Genesis Substance? Metal of Creation?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel his heart palpitate. No matter what it was, it would be of great help to him.","Furthermore, this was such a good opportunity, and it had taken the initiative to deliver itself to their doorstep.","On the second day, Ling Han and Buddha Doga went over to the gathering location. They didn’t know what to do next, so they would see what others did, and follow suit.","A person who looked like the leader appeared. Of course, he was also wearing a Bronze Battle Armor, and led Ling Han and Buddha Doga out. The miners that looked like refugees that they had seen yesterday had already gathered here.","\"Let’s go!\" The leader gave a command, and they headed towards the city gates.","After arriving at the city gates, the leader took out a small boat, but it immediately enlarged. Those miners climbed aboard one after another. All of them were very proficient, and by the looks of it, they had already done it countless times.","Realization dawned on Ling Han. The gravity fields outside were so strong, and he was still wondering how these people who were merely in the Core Formation Tier and True Self Tier managed to leave the city. As it turned out, they had a vehicle."]},{"number":4743,"title":"Chapter 4743: Mineshaft","paragraphs":["\"Hey, what are you guys doing?\" The leader suddenly called out.","Ling Han and Buddha Doga exchanged looks. They had also jumped onto the ship. However, looking at the leader’s expression, it was clear that this was a mistake.","\"I know you guys are lazy, but you guys can’t be so lazy!\" The leader shook his head, \"Hurry up and get down, pull the ship with me!\"","Fine.","Ling Han and Buddha Doga jumped off the ship. As expected, there were three ropes at the bow of the ship. It was unclear what material they were made of, but they should be extremely tough.","Thankfully, that person had not become suspicious. Otherwise, Ling Han and his companion’s identities would have been exposed.","Ling Han even sighed. Why was it that every time he hid his identity, it was very easy for his persona to collapse?","The three bronze warriors grabbed the ropes, then walked forwards.","After leaving the city, the terrifying gravity fields immediately took effect. Thankfully, the Bronze Battle Armor canceled out a large portion of the gravity fields, and that ship was made of some unknown material that could actually withstand the extreme weight of the gravity fields.","But for the people towing the ship, this was still considerably unfriendly.","That was because the ship was too heavy.","Even if the ship was made of a special material that could cancel out a portion of the gravity fields, it was still extraordinarily heavy as a whole. Otherwise, why would it be accompanied by three Saints to pull the ship?","Ling Han and Buddha Doga didn’t dare to exert too much force, fearing that their power would exceed the level that they should have.","\"Yi, what’s going on today? It’s much more relaxed,\" the leader said in surprise. Then, he glanced at Ling Han and Buddha Doga, \"Yo, you guys still know how to be apologetic. You’ve just been scolded by me, so you know how to work hard now?\"","This... Ling Han and Buddha Doga both laughed drily.","What kind of attributes did the other have?","After discovering the suspicious points, he would provide an explanation for it himself. There was no need for Ling Han and Buddha Doga to try to fool him.","Yes, this kind of person would definitely be able to live for a very long time. There was definitely no need to worry that he would be silenced.","With this in mind, Ling Han and Buddha Doga both smiled at the person in a friendly manner.","\"F***!\" The leader got a scare, \"What bad things have you guys done now? And you want me to clean up your mess?\"","\"Of course not.\" Ling Han and Buddha Doga both shook their heads. The favorable impression that they had just formed had already disappeared without a trace.","The three of them dragged the ship along at a slow speed. After a whole seven days of travelling, they finally arrived at a mountainous area.","Ling Han had initially thought that they had reached their destination, but in the end, they were only resting here for a while.","—He and Buddha Doga could withstand it, but how could the leader have such a physique and stamina?","That’s right, this person’s name was Tang Sishui.","\"Chu Tang and Luo Qi, how come your stamina is so much stronger than mine?\" Tang Sishui asked curiously. Without waiting for Ling Han and Buddha Doga to speak, he slapped his thigh and said, \"That’s right. Previously, you were trapped outside, which is equivalent to cultivating diligently every day. It’s only right that your physiques and stamina have been greatly improved.\"","As expected, his method of explaining away his own suspicions activated, and there was completely no fear that he would be killed to keep a secret.","Ling Han and Buddha Doga both smiled in unison, thinking that this person definitely wouldn’t be lonely. When he was bored, he could completely talk to himself.","After resting here for three days, they set out again. This journey took another five days.","The ship stopped again. This time, there was no need for Tang Sishui to speak. The miners all jumped down, and walked forwards.","Yi, there was actually no super gravity here again.","Ling Han was surprised. This Primitive Abyss was really strange. Sometimes, it would be incredibly dangerous. Merely the extreme weight of the Primitive Abyss could insta-kill a Saint, and there were some places that were completely harmless.","\"Today, the Fifth King is keeping watch. You two idiots have to be smarter — forget it, forget it. You guys just have to stop talking.\" Tang Sishui wanted to exhort Ling Han and Buddha Doga, but after some thought, he decided to forget it.","The Fifth King?","Was he the fifth disciple of the True Dragon Emperor?","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t take it to heart. What he was more curious about was why there was no extreme gravity here.","The smaller the matter was compressed, the greater the gravity field would be created. This was an objective fact. Then, what was here that cancelled out the extreme gravity?","What were the miners digging?","The two were definitely related, right? Otherwise, why didn’t they dig elsewhere, but rather here?","In this little bit of time, Ling Han’s thoughts flew.","\"The Fifth King is here!\" Tang Sishui suddenly exclaimed, then suddenly stood up.","Ling Han and Buddha Doga’s movements were slow as they looked into the distance.","A young man wearing a Silver Battle Armor walked over in large strides. He was extremely tall, and was even half a head taller than Ling Han. His long crimson hair couldn’t be concealed, even with a helmet, and danced wildly behind him.","\"Greetings, Fifth King!\" Tang Sishui hurriedly clasped his hands in greeting.","Ling Han and Buddha Doga followed suit. Fortunately, Tang Sishui didn’t kneel. Otherwise, Ling Han and Buddha Doga would definitely turn hostile immediately.","The Fifth King swept an eye over the three of them, and said calmly, \"The three of you have worked hard. In the next few days, the three of you should have a good rest, and I would have to trouble the three of you to send them back.\"","\"Fifth King, that is being too polite. It is our honor to be working for His Majesty, the True Dragon Emperor!\" Tang Sishui hurriedly said.","The Fifth King nodded, turned and left.","\"Amongst the nine disciples of the Great Emperor, the Fifth King is indeed the kindest,\" Tang Sishui said quietly, \"If it was the other disciples, they would definitely disdain from coming over to take a look at us.\"","Hey, you are a Saint, after all. Why are you so lacking in confidence?","True, these people should have been living here since birth. Even if they had occasionally gone out, all they could see was boundless darkness. How could they not know that there were other living beings in the universe?","Thus, they naturally didn’t have the arrogance of elites.","Ling Han and Buddha Doga excused themselves to rest, and began to move quietly.","The Fifth King was standing guard here, so they would just ignore him for the moment.","Ling Han and Buddha Doga were even more curious about what those miners were digging, that it actually needed a Great Emperor to personally create a city and oversee a region.","As for the Fifth King? When they returned from the mine area, they would knock him out and take him away.","The two of them entered the mineshaft and found the stones that the miners had dug out.","Ling Han immediately looked surprised. This actually contained Genesis Substance!","Though it was pitifully little, after some refinement, it was not difficult to forge a Battle Armor like the one he was wearing.","As it turned out, this was how the Battle Armor came about.","However, the Silver Battle Armor was clearly a level higher, and it was truly forged from metal. How could this kind of Stone Battle Armor compare?","Ling Han and Buddha Doga both released their divine sense to explore this area. However, their divine sense was quickly bounced back.","The two of them exchanged a look, shaking their heads and smiling bitterly.","Outside, they were practically omnipotent, but after entering into the Primitive Abyss, it was as if they had become weak cultivators that had just begun cultivating.","\"Let’s go into the mine and take a look.\"","They entered the mine and ventured deeper.","With their strength, as long as they did not want to be discovered, there was naturally no one that could see them.","Very soon, they arrived at the innermost depths of the mine."]},{"number":4744,"title":"Chapter 4744: Interrogation","paragraphs":["This place was completely dark.","There were miners working, but after being attacked by Ling Han’s divine sense, they immediately lost consciousness and fainted on the ground.","Ling Han walked over and picked up the hoe on the ground, appearing slightly surprised.","This hoe was very powerful, to actually be able to dig up that hard ore.","Though the soil structure of this mine was relatively loose, and was far from being as firm as the ground outside, even if Saints came here, their excavation efficiency would only be so.","In other words, this hoe could allow the wielder to possess Saint-level destructive power.","Of course it was awesome.","\"Yi!\" Ling Han sensed for a while, and discovered that there was a sliver of something similar to the Metal of Creation in this hoe. However, the difference in quality was too great, like a drop of water compared to an ocean.","But it was precisely because of the existence of this thing that this ordinary-looking hoe possessed the might of a Saint.","Anything from the Primitive Abyss was indeed amazing.","Ling Han held the hoe in his hand, and tried to dig a few times. Instantly, he saw the rocks on the cave wall fall down, piece by piece. It was extremely easy.","\"Tsk, tsk, tsk. Instead of resting well, the two of you actually came here to do physical labour. I am really touched!\" Behind the two of them, a voice suddenly rang out.","The Fifth King!","However, Ling Han and Buddha Doga weren’t surprised at all. After all, with their powerful divine sense, they had definitely noticed the other’s arrival long ago.","Ling Han turned around, and smiled slightly, \"Then shouldn’t the Fifth King bestow a good reward on us?\"","\"Reward, of course.\" The Fifth King also smiled, then his expression suddenly turned cold, \"I will reward the two of you with mining here for eternity!\"","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"I don’t like this reward.\"","\"This is my reward. If you like it, you can accept it, but if you don’t... you still have to accept it!\" the Fifth Kingsaid balefully.","\"Heh, isn’t this just forceful compulsion?\" Ling Han wagged his finger, and said, \"I’m telling you very responsibly that this is wrong.\"","The corners of the Five King’s mouth twitched slightly. What kind of character was this?","He had clearly grasped the rhythm of the exchange, and molded his image as an overlord that could give and take, but why had he been instantly led astray by Ling Han?","\"The two of you... who exactly are you!\" he asked. This was a very serious question.","Ling Han smiled and said, \"You came alone, so why don’t you think and wonder? What if you’re no match for us?\"","\"Humph!\" The Fifth King showed an expression of pride. In the first place, he was an eight-star Saint, and added with the Silver Battle Armor, aside from the Great Emperor, only the other disciples of the Great Emperor could compare.","Deal with the two of you who are wearing Bronze Battle Armors?","Easily.","\"Since you people are so stubborn and uncooperative I will have no option but to capture you first and interrogate you,\" the Fifth King said as he reached over to grab Ling Han and the Buddha Doga.","Ling Han pointed a finger at the Fifth King.","\"Where did you get such courage from?\" The Fifth King was proud. Ling Han actually dared to clash with him.","Peng!","With a single strike, the large hand that the Fifth King had shot out immediately crumbled.","\"What?!\" The Fifth King was stunned. Ling Han had actually blocked his attack with such ease?","This kind of battle prowess was too terrifying, wasn’t it?","How many disciples of the Great Emperor could accomplish this?","Unless it was those few trump cards.","But if he was such a trump card, how could he have appeared in the mine?","Which Great Emperor didn’t occupy territory?","’Oh, you’re not going to your own territory, but instead come to the True Dragon City to play. Are you bored out of your mind?’","All of a sudden, the heart of the Fifth King was filled with complaints, but for the moment, he did not know where to begin complaining.","\"Who exactly are you people?\" he finally asked again.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and stretched out a hand to grab the Fifth King, \"Let us exchange roles. I will ask, and you answer!\"","\"Impudence!\" The Fifth King humphed, and the Battle Armor on his body immediately glowed, injecting a powerful battle prowess into him.","He threw a punch, and the light was so dazzling that one couldn’t see anything else except for a place of white.","However, as an iron fist swung over, peng, the light was immediately extinguished.","Peng, the Fifth King was sent flying, and crashed into the cave wall. Then, he bounced back, causing a great many rocks to fall, burying him completely.","In only an instant, he broke out of the ground, yet did not linger in battle at all. Hurriedly, he turned around and fled.","This was truly a trump card. He was completely outmatched.","\"Hey, what are you running for!\" Ling Han said with a smile. Murderous aura shot out, turning into an iron fist. Its speed was astonishingly fast, and instantly sank into the back of the Fifth King’s head.","Peng! The Fifth King instantly collapsed to the ground, unconscious.","In the face of this kind of battle, Buddha Doga naturally disdained from interfering.","Ling Han first removed the Silver Battle Armor from the Fifth King’s body. This was really a good thing. It could greatly cancel out the extreme weight of gravity outside, allowing any Saint to come and go as they pleased.","Then, he jolted the Fifth King awake.","\"You guys—\"","\"If you speak another word of nonsense, I’ll stuff a rock into your a**.\"","The Fifth King had just spoken, when he was so shocked by Ling Han that he swallowed his words.","Was this guy a pervert? He had actually thought of such a malicious idea.","When Ling Han saw that this guy had shut up, he did not pay any heed to his silent complaints. He asked, \"What is the purpose of you guys mining these ores?\"","\"Refine the particles of the Metal of Creation, and think of a way to forge the Metal of Creation,\" the Fifth King answered honestly.","The Metal of Creation!","Ling Han and Buddha Doga exchanged looks. How could it be that the 36 Divine Beasts were all digging up the Metal of Creation here?","But the dignified Great Emperor actually transformed into the leader of miners. This was slightly unacceptable to the two of them.","This was too damaging to the image.","A Great Emperor, invincible in the world, ruling an era on his own, was the leader of miners?","How humiliating.","\"Looks like the 36 Divine Beasts are all conspiring to create the Metal of Creation. Thus, when the Natural-born Gold Spirit was discovered to fly out of the Primitive Abyss, the True Dragon Emperor chased out, following its tracks,\" Buddha Doga said.","Meanwhile, Ling Han looked towards the Fifth King, \"How much Metal of Creation have you guys gotten now?\"","He didn’t mind snatching all of it.","The Fifth King immediately cast him a disdainful look, but when he discovered that Ling Han’s expression had become fierce, he couldn’t help but tremble. He had almost forgotten that this guy was a freak that could not be trifled with!","He shook his head, and said, \"Do you think that it’s so easy to obtain the Metal of Creation? First of all, it needs a huge amount of Metal of Creation particles to be forged, but the success rate is too low. In so many years, there hasn’t been a single time that has succeeded.\"","Ling Han and Buddha Doga both breathed a sigh of relief. No matter what the True Dragon wanted to do, it definitely wasn’t a good thing. Thus, the fact that it hadn’t succeeded was good news.","\"This city... How long has it existed?\" Ling Han changed the topic.","\"I don’t know either.\" The Fifth King shook his head, and when he saw Ling Han pick up a rock, put it in his hand, weighed it in his hand, and when he turned his gaze to his behind, he broke out in a cold sweat, and hurriedly continued, \"I really don’t know. I have been in this city since birth.\"","\"All right, I’ll take that as the truth.\" Ling Han nodded, \"Then do you know that aside from the 36 Divine Beasts, there are other Great Emperors here?\""]},{"number":4745,"title":"Chapter 4745: Young man","paragraphs":["The Fifth King immediately revealed an expression of disdain, but then awkwardly withdrew his expression.","He said, \"Do you think that Great Emperors are as common as cabbages?\"","Because he felt too much disdain in his heart, there was quite a lot of disdain in his words.","Ling Han chuckled, and delivered a slap. ’Just see how smug you are.’","How could it be that he did not know?","In the outside world, it was said that Great Emperors would never see another. Only one Great Emperor could appear in a single era, and even if the masters of the Twelve Lands of Death had once been Great Emperors, and that was because they had destroyed their own life force, turning themselves into Yin souls.","But here, the 36 Divine Beasts were alive and kicking, completely breaking the tradition of a Great Emperor never seeing another.","Yi, was this a time that had returned to the Primitive Age?","\"Don’t you know how to speak properly?\" Ling Han glared at him.","Only then did the Fifth King nod obediently, feeling very depressed. He was the Fifth King, so why had he encountered such a freak?","\"No, there are only 36 Lord Divine Beasts here!\"","Ling Han looked at Buddha Doga, and Buddha Doga also frowned.","Looking at the expression of the Fifth King, the other party was not lying.","Then here was the problem.","The Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others were definitely still alive. Otherwise, the Natural-born Gold Spirit couldn’t possibly have contained a message from that Great Emperor.","But the Fifth King had completely no idea.","Could it be that their only purpose was to mine?","The effect of the Metal of Creation was to forge the strongest Imperial Weapon.","However, if the 36 Divine Beasts teamed up, even if their individual abilities were inferior to that of ordinary Great Emperors, they would still be able to sweep aside all opposition with their advantage in numbers.","Why did they have to expend so much effort to obtain the Metal of Creation?","Hold on!","Was it because the Great Emperor Wu Ya was currently battling fiercely with the 36 Divine Beasts, so the Divine Beasts wanted to forge the strongest Imperial Weapon to kill these Great Emperors?","Er, was there any need to go to so much trouble?","Moreover, could the strongest Imperial Weapon kill a Great Emperor?","In comparison, the person was the main force, while the Tool was only a supportive tool.","The only thing that made the Imperial Weapon stronger than the Great Emperor was that it could last for eternity and never be destroyed.","F***, he had clearly obtained even more information, but not only had he not solved the mystery, it was becoming more and more chaotic instead?","Pa, he slapped the head of the Fifth King again.","The Fifth King was a little confused. This time, he did not speak carelessly, nor did he show any disdain.","\"I’m not in a good mood,\" Ling Han explained very considerately.","’You’re in a bad mood, so you want to vent your anger on me?’","The Fifth King wanted to beat him up. He was the disciple of the Great Emperor, not your punching bag!","However, he wisely chose to keep his mouth shut.","Ling Han asked again, about anything the Fifth King knew about the Primitive Abyss.","However, there was really not much useful information.","The Fifth King basically mingled around in Dragon Head City, or stayed here to keep watch. Occasionally, he would also leave the Primitive Abyss and appreciate the Regulations in the outside world. This was also the main method for people like him to increase their cultivation level.","After all, there was too little Genesis Substance. It was too dangerous to venture too deep, so they could only try their luck in the outer regions.","However, in the misfortunate case of the Ninth King, he was accidentally killed by Ling Han.","Because this guy didn’t have any obvious evil deeds, Ling Han didn’t kill him. He only erased his recent memories.","\"Should we continue to venture deeper, or return?\" Ling Han asked Buddha Doga.","There was no longer any need to investigate this Dragon Head City.","Buddha Doga pondered for a moment before saying, \"We’ll rob the treasure storage before returning.\"","\"All right.\"","The two of them moved. With their strength, if the Great Emperor did not appear, who would be able to stop them?","It wasn’t long before they returned with a full load.","In truth, there really wasn’t much in the treasury, because once it had accumulated enough, the True Dragon Emperor would personally move to extract the essence within, attempting to forge the Metal of Creation.","However, so far, he had not succeeded even once.","Thus, although this mine had been dug for many, many years, it had basically been wasted. There were only a few Silver Battle Armors and a great many Bronze Battle Armors left behind.","Ling Han and Buddha Doga did all they could, directly robbing anyone they saw. They ransacked all the Saints who were wearing Bronze Battle Armors.","Then, they returned with a large number of Battle Armors.","Those Saints were all dumbfounded. Two extremely ruthless characters had come, and as soon as they came face-to-face, they directly knocked them unconscious and stripped them of their Battle Armor without saying a word, scaring them so much that they thought that they were going to \"lose their chastity\".","This caused a great commotion, drawing out the True Dragon Emperor who was recuperating from his injuries, but by this time, Ling Han and Buddha Doga had long since fled.","After exiting the Primitive Abyss, although they had stayed inside for several dozen years, not even a year had passed in the outside world.","Ling Han distributed the Battle Armors, arming them as much as possible. In this way, as long as one became a Saint, they could enter into the Primitive Abyss to find Genesis Substance. This could rapidly increase one’s cultivation level.","He had never denied that he was a selfish person. The distribution of these Battle Armors naturally prioritized his own people. However, in the case of Ding Shu, Jing Haoran, and Shui Qingchang, each of them had obtained a Battle Armor.","Ling Han hoped that they could go to the Primitive Abyss to comprehend the inner world inside their bodies. The flow of time there would be 100 times faster, so that they could cultivate to host stars as soon as possible, and move more forces here.","The large black dog, the little azure dragon and the others all moved out, entering into the Primitive Abyss. However, they all stayed in the outer circle, and did not go to Dragon Head City.","It was too dangerous there, and the True Dragon Emperor had also been alerted. It would be difficult to sneak in again. It was more likely that they would be directly blasted into smithereens.","Every few months, there would be people returning one after another.","Even though they had only been away for a few months, it had actually been as long as a few dozen years, and not one of them had obtained Genesis Substance.","This was actually normal. That kind of rare treasure was really too rare, and only Ling Han, with his nature-defying luck, could obtain such treasures two times in a row.","In the Primitive Abyss, there were actually some benefits, such as concocting alchemical pills and cultivating formations.","This did not involve Regulations. The only expense was time, so if it was carried out there, it would \"save\" a lot of time.","Several years had passed, yet they hadn’t made any progress. Instead, two Saints had been killed by the energy storms. Even the Bronze Battle Armor hadn’t been able to withstand the energy storms. They had been blasted into a sieve, and not even a corpse had been found.","After reaching Saint Tier, it was really no ordinary difficulty to advance another level.","Ling Han would also occasionally venture into the Primitive Abyss to try his luck. With his strength, he no longer needed the Battle Armor. If it was left to others, at least one more person would be able to enter the Primitive Abyss.","All of a sudden, they had already been here for seventeen years.","On this day, Ling Han was drinking tea with the empress, Hu Niu, Chi Menghan, Song Lan, and the others. Meanwhile, his little female attendant was still the same as before, serving him from the sidelines.","It was she who had insisted on becoming Ling Han’s maid, because once she lost this identity, how could she continue to stay by Ling Han’s side?","\"Hmm?\"","Ling Han frowned upon hearing this.","\"What is it?\" the empress asked.","\"We have a visitor.\" Ling Han stood up and looked into the distance.","A small figure walked over from the sky, and in the blink of an eye, he had appeared in front of everyone.","This was really a child. He was only eleven or twelve years old, his black locks fluttering, his feet bare. Dressed in snow-white coarse clothes, he looked delicate and refined."]},{"number":4746,"title":"Chapter 4746: Manipulating Time","paragraphs":["Seeing this pleasing-looking boy, both Chi Menghan and Song Lan were greatly moved by maternal tenderness, and began to imagine just how adorable the baby that they would have with Ling Han would be.","However, the empress was proud and haughty. In her eyes, everyone was inferior, so how could she give them a second look? And Hu Niu was more interested in food, and similarly couldn’t even be bothered to give him a second look.","Ling Han looked at the boy, and couldn’t help but feel surprised, because this boy was really young. At most, he had only lived for eleven or twelve years.","However, he actually couldn’t see through such a child!","He activated his eye technique, yet he could only see a stretch of emptiness.","Could it be that... the other party was Pseudo-Emperor, or even a Great Emperor?","If he was a Saint, Ling Han didn’t believe that there was any Saint that could block his eye technique.","Moreover, the appearance of this boy was far too bizarre.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Brother Monkey, the large black dog, the little azure dragon and the others all appeared. After all, it was too strange for a little boy to suddenly appear out of nowhere.","\"Huh? Which family are you from?\" the large black dog immediately asked.","\"My name is Little Ye,\" the boy said. \"I have come today to see just how powerful the so-called greatest prodigy of all eternity is.\"","Ling Han frowned. At first, he had thought that this little boy had come from the Primitive Abyss. After all, it was only there that such a strange young elite could be nurtured.","But now, judging from the other’s tone, he clearly came from the same place as them.","Furthermore, he did not come with good intentions. Was he from the Lands of Death?","\"Where’s your parents?\" the large black dog asked boldly. How could he be cautious about such a young child?","Furthermore, he still had Ling Han and the three Pseudo-Emperors behind him!","\"I don’t have parents.\" Little Ye giggled, \"Big doggy, you are fun. Why don’t you become my steed!\"","\"What, you wet-behind-the-ears brat actually want to ride on Grandpa Dog’s back?\" The large black dog said angrily, \"Come over here, and see if Grandpa Dog won’t beat your behind to mush!\"","Little Ye pouted, and shook his head at the large black dog, \"Come on then!\"","The large black dog howled, and immediately pounced towards Little Ye, \"Damn brat, Grandpa Dog will teach you the proper behaviour of a dog.\"","Though Ling Han felt that this Little Ye was a little strange, the large black dog was a Saint, and now, he was a Five Star Saint at that. He was still wearing the Bronze Battle Armor, and no matter how bad he was, there was no way he could be insta-killed by the other party.","Thus, he did not interfere.","The others were also observing. This little boy was too strange. He had charged over all by himself.","The large black dog didn’t unleash his full power. Instead, he launched a palm strike at Little Ye.","This child giggled, and stretched out a hand to press down on empty air. The large black dog’s movements suddenly slowed, and then became slower and slower. In fact, it was as if his movements were about to stop.","This!","Everyone was stunned. To be able to play around with a Saint like the large black dog in the palm of his hand, just how terrifying was this guy’s strength?","He could probably compete with Ling Han.","Little Ye moved calmly, and then it was seen that the large black dog’s speed suddenly recover. Boom, its attack landed, and naturally missed its target.","\"Yi, you can teleport, brat?\" The large black dog seemed to be completely unaware of what had just happened, his face filled with surprise.","Hearing the large black dog’s words, everyone was even more surprised. He actually didn’t know that he had been frozen in place by Little Ye?","It was as if it had not been frozen, but rather... time had slowed down and stopped.","Hiss!","The large black dog roared, and pounced towards Little Ye again.","This time, it was not slowed down again. This attack instantly landed solidly on Little Ye.","But a strange scene appeared. Little Ye’s body was flowing with light. Not only had this attack failed to wound him, it had not even managed to force him to take a step back.","How was this possible?","Even if the large black dog’s attack hadn’t succeeded, it shouldn’t have been so weak, right?","Little Ye stretched out his right hand, and then began to turn counter-clockwise. Instantly, the large black dog was rapidly shrinking in size, turning into a small puppy.","\"Woof! Woof!\" The large black dog didn’t even know how to speak anymore, and could only bark weakly.","However, Little Ye rapidly grew taller, turning into a tall and slender young man, captivating and enchanting.","Everyone was shocked by this scene. F*ck, he could actually turn his opponent back into a child?","How were they supposed to fight?","Directly turning you into an infant, what was left of your battle prowess?","\"Regulations of Time?\" Ling Han asked darkly. No wonder the large black dog didn’t react at all when Little Ye froze it in place. If this was Regulations of Time, then it could be explained.","Little Ye giggled, stuck out his tongue, and wore a dazzling smile, \"Ya, I’ve been seen through!\"","If this was a child, he would appear innocent and naive, but if it was an adult man, it would seem out of place.","Strange, the large black dog had shrunk, while he had matured. Was there a connection between these?","\"Recover him,\" Ling Han said calmly.","\"There’s no need to go to so much trouble.\" Little Ye shrugged, \"Controlling time is something heaven-defying. Thus, in half a day, at most, this stupid dog would return to its original state.\"","Was that really the case?","Ling Han was skeptical, but internally, he believed this.","Controlling time was too terrifying. It should be an ability unique to heaven and earth. Thus, there was a time limiting how long it could last, so this was still reasonable.","Ling Han waved a hand, and the large black dog, er, no, the small black dog was grabbed by him. Now, Old Black was just a puppy, and had no abilities at all. If it was not for the fact that he still had a pair of shining golden iron underwear on him, who would be able to connect the two?","Sigh, this despicable dog would also have a day like this.","Brother Monkey leaped out, waved the staff, and said, \"Old Sun will battle you!\"","Little Ye giggled again, \"Do you all want to bully me?\"","Brother Monkey did not waste any more words. He directly leaped out, and struck with his staff.","Little Ye raised his hand and pressed down on Brother Monkey. Brother Monkey aged rapidly at a visible rate, and in an instant, he had become an old monkey covered in white fur.","On the other hand, Little Ye had transformed from a young man to a two to three year old child. He was as fair as jade, and extremely adorable.","Hiss, he had only made two moves, and he had directly crippled the battle prowess of Brother Monkey and the large black dog.","Though the large black dog was slightly weaker, Brother Monkey was extremely, extremely strong.","This guy... was a strong opponent!","Ling Han stretched out a hand, and grabbed Brother Monkey as well. Though Brother Monkey was aged now, he still wanted to raise his staff to continue the battle.","However, he was only one step away from dying of old age, and it was already difficult for him to hold a staff, so how could he still make a move?","\"Who else is there?\" Little Ye asked in a childish voice. Though he was naive and cute, no one dared to look down on him.","Ling Han took a step forward, his fighting spirit blazing.","He had yet to encounter such an opponent, which made him excited.","For example, though a Saint had absorbed Regulations, it could only strengthen the destructive power. For example, if you had grasped Regulations of Metal, that could only strengthen the destructive power of your attack, and in the case of Regulations of Earth, that could strengthen your defense.","However, it was definitely impossible to conjure a piece of Divine Metal out of thin air just because one had grasped Regulations of Metal."]},{"number":4747,"title":"Chapter 4747: Limits","paragraphs":["However, in the hands of Little Ye, he could allow the Regulations of Time to unleash a completely different effect.","How was this done?","Ling Han had also thought about this before. If he could grasp the Regulations of Time, would he be able to age the Great Emperor in an instant? However, he was told by Buddha Doga that the Great Emperor was self-contained, and this would be ineffective.","He was already invincible against all opponents below the level of Great Emperor, so he naturally couldn’t be bothered to waste this time. He focused on cultivating the Regulations of Time.","Furthermore, it was highly possible that this would not succeed. After all, if Time was disturbed, that would be equivalent to disturbing the great dao, which would lead to extremely serious consequences.","Hence, he was very curious now, and his fighting spirit blazed.","\"Come fight me!\" Ling Han shouted. He wouldn’t treat this \"person\" in front of him like a child.","The other party could control time, so perhaps he himself was an old geezer.","Little Ye bared his teeth in a grin, \"The greatest prodigy of all eternity, I am really curious. To become a toothless old geezer, or a little brat wrapped in a diaper, how interesting would that be.\"","Ling Han also smiled, \"That would have to depend on your abilities.\"","\"En, let me think, should I turn you into an infant, or an old geezer?\" Little Ye said, biting on his finger. Because he now looked like a child, no one felt discomforted by his display.","However, everyone had seen how he looked like as an adult before, and when this scene flashed past in their minds, it naturally gave rise to a strong feeling of dissonance.","\"Better turn into a child first!\" Little Ye stretched out a hand, and pressed it down on Ling Han. Then, he began to spin counter-clockwise.","Ling Han suddenly felt an indescribable feeling assault him, causing him to undergo some kind of change.","Young age!","He could feel it, but right at this moment, with the light of great dao lightly flickering in his mind, this feeling instantly disappeared.","He stood there like a god.","\"Yi?\" Little Ye looked extremely surprised.","How was this possible?","Why had it not taken effect?","\"Strange!\" He once again turned his hand clockwise.","Weng, Ling Han had a strange feeling again. This time, he felt like time was urging him to age.","However, in his mind, the light of great dao trembled slightly, and this feeling instantly disappeared without a trace.","\"Hehe, hehe!\" Little Ye retracted his hand, and stopped trying, \"As expected of the number one prodigy of all eternity. You are indeed powerful, capable of resisting even my Mystical Power of Time.\"","Ling Han’s expression remained calm, yet a sliver of hope flashed through his mind.","If it was not for the fact that he had previously entered into the Primitive Abyss and refined the Genesis Substance, and thus cultivated the light of great dao, it was very possible that he would have already become an infant or an old geezer.","Just look at the large black dog and Brother Monkey. They have completely lost their battle prowess now, and was at the mercy of others.","In an instant, Ling Han’s killing intent blazed. This kind of opponent was too terrifying, and could cause a massive blow to his own side.","He had to deal with him as soon as possible.","Sensing Ling Han’s killing intent, Little Ye giggled, \"Yo, yo, yo, why are you suddenly filled with killing intent? However, Ling Han, even if you are the greatest prodigy of all eternity, you are still far from being able to kill me.\"","After saying this, his body suddenly enlarged, turning into a man in his early twenties. He stood tall, his aura filled with might.","\"Then let’s battle!\" Ling Han charged over. As he shot out a punch, he went all out, and all 43 flashes of Regulations were shot out.","Little Ye greeted the incoming attack, and confronted Ling Han head-on.","When their fists collided, Little Ye’s body suddenly trembled for a moment, and actually became two people. Then, they continuously overlapped into one, and then split into two again, repeating the same process.","Peng, the attack landed, and Little Ye suddenly stumbled backwards.","His face was a little pale, but he did not spurt out blood. Instead, he nodded, \"How impressive. I have underestimated you.\"","Meanwhile, Ling Han was astonished. This was because he had seen Ling Han continuously splitting into two before combining into one again. This wasn’t a shadow image after rapid movement. Instead, he had genuinely transformed into two people.","Was this another application of the Regulations of Time?","Meanwhile, everyone was astounded. Someone had actually survived a clash with Ling Han? This was far too terrifying.","Where had this monster come from?","\"Again!\" Ling Han let out a battle cry, raised his fist, and waved it again.","Peng!","In this exchange of blows, Little Ye’s body trembled, and manifested into three figures, but very soon, he became four, five, and only when there were seven, did he finally stabilize.","\"Impressive, truly impressive!\" he said sincerely, \"You almost pushed me to my limits. I have to admit, you are really strong, qualified to be called number one in all eternity.\"","What was the meaning of this?","If Ling Han was number one in history, then wouldn’t you be even stronger if you \"were almost pushed to your limits\"?","\"You still haven’t reached your limit?\" Ling Han smiled faintly, and charged out again. \"Then I’ll help you fight it out!\"","Hong! Hong! Hong!","He threw punch after punch, but Little Ye’s body split into seven, and each of his seven bodies took on the attacks respectively, but he was very calm and relaxed.","However, Ling Han was completely unconcerned, and his attacks became faster and faster.","This time, Little Ye’s expression finally changed.","Though he was still continuously splitting into seven to disperse the might of Ling Han’s attacks, his seven bodies were continuously trembling, as if they were about to shatter.","Finally, when Ling Han threw another punch, Little Ye didn’t dare to take it head-on anymore. Instead, he turned into a streak of light, and xiu, he appeared extremely far away.","He was no longer calm, but rather looked at Ling Han with a dark expression.","This was a slap to the face.","Just now, he had still been boasting, saying that Ling Han hadn’t made him hit his limit yet. In the end, however, he was being punched again and again by Ling Han. There was nothing fancy about it, and there was no variation at all as Ling Han hit him until he couldn’t bear it anymore.","His summoning doppelgangers were actually neutralized by Ling Han in such a violent manner.","Previously, he had continuously split into seven. It was he who had summoned the six versions of himself of the past and future at the same time, so that they could share Ling Han’s attack.","However, Ling Han’s attacks were too fast and too heavy. Even if there were seven \"selves\" to share the burden, under the continuous and endless attacks, the \"selves\" in the entire chain of time still sustained extremely heavy blows, and could no longer be summoned.","Otherwise, no matter which \"selves\" in the chain of time was injured, it would affect the current \"self\".","How could there be such a terrifying guy?","It should be known that he did not have a mortal body!","Seeing that Ling Han was finally on the upper hand, everyone breathed a sigh of relief. However, Little Ye was actually strong to this extent, and was finally outmatched after exchanging so many blows with Ling Han. This still made everyone dumbfounded.","\"Humph!\" With a wave of his hand, weng, space was torn apart, and a human figure that was completely enshrouded in golden light appeared.","Natural-born Gold Spirit!","Hiss, this Little Ye was indeed from the Lands of Death!","Which Great Emperor’s son was this? To actually possess such astonishing battle prowess?","After the Natural-born Gold Spirit it was another sixteen Skeleton Saint Tools. Though more than half of them had been destroyed by Ling Han, it was still no problem for them to take out sixteen of them.","Finally, it was the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters, one after another."]},{"number":4748,"title":"Chapter 4748: Mass Arrival","paragraphs":["The Lands of Death have charged over again.","How had they found this place?","Ling Han didn’t ask. This was already meaningless. The enemy had already reached the door, so their only option was to face them head-on.","Weng, the Natural-born Gold Spirit’s eyes immediately lit up, and a terrifying aura surged, as if he was a Great Emperor.","Xiu, he charged out.","Buddha Doga approached. Boom, the two Pseudo-Emperor-level beings started fighting, but in just a few moves, Buddha Doga was already at a disadvantage.","As long as the Natural-born Gold Spirit was refined, it could become a Pseudo-Emperor-level doppelganger. And now, it was controlled by the all twelve of the Lords of Death at the same time, so just how strong would it be?","Strength upon strength, it was naturally freakishly terrifying.","Qian Yanghao and Xia Houping exchanged a glance before immediately charging over to join forces with Buddha Doga to battle against the Natural-born Gold Spirit.","In this way, both sides were finally on the same level.","After all, they were Pseudo-Emperors. How many people had been able to cultivate to this kind of height in history?","Every Pseudo-Emperor was naturally inconceivably strong. However, whether it was the Natural-born Gold Spirit itself or the divine sense that controlled it, it had surpassed the level of Pseudo-Emperor, which allowed him to have the strength to fight three people on his own.","In this way, the threat posed by the Natural-born Gold Spirit temporarily disappeared. However, Ling Han’s side also lost three Pseudo-Emperors.","With just one enemy, this had weakened their forces by three people, which showed how terrifying the Natural-born Gold Spirit was!","\"Ling Han, no matter where you flee to, how can you escape from the prediction of the Great Emperor?\" Wu Xingtong said proudly.","Ling Han merely smiled faintly. He couldn’t be predicted, but the others could. Thus, as long as they could predict the whereabouts of Brother Monkey and the others, it was equivalent to knowing where Ling Han was.","\"Just the few of you?\" He shook his head, his disdain clear in his words.","\"Wouldn’t it be more than enough to sweep all of you aside?\" Wu Xingtong said with a smile.","Ling Han pointed at Little Ye, \"Who is this guy?\"","Wu Xingtong also showed a hint of surprise, but immediately said, \"That’s none of your business!\"","\"Yi, you probably don’t know either,\" Ling Han said with a smile. \"As I see it, he’s the one who’s been focused on and nurtured. None of you can dream of contesting for the throne with him.\"","When these words fell, the expressions of those Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters all darkened, as if their sore spot had been poked.","Peng! Right at this moment, Brother Monkey and the large black dog suddenly underwent a transformation. One of them became radiant and full of vitality, while the other transformed from a puppy into a large black dog.","—The effects of the flow of time on them had already passed, and they had returned to their original state.","The large black dog immediately snickered, and said impatiently, \"Are you really blood-related? The good thing of becoming Emperor doesn’t fall on you, but instead benefits an outsider!\"","As expected of Old Black. He had just recovered from that state, and was not rejoicing first, but was directly attacking.","Thus, the title of the greatest despicable Saint in the world was justified.","These words were annoying.","Wu Xingtong stared at the large black dog and said, \"Shut up, you despicable dog!\"","\"Just because you told Grandpa Dog to shut up, Grandpa Dog shut up? Grandpa Dog doesn’t want face?\" the large black dog howled. Then, he turned around, and shook his behind. His iron underwear was still very conspicuous, \"If you can, come and fight Grandpa Dog!\"","\"Die!\" Wu Xingtong couldn’t help but charge toward the large black dog.","\"Do you think I’m afraid of you?!\" The large black dog’s bearing immediately transformed, and it was as if he had become some powerful elite. He charged toward Wu Xingtong.","Boom!","Human and dog exchanged a blow, and it could be seen that the large black dog was not much at a disadvantage.","It wore a Bronze Battle Armor, greatly boosting its battle prowess.","And this was still a battle in the outside world. If it was in the Primitive Abyss, then Wu Xingtong would not be able to fight back at all, and could only be thrashed madly by the large black dog.","Seeing that Wu Xingtong and the large black dog were already locked in battle, Yang Yihuan, He Luo, and the others also pounced towards them.","A battle royale was thus drawn out.","If this were in the past, Ling Han’s side would definitely be at a disadvantage.","These were the sons and daughters of Great Emperors! Just how freakish were they?","However, many people now had Bronze Battle Armors in their hands, which greatly increased their power and defense. Thus, they could completely put up a fight.","It was also because of this that Ling Han didn’t interfere.","He simply stared at Little Ye. This was the strongest and most troublesome enemy.","This person... who exactly was he? Why was he able to use the Regulations of Time?","\"Ling Han, don’t even think of stalling for time. The Great Emperor is about to arrive personally. This is completely meaningless!\" Feng Miaoling suddenly shouted.","Yi?","Ling Han faltered upon hearing this. ’Are you trying to remind me?’","Meanwhile, Little Ye looked at Feng Miaoling with a playful gaze, but didn’t say anything.","\"Then let’s battle!\" Ling Han charged over. As Phoenix Wings Divine Flight unleashed, he charged towards Little Ye.","Even Little Ye did not dare to underestimate his opponent. Ling Han’s freakishness caused even him to feel wary.","He greeted the incoming attack, and shot out a kick. Colorful light shone from his leg, possessing the charm of great dao.","Peng!","Ling Han threw a punch, a faint smile curling up the corners of his lips.","Boom, he suddenly stimulated Destructive Energy.","Little Ye was immediately sent flying. However, what surprised Ling Han was that his leg was still there!","And what was even stranger was that there was actually black-coloured energy entwined around this guy’s legs as well.","Destructive Energy!","How was this possible?","Destructive Energy belonged to Xuan Taiyu in the last era, while in this era, it was grasped by Ling Han, Ding Shu and the other Genesis World rulers. As for the others, even if they were given the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram, they would not be able to learn it.","And now... it had appeared on the ninth person.","Ling Han couldn’t help but think. Heaven Crushing, Myriad Dao and Origin had all been killed. Those were the targets of accurate assaults from the Lords of Death. Previously, he had only thought that the Lords of Death had thought that the three of them were also great threats that needed to be eliminated.","However, after seeing Destructive Energy, he had another guess.","\"What did you do to Origin and the others!\" Ling Han shouted harshly.","Meanwhile, Little Ye was very regretful. At first, he had wanted to catch Ling Han off guard, and use Destructive Energy to kill Ling Han in one go. At the very least, he would have to cause him serious injury.","Unexpectedly, the two of them unanimously unleashed Destructive Energy, and neither of them had the upper hand.","He snickered, \"I didn’t do much. I just recycled and reused, and took something from them into my body.\"","Was it the Genesis World?","Ling Han only knew that grasping Destructive Energy was inextricably linked to the Genesis World, but he didn’t know the exact details.","\"You’re really disgusting!\" Ling Han shook his head. Wasn’t it disgusting to have something of a dead person planted into one’s body?","\"Winner takes all,\" Little Ye said calmly.","Xiu, with a flash, he once again charged towards Ling Han.","Ling Han’s eyes focused, and a powerful killing intent rose up in him.","He charged towards Little Ye, and as he swung his fist, not only did he use the Destructive Energy, it also came with the light of great dao.","This was his strongest trump card.","—If it was the holy flame, it would only be used as a last resort. After all, the more it was used, the less there would be left.","Weng, a mysterious light suddenly surged from Little Ye’s body, as if time had passed, which was extremely strange.","However, he forcefully stopped in his tracks.","\"Light of great dao!\" he exclaimed in shock."]},{"number":4749,"title":"Chapter 4749: Time Crystal","paragraphs":["Ling Han was astonished. The other party actually recognized the light of great dao. Moreover, he had forcefully halted his advance. This was like reining in his horse at the brink of a cliff, not daring to face him head-on.","He naturally would not give up, and set off in pursuit of Little Ye.","This time, Little Ye was no longer arrogant. Instead, he did not dare to take it head-on at all. He turned around and fled.","His speed was also abnormally fast, and he was teleporting in a flash.","Was this another application of the Regulations of Time?","Even if Ling Han possessed the world’s fastest movement technique, Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, he actually couldn’t catch up to him. He could only maintain a stalemate.","This caused Ling Han to have even stronger desire of killing him. However, what could he do if he couldn’t catch up to him?","Just now, Little Ye had been so arrogant, but when he saw the light of great dao, he was so scared that he fled in a panic.","Could it be that it was light of great dao could naturally restrain him?","With a thought from Ling Han, he threw a punch through the air. Instantly, the power of his fist surged violently, enveloping Destructive Energy and light of great dao.","How fast was this kind of attack?","That was because Ling Han himself was in an extremely high speed. This punch shot out explosively, turning into a brilliant ball of light that rapidly chased after Little Ye.","In a mere instant, the fist light had caught up to Little Ye.","Little Ye had no choice but to turn around to parry. Otherwise, it would definitely be a situation of death.","Peng!","He split into seven, and used the Doppelgangers Summoning Technique again, extracting six \"selves\" at different times to face the attack together.","The fist light exploded, and when the light dissipated, Little Ye was still standing there unscathed. However, the six doppelgangers trembled at the same time, and then quickly disappeared.","\"Wa!\" Little Ye threw up blood, but the expression on his face was much more relaxed.","\"Scared me to death. I had thought that you had really grasped the light of great dao, but as it turned out, it was just a little bit,\" he said thankfully.","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, \"Even if it’s just a little bit, it’s enough to beat the crap out of you!\"","This!","Little Ye’s expression turned dark. Previously, he had been scared out of his wits. When he sensed the aura of the light of great dao, he immediately fled. He had not thought that Ling Han had only grasped a little bit of it.","But even if it was just a little bit, it had still shattered his doppelgangers of time with a single strike, causing them to completely dissipate, and he would not be able to summon them out again for the moment.","Merely from this aspect, he was no match for Ling Han.","He looked at Ling Han, and there was actually the passing of time in his eyes. However, after only a while, his figure trembled, and blood seeped out from the corner of his mouth.","He wanted to use the Regulations of Time to predict Ling Han’s past and future, but all he saw was Primal Chaos. He wanted to forcibly erase the Primal Chaos, but when he looked closely, he suffered a backlash.","\"Hehe, Ling Han, you can restrict me, but if I make a move on others, will they be able to resist my Mystical Power of Time?\" Little Ye suddenly smiled, as if he had regained his confidence.","Ling Han looked at him coldly, \"You can give it a try!\"","A powerful killing intent radiated from his body as he said this.","Little Ye’s eyes darted around, and took out a crystal from his robes. It was transparent, but there was light circulating on its surface.","He played around with it for a while, and muttered, \"I can’t bear to part with this. After all, this is the only thing that accompanied my birth.\"","Then, he looked at Ling Han, and lit up the crystal, \"This thing is called the Time Crystal. When it is used in a certain area, it can decrease the flow of time in this area by a few hundred times.\"","\"Thus, as long as I trap you within, you can only watch helplessly as I commit murder. Hehe!\"","Ling Han’s expression changed drastically. He had seen the extreme changes in the flow of time in the Primitive Abyss. That was truly a hopeless situation. Even a Pseudo-Emperor would instantly become a skeleton in the Primitive Abyss. After all, a Pseudo-Emperor would only have a lifespan of a few million years, which was negligible before the passage of time in the universe.","Little Ye’s ability was definitely not comparable to heaven and earth, but if it was really as he had said, and he trapped him, then he could only sit by and watch as the other party reaped the heads of those in his party.","Aside from Ling Han, no one was a match for Little Ye. That Mystical Power of Time was too terrifying.","\"Hehe, go!\" Little Ye immediately threw out the Time Crystal. Ling Han hurriedly dodged, but the Time Crystal had already exploded. Weng, it turned into a massive screen of light that instantly caught up to Ling Han, enveloping him within.","Ling Han immediately discovered that his movements had slowed down.","No, no, no. He was not slow. It was just that others had become faster, at least a few hundred times faster.","He was affected by the Time Crystal, and the flow of time in his body was several hundred times slower than outside.","What could he do?","Ling Han immediately thought of this. Previously, Little Ye had also wanted to use the Mystical Power of Time to age him or turn him younger. However, the light of great dao had taken effect, and blocked this Mystical Power of Time.","Now... was this possible?","Ling Han actively channeled the light of great dao. Weng, his whole body glowed, exuding the Qi of great dao.","Xiu, his speed instantly sped up.","Two times, three times, five times, ten times... Though he had not recovered to the normal flow of time, compared to before, it was already much, much faster.","When Little Ye saw this, he couldn’t help but frown, \"What a freakish guy, to actually have mastered the light of great dao!\"","He no longer hesitated, and charged towards the empress and the others.","\"Hehe, age!\" He rotated his right hand clockwise.","However, before the Mystical Power of Time could be unleashed, the wings of fire flickered, and Ling Han had already stepped in front of the empress. Then, the Mystical Power of Time became completely ineffective.","Little Ye frowned. He had already taken out his trump card, and it was still unable to trap Ling Han?","\"Let’s go!\" Ling Han transmitted a message through his divine sense. He didn’t know when some Great Emperor would charge over, and it would be too unwise to continue fighting here.","He directly collected the stars, one, two, three, then led everyone to charge towards the Primitive Abyss.","He took the lead, and the three Pseudo-Emperors retreated as they fought, bringing up the rear.","The people from the Lands of Death pursued one after another. Even if there was the Primitive Abyss in front of them, they were unafraid, because very soon, a Great Emperor would appear, and suppress everything.","In the Primitive Abyss, specks of light rained down.","Boom!","A spot of light exploded, instantly emitting a terrifying wave of energy that spread out in all directions.","Everyone hurriedly dodged. This was something that could kill a nine-star Saint.","Yet Ling Han was completely unconcerned. He stood in front of them, protecting them.","This time, no one dared to give chase. Only the Natural-born Gold Spirit and Little Ye were unafraid of this kind of energy wave.","The two of them were still in pursuit, looking like they would not give up.","And right at this moment, outside of the Primitive Abyss, a Yin River pierced down from the skies.","Lord of Death, Great Emperor Senluo had arrived.","Without hesitation, this Yin River flowed into the Primitive Abyss, setting off in rapid pursuit.","F***!","Ling Han hurriedly drew everyone into his body. For those who held Imperial Weapons, whom he could not absorb into his body, he would grab them physically. He and the three Pseudo-Emperors brought them with them, running quickly.","Thankfully, they had entered into the Primitive Abyss first, and the flow of time here was much faster. With a head start, even the Great Emperor would not be able to catch up to them in a short amount of time.","Moreover, Great Emperor Senluo couldn’t unleash his full strength at this moment.","\"Let’s go to Dragon Head City!\"","Ling Han and the three Pseudo-Emperors did not hesitate at all, and headed towards the area of Primal Chaos.","In the outside world, no matter how fast they ran, they could not possibly be faster than a Great Emperor, and would always be caught up. Thus, they could only bring Great Emperor Senluo with them to Dragon Head City, and use another Great Emperor to restrain him."]},{"number":4750,"title":"Chapter 4750: Great Emperor restraining Great Emperor","paragraphs":["Previously, the True Dragon Emperor had suffered a great loss, and if he saw the Great Emperor Senluo now, he would definitely be furious.","This was the only way out for Ling Han and the others.","Furthermore, allowing the Lords of Death and the 36 Divine Beasts to fight was also in line with Ling Han’s plans, because no matter how he looked at it, both sides were aiming to destroy the universe.","Just let these dogs fight... Uh, these words couldn’t be heard by the large black dog.","This time, their luck was especially good. On the way, they did not encounter any energy storm. Though it took them a few months, they still successfully arrived outside Dragon Head City.","Behind them, the Yin River was already closing in.","Boom!","A terrifying aura surged out of the city, and then an Azure Dragon soared into the skies.","However... the Azure Dragon’s eyes were focused on Ling Han and the others.","Ling Han suddenly had an idea, and immediately called out loudly, \"Great Emperor Senluo, we have already reached our destination!\"","Instantly, the True Dragon Emperor shifted his gaze, landing on the Yin River that was rapidly chasing after them, his eyes bursting with hatred.","He was a Great Emperor, yet he had actually been forced to flee in a panic. This was a great humiliation!","Thus, he didn’t care about Ling Han and the other ants as he attacked Yin River.","When this Great Emperor made a move, even if Great Emperor Senluo felt disdain for the True Dragon Emperor, he could not possibly take it lightly.","Thus, he could only temporarily set Ling Han and the others aside to face the True Dragon Emperor.","\"Humph, nothing but a defeated opponent!\" he said disdainfully.","\"You’re neither a human nor a ghost, yet you still dare to boast shamelessly?\" the True Dragon Emperor said with a cold chuckle. He controlled his supreme Regulations and attacked the Yin River madly.","Without unleashing his full power, Great Emperor Senluo was no match for the True Dragon Emperor.","Ling Han and the others didn’t dare to watch the show from the sidelines. No matter which Great Emperor won, they would definitely be the next target.","They hurriedly passed through the Dragon Head City, then continued onwards.","Meanwhile, the Natural-born Gold Spirit and Little Ye continued their pursuit. One of them was a Pseudo-Empero, while the other was a supreme Saint that had grasped the Mystical Power of Time. They were qualified to act with no qualms like this.","Moreover, there were still twelve Great Emperors behind them, so they were even more unafraid.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The True Dragon Emperor bombarded him madly, blasting Yin River to the point that liquid was splashing everywhere. At this moment, he was extremely domineering, and had a great advantage.","\"Fake True Dragon, are you courting death?\" the Great Emperor Senluo humphed. He was already infuriated.","He was the overlord that was invincible in his era, so how high and noble was he?","And even if it was the True Dragon, there were still Divine Beasts in the past, so it could not be said that it was the sole ruler of an era, what more when this True Dragon in front of him had many problems, and was definitely not the same one as the one from all those years ago.","\"Humph, you’ve cultivated evil arts, and that’s why you were able to survive the passage of time. I don’t believe that you won’t need to pay a price for recovering to your prime, and that can continue endlessly!\" the True Dragon Emperor said balefully.","\"It’s more than enough to kill you!\" the Great Emperor Senluo said coldly.","The True Dragon Emperor took a step back, and said, \"This is my territory. If you step back, I don’t want to fight you to the point of mutual destruction either.\"","\"Are you even worthy of negotiating with me?\" the Great Emperor Senluo said, appearing extremely proud.","After all, he had once been invincible for an era.","\"You’ve gone too far!\" The True Dragon Emperor was also angered, and he didn’t say anything else. Instead, he intensified his attacks.","\"I really want to see what the hell is going on with your coming back to life!\" Great Emperor Senluo suddenly charged out of the Yin River. At this moment, he finally unleashed the true strength of the Great Emperor.","The situation was completely different. He attacked aggressively, and instantly gained the upper hand, beating down on the True Dragon Emperor.","This was the battle prowess that a Great Emperor should possess!","The situation was the same as the last time. The True Dragon Emperor was outmatched after battling for a long time, and didn’t dare to continue fighting. He hurriedly turned around and fled.","Thankfully, he did not die. He had not run too far, when he encountered an energy storm.","Even if they were Great Emperors, they still didn’t dare to face this storm of energy head-on. They had no choice but to stop in their tracks.","\"Fake True Dragon, let me see your true appearance!\" Great Emperor Senluo was also greatly interested in this being that looked to be a True Dragon, but should not be a True Dragon at all. His offensive was like a tide, fully showing the invincibility of the Great Emperor.","The True Dragon Emperor had nowhere to retreat, and could only battle to the death.","An expression of terror appeared on his face. If they continued to battle, so what if he was a Great Emperor? He would still be killed.","\"Ang!\" He released a dragon’s roar that shook the heavens.","\"Yi, summoning help?\" The Great Emperor Senluo looked surprised. No wonder; there was something similar to the True Dragon Emperor in the Primitive Abyss?","—Previously, though Ling Han had revealed the news of the 36 Divine Beasts to the ruler of the Blood Sea, the ruler of the Blood Sea did not believe it at all.","Thus, since she didn’t believe him, why would she tell the Great Emperor Senluo and the others?","\"All the more reason to kill you!\" Great Emperor Senluo’s killing intent surged like a flood.","Even as powerful as he was, he would still frown deeply when he was besieged by two \"True Dragon Emperors\". If there were three or even four of them, he would have to consider retreating.","Thus, he had to make the most of his time.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The might of the Great Emperor was fully unleashed. The True Dragon Emperor, on the other hand, was lacking in ability, and his performance was becoming worse and worse.","This was also in line with the deductions of Buddha Doga, Great Emperor Senluo and so on. There was a huge problem with this True Dragon, and it was definitely not like the real Great Emperor.","Though the True Dragon Emperor tried his best to resist, in a situation where there was no way out and he could only fight to the death, how could he last long?","Peng!","The Great Emperor Senluo unleashed a furious punch, and the True Dragon Emperor’s chest was forcefully pierced through. The Great Emperor Senluo then reached over with both hands and ripped the True Dragon Emperor into two.","\"Humph, with such a physique, are you worthy of being called the True Dragon?\" the Great Emperor Senluo said coldly. He took a deep breath, and instantly, whether it was the True Dragon Emperor that was still breathing, or the Dragon Head City in front of them, all of their life essence was sucked away by him.","In an instant, this had become a land of death.","His shrivelled body was slightly plumper, but he was still far from his complete state.","After all, there were far too few living beings in this place. If it weren’t for the fact that he had a Great Emperor, he wouldn’t have even recovered one-ten-thousandth of his power.","\"Strange, when did such a city appear inside the Primitive Abyss?\" The Great Emperor Senluo frowned, \"And it has to be at such a time! Could it be a coincidence?\"","\"Impossible, how could there be such a coincidence in this world!\"","He looked ahead, and could clearly sense that a frightening aura was presently rapidly approaching.","This was an existence that was not inferior to him.","Great Emperor-level!","In just a short while, a green divine bird flew over.","\"Azure Phoenix?\" The Great Emperor Senluo sneered. \"This is getting more and more fun. Even the Azure Phoenix has come back to life!\"","The Azure Phoenix was in the air, and Imperial Might permeated through the air.","\"You killed the True Dragon?\" The Azure Phoenix’s voice boomed, but if Ling Han was here, he would definitely discover that this Azure Phoenix was actually a male!","\"Do you also want to die?\" the Great Emperor Senluo asked calmly.","The Azure Phoenix Emperor gazed at Great Emperor Senluo and said, \"You’ve already entered a state of exhaustion. Can you still fight?\"","The Great Emperor Senluo smiled faintly, and said, \"I’m powerful enough to kill you!\"","Even if he was a Lord of Death, this kind of invincible confidence was still breathtaking."]},{"number":4751,"title":"Chapter 4751: Second City","paragraphs":["The Azure Phoenix Great Emperor wasn’t angered. Instead, he pondered for a moment before saying, \"Perhaps you can kill me. However, you’ll also have to pay an exorbitant price, and it’s probably not something that you can withstand.\"","The Great Emperor Senluo looked hesitant. Indeed, just as the Azure Phoenix Great Emperor had said, his battle prowess was still superior to the latter. However, he had just fought a battle with his recovered full battle prowess. If he fought again, he would also be in great danger.","After all, he had traversed countless years, and defied the heavens. Would he not need to pay a price for doing so?","Just in time. At this moment, the storm of heaven and earth had temporarily subsided. The Great Emperor Senluo flicked his sleeves, picked up the dragon corpse, and turned to leave.","The Azure Phoenix Great Emperor merely watched as the Great Emperor Senluo left. When Great Emperor Senluo’s figure had completely disappeared from sight, he mumbled, \"The situation is slightly beyond our control, but success is also in front of us. We still have to endure for a while longer.\"","After saying this, he turned around and flapped his wings at an indescribably quick speed.","...","Meanwhile, Ling Han, the Buddha Doga, and the others finally managed to throw the Great Emperor Senluo off their tails. Meanwhile, Little Ye and the Natural-born Gold Spirit, even though they were slightly troublesome, they were still manageable.","Thus, Ling Han stopped and turned around to face the Natural-born Gold Spirit and Little Ye.","\"Come and fight me?\" Ling Han asked with a smile.","Little Ye turned around to look, but frowned slightly, because he could no longer sense Great Emperor Senluo’s aura in this place.","This was the Primitive Abyss, a place that even Great Emperors had to be careful when entering. There were too many amazing things about it.","\"There’s no rush,\" Little Ye giggled. \"In any case, you’re just a few clowns, so I’ll let you live for a while longer.\"","He turned around and left, but after taking a few steps, he suddenly stopped, turned around and said, \"I am already a Nine-Star Saint, and next, I will be breaking through to the level of Pseudo-Emperor. You have to know that it is allowed to become Emperor in this era, so... if you continue to stay here, you can only watch helplessly as I become Emperor.\"","A Great Emperor possessed the fortune of heaven and earth, and only one could appear in a single era.","Thus, if Ling Han continued to stay here, he would be cut off from heaven and earth, so how could he possibly become Emperor?","To say nothing of becoming Emperor, he wouldn’t be able to successfully become a Pseudo-Emperor.","This was naturally a psychological attack, wanting to mess with Ling Han’s Dao Heart.","Ling Han was unmoved. There was Genesis Substance in the Primitive Abyss, which could support his cultivation at the Saint Tier, and as for Great Emperor Tier?","He had to cultivate to the consummate level of Saint Tier first.","Little Ye and the Natural-born Gold Spirit left. Ling Han and the others didn’t pursue them.","Little Ye was only secondary. The Natural-born Gold Spirit was really too terrifying. Even if three Pseudo-Emperors combined forces, they still could not suppress it. The moment it threw away all reservations, and set its eye on Ling Han to attack, even Ling Han would have a headache.","\"Now, should we advance or retreat?\" a few Saints who were wielding Imperial Weapons asked. They could not be absorbed into Ling Han’s body.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before looking ahead and saying, \"Since we’re already here, we naturally have to continue forward.\"","The three Pseudo-Emperors moved, helping everyone to hide their traces. Previously, they had clearly seen an azure divine bird fly through the skies. Though there was still a very far distance between them, Imperial Might had diffused the area, and from that, they knew very clearly that this was a Great Emperor.","\"A large azure bird... could it be the Azure Phoenix Great Emperor?\" everyone speculated.","Ling Han was even more astounded. Had the dead Divine Beasts really come back to life one after another?","First, there was the True Dragon. This was something that the little azure dragon had concluded was definitely dead, and in the case of the Azure Phoenix, Ling Han had obtained the images recorded after its death. It was similarly deader than dead.","Strange, too strange. How had these Divine Beasts come back to life? And why had they all come out at this time?","Ling Han couldn’t figure it out no matter what. What exactly was the Primitive Abyss hiding?","What exactly was the so-called immortality?","Similarly seeking immortality, some Great Emperors would become Lords of Death, some Great Emperors would be fighting against unknown powerful enemies in the Primitive Abyss, and some Great Emperors would be revived after death.","It was a complete mess.","They advanced, and not too long after, they saw the Azure Phoenix Great Emperor fly back. Similarly, because the Pseudo-Emperors had covered their tracks, they were still not discovered.","The group advanced at a much slower pace than a Great Emperor. This journey took about three days’ time, and they could see that a change had taken place in the desolate plain ahead of them. A desert had appeared.","Yellow sand was everywhere. There was no wind, and it was completely silent.","If they wanted to pass, they could only continue onwards. Everyone could only step onto the yellow sand, and begin a long journey of unknowns.","Actually, now that they were here, even Buddha Doga, Qian Yanghao and Xia Houping were completely at a loss. Though they had come to the Primitive Abyss before, they had only ventured as deep as the area of Dragon Head City, and did not dare go any further.","That was an area that only Great Emperors could enter.","But this time, they still had things like Battle Armors, which greatly increased their survivability. Furthermore, it seemed like there were cities built along the way, which gave them more reason and courage to venture deeper.","After walking in the desert for half a day, a breeze blew, causing the sand to gently roll.","This was an extremely normal phenomenon, but everyone’s faces were ashen.","It should be known that this speck of sand was as heavy as a star, but it was actually stirred up by a breeze. Then, if a strong wind blew, just how terrifying would it be?","When a grain of sand shot over, it would be like a star was crashing down.","Moreover, what kind of concept would it be if the sky was filled with sandstorms?","\"We can’t advance any further. We’ll just forcibly defend here!\" Buddha Doga said. He took the Clear Bamboo Swor, guarding on the front line.","It was too late to retreat. They had ventured deep into this place for half a day, so how could they leave immediately?","After only a short while, the winds immediately became stronger, and the yellow sand was no longer fluttering lightly. Instead, it was circling around on the ground, and it was possible that it would dance at any moment, turning into a sandstorm.","Ling Han unleashed the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, which enveloped everyone.","Boom, the yellow sand finally swatted over.","Buddha Doga brandished his sword. Shua, shua, shua! Sword Qi soared into the sky.","The might of the Pseudo-Emperor and the Imperial Weapon was still extremely astonishing. With a slash of the sword, all the grains of sand that attacked were destroyed.","However, in this desert, how much sand was there?","Millions and millions of grains!","It could be said that there was no end to it.","Even though Buddha Doga was so powerful, he was still unable to fully protect himself. There were still a few scattered grains of sand that passed through.","However, they still had a second line of defense.","The grains of sand landed on the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, releasing a heavy and muffled sound. At the same time, waves of shockwaves also assaulted them.","However, there were still two Pseudo-Emperors and Ling Han in the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. They worked together to disperse the shockwave, and when Buddha Doga was about to collapse, Xia Houping and Qian Yanghao went out to take his place, one after another.","Moreover, there were also three Imperial Weapons here, which could also be of use.","This sandstorm lasted for a whole three months before it finally ended. When all the yellow sand fell onto the ground, and the winds stopped blowing, everyone was sprawled out on the ground in exhaustion.","After recovering for a while, no one dared to stay here any longer, and hurriedly continued onwards.","This was still not the most dangerous storm of heaven and earth of the Primitive Abyss. Otherwise, even Great Emperors would be blasted into smithereens, so what use would Imperial Weapons have?","Another two days later, a large city appeared ahead of them.","It was like a divine bird spreading its wings."]},{"number":4752,"title":"Chapter 4752: Tournament of the Nine Cities","paragraphs":["Ahead of them, there was a city that was like a divine bird that was spreading its wings and soaring high, wanting to charge into the Nine Heavens.","\"Are we... going there?\" a Saint asked softly.","They couldn’t help but feel apprehensive. This was because they had seen a divine bird that they suspected was the Azure Phoenix streak across the sky just then. It was extremely likely that the Azure Phoenix Great Emperor was in the city ahead of them.","Who wouldn’t be terrified to barge into the territory of a Great Emperor?","\"There’s no need for so many people to go. Just a few people would do. We will go and investigate the situation first,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","This caused the Saints to sigh in relief. Otherwise, their hearts might not have been able to withstand it.","After some discussion, Ling Han, Buddha Doga, and the other Pseudo-Emperors set off as a group, entering into the Azure Phoenix City to see how things were going.","In any case, Ling Han had already absorbed most of them into his body. At that time, he had already endured for more than 200 years. As for now? It was no big deal.","Very soon, the four of them arrived at the city gates.","There were still guards here, but when they saw that one of Ling Han’s group was wearing a Silver Battle Armor, they immediately chuckled, \"Which Great Emperor are you under, Milord?\"","By the looks of it, the Silver Battle Armor was the standard for disciples of the Great Emperors.","Ling Han smiled and said, \"I’m the disciple of the True Dragon Emperor, the Ninth King!\"","In any case, this guy had long since died. However, only Ling Han and the others had seen him die. To outsiders, since he had died without a corpse, it could only be said that he had disappeared.","\"So it’s the Ninth King. Please come in!\" The guard hurriedly stepped aside, and said very considerately, \"Lord Ninth King, you really targeted the timing and came just in time. The Nine Cities Tournament will be held tomorrow.\"","Yi, what Nine Cities Tournament?","Ling Han naturally didn’t ask. This question would definitely give him away.","They thought that he had come to participate in the competition of the Nine Cities, but what the heck was this?","Ling Han first pushed his doubts back into his mind. Then, with a wave of his hand, he brought Buddha Doga and the others into the city.","\"What extravagance!\" That guard hissed. He had come out to participate in a tournament, and actually brought three Saints with him as guards. Wasn’t this extravagant enough?","What he didn’t know was that Buddha Doga and the others were actually Pseudo-Emperors. Otherwise, his tongue would probably be sticking out of his mouth as he gaped.","After Ling Han entered the city, he randomly grabbed a person and ducked into a hidden spot, and then asked around.","In truth, when others saw him wearing a Silver Battle Armor, they would have long since developed reverence, and would definitely tell him everything they knew.","After a round of queries, Ling Han finally understood. As it turned out, a battle for supremacy among the disciples of the Great Emperors would be held in the Azure Phoenix City tomorrow, and the range of participation would be the nine great cities of the first line of defense, which included the True Dragon, Azure Phoenix, the Crimson Ape and the other Divine Beasts.","At first, Ling Han had not been interested in this. However, when he found out that the prize for the first place was a Genesis Substance-level Celestial medicine, he could not hold himself back any longer.","What he needed the most now was the Genesis Substance, which could allow him to accommodate more Regulations while his body would not experience Silent Destruction.","Of course, Genesis Substance was not all that multi-purpose. It only allowed the user to possess the ability to accommodate more Regulations without going through Silent Destruction. It did not mean that one would definitely be able to accommodate Regulations. The key was still the individual’s own ability.","Only if prodigies obtained it, would it be like adding wings to a tiger, and strengthen them further..","This was icing on the cake, and definitely not timely help.","\"You want to participate?\" When Buddha Doga saw Ling Han’s excited expression, he knew that Ling Han couldn’t hold himself back any longer.","Ling Han nodded earnestly, \"M-hm.\"","Buddha Doga and the others exchanged hesitant glances.","If Ling Han wanted to participate in the competition, he could only pretend to be the disciple of the True Dragon Emperor. It would either be the Ninth King, or the Fifth King. However, there was still a Great Emperor in charge here, so how could it be easy to put on a disguise in front of such a being?","If he was discovered, would he be directly blasted into smithereens?","\"Ling Han, you have to consider carefully,\" Xia Houping said solemnly.","\"You may be the only hope for the future,\" Qian Yanghao said.","Ling Han nodded earnestly, \"Precisely because of this, I need to mature as soon as possible.\"","\"All right!\" Buddha Doga nodded. Being able to become Emperor, his temperament was naturally outstanding. Once he had made a decision, he would definitely not waver.","Ling Han stretched out a hand, and erased the memories of that person who had been questioned during this period of time.","Then, he boldly walked out, heading directly to a place in the city. At present, the disciples of the Great Emperors of the Nine Cities were all gathered here.","This kind of tournament wasn’t held often. On the other hand, there were pitifully few such tournaments. After all, the Genesis Substance was used as a reward, so how could it be held often?","Otherwise, no matter which Great Emperor, they would definitely go bankrupt.","When he arrived, this was actually a very simple and crude courtyard. After all, it was the Primitive Abyss. Being able to build a city was already an inconceivable feat, so how could he expect it to be resplendent and dazzling?","This was the temporary residence of the disciples of the Great Emperors. There were two guards at the entrance, and when they saw Ling Han, they immediately felt deep veneration.","\"Lord!\" They paid their respects. Wearing a Silver Battle Armor, that was the standard setup for disciples of a Great Emperor.","Ling Han couldn’t help but smile. This was really simple, saving him a lot of trouble.","\"I am the Ninth King under the True Dragon Emperor,\" he declared proudly.","\"Lord Ninth King!\" The two guards bowed again.","\"I’ve just arrived. Please bring me in,\" Ling Han said calmly. He didn’t want to give himself away.","\"Understood!\" A guard hurriedly brought Ling Han in.","Even though this courtyard was simple and crude, it still occupied a considerably large area, with multiple buildings lined up one after another.","Ling Han didn’t see anyone else, but he could sense that many rooms were exuding powerful fluctuations of aura.","Saint Tier!","Disciples of Great Emperors would definitely be Saint-level. Otherwise, they would not have been qualified to come here to participate in the so-called Nine Cities Tournament.","\"Lord Ninth King, this is your residence.\" The guard led Ling Han to a more remote location. He seemed to be afraid that Ling Han would be unhappy, so he continued to explain, \"You came later, so the good places have all been chosen by other Lords.\"","\"It’s fine.\" Ling Han waved his hand, and strode into the house.","\"Lord Ninth King, please have a good rest.\" The guard bowed again, then turned and left.","Ling Han entered the room, and his eyes swept over the surroundings. This place was even simpler. There wasn’t even a bed. There was only a bamboo mat, and it wasn’t very big either. This should be used for meditation.","However, Ling Han’s eyes lit up.","This bamboo mat was really something good!","He stretched out a hand to sense. There was a sliver of Genesis Qi within. Though he could not extract Genesis Substance, if he sat cross-legged on it and cultivated, the benefits would be much greater.","Hehe, though the conditions here were harsh, there was a considerable amount of good stuff.","Ling Han nodded. No matter what, this bamboo mat belonged to him now, and there was definitely no way he could return it.","\"I have to think of a way to steal the bamboo mats in the other rooms as well,\" he muttered.","A night passed, and a new day arrived.","There was a man-made sun here. It was too simple. There was no need for a Great Emperor to move, and the Saint would be able to create a beautiful one.","Ling Han followed the others out of the Azure Phoenix City and into a large mountain.","There... was a mine here."]},{"number":4753,"title":"Chapter 4753: Awkwardness","paragraphs":["Yi, this wouldn’t be asking them to compete in who would be mining faster, right?","Ling Han couldn’t help but curse in his mind.","Quite a number of people had come under the banner of every Great Emperor, and usually, these Great Emperors would barely interact with one another, allowing Ling Han to blend in.","—Everyone thought that he was a disciple of some Great Emperor, though he was not from their own faction.","Thus, if Ling Han didn’t speak and didn’t take sides, he wouldn’t be exposed.","An elder spoke up. He was a Nine-Star Saint, but in this place, his cultivation level could not be considered the highest, because there was no shortage of Nine-Star Saints here.","From this aspect alone, the Primitive Abyss’s overall level of cultivation was higher than the outside world.","All the Imperial Clans added together, even taking into account the old Saints that lived in seclusion and were rumored to have long since died, the number of nine-star Saints could only be counted on two hands, at most, but in this place, there were only nine cities, and that had already exceeded this number.","There was nothing that could be done. With a Great Emperor overseeing things, wasn’t this very normal?","\"Inside this mine, there are four Ignited Stone Beasts. You guys go and kill them. The four people who return with the heads of the Ignited Stone Beasts can advance to the next round. As for the others, they will all be eliminated,\" the old Saint said.","This was really simple and rough. No matter how many people there were, it would be directly passing through a round of selection to the top four.","\"Go on.\" The old Saint waved them off.","Instantly, one after another, teams set out, and rushed into the cave.","\"Yi, why haven’t you entered yet?\" The old Saint looked towards Ling Han.","Why was this guy so strange?","Ling Han was also very confused. He didn’t know which team belonged to the True Dragon Emperor. Moreover, even if he knew, if he forcefully approached, how could those people recognize him?","Wouldn’t his identity instantly exposed?","This was about to become Ling Han’s sore spot. This was a persona, a persona that couldn’t be destroyed too quickly.","\"I’m a more modest person,\" Ling Han said with a smile. \"So, let them go first.\"","The old Saint’s eyes involuntarily lit up. This kind of quality was really too rare.","\"Which Great Emperor are you under?\" he asked.","\"Ninth King under the True Dragon Emperor,\" Ling Han said calmly.","The old Saint nodded. He would remember this.","\"Hurry up and go. You can’t fall too far behind. After all, there are only four Ignited Stone Beasts,\" the old Saint said with a smile. His eyes were filled with kindness as he looked at Ling Han.","Ling Han gave an ’oh’. He had only been making up nonsense, so how had he gained a favorable impression?","Er, who cares.","Ling Han strode into the mine.","He didn’t care whether others would beat him to it or not. In any case, if he saw one person defeat one, then even if the Ignited Stone Beast was killed by another, he could still snatch the beast’s head.","After all, this was only a request to bring back the beast’s head. There was no requirement that it must have been killed by oneself.","He was very relaxed, whistling as he thought about how he was going to cover up for his identity later.","En, if all the disciples of the True Dragon Emperor had \"disappeared\", then there would definitely be no one who would expose his identity.","Ling Han thought for a moment, and felt that this matter could not be resolved any easier.","The paths in the mine extended in all directions. The deeper they went, the more forks there were. Furthermore, this was an abandoned mine, and there were no miners. After countless years of excavation, the passageways here were also like a spider’s web, densely packed.","Ling Han released his divine sense, and searched for the location of the Ignited Stone Beast.","Since it was called Ignited Stone Beast, it must be related to flames. Thus, one only had to grasp the movement of the flames.","However, why was the gravity field here so powerful?","Previously, Ling Han had also gone to a mineshaft. The gravity fields there were very weak, and even if he didn’t wear Battle Armor, he could still come and go as he pleased in the mineshaft, even if he was in the Spiritual Transformation Tier.","But in this place, the gravity was extraordinarily strong, and there was not much difference between this place and the outside world.","Could it be because the mines here had the effect of cancelling out the gravity fields, and now that the ores had been dug out, the gravity fields had returned to their original level?","Yes, that should be the case.","Ling Han mulled over this as he continued his search.","Found it.","He smiled, crossed his arms behind his back, and began walking in this beehive-like mine. It was a walk in the park for him, and he didn’t need to hesitate at all when he encountered a fork in the path.","Half a day later, boom, the shockwaves of a great battle suddenly spread out ahead of him.","Someone had beaten him to it?","Ling Han pursed his lips. Whatever, he would just snatch it back.","He continued to advance. Boom! Boom! Boom! The shockwaves of the great battle surged over continuously, causing the shards on the stone walls to fall one after another.","After another while, the path ahead suddenly opened up. Seven silver-armored warriors were attacking a giant beast made of green stone, and the strange thing was that this was clearly a fierce beast made of stone, yet it was burning with flames, exuding a blazing heat.","It was precisely because of these flames that the seven people surrounding it didn’t dare to force it too far. As their attacks continued, more than half of them were directly burned by the flames, and it was difficult for them to have a very good effect.","However, two of these seven people were Nine Star Saints, and the remaining were either Eight Star Saints or Seven Star Saints. The weakest was at least Six Stars, and with the addition of the Silver Battle Armor, their battle prowess could be said to be considerably strong. Sooner or later, they would be able to grind this fierce beast to death.","En, this must be the Ignited Stone Beast.","Ling Han had no intention of hiding himself. Thus, the seven people immediately discovered him.","\"Old Eighth, go and stop him. Don’t let him send out a signal to draw another team over,\" a silver-armored warrior said.","\"All right!\"","One of the seven silver-armored warriors broke away from the battle, and with a leap, arrived in front of Ling Han.","\"Hehe, which Great Emperor is this brother under?\" this person asked.","Ling Han coughed and said, \"Under the True Dragon Emperor’s banner, the Ninth King!\"","The person on the other side clearly faltered for a moment, then forced out a smile, \"Sir, there is no need to act all mysterious. We are the disciples of the True Dragon Emperor!\"","Er... what a coincidence!","\"Hehe, that would really be awkward,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","’You’re still smiling so brightly?’","The silver-armored warrior was the eighth disciple of the True Dragon Emperor. He said coldly, \"Ninth disappeared tens of thousands of years ago, and you impersonated him. Humph, are you provoking us?\"","\"Eighth Brother, do you not recognize me? I am really Ninth!\" Ling Han said very exaggeratedly, \"In these tens of thousands of years, I have been trapped by the storms of heaven and earth, and only managed to break free not too long ago.\"","\"Have I changed so much? So much that my Eighth Brother doesn’t even recognize me anymore?\"","F***!","The expression of the Eighth King immediately darkened, \"Though strictly speaking, we are all family, you keep impersonating my Ninth Brother, and could possibly be blaspheming a dead man. I will definitely not spare you.\"","\"Eighth Brother! I really am your Ninth Brother!\" Ling Han continued his performance.","\"Damn it!\" The Eighth King charged out, and moved to thrash him with a single punch.","Ling Han moved, and exchanged a blow with the Eighth King. Boom, when their fists crashed into each other, the Eighth King immediately turned into a cannonball, shooting backwards rapidly.","Peng, he crashed heavily into the cave wall, then bounced back. A hemispherical pit was actually revealed behind him.","The might of this punch showed clearly just how violent it was."]},{"number":4754,"title":"Chapter 4754: Stomped to Death","paragraphs":["\"Who exactly are you?\" the Eighth King asked balefully. He had repeatedly joked about their Ninth Brother; he had gone too far.","Furthermore, how could he be so strong?","Ling Han laughed loudly, and said, \"Alright, I won’t tease you guys anymore. I accidentally killed your Ninth Brother, so you guys can transfer him from the list of missing people to the list of dead.\"","\"What!\" The Eighth King was shocked, and looked suspiciously at Ling Han.","If it was said that he had only gone too far previously, then killing the Ninth King was definitely a heinous crime.","As a fellow disciple of a Great Emperor, how dare you?","\"Humph, I’ll capture you first, then slowly interrogate you!\" The Eighth King moved, grabbing out at Ling Han.","Weng, the Silver Battle Armor had bestowed him with great power. As he shot out an attack, not only was Regulations boiling, there was also another mysterious power that boosted his battle prowess.","Ling Han was unconcerned, and casually sent out a palm strike.","Peng, the Eighth King instantly sprawled out on the ground.","\"You!\" The Eighth King immediately shot up again. He looked at Ling Han in horror, revealing a hint of wariness.","Too strong, this was a trump card-level ability!","\"First!\" The Eighth King called out loudly, \"We seem to have been targeted by the trump card of some Great Emperor!\"","\"Oh?\" With a flash, the man who had commanded the Eighth King to battle earlier had already left the battle and stood beside the Eighth King. He was the number one disciple of the Azure Dragon Great Emperor, Liu Yuhao.","\"First, why did you run away without any warning!\"","\"F***, we’re under great pressure!\"","The remaining five called out one after another. The battle situation was instantly reversed by the Ignited Stone Beast, and they could only retreat successively in defeat.","\"It’s all right. You won’t die for a while,\" Liu Yuhao said indifferently, his eyes fixed on Ling Han, \"You look unfamiliar. Who exactly are you?\"","Ling Han wore an astounded expression as he shouted, \"Big Brother, I’m your Ninth Brother!\"","’F*** you!’","The Eighth King rolled his eyes. Just now, you already said that you accidentally killed the Ninth King, and now you’re here to impersonate Ninth. Wasn’t that just toying with him like he was a monkey?","\"Among the trump cards under the Great Emperors, you definitely do not exist!\" Liu Yuhao stated calmly, then faltered, \"Could it be that you come from the second level?\"","The 36 Divine Beasts formed groups of nine, guarding the Primitive Abyss. Each group was divided into various levels, going deeper and deeper.","For example, the True Dragon Emperor, Azure Phoenix Emperor, and so on all belonged to the first level.","Now, an unfamiliar elite had suddenly appeared. Aside from coming from the second level, was there any other explanation?","Er, this guy also had a very strong imagination. Could it be that he had attributes like Tang Sishui, and forcibly explained so that he would never be silenced?","Ling Han laughed loudly, \"Wrong, wrong. I do not come from within, but rather from outside.\"","\"What?!\" Liu Yuhao and the Eighth King exclaimed in astonishment. This person had actually come from the outside world?","All of a sudden, a baleful killing intent appeared on their faces.","They stood guard here, and their daily task was to cultivate and supervise the mines, and the true mission they bore was to kill all outsiders.","However, in their long lives, they had never encountered outsiders, so they did not take it to heart at all.","Right until this moment.","There was actually an outsider that had come in!","’How did he suddenly appear?’","It should be known that without the protection of a special Battle Armor, to say nothing of battle, even standing here itself was an extremely extravagant thing.","But now, not only had he come safely, he had even managed to snatch a Silver Battle Armor!","\"You killed Ninth?\" Liu Yuhao asked balefully.","\"Er, strictly speaking, I didn’t want to kill him,\" Ling Han said with a smile. \"I took off his Battle Armor, and as a result, this guy was crushed into smithereens. Not even a single hair was left behind.\"","\"Don’t you f*cking know? Without the protection of the Battle Armor, anyone can only die!\" Liu Yuhao and the Eighth King shouted at the same time.","Didn’t this idiot have any common sense? They couldn’t help but curse.","Ling Han was extremely displeased, and he exclaimed, \"I hate it the most when others insult me!\"","\"Humph, not only am I insulting you, but I am also going to kill you!\" Liu Yuhao rushed out, and stretched out a hand, delivering a palm strike towards Ling Han.","This person was indeed extraordinary. His cultivation level was that of a Nine Star Saint, and his battle prowess had actually reached thirty stars.","Even with the boost from the Battle Armor, his strength could not be denied. He was even more awesome than the majority of the Golden Generation.","Unfortunately, he was still far inferior to Ling Han.","Ling Han casually threw a punch. Peng! Liu Yuhao was instantly sent flying, crashing into the battle between the other five kings and the Ignited Stone Beast.","His sudden arrival was something that no one had expected. The Ignited Stone Beast’s claw just happened to strike down, and Liu Yuhao was trampled beneath its feet.","This!","Just how terrifying was the battle prowess of the Ignited Stone Beast? Even if the seven of them joined forces, they could only place their hopes on slowly wearing down this fierce beast. Now that Liu Yuhao had been firmly stomped on, just how terrifying was the destructive power that he had to sustain?","\"Ang?\" Even the Ignited Stone Beast was very confused. Why had someone suddenly charged over to die? Furthermore, it was that most ruthless and most powerful person who had ganged up on it previously.","As it roared, it continued to crush down its claw.","\"Boss!\" the remaining six kings shouted at the same time. Oh no, he might still have had a breath of life at first, but now, he was definitely dead.","The Ignited Stone Beast raised its leg, and saw that the Silver Battle Armor was still completely unscathed, but as for the person inside... he was already too horrible to look at.","This Battle Armorcould have defensive effects, but it wasn’t omnipotent. As long as the attack power exceeded the upper limit of its absorption rate, the person inside would still be affected.","Originally, with Liu Yuhao’s strength, he would have been able to disperse this part of the impact. But the problem was, he had already passed out at the same time that he had been sent flying by Ling Han. How could he defend in that situation?","He was a nine-star Saint, a disciple of a Great Emperor, and a trump card at that. Yet, he had been killed with a single stomp from the ferocious beast just like that.","What an injustice!","\"You!\" Instantly, the gazes of the remaining six kings were all focused on Ling Han, and it was as if they were about to spit fire.","Ling Han smiled, and stretched out a finger to remind them, \"Take note, that fierce beast doesn’t seem to have eaten enough!\"","\"Ang!\" The Ignited Stone Beast roared loudly, and was already charging towards the Second King and the others.","Weren’t you guys very fierce just now?","’Come on, continue to be fierce!’","The fiercest one had already been stomped to death by it, and the remaining people, hoho, couldn’t even withstand a single blow!","The six disciples of the Great Emperor hurriedly regathered their battle lines, blocking this great beast. However, they were terrified, because there was an even more terrifying bringer of misfortune behind them.","Even as powerful as Liu Yuhao was, he was still no match for a single punch from his opponent. What if this guy took advantage of the opening to attack them as well?","In front of them, there was the Ignited Stone Beast, and behind them, there was the bringer of misfortune. What were they to do now?","Ling Han snickered, and resolutely moved to cause trouble.","Peng, one person was sent flying, and just happened to be stepped on by the Ignited Stone Beast, which directly crushed him to death.","This... another person had died.","The remaining five kings were both shocked and furious, but in this situation, they could not stop at all. Otherwise, they would be instantly annihilated by the Ignited Stone Beast, but even so, they were only struggling at death’s door.","What could they do? What could they do?","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Ling Han attacked continuously, throwing the remaining disciples of the Great Emperor towards the Ignited Stone Beast, and they were all trampled to death."]},{"number":4755,"title":"Chapter 4755: Killing a Beast","paragraphs":["Ling Han didn’t directly kill them because he had taken into account the fact that he couldn’t expose any flaws.","No matter what kind of martial arts competition it was, they would not allow members of their own forces to kill each other — except for some freakish sects.","Thus, if these people had died by his hand, it would definitely lead to an investigation, and there was a Great Emperor standing guard here. How could Ling Han possibly take such a risk?","In that case, he could only borrow the hand of another to do the dirty work.","In this way, though it was a little strange that so many people had died, all of them had indeed died at the hands of the Ignited Stone Beast. As long as the Ignited Stone Beast was killed, there would really be no one left to bear witness.","The Ignited Stone Beast was also very confused. Why did they all take the initiative to charge under its claws, scrambling to be smacked to death by it?","Could it be that its strength had become stronger again?","This fierce beast set its eyes on Ling Han; there was only one person left.","\"Hey, hey, hey, I can also be considered half your savior. Are you planning to repay kindness with ingratitude?\" Ling Han asked with a smile.","This human wasn’t afraid of him at all.","The Ignited Stone Beast was slightly hesitant, but it was not because it was grateful to Ling Han, but rather because it felt that this seemingly tiny human had unfathomable depths.","It wasn’t smart enough, but it wasn’t stupid.","However, it had killed seven people in a row, and it was already swelling with pride, feeling that it was invincible in this world.","\"Ang!\" It roared loudly, and charged towards Ling Han.","\"Sigh!\" Ling Han shook his head, and greeted the incoming attack with a raised fist.","Peng!","The man and beast exchanged a blow, and the energy turned into a wild wave that surged out in all directions.","The Ignited Stone Beast was actually sent flying, crashing towards the wall. Then, it bounced back, leaving behind a massive groove.","It shook its head as it crawled up, feeling extremely dizzy.","Ling Han was surprised. This fierce beast was really tough and coarse. Aside from the fact that he had not used the Destructive Energy and light of dao, he had not held anything back in terms of power and Regulations, but this attack actually did not kill this fierce beast instantly.","\"Your skin is so tough,\" he said with a smile. \"It definitely doesn’t taste good.\"","He evaluated from a very professional angle.","\"Ang!\" That fierce beast was furious. A mere human actually dared to look down on an existence like itself?","’Die!’","It gathered its remaining power, and charged towards Ling Han again. However, with a bang, it was once again sent flying, and crashed heavily into the wall. It experienced another wave of dizziness and blurred vision.","After being unable to withstand a single blow twice in a row, the Ignited Stone Beast couldn’t help but look panicked. Its swelling confidence also returned to normal in an instant.","This human was too strong. It was far from being a match for him.","Run!","However, the problem was that this human was blocking its path. If it wanted to escape, it would have to circle around him first.","For the sake of survival, he would give it his all.","It charged towards Ling Han, but this attack was not meant to defeat this human, but rather wanted to force Ling Han to retreat, so it could then circle around him.","Unfortunately, this was naturally an extravagant hope.","Peng!","Ling Han threw a punch, and sent the Ignited Stone Beast flying again.","He played it down, and did not use his full strength at all. Yet he was able to cause the Ignited Stone Beast to have a psychological breakdown, and doubt reality.","—Amongst the Primitive Abyss beings, it could also be considered a \"king\"-like existence, but it was actually bullied to this extent by a Saint, so how could it not doubt reality?","However, it didn’t have much time to ponder over this problem. Ling Han finally unleashed his full power, killing this ferocious beast before severing its head.","In this place, the gravity fields were so strong that even the Spatial Tool could be forcefully crushed. Thus, Ling Han was unable to store such a massive head into the Spatial Tool.","Moreover, this was the head of a Holy Beast, so it couldn’t be easily shrunk down.","It was possible, but this would expose Ling Han’s strength.","Thus, it would be slightly more troublesome for him, but he would just have to carry it like this.","\"En, I have to set up the scene again.\" Ling Han dealt with the scene, making it conform to what he would say in future — their team had fought to the death to kill the Ignited Stone Beast, but had also paid the price of seven people dying in battle.","To the people here, Ling Han did not feel any pity. There was no difference between them and the fallen Imperial Sons.","He went back the way he came.","\"Yi?\" He had not walked for too long, when a person appeared ahead of him. Seeing that he was carrying a massive head that was still burning with flames, that person faltered at first, and then looked overjoyed.","\"Wait!\" Ling Han stretched out his hand first. \"If you want to say that I should hand the head of this Ignited Stone Beast over to you, then you don’t have to speak.\"","’Holy f*ck!’","That person instantly felt a suffocating feeling in his chest. This was what he wanted to say, and now these words were stuffed back into his throat, which made him feel very uncomfortable.","\"Humph, do you think I will let you go just because you say that?\" That person asked coldly, appearing very disdainful.","\"I am the Ninth King of the True Dragon Emperor. Who are you?\" Ling Han introduced himself first.","\"Xu Gao, the seventh disciple of the Flying Snake Great Emperor,\" the other replied.","En, he had found out the origins of another Divine Beast.","\"Aren’t you afraid that you won’t be able to defeat me?\" Ling Han asked with a smile.","Xu Gao couldn’t help but shiver. Ling Han was carrying the head of an Ignited Stone Beast. What did this signify?","He could kill such a fierce beast!","It should be known that this kind of fierce beast was incredibly frightening. Even if one was a trump card, he would have to pay a considerable price to be able to kill it. Otherwise, it would not have become a tool for the first round of elimination battles.","Hence, the other’s strength... was extraordinary!","However, how strong could the ninth disciple of the True Dragon Emperor be?","Wasn’t the disciple of the True Dragon Emperor Liu Yuhao?","With this thought, he wasn’t afraid anymore. Presumably, this Ignited Stone Beast was definitely killed by all the disciples of the True Dragon together, and for some unknown reason, the beast’s head had fallen into the hands of this person.","Haha, wasn’t this gifting him a huge advantage?","\"Defeat you? It would be a piece of cake,\" he said proudly.","Ling Han revealed a playful expression, \"Are you sure?\"","\"Of course!\" Xu Gao shot out like an arrow, charging towards Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled and flipped his palm over. Hong, instantly, a terrifying pressure crushed down on Xu Gao. With a peng, Xu Gao was pressed onto the ground. He felt as if he was carrying a sky full of stars on his back, and couldn’t even move a single finger.","He couldn’t help but feel shocked. What kind of abilities were these? He was frighteningly strong!","Ling Han said seriously, \"Could it be that you don’t know? Previously, I disappeared for tens of thousands of years! That was because I was trapped by the storm of heaven and earth, yet accidentally obtained a great amount of Genesis Substance. Though my cultivation level hasn’t increased, my battle prowess has soared by tons.\"","This could be considered as a forceful explanation. Otherwise, it was unbelievable that a mere disciple ranked at the last would have battle prowess that would suddenly soar to surpass the trump card.","Xu Gao had to believe it even if he didn’t want to. Otherwise, how could he explain the other’s strength?","\"Since you dare to provoke me, you’ll have to pay the price!\" Ling Han wanted to take off his Battle Armor.","Xu Gaoi’s face instantly turned green with fear.","Why did he take off his clothes?","He wouldn’t believe it even if it killed him, and that was Ling Han was merely trying to snatch his Battle Armor!","Could it be that this guy, was, a pervert!","All of a sudden, cold sweat poured down his body like a waterfall.","\"F***, what nonsense are you thinking!\" Ling Han delivered a slap. Xu Gao’s resentful gaze was practically intolerable to him."]},{"number":4756,"title":"Chapter 4756: Attracting animosity","paragraphs":["Ling Han still stopped.","The mines here had been completely emptied, so the gravity field was extraordinarily strong. If it weren’t for the protection of the Silver Battle Armor, it was guaranteed that Xu Gao would be instantly crushed into dust.","Then, this would be a deliberate murder.","Sigh, for the sake of Genesis-level Celestial medicines, I will endure!","Ling Han stood up and walked forward.","Xu Gao breathed a sigh of relief, feeling cold sweat all over his body.","Thankfully, this guy had pulled back from the edge. Otherwise, he would have been in deep trouble just now.","Ling Han hummed a soft tune as he strode forward.","With strength, that was how confident he was.","\"Yi, the Ignited Stone Beast’s head!\" Another person appeared ahead of them. Before they saw Ling Han, they had already discovered the head of the Ignited Stone Beast. It couldn’t be helped; that thing was too big and too obvious.","\"Which sect are you from?\" the person shouted.","\"I am the disciple of the Strongest Great Emperor, the True Dragon!\" Ling Han began to attract animosity.","\"Humph, though the True Dragon Emperor is strong, it can’t be considered the strongest!\" The person on the other side was immediately angered, \"Our Crimson Ape Emperor is the strongest!\"","\"Nonsense!\" Ling Han said resolutely, \"However the Master is, that is how the disciple would turn out like. Let’s compete. Whoever wins will prove whose Great Emperor is stronger.\"","Er, could they be compared like this?","The man hesitated. What if he lost? Would he really have to admit that the True Dragon Emperor was stronger than the Crimson Ape Emperor?","\"Haha, you don’t dare?\" Ling Han asked with a chuckle.","\"I’m afraid that you’ll go back on your word after losing!\" That person hurriedly sneered, and charged out.","Peng!","Ling Han sent him flying with a single kick.","That person only saw stars in front of his eyes. How could he be so strong?","He was no match at all!","\"Now do you know how awesome our True Dragon Emperor is?\" Ling Han said with a chuckle.","That person gritted his teeth, and did not deny it.","Who asked him to lose?","\"Who are you?\" This person was definitely not the first disciple of the True Dragon Emperor. Though he did not know all the disciples of the True Dragon Emperor, he definitely knew the trump card.","\"Ninth King!\" Ling Han said with a smile.","\"Impossible!\" That person could not believe it no matter what.","Ling Han forcibly explained again, \"That’s right, though tens of thousands of years ago, I encountered a storm of heaven and earth, and was trapped in...\"","Blah, blah, blah. Ling Han believed that as long as he spoke to a few more people, very soon, there would be no further need for him to explain.","That person was extremely depressed, but did not connect Ling Han with an outsider at all.","Because only an Emperor could enter this space, Saints would only be seeking death if they entered. Thus, this was a paradox. Since they couldn’t obtain the Battle Armor and couldn’t enter the Primitive Abyss, how could they possibly appear in front of them?","Ling Han left again. Not too long after, he encountered another person who tried to block his way and rob him. After he taught him a lesson, he also related his \"fateful encounter story\".","Half a day later, the exit was already within sight.","However, there was an additional group of seven here.","They were clearly on the same side, and blocked the way. The only thing missing was the word \"robbers\" to be written on their faces.","\"Which Great Emperor are you under?!\" Ling Han asked.","\"Haha, you don’t even recognize our trump card, An Heming?\" one of them immediately shouted. \"We’re disciples of the Great Emperor Bai Ze!\"","It was not every Great Emperor would take nine disciples. There were only seven disciples under this one, and his first disciple was An Heming, the trump card under Great Emperor Bai Ze.","In truth, it was not that the first disciple was a trump card, but rather that after becoming a trump card, one would automatically be promoted to become the first disciple.","For example, An Heming hadn’t been his first disciple before. However, after he had displayed his outstanding talent, he had been bestowed the title of trump card, and he had been promoted to the position of first disciple.","Ling Han gave an ’oh’, and began to attract animosity, \"I am the disciple of the Strongest Great Emperor, True Dragon, the Ninth King!\"","\"Pei!\" His self-introduction instantly elicited strong objections. Even the aloof An Heming wore an expression of displeasure.","They had never seen such a shameless person. When he was introducing himself, he would flatter his Master madly, and belittle the other Divine Beasts while he was at it.","The Strongest Great Emperor?","Who had bestowed this title?","\"Ninth, aren’t you a little too arrogant?\"","\"Humph, even if the True Dragon Emperor knew about this, he wouldn’t allow you to do so!\"","\"Don’t fail to curry favor, and instead get yourself into trouble!\"","The seven people all said coldly.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"My Lord True Dragon is number one, and you guys don’t like it? Then I’ll beat you guys into submission!\"","Everyone was eager. He was merely the ninth disciple, so what was there to be afraid of?","Meanwhile, An Heming frowned slightly, and said, \"There’s something strange about this person!\"","To be able to kill the Ignited Stone Beast, that definitely had to be the strength of the team, but now, Ling Han was the only one left. Where were the other disciples of the True Dragon Emperor?","Was this a bait to deliberately draw their attention, and then there would be an unpredictable ambush lying in wait for them?","It had to be admitted that the appearance of Ling Han alone was too outrageously bold. Furthermore, he was carrying the head of the Ignited Stone Beast. This was practically luring others to rob him, so it was too illogical.","This didn’t make sense, so there was definitely a trap.","\"Old Fourth, go and scout the area,\" An Heming commanded.","\"Yes,\" one of them immediately replied. Then, his figure slowly became transparent, as if he had disappeared into thin air.","Ling Han wasn’t in a hurry to make a move either. He simply talked nonsense with the six people on the other side, trying his best to instill the concept of the True Dragon being the strongest, madly attracting animosity.","He was born with a natural halo of trouble, and now that he was actively attracting aggro, so the amount he attracted was naturally impressive.","\"First, I can’t help but want to attack!\"","First, I also want to fight!\"","Everyone was excited, and all of them were about to erupt.","An Heming also found this slightly intolerable. However, he had just told Old Fourth to investigate the situation and see if there were any ambushes. Thus, they had no option but to endure this for now.","\"Close your ears, and don’t listen!\" He outlined a strategy.","That’s right!","The remaining five immediately shut their ears. With their Saint-level cultivation, this was naturally no big deal.","A while later, Old Fourth, who had gone to scout, returned. He said, \"First, there is no ambush.\"","Yi?","He was taken aback. It was as if First and the others had gone stupid, and actually turned a deaf ear to his words.","That... that would be terrifying!","He had only left for a short while, and First and the others had already been \"dealt with\" without his knowledge?","With this in mind, he couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat.","\"What did you say?\" An Heming suddenly asked.","This caused Old Fourth to be dumbfounded. What was going on?","Were they in a different time flow?","Or had there been a lapse in our space, which caused a great delay in the transmission of sound?","\"Fourth, what did you say just now?\"","\"Fourth Brother, I didn’t hear what you said either.\"","The others also came to their senses, and asked one after another.","This!","Old Fourth was even more stunned. What exactly was going on here?","How could he have imagined that First and the others had no choice but to close their ears because they could not bear Ling Han’s blabbering? Naturally, they could not hear what he had said.","However, when he confirmed that there was no ambush, An Heming and the others were all burning with fighting spirit.","There was no ambush, so they could move without any reservations!","Humph, this blabbering guy, though they could not kill anyone, no matter what, they had to teach him a harsh lesson."]},{"number":4757,"title":"Chapter 4757: Story","paragraphs":["Peng, peng, peng! They all charged forward.","Ling Han very much wanted to defeat all of them, but if he could easily defeat even a trump card, how could he explain the fact that aside from him, the entire line of the True Dragon, had all died in battle?","He could be strong, but he couldn’t be too strong. Only like this, would it match with the theory that only he had managed to escape.","Fine then.","Ling Han sighed, and began to contend with these seven people.","He did not go all out, but with his present strength, he was completely capable of moving freely among them.","This caused An Heming and the others to feel both humiliated and furious.","The seven of them joined forces, yet they were still unable to capture Ling Han?","In truth, this guy was not very strong either. It was just that he was too slippery. No matter how strong your martial arts were, what could you do if you did not hit your target?","\"I’m not playing with you guys anymore.\" Ling Han laughed loudly, and sped up. Xiu, he began to break out of the siege.","\"You won’t be able to escape!\" An Heming said with a cold chuckle. ’You’re bringing such a large beast head, yet you still want to break free from the seven of us?’","He really did not take them seriously — f***!","A muscle twitched in his cheek, and he saw that Ling Han had successfully broken out of the siege. He was clearly still carrying the head of a beast, but his speed was getting faster and faster, leaving them in the dust, so his Junior Brothers and Junior Sisters could only look at his back.","W-what kind of freak was this?","\"Chase!\" The seven of them were all furious. If this spread out, how would they be able to face others in future?","To say nothing of the fact that this was only the ninth disciple of the True Dragon, even if he was a trump card, they could not allow him to come and go as he pleased.","Otherwise, Ling Han’s claim that the True Dragon was the StrongestGreat Emperor would be confirmed. At least, the True Dragon was more powerful than Great Emperor Bai Ze.","They worked hard to catch up. This was no longer just a competition for the top four spots, b@stard!","However, none of them could match Ling Han’s speed. When they chased out of the mine, they saw that Ling Han had already stopped and unloaded the beast’s head.","On the sidelines, that old Saint had a benevolent expression, as if he was very fond of Ling Han.","In the eyes of the old Saint, this was the repayment for Ling Han’s previous benevolence.","You see, he had been humble and courteous, yet in the end, it was he who was the first to bring out the head of the Ignited Stone Beast. Wasn’t this the blessing of the heavens mysteriously bestowed upon him?","If An Heming and the others found out about this, they would definitely complain.","This guy was humble and respectful?","His words could drive one to fury, all right?","The old Saint was also very curious, and asked, \"How did you kill this Ignited Stone Beast?\"","This also piqued the curiosity of An Heming and the others. Indeed, how had Ling Han done it?","Even if it was a trump card, he would still need the support of others to slowly grind the Ignited Stone Beast to death. Otherwise, even if he could succeed, hewould have to pay a very heavy price.","But looking at Ling Han... he didn’t seem to have suffered any injuries.","Ling Han immediately put on an expression of grief, and said, \"You know that I entered later. When I rushed to meet up with the other Senior Brothers, the Senior Brothers had already begun a fierce battle with this stone beast.\"","\"I was too late. Senior Brother and the others experienced a bloody battle, and this stone beast was already on its last breath, but Senior Brother and the others... also died in battle.\"","Yi!","The old Saint, An Heming, and the others all widened their eyes in shock. F*ck! They had actually lost their lives for the sake of this competition?","Hiss, how could there be such idiots?","The old Saint immediately wanted to enter the mine to investigate, but when he recalled that he was still responsible for the role of referee, and could not leave, he could only suppress this urge.","Now, he could only wait. When the competition ended, he would go in and investigate.","Someone had died. This was a serious matter.","Another three days passed, and only then did the trump cards of the various forces take out the heads of the Ignited Stone Beasts one by one.","It could not be helped. The Ignited Stone Beast was very, very strong. If one pursued a speedy kill, they would definitely have to pay a heavy price.","After the old Saint announced the top four, he immediately rushed into the mine.","The others also followed him in out of curiosity.","As expected.","They saw the corpses of the seven people. It was obvious that they had all been stomped to death by the Ignited Stone Beast.","Gasp! Just how brutal and intense was this battle?","Furthermore, what was the point?","Though Genesis-level Celestial medicines were very precious, sacrificing one’s life for them was definitely not worth it.","Why didn’t they grind it down slowly?","Ling Han added insult to injury as appropriate, \"It’s all because Senior Brothers dote on me and want to take down the Ignited Stone Beast as soon as possible, to prevent other teams from snatching it! Thus, in order to prevent Senior Brothers from dying for nothing, I must take first place!\"","If the large black dog was here, he would definitely give him a thumbs up.","This kind of shamelessness was really at least half as skilled as Old Black.","Everyone looked at each other. Though Ling Han’s words seemed to be very logical, why did they feel a strange feeling when they heard it?","The competition ended, but the fact that almost all the disciples of the True Dragon Emperor had died had to be carefully investigated. After all, such a thing like this had never happened before.","The investigation was one thing, but the competition still had to continue.","The top four had already appeared, and the next step was to draw lots.","The opponent that Ling Han had drawn for the first round was Luoyi Xingxiao, the ace under the Great Emperor Crimson Ape. He was an elegant-looking young man, and when he was in the city, he wore a long white robe, looking a little flamboyant.","The two elimination battles would be held at the same time, and the victors would immediately enter into the final battle.","There was no need to drag things out. In this place, efficiency was what was most important.","\"Junior Brother, please.\" Luoyi Xingxiao smiled faintly. By now, he was naturally already wearing the Silver Battle Armor. Without this Battle Armor, one’s battle prowess would be completely different.","Ling Han chuckled and said, \"Right now, I’m the first disciple and trump card of the True Dragon Emperor. Our True Dragon Emperor has never been inferior to anyone in his life. It’s best that you address me as Senior Brother.\"","’Holy f*ck!’","Luoyi Xingxiao almost threw up blood.","I am only being polite to you. Furthermore, you are the ninth disciple of the True Dragon, so isn’t it only right that I call you Junior Brother?","’Why are you suddenly getting so serious?’","Are you here to spar or to infuriate me?","Could it be that you have some kind of negative emotion system that can help you increase your cultivation level and redeem treasures?","\"First come, first served,\" Luoyi Xingxiao said. \"Junior Brother, even if you become the first disciple under the True Dragon Emperor, there’s nothing wrong with me calling you Junior Brother.\"","\"That’s not right. All the Great Emperors are on equal footing, and we are all trump cards, so why am I Junior Brother?\" Ling Han argued strongly, \"Moreover, the True Dragon Emperor has been invincible all his life, and is considered the strongest.\"","Hey, hey, hey, why are you starting to attract animosity again?","Luoyi Xingxiao suppressed his anger, \"Junior Brother, your words are incorrect. All the Great Emperors can suppress the world, so how could there be anyone who is superior?\"","...","Hearing the two of them engage in an intense debate, everyone felt like mocking.","Have you come to spar or debate eloquence?","Luoyi Xingxiao, you are really taking it too seriously. Why do you have to bicker with this guy on the issue of Senior Brother and Junior Brother?","However, in terms of debate, how could Luoyi Xingxiao compare to Ling Han?","Whether it was a twisted reason or not, Ling Han could always speak logically, causing Luoyi Xingxiao to become more and more driven mad. Usually, he would need to consider for as long as one to two minutes to be able to come up with a response.","If the outcome was decided through debate, then Ling Han had already won, and it was a complete victory at that."]},{"number":4758,"title":"Chapter 4758: Bet","paragraphs":["Luoyi Xingxiao racking his brains over the matter, but everyone was becoming more and more impatient.","What was going on?","Have you both come to perform a crosstalk performance?","Even the old Saint who was the referee couldn’t bear to watch on any longer. He warned, \"The tournament battle is to begin immediately. There is no need to continue this pointless entanglement!\"","However, his words were ineffective.","Luoyi Xingxiao was a trump card!","What was a trump card?","The strongest disciple of the Great Emperor. Not only was he a Nine-Star Saint, he was also an outstanding existence among Nine-Star Saints. Thus, did Luoyi Xingxiao need to take this old Saint seriously?","The only thing that could make a trump card obey obediently was the Great Emperor.","Seeing that Luoyi Xingxiao was still scrambling his brains to think of how to refute Ling Han, the old Saint could only turn to Ling Han, and say, \"Hurry up and begin the competition.\"","These words were spoken with a pleading tone.","Ling Han smiled and nodded. Xiu, he charged towards Luoyi Xingxiao.","Though he did not go all out, how could his battle prowess be underestimated?","Moreover, Luoyi Xingxiao was still racking his brains over how to refute Ling Han, so he was naturally caught off guard and instantly flustered.","\"Despicable, you are too despicable!\" Luoyi Xingxiao hurriedly shouted, as if his train of thought had suddenly been cleared up by Ling Han. As he parried, he said, \"You are so shameless, what right do you have to be a trump card?\"","He then looked around, \"You have all seen for yourselves. This guy is so shameless. If he was allowed to become the trump card, would there still be any law or reason?\"","However... his logic was too profound, and no one paid attention to him at all.","Yi, why are you guys like this?","Was he wrong?","Ling Han laughed loudly, his palms moving like wheels, endlessly striking out at Luoyi Xingxiao. His palms were like heavy axes, incredibly terrifying.","Luoyi Xingxiao had no choice but to stay alert. In front of such an offensive, how could he possibly be distracted any longer?","The two of them instantly engaged in a fierce battle. Thankfully, this was in the Primitive Abyss. Otherwise, if two Saints with battle prowess of at least 30 Stars were to exchange blows, just how terrifying would the damage be?","Crushing one or two galaxies was no big deal.","\"Yi, how could the ninth disciple of the True Dragon City be so strong?\"","\"That’s right, his abilities are close to trump cards!\"","\"I’ve never heard of him being this strong?\"","Everyone was extremely curious. How had a prodigy that was comparable to a trump card suddenly popped out?","\"You guys don’t know, but tens of thousands of years ago, when he went out to search for Genesis Substance, he encountered a storm of from heaven and earth, and was trapped. However, this guy also got lucky, and obtained quite a number of Genesis-level Great Herbs from where he was trapped.\"","\"And like that, his cultivation level has not changed, but his abilities have increased greatly.\"","Immediately, someone who \"understood\" the situation hurriedly explained.","Oh, so that was the case.","Everyone came to a sudden realization, and nodded repeatedly. Though they were still a little jealous, as to why they had not encountered such a good thing, they also knew that even if Genesis Substance was piled up in front of them, not everyone could become a trump card.","That was because Genesis Substance would only give you a chance to break through under the condition of not going through Silent Destruction, but whether you could break through would still have to depend on your own comprehension ability and grasp of Regulations.","Thus, to most people, Genesis Substance was indeed useful, but it definitely couldn’t turn them into supreme prodigies.","Ling Han was only able to become as strong as he was now because of Genesis Substance, but more so because of his own natural talent.","There was no need for Ling Han to explain anything. The seeds that he had planted previously had already bloomed and bore fruit, automatically helping him explain.","Ling Han added some power appropriately, and gained a great advantage on the scene, gradually suppressing Luoyi Xingxiao.","This caused Luoyi Xingxiao to throw up blood again.","He couldn’t refute him, and he couldn’t even defeat him?","He was about to die of fury!","Peng!","In a moment of carelessness, he was struck by Ling Han’s palm strike. Teng, teng, teng! His feet retreated continuously, and he felt his chest flip over, as if all his organs had been knocked upside down.","He had lost.","Luoyi Xingxiao was at a loss. How had he lost?","Hiss, he had still been thinking about how he was going to defeat Ling Han verbally. How had he been knocked down by Ling Han, and did not even have the chance to speak?","He couldn’t help but throw up blood, feeling indescribably terrible.","Ling Han smiled, and did not make another move.","The victor of the other battle was also determined with great difficulty, yet the victor was a woman.","Though there were many women under the nine Great Emperors, there was only one that could become their trump card.","This was Mo Ziyun, a disciple of the Azure Phoenix.","Without any rest, the finals immediately began.","Ling Han sized up his final opponent. This was an exquisite beauty. Though her whole body was covered by the Silver Battle Armor, her beautiful hair was like clouds, cascading down like a waterfall. Every strand of her hair was so black that it shone.","She was also extremely beautiful, with a jade-like nose and cherry lips, especially her eyes, which were filled with a captivating spirit.","Even Ling Han, who was accustomed to seeing beautiful women, felt a slight ripple in his heart when he first set eyes on her.","But it was only a sliver, and his heart and spirit calmed.","Mo Ziyun was also sizing up Ling Han. This time, she was battling on her home ground, so it would not be strange for her to be able to make it into the finals.","However, she had never imagined that her final opponent would not be a trump card, but rather the ninth disciple from True Dragon City!","She resolutely didn’t argue with Ling Han about who was the Senior Brother or Senior Sister. What happened to Luoyi Xingxiao was clear to see.","\"Please!\" She drew her sword. The sword was three feet long, and was as black as ink, as if it had been refined from the darkness itself.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel surprised. He could sense an aura of destruction from this sword.","It was a little similar to Destructive Energy.","Yi?","What kind of material was this?","Or was it that ... after it was forged, Destructive Energy had been infused into it?","\"Please,\" he said with a nod. His eyes were still fixed on the black sword.","But in everyone’s eyes, his target was Mo Ziyun.","He was too direct, wasn’t he?","Although Mo Ziyun was indeed a well-known beauty in the first level, there were at least eight hundred people who wanted her, if not a thousand. However, she was a trump card, so no one would dare to have the slightest bit of improper thoughts.","Ling Han, on the other hand, was just staring straight at her.","\"Shameless brat!\" Luoyi Xingxiao couldn’t help but reprimand him. How could such a person be qualified to be a trump card, what more when he was using him as a stepping stone.","Mo Ziyun also revealed an expression of anger. This person actually dared to look at her like this; he was really lecherous!","\"How about we make a bet?\" Ling Han suddenly spoke up.","\"What are we betting on?\" Mo Ziyun asked darkly.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"If I win, I want you—\"","\"Fine, if you lose, I’ll take your life!\" Mo Ziyun said resolutely, interrupting Ling Han’s words.","Yi?","Ling Han was astonished. ’If you say this, others will misunderstand, okay?’","’I only want your sword. I’m not interested in your people!’","But when he thought about it, he had already won the battle, so how easy would it be to get a sword?","\"All right.\" Ling Han nodded, his face full of smiles.","In everyone’s eyes, this was clearly a lewd grin!","Shameless, too shameless, to actually propose such a wager in public, how utterly shameless!"]},{"number":4759,"title":"Chapter 4759: Misunderstanding","paragraphs":["Mo Ziyun took a deep breath to calm herself down, then drew her sword.","Shua, the sword slashed out, and a black-coloured Sword Qi sliced towards Ling Han. Though it was only thirty metres long, the Sword Qi condensed, possessing astonishing might.","Ling Han couldn’t help but raise a brow. His opponent’s battle prowess could possibly only be thirty stars, but this strike carried a sliver of Destructive Energy, which instantly increased its destructive power greatly, and could produce the might of thirty-one or even thirty-two stars.","He didn’t take it head-on, as he didn’t want to expose the secret that he possessed Destructive Energy.","Relying on the agility of his footwork, Ling Han aggressively charged forward, planning to engage in close-quarter combat.","\"Despicable!\" Everyone couldn’t help but curse softly.","Aren’t you clearly trying to take advantage by engaging in close-quarter combat with a female cultivator?","Hiss, this pervert!","Even the old Saint’s expression became a little strange. He was indeed very optimistic about Ling Han. However, Ling Han’s performance caused his jaw to drop in shock. He was such a humble young man, so how had he fallen into the path of lust?","Mo Ziyun was even more enraged. He actually dared to insult her like this?","\"You deserve to die!\" she shouted lightly, as she increased her attacks.","Ling Han found this strange. Could it be that he wasn’t allowed to win?","How had it become that he deserved to die?","Sigh, it was all this woman’s fault. She had cut off his words, and did not let him speak fully. Otherwise, if he had said that he would be winning the other party’s treasured sword, would it still cause the current misunderstanding?","Thankfully, thankfully. Even if she was ruining someone’s image, it was not his image.","Ling Han felt a sense of relief. In any case, he wouldn’t be exposed, so it didn’t matter.","He continued to charge forward, attacking with every move.","If the two of them were men, then it wouldn’t matter. It was very normal, but now, it was a man and a woman. Then, Ling Han’s action was a little vulgar, as if he was deliberately taking advantage of Mo Ziyun.","It couldn’t be helped. Everyone had first impressions, and already had the impression in their minds that Ling Han was a pervert, so that would naturally taint any movement he made.","As they saw it, Ling Han wasn’t contending for victory at all. Instead, he was deliberately taking liberties with her, so Mo Ziyun would become wary of him.","However, Mo Ziyun was in the middle of it, so only she herself would be aware of her own suffering.","She knew that Ling Han’s attacks weren’t attempts to take liberties with her. Uh, although some moves were indeed very perverted, aimed at her chest, and seemed to be grabbing and touching at the same time, most attacks were still normal.","However, his battle prowess was extremely strong, and he was extremely experienced in battle. He would always be able to grasp the flaw that had been revealed in a flash, and then enlarge it, chasing after her and attacking fiercely.","She clearly felt that the battle prowess of the two of them was about the same, but it was the other party that had caught hold of one small flaw after another, gradually causing her to fall into a disadvantage.","What kind of person was this? Why was his comprehension and sensitivity to battle so terrifying?","Seeing that Mo Ziyun had fallen into a disadvantage, everyone was filled with righteous indignation. As they saw it, it was clearly Ling Han who had used such a despicable move to restrain Mo Ziyun, causing her to be unable to unleash her full strength.","Despicable, too despicable!","After exchanging over three hundred moves, Mo Ziyun was already at a complete disadvantage, and had no choice but to admit defeat.","Without saying a word, she turned around and left.","Ling Han couldn’t help but sigh. Could it be that she had forgotten the bet?","’My sword!’","Seeing Ling Han’s despondent expression, everyone wanted to beat him up even more. Could it be that you really hope to win the beauty over just like that?","To win in such a despicable manner, who would submit to you?","Ling Han had obtained a Genesis-level Celestial medicine. Logically speaking, he should have successfully retreated, but when he thought of that sword, he decided to wait a little longer. He would find a chance to knock out Mo Ziyun, and then leave with the sword.","But just as he was planning to leave the city to refine the Celestial medicine, he suddenly discovered that someone had entered into this shabby room of his.","Yi... it was Mo Ziyun.","Was this woman unwilling to lose to him, and wanted to snatch the Celestial medicine?","Hehe, he really wanted to see who would be doing the snatching here.","Ling Han walked out and saw that Mo Ziyun was no longer wearing the Silver Battle Armor. Instead, she had changed into a dark green tight-fitting suit. Though the attire was not the slightest bit luxurious, it completely outlined her perfect curves.","Beautiful, alluring, capable of captivating one’s soul.","Ling Han took a second look. Tsk, tsk, tsk! Previously, she had been concealed in the Battle Armor, and he had not realized that this little girl’s figure was so impressive.","She was shapely and curvaceous, and could be considered perfect.","\"Whatever happened tonight, you are not allowed to tell anyone!\" Mo Ziyun bit her red lips and said, \"Otherwise, I will definitely kill you!\"","Hold on, have you misunderstood?","Ling Han grimaced, and said, \"I say, Young Miss Mo, you may have misunderstood!\"","Mo Ziyun’s pretty face changed drastically. ’You said you wanted me in public, and now you’re saying I misunderstood?’","He was too petty!","But who asked her to lose?","Actually, this was the Azure Phoenix City, and she was also a disciple of the Azure Phoenix Great Emperor. As long as she was unwilling, who could force her?","Moreover, Ling Han’s actions had already incited public anger, and there was even less support for him.","However, Mo Ziyun had a proud and aloof personality. Since she had lost the bet, she would accept her loss. No matter how upset she would be in the future, she was not willing to break the bet.","She turned around, relaxed her defenses, and said resignedly, \"Hurry up!\"","F***, what kind of discrimination was this?","’Am I the type to be very \"fast\"?’","Ling Han hurriedly shook his head. He had almost been led astray by this girl.","’Huh? Where’s your treasured sword?’","Ling Han originally wanted to knock her unconscious and leave with his sword, but what sword was there with Mo Ziyun?","The gravity fields here were too strong, and there was absolutely no possibility for a Spatial Spirit Tool to exist. Thus, Mo Ziyun must have placed both her sword and Battle Armor in her quarters. This could be imagined. After all, she had not come here to fight.","Damn it!","Ling Han coughed, and said, \"Actually, what I’m interested in is your sword.\"","W-what?","Mo Ziyun was taken aback, and recalled again. Indeed, it was she who had interrupted Ling Han’s words at the time. As it turned out, he had not been staring at her at the time, but her sword. The so-called \"I want you\" was actually \"I want your sword\".","Er!","However, now that the misunderstanding was resolved, she instead felt a sense of shame, anger, and indignation.","Since the misunderstanding had already happened, and she had taken the initiative to come over to fulfil her promise, Ling Han actually did not want her!","Was she that bad?","He did not want her, even when she was taking the initiative to throw herself into his arms?","This was a great humiliation!","Humph!","Mo Ziyun directly leaped and fled.","She fled?","She ran off just like that?","Ling Han didn’t give chase. Firstly, he didn’t know where Mo Ziyun lived. So what if he captured her? He couldn’t find the sword.","Moreover, to make a move right in front of the eyes of the Azure Phoenix, wasn’t this looking down on this Great Emperor a little too much?","He wasn’t like the True Dragon Emperor, who was recuperating from his injuries!","Ling Han shook his head, and directly left the city. Then, he began to refine the Celestial medicine.","He ingested the Celestial medicine, and instantly, Genesis Substance channeled inside his body, sending a streak of great dao soaring into the sky.","After he refined the Genesis Substance, the number of Regulations he could accommodate in his body reached as many as 50. Furthermore, the light of great dao had also become slightly thicker.","The change was not very obvious, but it had indeed improved slightly.","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. He had profited greatly this time.","Though he still did not know how much might the light of great dao could ultimately unleash, this level was very possibly superior to Regulations."]},{"number":4760,"title":"Chapter 4760: Joint Challenge","paragraphs":["The Nine Star Regulations were supreme, and the Eight Star Regulations could not be intertwined at all.","Thankfully, Ling Han had grasped the light of great dao. This was very possibly an existence that surpassed Regulations, giving Ling Han the possibility to challenge a higher level.","At present, he was still no match for a Pseudo-Emperor. However, when he grasped some more eight-star Regulations, he might be able to. After all, even a Pseudo-Emperor had only touched a corner of Nine Star Regulations.","And added with the light of great dao?","Ling Han believed that he even had a chance of defeating a Pseudo-Emperor.","As for this, hehe, he would find out when he sparred with Buddha Doga and the others in the future. As many as three Pseudo-Emperors would become his sparring partners; aside from Ling Han, there was no one else who could have that in this world.","What made Ling Han frown was whether there were Pseudo-Emperors as well on the side of the Lands of Death.","For example, Little Ye. He had appeared out of thin air, and had never been heard of before. In fact, even the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters of the Lands of Death did not know of such an existence.","It could be seen that the Lords of Death favored him, allowing him to obtain the Genesis Worlds from Origin and the others. Thus, he could use Destructive Energy.","Why didn’t the Lords of Death take it?","Perhaps... they were no longer living beings, and had no way to accommodate the Genesis World.","Ling Han frowned. Little Ye was extremely strange. Could it be that he had also come from the Primitive Abyss? Otherwise, he had really never seen anyone who could control time.","—Even Pseudo-Emperors like Buddha Doga could not do it.","Ling Han returned to the Azure Phoenix City. Although the competition had already ended, if he still stayed here shamelessly, naturally, no one would chase him away.","His target was the sword in Mo Ziyun’s hand, but the others didn’t know. Seeing that he didn’t want to leave, they only thought that he had feelings for Mo Ziyun, so they were naturally all furious.","You pervert, using underhanded means to defeat Mo Ziyun, could it be that you really want Goddess Mo to fulfill the bet?","This was too shameless.","Obviously, Mo Ziyun’s popularity in the Azure Phoenix City was considerably high. Now, when everyone saw Ling Han, they first humphed, then spat.","This!","Ling Han felt gloomy. It was clearly little girl Mo that had caused this misunderstanding, so why was it that he was the only one to bear the consequences?","He decided that when it was time to snatch the sword, he would definitely give Mo Ziyun a good spanking to vent his anger.","Er, in any case, they would not be able to find him, so there was no need for him to worry about exposing his identity.","If the large black dog and the others were here, they would definitely point out, ’Is there any other freakish guy like you in this world? Could you put on a false face, or could you fake your abilities?’","Buddha Doga and the others arrived. Because the competition had already ended, it was about time for them to leave. After all, there was a Great Emperor watching over this place. How could they not be on tenterhooks when they were doing things right under the nose of this Great Emperor?","This had nothing to do with cowardice or courage, but rather caution.","Meanwhile, Ling Han had the three Pseudo-Emperors leave first; he still had to stay for a few more days.","\"Yi, could it be that you really have feelings for that little girl?\" Xia Houping asked with a smile.","Ling Han was speechless. This news had already spread to the point that even the three Pseudo-Emperors knew?","Rumors!","He shook his head, and said, \"That person has a Spirit Tool. I think there’s a need to study it.\"","After some discussion, the three Pseudo-Emperors decided to leave first, and continue to scout ahead. They would come back in a few days.","Originally, the Primitive Abyss was completely desolate, so why would there be cities?","Thus, the three Pseudo-Emperors all wanted to investigate just how these thirty six Divine Beasts came to be, and why did they insist on overseeing this area?","Meanwhile, Ling Han continued to inquire about Mo Ziyun’s residence, planning to knock her out as soon as possible, snatch her sword and leave. He couldn’t be bothered to waste time.","However, in the Azure Phoenix City, everyone treated him like a perverted evil spirit, and no one was willing to tell him Mo Ziyun’s whereabouts.","Thus, Ling Han felt like he was a rat that everyone wanted to beat up. His image had already been ruined to the extreme.","\"Fortunately... that is the Ninth King, and has nothing to do with me!\" Ling Han murmured to himself.","However, before he could find out Mo Ziyun’s whereabouts, he had already drawn public indignation.","—Aside from the Azure Phoenix City and True Dragon City, the remaining seven trump cards of the Great Emperors joined forces to issue a challenge to Ling Han.","He would either have to get out of the Azure Phoenix City himself, or they would make him get out.","Ya, was Mo Ziyun really that popular?","Ling Han definitely wouldn’t leave the Azure Phoenix City. He was extremely curious about that sword—why did it also possess the unique trait of Destructive Energy?","Since you guys are so determined to seek a beating, I will oblige you.","Ling Han accepted the letter of challenge.","The next day, he arrived at the small plaza in the city.","This actually couldn’t be considered a plaza. It was just that this place was relatively empty, and as time passed, it was used as a plaza.","If they fought here, it was fine. The structure of the Primitive Abyss was too sturdy. To say nothing of the fact that Saints could not damage it, even Great Emperors could not.","How could the place where heaven and earth began be anything ordinary?","When Ling Han arrived, not only were the seven trump cards already waiting there, but even many citizens of the city had come, looking to be in high spirits.","When they discovered that Ling Han had come over, the commoners all booed.","Was there a need to do this?","Ling Han shook his head. Was Mo Ziyun’s popularity really that high?","He naturally wouldn’t care. Amidst everyone’s cheers, he walked to the center of the plaza.","\"Ninth, I really can’t help but admire your courage!\" Luoyi Xingxiao said. He deliberately emphasized the words \"Ninth\", obviously still fixated on his \"debate\" with Ling Han previously.","Ling Han wore a playful smile, and said, \"Enough with the nonsense. Let’s battle! Are you guys going to fight me one by one, or all at once?\"","\"You’re indeed arrogant!\" An Heming said coldly. \"However, you’re far too naive to try to provoke us into a one-on-one battle!\"","No matter what, Ling Han was the champion of this tournament. Theoretically speaking, he was invincible in a one-on-one battle. Thus, it was reasonable for them to gang up on him.","Most importantly, there were no rules here, as long as no one was killed or crippled.","Xiu, a figure flew over, her white robes fluttering. It was Mo Ziyun.","Obviously, with such a big event happening, how could she, the local tyrant of Azure Phoenix City, not have discovered it?","When they saw Mo Ziyun, even these trump cards’ eyes lit up.","Ling Han also stared at Mo Ziyun. This little girl was always unwilling to appear, causing him to search everywhere. This time, he definitely could not allow her to escape.","\"How dare you!\" Seeing that Ling Han actually dared to stare at Mo Ziyun, the seven trump cards were all furious.","\"Sigh, I’ve already told you guys to speak less nonsense. Don’t waste time. Hurry up and make your move,\" Ling Han said with a smile, looking disdainful.","This enraged the seven trump cards. To look down on them like this, he really had no concept of proper behaviour.","\"Hehe, this Ninth of the True Dragon City is really arrogant!\"","\"It can’t be helped. He’s the new champion of the martial arts competition, so it’s normal for him to be a little arrogant.\"","\"Hmph, in the first round, it was because he sacrificed his Senior Brothers. In the knockout battles, he first messed up Luoyi Xingxiao’s mind, then used despicable means to instill wariness in Lady Mo so she could not go all out. All his victories were not honourable at all!\"","\"This kind of person... where did he get his true abilities from?\"","The spectators discussed spiritedly, all of them thinking that Ling Han’s first place was very undeserved."]},{"number":4761,"title":"Chapter 4761: Like cutting straws","paragraphs":["No one was optimistic about Ling Han, even if he was the champion this time.","On his way here, there had been too much controversy.","How could the masses convinced with such empty victories?","Only Mo Ziyun did not think so. She was the one who had personally exchanged blows with Ling Han, and was more willing to accept the truth than Luoyi Xingxiao.","However, if the seven trump cards joined forces, would Ling Han still have a chance of winning?","She was also very concerned, and stood at the sidelines, watching quietly.","\"Ninth, it would be better for you to return to the Azure Dragon City and cultivate for a few more years!\" Luoyi Xingxiao strongly emphasized \"Ninth\" again, and led the charge, heading towards Ling Han.","Boom!","This time, he no longer focused his energy on arguing with Ling Han about who should be the \"Senior Brother\". He was like a primal ferocious beast that had charged out, his aura astonishing.","Each of the trump cards was a Nine-Star Saint, and they were the most outstanding among them at that. Their battle prowess far surpassed ordinary Nine-Star Saints.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! An Heming and the others also charged over.","They didn’t mind battling seven against one at all. This wasn’t a sparring match.","Ling Han smiled, and charged towards the seven great trump cards.","\"Hiss!\"","\"This guy is really outrageously bold!\"","\"It’s a one-on-seven battle, yet he still dares to attack?\"","\"Does he really think that just because he has gotten first place, he would be able to sweep aside all opposition in Saint Tier?\"","\"Hehe, even if he is the strongest of Saints, he could not possibly match the combined forces of seven trump cards!\"","\"He’s asking for a beating.\"","The spectators all shook their heads. Even if Ling Han was really the number one Saint, he should still focus on circling around the seven great trump cards, defeating them one by one.","To rashly charge into enemy lines like Ling Han was, was he complaining that he wasn’t losing fast enough?","\"Sigh, after all, he’s all young.\"","\"It is inevitable that a young man would be overwhelmed in his success.\"","\"F*ck!\"","However, when everyone was still chattering, they suddenly saw an inconceivable scene.","—Human figures flew through the air like straws.","Those were the seven trump cards!","Ling Han barged through, and wherever he passed, there was no one that could match him. They were all sent flying.","This!","Those were seven trump cards, top grade nine-star Saints. Even if there was someone that could surpass them, they would only be slightly superior, at most. How could they possibly sweep aside all opposition like he was doing now?","If they didn’t know that these seven people were trump cards, they would have thought that they were just cats and dogs. They were completely weaklings in battle.","Mo Ziyun’s small mouth was also wide open, completely unable to close.","She knew that Ling Han’s strength was superior to hers, but how could he possibly be strong to this extent?","Are you even human?","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Though Ling Han hadn’t gone all out, even without using the power of belief, the number of Regulations he could use had still reached as many as fifty. Just how overwhelming was this?","\"Haha, after refining the Genesis-level Celestial medicine, my divine arts have reached Great Accomplishment level, and I am invincible in this world!\" he called out, forcibly explaining.","Everyone broke out in a cold sweat. Could this kind of battle prowess be f****** forged by a Celestial medicine?","’Are you lying through your teeth?!’","However, Ling Han was really too powerful. One punch after another, no one could withstand a single blow from him, blasting the seven great trump cards like they were straws dancing wildly in the wind.","\"Don’t let him defeat you one by one!\" An Heming shouted. \"Let’s work together!\"","\"All right!\"","The seven trump cards didn’t dare to be careless anymore. After being beaten so badly by Ling Han, they finally realized that though Ling Han was despicable and vulgar, his abilities were still very strong, and chillingly strong at that.","But this guy’s abilities were clearly so strong, so why did he still use such a despicable and vulgar method to win?","\"Hah!\"","The seven trump cards finally joined forces, and attacked in unison.","Though they had also attacked together just now, they had each fought on their own, as if they were scattered sand.","It couldn’t be helped. They were all trump cards, and thought that they were not inferior to Ling Han in a one-on-one battle. It was already very embarrassing for them to attack together, so what need was there for them to cooperate well?","However, they now knew that Ling Han was too strong, so strong that they had to cooperate well. Otherwise, they would really be defeated by Ling Han.","Boom! The truly violent attack finally arrived.","Everyone turned pale as they watched, especially the Saints. They were very clear how terrifying this attack was.","With a single strike, a Saint could be insta-killed!","How was Ling Han supposed to block this?","This time, the seven trump cards were going all out.","Ling Han smiled faintly, completely unconcerned. He merely shot out a very ordinary punch.","This punch was very ordinary, but it was incredibly smooth, and matched the charm of the Dao of Heaven and Earth.","Peng!","It was only a single strike, and the seven great trump cards were all sent flying like fireworks.","What!","Seeing this scene, everyone’s eyes widened, as if they had seen a ghost. Their hair was about to stand on end.","Peng, peng, peng! The seven trump cards all collapsed to the ground. Although they weren’t severely wounded, the seven of them still couldn’t withstand a single strike from Ling Han. How could they not feel despair?","This was too terrifying.","How could there be such a monster?","All of a sudden, a dead silence fell. This kind of battle prowess was like a sudden strike of lightning on flat ground, shocking everyone.","\"Still want to fight?\" Ling Han asked calmly.","These words were not spoken very loudly, but it caused everyone’s hearts to tremble.","The seven trump cards were all silent. What was the point of continuing the battle? The seven of them had joined forces, yet were still sent flying with a single punch. Unless their heads had been kicked by a donkey, they would not think of fighting Ling Han again.","Ling Han looked towards Mo Ziyun and couldn’t help but feel gloomy. This little girl wasn’t wearing a Battle Armor, so she naturally hadn’t brought the sword he wanted.","Damn it, was he again not allowed to snatch it from her?","\"Junior Sister Mo, let’s have a chat,\" Ling Han said with a smile, striding over.","Mo Ziyun couldn’t help but feel her heart palpitate. Ling Han was too strong, so strong that the defense in her heart crumbled with a single strike.","An exquisite prodigy like her could not possibly fall in love, because even if it was a prodigy of about the same standard, in her eyes, it was only \"barely\", so how could she possibly be moved?","But now?","Ling Han’s appearance directly shattered her defenses. His battle prowess was so strong that she was instantly conquered.","\"All right.\" She nodded gently, like an obedient little wife.","This!","Everyone felt suffocated as they watched. It was obvious that such a beautiful flower was about to be snatched.","\"Let’s go to your quarters,\" Ling Han suggested.","\"En.\" Mo Ziyun nodded again.","Seeing the two of them leave side by side, everyone was filled with envy, jealousy, and hatred.","As long as one wasn’t blind, one could tell that Mo Ziyun had already developed great fondness for Ling Han. Then, what would a man and woman do alone in the same room?","Damn it!","However, after witnessing Ling Han’s terrifying battle prowess, who would dare to \"save the damsel in distress\"?","Moreover, if anyone stepped forwards, the beauty would be the first to flip out.","Sigh!","Everyone shook their heads. There was nothing they could do about it. This was consensual, so whoever stepped forwards would only be asking for a beating.","On the other side, Ling Han and Mo Ziyun walked together, and very soon, arrived at her quarters. Though this was also an incredibly simple and crude house, it had been tidied up by Mo Ziyun, so it was exuding an elegant aura.","However, Ling Han’s intentions did not lie here. He released his divine sense to sense the location of the sword.","\"Senior Brother!\" Mo Ziyun whispered softly, her pretty face flushed, captivating one’s soul."]},{"number":4762,"title":"Chapter 4762: Black light within the sword","paragraphs":["Found it!","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said to Mo Ziyun, \"Junior Sister, come here.\"","Was he going to kiss hwe?","Mo Ziyun couldn’t help but feel like her heart was beating wildly. Should she act shy, or should she be more proactive?","Oh no, she didn’t know what type Senior Brother liked.","She slowly approached, yet saw Ling Han’s palm strike slash over. Peng, she instantly felt her consciousness rapidly dim.","Yi, did Senior Brother like the type that lies down and doesn’t move?","What a hardcore taste!","This was the last thought that streaked through her mind. Then, she completely lost consciousness.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and laid Mo Ziyun against the wall. Meanwhile, he entered her rooms and found the sword.","After some thought, he also took away Mo Ziyun’s Silver Battle Armor while he was at it.","He immediately left the city and found the three Pseudo-Emperors and the others, then left the Primitive Abyss.","Though Ling Han could accommodate stars in his body, that still placed some pressure on him, after all. He couldn’t keep them like this forever, right?","Release them here?","Then these stars would definitely be destroyed immediately; how could they possibly sustain the extreme weight of gravity from the Primitive Abyss?","Thus, everyone left first.","But this time, they encountered multiple energy storms, and here and there, they waited for seven years, before finally arriving at the Azure Dragon City.","Here, everything was peaceful.","Had the news of the deaths of the Great Emperor’s disciples not transmitted over, or had it been transmitted over, yet everyone did not care?","They snuck into the Azure Dragon City, and the city was also completely peaceful, as if nothing had happened at all.","With the True Dragon Emperor holding down the fort, they wouldn’t be afraid even if the sky collapsed.","Ling Han and the others didn’t find this strange. A Great Emperor was the strongest existence in the world, and with a Great Emperor as overseer, the situation was naturally stable.","However, Ling Han hadn’t been present at the time, so he didn’t know that the True Dragon Emperor had actually been killed by the Great Emperor Senluo. Otherwise, all of them would have definitely gone numb with shock.","A dead Great Emperor... had actually come back to life?","How could such a thing happen?","Because they didn’t know, Ling Han and the others instead felt that this was only natural.","They exited the Dragon Head City and experienced several storms of heaven and earth on their way. Finally, they exited the Primitive Abyss.","Ling Han released the three stars in his body. Instantly, he felt relaxed, as if even his battle prowess had increased slightly.","In that case... should he take out the Genesis World as well?","Ling Han had always had this thought. A star could not match the crushing power of this great universe, but dimensions should be able to, because every dimension was no weaker than the Venerate Tier.","He began to experiment. Though this would cause him to lose the power of belief, at his current height, did he still need the power of belief?","It was only worth five stars of battle prowess.","Moreover, Ling Han had a feeling that if he truly wanted to become the strongest, he would need to strip the Genesis World from his body.","—What elite had relied on the power of others to become invincible in this world?","At the same time that Genesis World helped him, wasn’t it also a burden on his body?","He would make a decision when the time came!","He began to make an attempt. He didn’t bring out the entire Genesis World, but only one of the dimensions.","Under his continuous strengthening, the dimensions inside his body were all transcendent leve, which was equivalent to an Eighth Tier Heavenly Venerate.","Hence, if this was taken out, it would definitely be able to resist the compression of the great world.","This wasn’t difficult. Ling Han quickly took out this dimension.","Weng! The pressure of heaven and earth instantly surged over, yearning to crush this dimension.","However, the dimension itself was equivalent to an Eighth Tier Heavenly Venerate, so it naturally withstood this kind of pressure, and soon stabilized.","Ling Han guided it appropriately, allowing the power of heaven and earth to flow in, and also allowing this dimension to slowly integrate into the great world.","One day, two days, three days, everything was stable.","That was enough.","Ling Han revealed a smile. In this way, he would no longer need to use his divine sense to \"meet\" Liu Yutong and the other beautiful wives. Instead, he would be able to truly communicate with them face-to-face.","Furthermore, after entering into this great world, everyone could use the cultivation techniques of this great world to cultivate, and everyone could break through the limits of Heavenly Venerable Tier.","The only problem was that this dimension wasn’t very big. Even the entire dimension was only the size of a grain of sand.","Er, this was a small problem.","Ling Han retrieved dimensions one after another from his body. The second dimension was the dimension that Liu Yutong and the other wives and descendants were in. When this dimension appeared, he finally met his parents and the others.","After spending a whole three years, Ling Han finally took out all the dimensions. Then, he felt an unprecedented relaxation.","It was just like how he had previously been burdened with the identity of the ruler of the Genesis World. This was a supreme position, but at the same time, it was also a responsibility. Now, he had lost the power of belief of the dimensions inside him, but had also obtained true freedom.","From now onwards, he no longer had to bear the fate of others.","\"And now, my mind is finally cleared.\"","Ling Han smiled. He had never coveted power. Thus, while others might envy his identity as the Genesis World’s overlord, he didn’t care at all. If it weren’t because he had to do it to save their lives, he wouldn’t have taken on this responsibility.","Boom! He stretched out his hand, only to see that his fist was still enshrouded in Destructive Energy. This didn’t disappear just because the dimensions had left his body.","\"Very good. As long as the Destructive Energy hasn’t disappeared, I’ll still have a powerful weapon.\"","Ling Han took out Mo Ziyun’s sword and began to study it.","Previously, he had suddenly had an idea, and brought out the dimensions in his body. He had forgotten about this sword.","He studied it carefully, and sure enough, the destructive power of this sword was boundless. It possessed about the same traits as the Destructive Energy. However, the two were different, but exactly what was different, Ling Han couldn’t put his finger on.","It was as if the two were born from the same mother. They were very similar, but even blood brothers would have a lot of differences.","He could think of no better analogy.","\"Let’s dismantle it and see.\"","Ling Han began to dismantle his sword. This was a Saintly Material, and logically speaking, Saints would also have to draw on the power of heaven and earth to slowly refine it. It would be very, very difficult to damage it by force.","But in Ling Han’s hands, this was no big deal.","Under his dismantling, this sword soon turned into pieces. Then, multiple thin streaks of black light rose up, and rapidly disappeared.","Ling Han tried his best to capture it, storing it in his mind.","Weng, the light of great dao shone with blazing brilliance, and actually took the initiative to attack these black lights.","Even though there was pitifully little light of great dao, compared to these fine black lights, it was still a colossal existence.","The thin black light couldn’t block it at all!","Ling Han hurriedly stepped forward to protect it. However, the light of great dao shone down on him, and the thin black light was like snow, rapidly disappearing.","F***!","Ling Han cursed in his mind. However, with a thought, boom, the Destructive Energy instantly combusted in his mind. At this moment, the thin black light seemed to have seen its birth parents, and immediately surged over, fusing with the Destructive Energy.","This time, even the light of great dao couldn’t do anything. It could only confront the Destructive Energy head-on."]},{"number":4763,"title":"Chapter 4763: Matching Pseudo-Emperor?","paragraphs":["Yi?","Ling Han was surprised. When the thin black light fused into the Destructive Energy, a subtle change actually took place in the Destructive Energy.","Originally, even if this was of the same origin as Destructive Energy, because of the slight difference, merging should not have been possible.","However, the current situation was special. The thin black light was facing the great danger of being destroyed by the light of great dao, so it could only be forced to fuse into the Destructive Energy.","At this moment, Ling Han once again saw the Dao of Heaven and Earth.","It was as if he were his own body, and he himself was heaven and earth.","—This Dao of Heaven and Earth was in his mind.","In this great dao, Ling Han saw creation and destruction, life and death, which evolved endless mysteries.","But it was only an instant, and this Dao of Heaven and Earth had disappeared.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel disappointed and frustrated, feeling extremely terrible.","In comparison, the light of great dao in his mind didn’t live up to its name.","This was not yet qualified to be called the light of great dao. It was only a branch of great dao, at most.","\"The true great dao includes creation, destruction, life, and death.\" Enlightenment dawned on Ling Han. This was an existence that had surpassed Regulations, and was the true cornerstone of heaven and earth.","\"If I could grasp this kind of foundation stone of heaven and earth, would I be able to suppress even a Great Emperor?\"","Ling Han’s heart beat wildly. The Great Emperor had only dealt with the Nine Star Regulations, but in the case of the Dao of Heaven and Earth... this could crush everything.","In fact, because the Great Emperor was being suppressed by the Dao of Heaven and Earth, there would even come a day when his lifespan would dry up. However, what if he was cultivating the Dao of Heaven and Earth itself?","Could he become immortal and indestructible?","Ling Han’s heart throbbed wildly. He felt that he may have found the correct way to achieve immortality.","It was no wonder that the Great Emperors had entered the Primitive Abyss in pursuit of immortality. The secret of the creation of heaven and earth was indeed hidden here.","And as for Ling Han, he was even luckier.","As the Genesis World’s ruler, it was equivalent to him naturally grasping the Destructive Energy. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have obtained the great dao light, and now, he couldn’t fuse with that tiny bit of black light.","All the coincidences allowed him to glimpse the Dao of Heaven and Earth.","\"In other words, if I want to peek into the Dao of Heaven and Earth, I’ll need more Genesis Substance, or this kind of destructive substance.\"","However, this was something that could only be encountered but not sought. Obtaining even one was as difficult as ascending the heavens.","\"I can’t rush things. I need to take things one step at a time.\"","Ling Han went to look for Buddha Doga.","\"Senior, I would like to ask for some guidance,\" he said.","Buddha Doga couldn’t help but smile and nod. \"Alright, I want to see just how far you are from Pseudo-Emperor.\"","The two of them arrived in space, and immediately began a fierce battle.","Buddha Doga deliberately controlled his battle prowess to avoid defeating Ling Han as soon as he started fighting.","Ling Han directly used 50 eight-star Regulations. After getting used to it, Buddha Doga also used his battle prowess to resist.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Though their battle prowess had not reached Pseudo-Emperor-level, it had surpassed all Saints. Thus, it was very soon that Qian Yanghao and Xia Houping, these two Pseudo-Emperor-level beings were drawn over, followed by the large black dog, the empress and the others.","They naturally would not interfere, and merely watched the battle from the sidelines.","\"Can Ling Han win?\" Chi Menghan suddenly asked.","This!","Logically speaking, everyone thought that it was impossible for Ling Han to win. After all, his opponent was a Pseudo-Emperor! No matter how freakish Ling Han was, even if he was the strongest Saint of eternity, it was useless. With the word ’Emperor’ in the title, that meant a completely different level.","However, Ling Han had created too many miracles on his way here, so it was inevitable that people would feel hope again. What if?","What if he could stand against a Pseudo-Emperor?","However, Buddha Doga only exerted a slight bit of force, and Ling Han immediately fell into a disadvantage.","\"You want to fight me with such measly abilities?\" Buddha Doga asked calmly.","Ling Han chuckled. If he wanted to stand against a Pseudo-Emperor with fifty Eight Star Regulations, the idea was too naive.","He began to increase his power. Although he had transferred all the dimensions in his body out now, and lost the boost from the power of belief, his body had regained true freedom, which increased his battle prowess from another aspect.","Overall, his battle prowess should have been slightly weakened, but in the long run, this was indeed completely worth it.","Ling Han channelled Destructive Energy. Boom! As punches rained down, his destructive power soared.","Even someone as powerful as a Pseudo-Emperor didn’t dare to face Destructive Energy head-on with his physical body. Thus, Buddha Doga had no choice but to increase the distance between them, using long-distance attacks to disperse Destructive Energy.","In this way, he was naturally safe. However, it also greatly decreased the pressure he exerted on Ling Han.","Hence, he had no choice but to increase his battle prowess further, so that he could maintain the suppression on Ling Han.","\"As expected of the number one prodigy of all eternity,\" Qian Yanghao and Xia Houping both said with a nod. They were filled with praise for Ling Han.","They had all come from Saints, and now that they had advanced into the level of Pseudo-Emperor, they were very clear about the battle prowess of Saints, and just how far the gap was between them and Pseudo-Emperor.","It was precisely because of this that they were so stunned. Just how terrifying was Ling Han’s battle prowess?","However, as Buddha Doga increased his power further, Ling Han was once again embroiled in a tough battle, swaying on the verge of defeat.","This was naturally a deliberate move by Buddha Doga, who wanted to accurately calculate Ling Han’s battle prowess.","Ling Han shouted loudly, and the light of great dao also channelled out. Boom, his battle prowess instantly increased greatly again.","Right now, the majority of Imperial Techniques were already useless to him. He had already created his own path, and each and every move was profound and mysterious. In fact, he had even glimpsed the traces of great dao, and every move he made had the charm of heaven and earth fusing together.","Buddha Doga couldn’t help but exclaim in surprise. This light of great dao was an attack style that he had never seen before, and it gave him a slight shock.","But that was all.","Buddha Doga’s attacks became even more powerful, yet he was still able to suppress Ling Han.","Though Ling Han still had trump cards, such as the holy flame and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, the holy flame was used to fight only in desperate straits, while the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was an external object. It was not his own strength, so it was naturally not suitable to be used.","After Ling Han battled for a while longer, he took the initiative to admit defeat.","\"You’ve now grasped fifty eight-star Regulations?\" After Ling Han revealed everything, the three Pseudo-Emperors were all extremely shocked.","Fifty, that was too terrifying.","It should be known that Ling Han was presently only a Three Star Saint!","Then what was this guy’s limit?","\"Judging from your current battle prowess, you’ll probably possess Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess when you grasp 70 eight-star Regulations,\" Buddha Doga said.","Ling Han nodded. That was why a Pseudo-Emperor was so powerful.","Saints, even if they were the son of a Great Emperor, and were extremely talented, at nine stars, they would only be able to grasp around thirty eight-star Regulations at most, which was ridiculously far from seventy.","Furthermore, without the light of great dao and Destructive Energy, even if he could really grasp seventy eight-star Regulations, he would not be able to match a Pseudo-Emperor.","This also indirectly proved the strength of a Pseudo-Emperor.","As for Ling Han?","Even without the Genesis Substance, it would still be a piece of cake for him to master 70 eight-star Regulations even if he had to go through Silent Destruction four times.","He was the most powerful Saint in all of history, and he truly lived up to his name."]},{"number":4764,"title":"Chapter 4764: Reappearance of the Nine Disciples","paragraphs":["After this battle, Ling Han also gained a complete understanding of his own strength.","The three Pseudo-Emperors did not hold anything back either. They each related their respective experiences of breaking through to the level of Pseudo-Emperor.","This was definitely priceless!","Although Pseudo-Emperor still had the word ’Pseudo’, even so, throughout history, there were not many such existences.","This path of advancement was really, really too difficult.","And now, there was someone there to give Ling Han an explanation. Just how great of a help was this?","Ling Han wouldn’t take the same path as these three Pseudo-Emperors. However, he could avoid the wrong turns that these three Pseudo-Emperors had taken. This would save him a lot of time.","In truth, there were also differences in battle prowess among Pseudo-Emperors. However, because there were really, really too few people that could attain the level of Pseudo-Emperor, so the level of Pseudo-Emperor was not further divided into sub-levels, unlike the level of Saint Tier, which was differentiated into levels of One to Nine Stars.","If it was just Buddha Doga and the other two, it should be Buddha Doga that was the strongest. However, compared to Qian Yanghao and Xia Houping, he was not much stronger. This was practically an instinctive feeling. There was no need to compare, as they each knew their own measure.","But if it was really a mortal duel, then this kind of strength may not become the basis for whichever side would survive.","That was because a battle of this level was too delicate. Even the slightest difference in reaction speed could possibly affect the final result.","Again, who would be weaker than the other among those who could become Emperor?","It was the same for Pseudo-Emperors.","What was his next plan?","Going back to plunder Yin souls?","Ling Han shook his head. This trip would take at least 200 years, and to return here again, it would be 400 years. Where would he get so much time to waste?","Moreover, if he didn’t become Emperor, what was the point of going back? If he encountered the Lords of Death, he would still have to flee with his tail between his legs.","Thus, it would be better to train here.","Then... should he enter into the Primitive Abyss again?","This seemed to be the only option. Otherwise, what could he do in this dark, boundless space?","There were only three planets.","Before Ling Han could enter into the Primitive Abyss, he saw Ding Shu, Jing Haoran, and Shui Qingchang return.","They had finally succeeded, and could now hold a planet with their bodies!","This was a piece of good news. When Buddha Doga and the others found out, they decided to go through the trouble and make a few more trips. They would bring Ding Shu and the others to bring more planets over.","With how big the universe was, it would take more than a little time for the Netherworld to invade this place. However, 99% of the stars in the entire universe were gathered in one-ten-thousandth of this area, or even one-ten-hundred-millionth of this area.","Thus, in terms of planets alone, the Living Realm had practically fallen completely.","There was no time to lose. Buddha Doga and the others each took one Genesis World’s ruler with them, and left respectively.","In the next few thousand years, the three of them would probably be busy with this matter.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before deciding to enter the Primitive Abyss again.","Only the Genesis Substance could allow him to rapidly increase his cultivation level, and only this thing could allow Ling Han to reach the height of being able to absorb 99 eight-star Regulations.","—With another twenty Regulations, he would be able to reach the battle prowess of Pseudo-Emperor.","This filled Ling Han with motivation. When he reached this level, he would truly be the strongest Saint in history.","Capable of standing against a Pseudo-Emperor!","Brother Monkey, the large black dog, and the little azure dragon all set off together, entering the Primitive Abyss with Ling Han. As for the empress, Hu Niu, and the others, their goal was still the outer circle of the Primitive Abyss. They wanted to try their luck and see if they could find Genesis Substance.","After a proper discussion, everyone set out.","They journeyed cautiously. Even if it was only the first passage, aside from Ling Han, there was still no one that could be careless. At the slightest provocation, they would be severely injured by the shockwave, or even die.","Then, Ling Han’s group and the empress’s group went their separate ways.","The storms of heaven and earth continued endlessly, and after spending a whole seven years, Ling Han and the others finally arrived in front of the Dragon Head City.","The feelings of the little azure dragon were the most complicated. The True Dragon Emperor here was definitely not his father, but it definitely had a very, very deep relationship with the line of the True Dragon, which made him feel very conflicted. He very much wanted to discover the true identity of the True Dragon Emperor.","Ling Han and his group entered into the city. However, after only roaming around the city for a short while, they all looked stunned.","Why?","This was because they had learned from the gossip of others that the nine disciples of the True Dragon Emperor were still alive.","How could the four of them not be shocked?","The True Dragon Emperor’s nine great disciples had all died by Ling Han’s hand — or had died because of Ling Han. This was something that Ling Han had seen very clearly.","Now, he was told that his nine great disciples were still alive?","Wasn’t this a joke?","But others did not know that they had come, so what reason did they have to lie to them?","\"There’s something strange about this!\"","\"Extremely strange!\"","\"But could it be that the True Dragon Emperor has taken in another nine disciples?\"","This was possible. After all, they had been in the outside world for a few years, and in the Primitive Abyss, that would be several hundred years.","However, this True Dragon Emperor was far too efficient, wasn’t he? He had taken in nine disciples in just a few hundred years?","Ordinarily, when one had reached the level of Emperor, taking in a disciple would definitely be a very cautious matter. It would not be strange for one to only get a disciple that he liked after tens of thousands of years.","And now, he had taken nine disciples in just a few hundred years?","Was there any need to rush things like this?","\"This is worth investigating.\"","Ling Han and the others set off to investigate the residences of the nine disciples.","With their Saint-level strength, they were completely capable of being impenetrable.","Thus, when the day ended, and they returned respectively, the whereabouts of the nine disciples also became clear.","\"Which one should we go to first?\"","Ling Han pondered for a moment before replying, \"The Ninth King.\"","Previously, he had impersonated the Ninth King, so it must be fate.","The four of them moved out, and soon arrived in front of the manor of the Ninth King.","Of course, though this was called a manor, it was incredibly simple and crude. In the Primitive Abyss, the main theme was simple and plain.","In fact, there wasn’t even a single servant here. In the Primitive Abyss, the population was really too small. Manpower was a kind of precious resource, and they were all sent to mine.","This was good too. Ling Han would be able to spend a little less effort, to use the murderous aura to knock someone unconscious.","However, though the manor was simple and crude, it occupied a large area. Thus, Ling Han and the others still spent some time to finally find the location of the Ninth King. After all, they were all Saints, so they couldn’t be too impudent.","Yi!","When they arrived in front of the building where the Ninth King was, they were shocked to discover that the aura exuding from within was actually only that of a Half-Saint.","The four of them looked at each other. True enough, the True Dragon Emperor had taken in another nine disciples, so he needed to start nurturing from the very beginning.","\"Genesis Substance!\" Ling Han sensed it for a moment, and couldn’t help but feel his heartbeat quicken.","He looked around secretly, only to see a person sitting cross-legged in the room. He held a Celestial medicine in his hand, and this was the aura that was unique to Genesis Substance.","F***, how extravagant, to actually use Genesis Substance to cultivate!","En, because this Ninth King’s cultivation level was still relatively weak, and had not advanced into Saint Tier, he did not dare to directly ingest the Celestial medicine either, fearing that his body would explode from the force. He could only sniff it, and obtain a little bit of \"fertilizer\".","For a Half-Saint, this was enough to allow his cultivation level to soar.","Ling Han’s sharp eyes swept over the face of this Ninth King, and his mouth involuntarily gaped widely."]},{"number":4765,"title":"Chapter 4765: The same Ninth King","paragraphs":["\"Little Han, have you seen a ghost?\" the large black dog asked.","\"Or did you see a beauty come out of the bath, which made your eyes widen?\" the little azure dragon also asked.","Of course, they were both using their divine sense to ask this question.","Ling Han shook his head, and directly rushed into the room. Weng, the murderous aura attack was also activated at the same time.","With his current strength, could a Half-Saint block a single thought from him?","Pa, this Ninth King immediately fainted.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Brother Monkey and the others also leaped in one after another, \"This is the Genesis-level Celestial medicine?\"","They looked at the Celestial medicine that the Ninth King was still holding in his hands, and all of them looked curious.","Ling Han nodded, \"However, the reason why I couldn’t help but make a move is not because of this Celestial medicine.\"","\"Yi, have you changed your personality, brat?\" The large black dog immediately asked curiously, and even wanted to stretch out a hand to touch Ling Han’s forehead, \"Come, let Grandpa Dog see if you have a fever!\"","\"Go!\" Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, \"This Ninth King is exactly the same as the Ninth King I have seen before.\"","’Hah?’","Brother Monkey and the others looked at each other in confusion.","It should be known that the Ninth King had died.","\"Could it be a brother?\" The large black dog speculated, \"Perhaps this True Dragon Emperor is more nostalgic, and after he found out that his nine disciples had died, he took the younger brother or son of his original nine disciples as his disciple.\"","Ling Han shook his head, \"You didn’t understand what I meant. I mean, these two people are exactly the same.\"","\"Even in terms of divine sense?\" Brother Monkey asked solemnly.","\"En.\" Ling Han nodded.","Hiss!","Brother Monkey and the others all inhaled sharply. This was inconceivable.","There were no two flowers that were the same in this world, nor were there two souls that were the same.","The appearance could be similar, and elites like Ling Han could even completely disguise themselves as others. However, the soul could not be completely simulated. Even if Ling Han possessed the Soul Forming Technique, it was still possible that he would be seen through by those with higher cultivation levels.","Thus, even if this Ninth King had also cultivated a secret technique like the Soul Forming Technique, would his cultivation level be higher than Ling Han’s? Would he be able to deceive Ling Han?","Moreover, there was no need for him to do so.","What was he doing? Was he also an impersonator like Ling Han? But if he was really an impersonator, why would he be a Half-Saint?","This was completely inexcusable, wasn’t it?","\"So, this is the Ninth King, and it turns out to be the same one from before!\" The large black dog emphasized again.","\"That should be the case.\" Ling Han nodded.","\"But when one dies, the soul will enter the Netherworld and all memories would be erased. One would have nothing to do with the Living Realm anymore,\" the little azure dragon said.","Ling Han pondered for a moment, then said slowly, \"This is the Primitive Abyss.\"","The Primitive Abyss was where heaven and earth originated. Thus, while there was the Living Realm and the Netherworld outside, in this place, it was a complete area of Primal Chaos.","This wasn’t the Living Realm, nor was it the Netherworld. However, it was both the Living Realm and the Netherworld.","So... even the dead could be revived?","The four of them exchanged looks. What relation did the so-called immortality have with this?","\"Could that True Dragon Emperor has also been revived like this?\" the little azure dragon suddenly said. He had always been extremely bothered by this matter.","If so, who was behind this?","The little azure dragon was one hundred percent sure that the True Dragon had indeed died.","It should be known that when the Great Emperor died, his soul would be fused with heaven and earth. It could not be helped. He was too strong, and could not possibly enter into the Netherworld.","Since that was the case, how could it be that anyone else could snatch back the soul of the True Dragon from the hands of the Dao of Heaven and Earth?","If he was really that strong, then he would be able to suppress the whole world with a single thought, so what was the point of continuing the game!","Ling Han first collected the Celestial medicine, then smacked the Ninth King awake.","The Ninth King woke up in a daze, and when he saw four unfamiliar faces, he couldn’t help but feel shocked. Hurriedly, he asked, \"Who are you people?\"","He still wanted to use his divine sense to send out a warning wave, but his cultivation level was completely restricted by Ling Han, so he naturally couldn’t send it out.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"Little Ninth, do you know me?\"","\"Who are you?\" The Ninth King looked at Ling Han blankly.","Yi, this was not an act; he really did not know.","Otherwise, how could he not have revealed the slightest bit of resentment after being \"accidentally\" killed by Ling Han?","\"Forget it!\" Ling Han stretched out a hand, and placed it on the forehead of the Ninth King, directly searching his soul.","\"Wu!\" The Ninth King was once again knocked unconscious.","After a while, Ling Han withdrew his hand, revealing an astounded expression.","He discovered that the memories of the Ninth King only comprised of a few hundred years. He had been cultivating in Dragon Head City all this while, and afterwards, he had been taken as the last disciple by the True Dragon Emperor. His whole life had been spent in cultivation.","This... there was nothing strange about it, but it was also filled with strangeness.","Someone had really given birth to the Ninth King, and he had not been directly revived, but had rather started from the stage of infancy... that was not right either.","In the memories of the Ninth King, he didn’t have a childhood at all.","It was understandable that he couldn’t remember things from when he was an infant. However, he only had memories from when he was an adult. What the hell was this?","Ling Han’s expression suddenly became very strange, and he asked, \"Have you seen any children in the city?\"","\"No.\"","\"No.\"","Brother Monkey and the others all shook their heads. They didn’t understand why Ling Han was asking this.","\"In the memories of the Ninth King, there are no memories of childhood,\" Ling Han said.","\"Hiss!\"","With how smart Brother Monkey and the others were, they immediately understood why Ling Han had asked previously.","\"This city is not naturally developed at all. Everyone is like a puppet!\"","There was no childhood. The moment they were \"created\", they would be adults. However, everyone’s fate was different. Some had become disciples of the Great Emperor, some had become Saint-level guards, and some had become miners.","\"Hold on!\" The large black dog suddenly waved his paws, signaling for everyone to remain silent, \"Say, could this True Dragon Emperor also be... like this?\"","As it said this, it glanced at the little azure dragon. After all, the little azure dragon was more sensitive about this matter.","\"Very likely.\" Ling Han nodded. The little azure dragon was absolutely certain that the True Dragon had definitely died, and reality had also proven that this True Dragon Emperor’s battle prowess was inferior to a normal Great Emperor.","Hence, if this Great Emperor was actually created, then it could be explained.","What had been created would definitely be inferior to the strength that came from true cultivation.","However, this was still incredibly terrifying.","A Great Emperor could actually be created?","Even if they were weaker Great Emperors, they could still crush the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands, and were chillingly strong.","There were a total of 36 Divine Beast Great Emperors in the Primitive Abyss.","Was, was it all like this?","Ling Han couldn’t help but recall the scene he had seen in the feather of the Azure Phoenix. An unknown Divine Beast had appeared, and entered into the Divine Beast Graveyard.","There was definitely a connection, but what exactly was it?","Ling Han felt a headache coming on. The information he had was limited, and it was really difficult to deduce.","Furthermore, this truth could possibly be world-shaking.","The Great Emperor Wu Ya said that there was a terrifying danger in the Primitive Abyss that could threaten the survival of the whole universe. Could it be related to this?","\"My abilities are insufficient!\" Ling Han said sincerely. Otherwise, he could completely barge all the way into the depths of the Primitive Abyss, and ask the Great Emperor Wu Ya about it."]},{"number":4766,"title":"Chapter 4766: You’ve Got the Wrong Person","paragraphs":["Ling Han and the others continued to set off, heading to the locations of the other eight disciples.","As expected, their cultivation levels were either Half-Saint, One Star Saint, or Two Star Saint. After they were \"created\", they could only cultivate again from the beginning. Being able to become Saints in a few hundred years was already an amazing miracle.","Some had already refined the Genesis-level Celestial medicine. Some had not, so Ling Han and the others naturally wouldn’t be reserved. They would loot those that had yet to refine it!","Ling Han kidnapped all nine of the disciples. He really wanted to see if there would be any more disciples that would be created.","\"Let’s go!\"","They exited the city, and Ling Han immediately began to refine the Celestial medicine.","They had obtained a total of four Genesis-level Celestial medicines, and now, these were all handed over to Ling Han.","—The large black dog and the others all knew that only by raising Ling Han’s cultivation level as soon as possible, would they be able to stand against the Lands of Death, and truly possess the right to live.","Ling Han wasn’t reserved either. They were all family, so there was no need for reservations.","However, the higher the cultivation level, the greater the expense of Genesis Substance. Furthermore, Ling Han discovered that though this was Genesis-level Celestial medicine, the Genesis Substance contained within was not very high. All four of them added together were only comparable to the one he had previously obtained.","Thankfully, when he refined the four Celestial medicines, he had also absorbed 54 Regulations.","In a situation where his body had only experienced Silent Destruction three times, the fact that he could attain such accomplishments was extremely astonishing.","\"Just a little bit more, just a little bit more,\" Ling Han murmured. He was getting closer and closer to Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess.","They were indeed talented and courageous. They returned to Dragon Head City, wanting to know if another nine disciples would appear.","In the end... there was none.","Was it because they hadn’t died, or was it because there wasn’t enough time?","What surprised Ling Han and the others even more was the fact that the True Dragon Emperor didn’t react at all even though his nine disciples had disappeared. He was still in seclusion.","This, what was going on here?","If Ling Han and the others knew that the True Dragon Emperor had been killed by Great Emperor Senluo, they could now make a deduction. Could it be that this Great Emperor had also just been \"created\", and was in need of a great amount of time to return to the level of Great Emperor?","However, it was a shame that they had only cared about fleeing at that time. Whether it was the Azure Phoenix Emperor or Great Emperor Senluo, they wouldn’t have especially notified them, right?","However, an uninvited guest had also arrived at Dragon Head City.","Mo Ziyun.","Why had this woman come?","That’s right. She had been tricked by Ling Han, so she naturally had to run to Dragon Head City to look for him.","Ling Han couldn’t help but think. After this little girl came here, when she discovered that the Ninth King had disappeared again, what would she think?","She took it for granted that everyone in the city was lying to her. Thus, she was reluctant to go, and was determined to seek an explanation.","Er, this was his fault.","\"Little Han, it looks like this is your doing,\" the large black dog immediately said.","Ling Han wore a righteous expression as he said, \"Nonsense!\"","However, Mo Ziyun suddenly left again, very quickly.","Yi, what was going on?","Ling Han was extremely curious. With his understanding of Mo Ziyun, would she give up so easily?","\"Come, let’s follow.\"","Ling Han and the others trailed behind Mo Ziyun.","If it was only Brother Monkey and the others, they would definitely be discovered by Mo Ziyun. After all, Mo Ziyun’s strength was superior to theirs.","However, with Ling Han around, it was a different story. His present strength was already getting closer and closer to the level of Pseudo-Emperor. If he did not want to be discovered, Mo Ziyun would really not be able to discover them no matter how hard she tried.","Because the weather was not too bad, a dozen over days later, they arrived at the Azure Phoenix City. Then, there was practically no waiting, and they saw Mo Ziyun leave the city.","This time, she wasn’t alone. Instead, she was accompanied by the other disciples of the Azure Phoenix Emperor.","There were a total of eight of them.","\"Looks like they’re going to carry out some kind of mission,\" the little azure dragon said.","\"No matter what kind of mission it is, nothing good will happen.\" The large black dog roared, \"Come, let’s go and stop them.\"","Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, \"There’s no hurry. Let’s see what they want to do first.\"","The four of them followed, and the eight people in front of them were completely unaware, as they continued onwards.","In this period of time, their luck was not very good. They repeatedly encountered storms of heaven and earth, causing Ling Han to almost lose track of them.","Thankfully, after losing them a few times, they caught up again, and finally managed to control the situation.","This trip took seven years, and they finally arrived at their destination.","Actually, the time that was really used for their journey was not very long. However, the storms of heaven and earth were too frightening. If they encountered them, they would have to dodge. Sometimes, they would even have to take a detour. They may even be forced to change their course, and this led to their progress being very, very slow.","Mo Ziyun and the others arrived at a lake.","This made Ling Han very surprised, because he had never seen a lake in the Primitive Abyss.","This lake wasn’t large, and its widest point was only 5km, while its narrow point was only 1km or so. It appeared narrow and long, and the lake waters were as black as ink. Who knew what kind of liquid it was.","The lake was not calm and without waves, but was rather slowly spinning, forming two holes on the left and right side. One was moving in a clockwise direction, while the other was moving in a counter-clockwise direction, which was very bizarre.","Mo Ziyun and the others were not the only ones who had come. There were four other teams as well. Ling Han immediately recognized them. They were all disciples of the Great Emperors that had taken part in the Nine Cities Tournament.","Yi, why had so many disciples of the Great Emperors come here?","Ling Han believed that the disciples of the other Great Emperors would also come. This was only a matter of time.","As expected, a few months later, another three teams arrived, and there were a total of eight teams.","Obviously, if it was not for the fact that all the disciples of the True Dragon Emperor had been wiped out by Ling Han, there should be nine teams here by now.","\"I wonder what they’re planning.\" The large black dog was extremely curious, and it felt an itch in its heart.","\"Want to know?\" Ling Han asked with a smile.","\"You have a way?\" the large black dog asked.","\"Why don’t we go up and ask?\" Ling Han said matter-of-factly.","\"Yi, that works?\"","\"Of course, just say that you’re a new disciple of the True Dragon Emperor,\" Ling Han said. In any case, in the perception of Mo Ziyun and the others, all the old disciples had died, leaving behind only the Ninth King.","Hence, was this not easy to impersonate?","The large black dog’s interest was immediately piqued, \"Then give the Silver Battle Armor to Grandpa Dog!\"","Ling Han exchanged the Battle Armor with the large black dog. Seeing that the large black dog still didn’t forget to take off his iron underwear when wearing the Battle Armor, and then wear it outside, Ling Han instantly felt an urge to hit him.","Was he going to advance indomitably on the path of the Despicable Saint, and never look back?","\"Boys, follow Grandpa Dog!\" The large black dog stood on its hind legs, crossed its front paws behind its back, and swaggered towards the lakeside.","The moment the four of them came out, they immediately attracted the attention of Mo Ziyun and the others. They all looked over.","Yi, who were these four people?","What a strange combination!","Although they were wearing Battle Armors, they could still clearly see that only one of them was a human. Then, there was a dog, a monkey... and there was also a four-legged snake?","\"You are—\" Mo Ziyun immediately stared at Ling Han, feeling that this person gave her a familiar feeling.","\"I’m not!\" Ling Han hurriedly shook his head. \"You’ve got the wrong person.\""]},{"number":4767,"title":"Chapter 4767: Demon Star Lake","paragraphs":["’F*ck! I haven’t even said who you are yet, so how do you know that I’ve made a mistake?’","Mo Ziyun was extremely suspicious. Why did this kind of expression and tone seem so much like that irresponsible guy?","While she was pondering over this, the others all turned their attention to the large black dog. After all, it was the large black dog that was wearing the Silver Battle Armor.","In the Primitive Abyss, the type of Battle Armor represented one’s identity.","Disciple of a Great Emperor?","There were already eight teams of disciples of Great Emperors here, so these four people definitely belonged to the True Dragon City.","Hiss, since when did the True Dragon Emperor have such strong tastes, to actually take a dog as his disciple?","\"Under the True Dragon Emperor?\" An Heming asked. This was a \"fact\" that everyone already knew.","\"That’s right.\" The large black dog puffed out his chest, \"Grandpa Dog is the first disciple of the True Dragon Emperor, Black Murderous Dog King!\"","Everyone couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat. It was very normal for disciples of Great Emperors to be called \"king\", and this guy was a dog. It seemed right for him to be called \"dog king\", but from its mouth, why did it feel like it was demeaning him as well?","Just look, they, they were all Seventh King, Eighth King, Ninth King and so on, and suddenly a Dog King appeared in their midst. Wouldn’t their status instantly decline?","They couldn’t help but glance at the large black dog’s iron underwear. There was nothing they could do about this. The golden light was far too dazzling.","\"You guys... don’t even think of snatching Grandpa Dog’s treasure!\" the large black dog immediately warned solemnly.","\"We don’t have that kind of interest!\" everyone immediately shouted. In fact, they were even a little embarrassed.","Gods, just how hardcore did they have to be to snatch a dog’s underpants?","\"Where’s your Ninth?\" Mo Ziyun came back to her senses and asked the large black dog.","\"Oh, Ninth.\" The large black dog’s eyes darted around, and he immediately started to speak without thinking, \"You’re that Mo Yuzai, right? My Ninth said that he has had a sweetheart since childhood, so he can only disappoint your deep love.\"","When these words fell, it immediately attracted tons of animosity for it, and everyone was looking at it angrily.","The large black dog was given a fright, and hurriedly covered his iron underwear, his expression filled with terror, \"You guys are indeed trying to snatch Grandpa Dog’s treasure!\"","Everyone was instantly rendered speechless. Then, they felt like they were about to go crazy. Why was this disciple of a Great Emperor exuding a strong sense of despicableness?","This kind of despicable dog would actually be taken as disciple by a Great Emperor, and his first disciple at that?","However, such a team had come from the True Dragon City. Even if they didn’t want to believe it, they had to.","\"Forget it, let’s not waste any more time on this,\" An Heming hurriedly said. This was because he saw Luoyi Xingxiao opening his mouth to speak again. This guy took things too seriously. What would happen if he was allowed to speak?","Clearly, the large black dog’s battle prowess wasn’t weak either.","\"The Demonic Eyes have already appeared on the Demon Star Lake. Then, in at most a year’s time, we would be able to enter,\" he said.","Ling Han and the others remained calm and collected. However, they all gave an ’oh’ in their minds. As it turned out, this was the Demonic Star Lake, and those two whirlpools were the Demonic Eyes.","Their aim was to enter the bottom of the Demon Star Lake?","What was there there?","Were they going to directly dig a hole and travel to the bottom of the lake?","That was too naive. Didn’t everyone know just how sturdy the ground here was? The strike of a Saint would not even leave behind the slightest mark.","Unless Ling Han made a move, and unleashed the combined might of Destructive Energy and light of great dao together. He would then possess destructive power that surpassed even the Imperial Weapon.","However, Ling Han didn’t know what would happen after he went to the bottom of the lake. Thus, he naturally didn’t move now.","The group of people settled down here. Thankfully, there was no storm of heaven and earth in the area of the lake — perhaps, this lake itself contained great danger.","Though Ling Han had not entered into the lake, he had a feeling that the waters of the lake were filled with destructive power, and definitely could not be touched easily.","Thus, even though everyone here was a Saint, they could only watch from the sidelines. No one dared to enter the lake.","Looking at this whirlpool, it looked like it was getting faster and faster, and bigger and bigger. At this rate, the bottom of the lake would soon appear.","Was this what they were waiting for?","Because they had to wait, everyone set up camp by the lake, and Mo Ziyun was the goddess in everyone’s hearts. The Ninth King of the True Dragon City was not present, so it was a good opportunity to strike at her defenses","These people kept circling around Mo Ziyun, making her extremely annoyed. Naturally, she did not have the time to look for Ling Han again to prove the suspicion in her heart.","Day after day passed, and the two holes in the Demon Star Lake became larger and larger. On a certain day, the bottom of the lake was finally revealed.","\"Same rules as before. We’ll draw lots to decide who enters the left eye and who enters the right eye,\" An Heming said.","\"All right.\"","Everyone began to draw lots. Not long after, the lots were drawn, and Ling Han drew the left eye, while Brother Monkey and the others drew the right eye.","The four of them communicated through divine sense for a while, and reached a consensus. They would go with the flow first, and see what exactly was inside this Demon Star Lake.","They didn’t ask. It was clear that they would definitely be tied up if they asked. Before setting out, would the True Dragon Emperor not have informed them first?","After drawing lots, they were divided into two groups, each leaping towards the eye of the lake.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! This time, none of them hesitated, as if they were dumplings being thrown into a pot.","In the crowd, Ling Han appeared especially eye-catching, because he was the only one wearing a Bronze Battle Armor.","This caused everyone to look at him with a hint of disdain. In fact, they even felt a displeasure as if they had been insulted.","—A mere guard could actually associate with them?","However, none of them flared up for the moment.","The group arrived at the bottom of the lake, and saw that there was actually a cave here. It was dark and eerie, and its depth was unknown.","They then entered into this cave, walking all the way. At times, they would go downwards, and at times, they would go upwards. After walking for a long time, the path ahead of them suddenly opened up.","This was still underground, but an extremely large cave had appeared. It was as tall as three thousand meters, and was extraordinarily huge.","Ling Han was extremely curious. What was hidden here?","Why did they have to enter different Demonic Eyes?","No one gave Ling Han an explanation, and even if he asked, it was probable that no one would answer him — who are you? You are merely a guard, so why are you talking so much? Don’t you know the hierarchy of seniority?","They merely advanced. After advancing for a certain distance, a dead old tree appeared ahead of them. However, there was also a purple vine entwined around the old tree. However, this vine was about to die, and there was no longer any sign of life circulating around it.","However, to be nurtured in such a dangerous place, it was definitely no ordinary item!","Unfortunately, it was about to die.","Ling Han could sense that this vine was exuding the aura of Genesis Substance, but it was too weak.","Yi, did they travel so far just for this old vine?","Wasn’t this too much? It was completely not worth it.","Ling Han didn’t say anything. There should be something that he didn’t know.","\"You, go over,\" one of them suddenly shouted at Ling Han.","\"Me?\" Ling Han pointed at himself, then smiled, \"Why?\"","\"Do you have the right to refuse?\" That person smirked coldly, \"We are all disciples of Great Emperors, so who do you think you are?\"","Ling Han pondered for a moment, then said, \"I’m your uncle!\"","Instantly, that person was angered. A mere guard actually dared to provoke him?","How reckless!"]},{"number":4768,"title":"Chapter 4768: What goes around comes around","paragraphs":["All the disciples of the Great Emperors looked coldly at Ling Han, their killing intent flickering.","As they saw it, even if they killed a mere guard, so what? He actually dared to be insolent in front of them?","\"Hehe, the True Dragon City is really weird. It has produced a Ninth King, and something like you who knows no respect for seniority!\" The Great Emperor’s disciple from before said coldly. His name was Guo Ming, and he was the sixth disciple of the Crimson Ape City.","Ling Han was extremely displeased, \"Do you know how to speak properly?\"","\"You still dare to be arrogant?\" Everyone was surprised. Could it be that this guy did not have a brain?","As a mere guard, what right did he have to talk back to the disciples of a Great Emperor?","Or had the line of the True Dragon been led astray by the Ninth King? Did he think that just because the Ninth King had defeated Saints, he, a servant, could act arrogant and domineering?","Humph!","\"Since you have disrespected us, I will allow you to suffer the consequences of your own actions!\" Guo Ming said, and stretched out a hand to grab Ling Han, intending to throw him directly towards the withered tree and old vine.","Ling Han shook his head in exasperation. F*ck, his image had collapsed again.","Why did he always destroy his image so quickly?","See, wasn’t he very low-key this time? He didn’t take the initiative to cause trouble at all, right?","\"Could it be that I am too dazzling?\" he murmured.","At this time, Guo Ming’s large hand had already caught hold of him, but when he was about to throw Ling Han out, he felt awkward, because he discovered that Ling Han was completely motionless, and could not be picked up at all.","Hiss, what the hell was this?","Guo Ming faltered for a moment. Then, he exerted force with one hand, and continued to pull, but it was still useless.","Instantly, he felt his face burn.","The other didn’t even fight back, and he was actually helpless. What face did he have left?","He stretched out his other hand, and both of them grabbed onto Ling Han. Then, with a loud shout, he wanted to throw Ling Han out.","However, it was still completely useless.","Ling Han simply stood there, as if his feet were rooted into the ground.","Guo Ming was stunned. Could it be that this guard’s cultivation level was superior to his?","But he was already a Seven Star Saint. Even if Ling Han was a Nine Star Saint, with how high his natural talent was, how could he not be able to suppress him?","\"You should go on your own.\" Ling Han moved, and with a wave of his hand, xiu, Guo Ming’s whole person was sent flying, and then crashed heavily into the great tree.","In the process of flying out, Guo Ming’s expression changed drastically, as if he had received a massive shock. Thus, the moment he landed, he immediately wanted to flee back, but it was too late.","Zi, a purple lightning bolt suddenly struck out from the old vine, rapidly slashing towards Guo Ming.","Guo Ming wanted to dodge, but the speed of the lightning was really too fast, so how could he possibly dodge?","\"Ah!\" He released a terrible scream, smoke rising from all over his body, and the fragrance of meat wafted out.","Zi, zi, zi, the purple lightning struck one after another. Even if Guo Ming was wearing a Silver Battle Armor, which greatly increased his defenses, it was useless. It was as if the purple lightning could ignore this layer of defense, and directly strike his body.","After a few times, Guo Ming was seen lying on the ground, with traces of burnt smoke continuously exuding from his body.","\"Is it seventy percent cooked?\" Ling Han guessed. This was the judgment of a professional glutton.","Shua! All of a sudden, the other disciples of the Great Emperors all turned to look at him.","\"Who exactly are you?\" An Heming asked. There was a hint of seriousness in his voice, as well as a hint of shock.","With a wave of his hand, he had thrown Guo Ming out. He had done it so casually, as easily as if he had thrown out a piece of scrap paper. What kind of powerful strength was that?","How could a guard... possess such a level?","Ling Han sighed, and said, \"Do you guys know what I hate the most?\"","How would we know?","Even though An Heming thought this, he still suppressed his urge to attack and asked in a solemn voice, \"What is it?\"","\"Destroying my public image!\" Ling Han said bitterly. \"Can you all understand? You spent so much effort to conceal your identities and infiltrate the enemy camp, yet in the end, you were forced to reveal your identities for such a trivial matter?\"","F***, what kind of mockery was that?","An Heming humphed, and said, \"As expected, you’re an imposter!\"","Ling Han wasn’t the only one. There was also that despicable dog, as well as the monkey and the four-legged snake. That’s right, why would the True Dragon Emperor have such hardcore tastes in choosing disciples?","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"Since my public image has collapsed, I can only kill all of you to keep the secret!\"","With a thought, he returned to his original appearance.","This naturally could not possibly be recognized by the masses. After all, his appearance was completely unlike the \"Ninth King\".","An Heming laughed loudly, and said, \"Who do you think you are?\"","Aside from the boundlessly freakish Ninth King, could there be a second person in this world that could sweep aside seven great trump cards all by himself?","There was none! That was impossible.","\"Capture him, and interrogate him about his origins!\"","\"En!\"","All the disciples of the Great Emperors nodded, every one of them showing an ominous glint.","\"Come!\" Ling Han crooked a finger at them, appearing extremely disdainful, filled with provocation.","\"Attack together!\" An Heming shouted. The opponent was truly powerful, so he didn’t dare to be careless.","Thus, just to be safe, it was best to gang up on him.","Xiu, xiu, xiu, everyone pounced out.","Ling Han sighed, appearing disinterested.","Previously, when the seven great trump cards had joined forces to fight him, he had also dealt with them easily.","But now?","His strength had increased greatly, but there were only four trump cards here. How much stronger was this comparison?","Ling Han stretched out a hand. It was not clear how fast he was, nor how mysterious his movements were, but with a stretch of his hand, a person was captured by him. Then, xiu, he smashed him towards the old vine.","Zi, purple lightning rose again, striking madly at that person.","Ling Han did not make another move. He merely dodged, and then observed from the sidelines.","Not long after, that person lay on the ground and stopped moving, and the lightning did not strike him again.","Again.","Ling Han casually grabbed out, and another person was captured, which he tossed towards the withered tree.","It was still the same. Lightning struck, causing that person to cry out endlessly.","He moved casually and in a relaxed manner. However, in the eyes of An Heming and the others, this was far too terrifying.","Under their combined attacks, Ling Han could still be so relaxed. He caught one of them and threw them in a single stroke, as if he was in a place where he faced no opposition.","Was this opponent... a demon?","What could they do?","They looked at each other, and a strong chill rose up in both of them.","\"Summon the Saint Tool!\" They all drew out their Saint Tool, and then attacked Ling Han.","However, what use was this?","Ling Han threw a punch. Not only did the Saint Tool’s light dim, but it even shattered the Saint Tool!","This, what kind of monster was this!","\"Who exactly are you!\"","\"A Great Emperor?\"","Everyone’s hair stood on end. Aside from a Great Emperor, was there any other existence that was so powerful?","\"Don’t be surprised!\" Ling Han shook his head, and attacked repeatedly, blasting everyone onto the ground. Not a single person managed to escape.","As powerful as he was, he already had a sliver of the might of Pseudo-Emperor.","He grinned as he tossed them one after another towards the withered tree, \"How is it? Do you now know what the wheel of fortune has turned?\"","Everyone was speechless. They had only wanted to force Ling Han to approach the withered tree, and had not succeeded. You are not a victim at all, so what need is there to talk about how the tables have turned?","This couldn’t be condoned. After defeating them physically, he still had to continue to torture them mentally.","What kind of person was this!"]},{"number":4769,"title":"Chapter 4769: Purple Shell Leaf","paragraphs":["When Ling Han threw out the ninth person, he discovered that the might of the lightning that the old vine had shot out had suddenly decreased.","He threw again, and again, and again. When he threw the fourteenth person, its might was extremely weak. Even after throwing the fifteenth person, it did not seem to have weakened further.","Right at this moment, a leaf floated down from the old vine. It danced in the air for a while, and slowly descended towards Ling Han.","Yi?","Ling Han swept an eye over them, and saw that those who had not passed out were all staring at that leaf, as if it was very important.","He wasn’t careless, and he used his divine sense to scan the leaf. Only then did he reach over and grab the leaf.","This caused everyone to involuntarily swallow, revealing expressions of envy and jealousy.","Ling Han was surprised. This leaf did indeed have a sliver of Genesis Substance, but it was pitifully little. Did you guys have to be so nervous?","Could it be that it could be used for other purposes?","Ling Han stretched out a hand, and retrieved the people that he had thrown out through the air. Then, he slapped them awake one by one.","\"Now, who can tell me what this leaf is used for?\" Ling Han asked. After sweeping an eye over the masses, he set his eyes on Luoyi Xingxiao, and smiled. \"You answer.\"","\"Humph, do you think I’ll tell—\"","Xiu!","Luoyi Xingxiao still wanted to argue, but before he could finish speaking, he was thrown out by Ling Han. Peng, he crashed into the withered tree. Instantly, the old vine showed its might, blasting out purple lightning, and what surprised Ling Han was that the might had actually become stronger again. Furthermore, it was stronger than at the beginning.","Yi, what the hell was this?","The others inhaled sharply. This guy was too cruel. He had clearly obtained the leaf, so why was he still torturing them?","\"Enough!\" Seeing that Ling Han was about to reach over, An Heming couldn’t help but shout, \"You’ve already obtained the Purple Shell Leaf, so there’s no need to deliberately torture others like this!\"","That’s right!","Everyone was filled with righteous indignation, and felt that Ling Han had really gone too far.","Ling Han shook his head, \"Are you guys retarded? I’m not from here, so how would I know what Purple Shell Leaf or Red Shell Leaf is?\"","Everyone’s aura instantly weakened. That’s right, this guy was too unfamiliar. Since he was not from this place, how could he know so much?","\"All right, I’ll tell you!\" An Heming said. \"Take this Purple Shell Leaf and walk forwards. There are still three ahead of you, and use the same method to obtain a leaf from each. Then, join up with the other team, and you will be able to open the mother vine and enter into the Pool of Genesis.\"","Pool of Genesis?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel a rush of excitement. This sounded like something good.","\"Come, come, come. Be more specific,\" he said.","Since An Heming had already started, he didn’t hide anything else. He revealed all the information that he knew.","As it turned out, the old vines they encountered here were all branches of a mother vine. There were a total of eight branches, and they were located in the two areas that could be entered from each Demonic Eye.","Obtaining a leaf on each of the old vines would allow one to pass through the mother vine and enter the Pool of Genesis.","After the Demonic Eye opened, it would be the weakest period for the mother vine, but it would only last for a few days.","Thus, they had to hurry up, and split into two groups. Otherwise, they wouldn’t be able to obtain all eight leaves in this time when the mother vine was weakest.","—If they could not get it now, then there was no way they would be able to in future.","And every time, the mother vine would only shed a single leaf. Subsequently, it would become incredibly violent, and there was no way to pluck a second leaf at all.","Ling Han gave an ’oh’. He looked at the old vine in front of him, and suddenly felt a sense of curiosity. Could he block that kind of lightning attack?","Involuntarily, he walked forwards.","\"This guy’s crazy!\" An Heming murmured softly. Even though they were wearing Silver Battle Armors, they didn’t dare to face the old vine’s lightning attacks head-on. After going berserk, killing people would be as easy as mowing grass.","\"Hehe.\" Ling Han paused, then turned to look at An Heming. \"Your warning is very reasonable.\"","This caused the others to want to beat up An Heming. It wasn’t easy for this bringer of misfortune to seek his own death, so why did you have to remind him?","An Heming also felt great regret. That’s right, why had he suddenly become such a blabbermouth?","Ling Han reached over and picked An Heming up. He then continued to advance.","F***!","An Heming’s expression instantly changed drastically. As it turned out, Ling Han hadn’t dismissed the idea of testing the might of the old vine yet. Meanwhile, he had become a human shield.","Heavens, was he shooting himself in the foot?","He was about to cry. Why did he have to blabber just now?","He wasn’t Luoyi Xingxiao, a guy who liked to argue with others. Why did he suddenly lose control of his mouth?","Ling Han slowly approached. Crackle... A bolt of lightning quickly struck over.","An Heming discovered that Ling Han had raised him up to block his front.","He was done for!","Being struck by such violent lightning, even if he didn’t die, he would be severely injured.","Yi?","It wasn’t long before he discovered that he didn’t feel any wounds on his body.","What was going on?","He turned around, only to see that the lightning had already disappeared. It was as if it hadn’t struck him at all.","Where did he go?","He looked back at those people behind him, and saw that all of them were dumbfounded, as if they had seen a ghost.","What was going on?","He hadn’t seen it, but everyone had seen it clearly. When the lightning had struck, though Ling Han had blocked An Heming in front of him, that had only been a feint to scare An Heming. In truth, he had greeted it with a punch.","The most terrifying thing was that this punch actually shattered the lightning!","Heavens!","How could there be such a monster?","With that kind of strength, he was completely capable of not plucking any Purple Shell Leaf, and directly rush to the mother vine, and barge in forcefully.","Zi, another bolt of lightning struck over.","This time, An Heming saw things clearly. Ling Han threw a punch, which landed on the lightning, forcibly dispersing this terrifying lightning.","Are you f****** a Great Emperor?","Otherwise, how could he possibly be so powerful?","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"Of course I am a Saint. If you don’t believe me, look at my holy flame.\"","He showed off his holy flame. It was orange in colour, proving he was a genuine Three Star Saint.","Everyone was petrified at this. This was a Three Star Saint!","This guy that was so strong that they suspected that he was a Great Emperor, was actually only a Three Star Saint.","Who could believe this?","After Ling Han took a few blows, he lost interest.","This power was indeed strong. It was just a step away from reaching the level of Pseudo-Emperor, but he was completely capable of withstanding it.","In the outside world, this was an extremely terrifying existence, but this was the Primitive Abyss, and compared to the natural storms of heaven and earth, this was practically child’s play.","He plucked a few more leaves, then tossed An Heming and the others at the feet of the old vine. In an instant, they were severely wounded and knocked unconscious.","Even if these people woke up, they did not dare to move recklessly. If they moved, they would be struck by lightning, and could only stay here obediently.","Ling Han and them couldn’t be considered enemies, but it was very likely that he and the 36 Divine Beasts were on opposing sides. Thus, it was already benevolent of him not to kill these disciples of the Great Emperors with his own hands.","—Most importantly, even if they were killed, it was highly possible that these people would be created again, so it would be better to trap them here."]},{"number":4770,"title":"Chapter 4770: Pool of Genesis","paragraphs":["Ling Han strode off, and not too long after, he discovered another old vine.","This time, he didn’t hold back and directly barged over. He allowed the lightning to strike him as he plucked a few more leaves.","Just like that, he advanced. In less than half a day, a massive withered tree appeared ahead of him, but there was also an old vine entwined around it.","The difference was that this old vine was filled with vitality, and every single leaf was exuding the light of lightning.","Its might could not be underestimated.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel an itch in his hands. He strode over, wanting to give it a try.","However, he discovered that this old vine actually did not attack him.","Yi?","He was taken aback at first, then realization dawned on him. He had Purple Shell Leaf on him, and had the aura of the old vine, so the old vine treated him as one of their own.","Fine then.","He walked to the side, took out the Purple Shell Leaf, and placed it on the ground.","It was fine. The Purple Shell Leaf had grown here, and could completely withstand the gravity fields here.","Ling Han then stepped forward again.","This time, the old vine was no longer reserved. Instantly, multiple bolts of lightning shot out, blasting towards Ling Han.","\"Good timing!\" Ling Han laughed loudly, greeting the incoming attack with a raised fist.","Zi!","It was only a single strike, and a charred mark had already appeared on Ling Han’s fist. He had used 54 eight-star Regulations at the same time, and he was actually still no match?","Ling Han was astonished. No wonder this was a mother vine. Its might was far greater than that of the branch vines.","However, would this be enough to stop him?","Ling Han brandished his fists, advancing bravely.","This time, he used the Destructive Energy. When the lightning struck, it was instantly annihilated by the Destructive Energy. Even if there was a sliver of remnant might left behind, it would still be a piece of cake for 54 eight-star Regulations to neutralize it.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and attacked aggressively. Very soon, he had arrived in front of this mother vine.","He discovered that the trunk of the withered tree was hollow, revealing a massive tree hollow that was as wide as three people could wrap their arms around. It was completely wide enough for one to easily descend downwards.","Was this... the Pool of Genesis?","Ling Han immediately entered into the tree hollow and descended.","In a short while, he arrived at the bottom. He saw that this was a small cave. It was not very big, and in the middle of the cave, there was a small pool of water. There was about a third of the liquid in the pool, and it was exuding a dense aura of Genesis Substance.","Ling Han looked pleasantly surprised. This was a great gain!","He was rich, he was rich now!","Ling Han thought for a moment, and first went to retrieve the Purple Shell Leaf. Then, he came into the tree hollow, scooped up a mouthful of pool liquid, and delivered it into his mouth, swallowing it without hesitation.","Weng, a sliver of great dao immediately appeared in his head.","By now, Ling Han was certain that this was an incomplete great dao. It only had Life as a cornerstone, and did not have Creation, Destruction or Death.","He naturally wouldn’t care. He simply observed the great dao, continuously extracting the Regulations.","At the same time, with the support of Genesis Substance, his body accommodated these newly grasped Regulations under the condition that he didn’t go through Silent Destruction.","Half a day later, Ling Han successfully accommodated a new Regulation, totalling up to 55.","However, Genesis Substance had also been exhausted, so he took another sip.","Again.","This time, one mouthful of Genesis Substance was already not enough to support him in comprehending another Regulations. Thus, he took another mouthful.","Two days later, Ling Han increased the number of Regulations he had absorbed to 56.","At this moment, he sensed an aura surging over from outside.","Brother Monkey and the others had arrived.","Ling Han wasn’t in a hurry to leave. He simply used his divine sense as a tentacle to observe the surroundings.","\"Yi, the other group hasn’t arrived yet.\" Someone looked left and right.","\"Hehe, we’re still the fastest.\"","\"Let’s just wait.\"","\"We can only do that.\"","This group of people sat cross-legged 300 meters away from the mother vine, not daring to approach any closer. Otherwise, they would definitely be struck by lightning.","Ling Han \"saw\" that Brother Monkey, the little azure dragon, and the large black dog had traces of being struck by lightning on their bodies. Moreover, there were extremely many of them, unlike the others, who only had one or two.","Clearly, they had suffered the same treatment as Ling Han and the others, and were forced to charge forwards to exhaust the might of the branch vines.","Ling Han immediately couldn’t bear it any longer. He directly stood up, and exited through the hollow.","\"Yi!\"","Seeing a person actually climb out of the tree hollow, Mo Ziyun and the others were all completely stunned.","There... was actually someone here!","How was this possible?","Every few million years, the mother vine would experience a period of weakness. They could each pluck a single Purple Shell Leaf from the branch vine. They definitely could not pluck more, or it would definitely go berserk.","And to pass through the obstruction of the mother vine, and enter into the cave, one would need to harvest at least eight Purple Shell Leaves.","And now, with four Purple Shell Leaves in their possession, how had this person managed to enter?","—The Purple Shell Leaves that had been left behind from the last time?","Sorry, once the Purple Shell Leaves have left the vine, it could only last for a month, at most. Then, it would definitely melt back into the heaven and earth, and would not exist in the slightest.","\"Who are you? How can you possibly have so many Purple Shell Leaves?\" Immediately, someone shouted at Ling Han.","How could Ling Han possibly pay any heed to him? He smiled at the large black dog, \"You didn’t succeed in showing off this time, and have instead been bullied, right?\"","The large black dog was extremely depressed, \"Who would have known that these guys don’t have the camaraderie of Sect Brothers at all, pushing Grandpa Dog into danger!\"","Hearing these words, Mo Ziyun, Ziyun and the others all felt disdain.","How despicable is your mouth? Don’t you have any idea?","’We are already giving the True Dragon Emperor some face by not killing you.’","Ling Han nodded, \"All right, let’s get our revenge!\"","\"Brat, who do you think you are?\" someone shouted at Ling Han. Though Ling Han was still wearing the Bronze Battle Armor, because he had returned to his original appearance, he was naturally not recognized by others.","\"You have a dirty mouth!\" Ling Han humphed, and with a flash, he had already appeared in front of that person. Then, with a grab and a toss, that person was picked up by Ling Han, and thrown towards the mother vine.","Zi!","The lightning struck, and that person only managed to let out a terrible scream before collapsing onto the ground. It was unknown whether he was dead or alive.","The chances of him dying were higher, because the might of the mother vine was comparable to 54 eight-star Regulations, or perhaps even stronger.","Everyone was shocked, because they had not seen how Ling Han had moved.","With just a blur of vision, he had been thrown out?","Not even the slightest bit of resistance?","Mo Ziyun stared fixedly at Ling Han. It seemed like there was only one person that possessed such powerful strength.","\"Ninth King?\" she asked. There was a hint of resentment in her voice, and there was also a hint of anger.","This was too much of a bully. He had tricked her, stolen her sword, and even hid himself in the True Dragon City without seeing her!","\"You’ve got the wrong person,\" Ling Han resolutely denied. Upon further thought, he definitely couldn’t allow his aura to weaken. Immediately, he revealed his viciousness again. \"Brother Monkey, Old Black, we’ll avenge our grudges, and we’ll avenge our grievances!\"","’Die!’","The four of them immediately charged out, unconcerned even if they were outnumbered.","Everyone was furious. ’You guys are underestimating us too much, aren’t you?’","However, as soon as they exchanged blows, they knew that the four people on the other side really weren’t underestimating anyone.","F***, they were too strong. They were completely outmatched."]},{"number":4771,"title":"Chapter 4771: Can rival Pseudo-Emperor!","paragraphs":["Ling Han didn’t waste any time, and soon defeated Mo Ziyun and the others.","\"Little Han, aren’t you a little too unfeeling towards the fairer sex?\" The large black dog pointed at Mo Ziyun, \"She seems to be constantly thinking about you.\"","You see, she had almost recognized Ling Han twice, though in her heart, the appearance of the Ninth King should be Ling Han himself.","Ling Han shrugged, \"At most, when you guys make your move later, be gentle.\"","\"Hehe, understood!\" The large black dog and the little dragon weren’t people who were willing to suffer losses. They immediately threw everyone toward the mother vine. Bolts of lightning struck, causing everyone to scream and wail in pain.","Thankfully, the large black dog and the others did not intend to kill anyone, and did not throw them too close to the mother vine. Otherwise, at most, only a few of the trump cards would be able to survive, and the others would all die.","Mo Ziyun was also one of the luckier ones. She was tossed in the outermost circle, and practically no lightning had struck her.","\"Come, let’s go in and absorb Genesis Substance,\" Ling Han said.","The eyes of Brother Monkey and the others lit up. They naturally wanted to increase their cultivation level as well. However, their resources were limited, so it definitely had to be used on Ling Han first. As for themselves? They would have to completely depend on hard cultivation.","Judging by Ling Han’s words, it seemed like there was a very great amount of Genesis Substance!","\"There aren’t enough Purple Shell Leaves,\" the large black dog immediately said.","\"It’s fine.\" Ling Han distributed the Purple Shell Leaves that he had on him first, and added with the four leaves that he had robbed from Mo Ziyun and the others, it was just enough to equip Brother Monkey and the others.","\"What about you?\" the large black dog and the others asked.","\"Me?\" Ling Han smiled faintly, and directly strode forwards.","Zi, zi, zi, lightning immediately appeared, striking out at Ling Han. However, Ling Han threw punches left and right, and the lightning bolts were all sent flying and annihilated.","\"Ah!\" However, the people lying on the ground were miserable. Being struck by the lightning that had been sent flying, it was really painful.","This made Mo Ziyun and the others depressed. Not only did they have to watch Ling Han show off, they also had to suffer lightning strikes for no reason. Life was really too unfortunate.","Ling Han quickly arrived at the side of the withered tree. Then, he turned around and waved at Brother Monkey and the others.","Brother Monkey and the others also stepped forward. They had the Purple Shell Leaf, which concealed their aura, so the mother vine naturally wouldn’t attack them.","Thus, the four brothers arrived at the bottom of the tree hollow.","\"So much Genesis Substance?\" The large black dog was immediately excited.","\"Come, come, come, don’t stand on ceremony!\" Ling Han said with a smile.","The four of them gathered around the pool. Then, they each scooped up a mouthful of Genesis Substance and placed it into their mouths.","Unlike Ling Han, though Brother Monkey and the others had ingested Genesis Substance, there was no great dao rushing out of their heads.","Was this a trait that only the Genesis World’s Master possessed?","This thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind, but he immediately put it aside, and also began refining.","The four brothers drank one mouthful after another, rapidly increasing their cultivation level.","Ling Han’s natural talent in cultivation was indeed heaven-defyingly strong, but Brother Monkey and the others weren’t weak either. With the help of Genesis Substance, they all grasped even more Regulations in a short period of time.","Theoretically speaking, this was enough to elevate their cultivation by a few levels. However, due to the unique nature of Genesis Substance, none of their bodies experienced Silent Destruction.","Even though their cultivation level hadn’t increased, this was a good thing that couldn’t be obtained even if one begged for it.","Originally, Brother Monkey and the others were still slightly inferior to the sons of the Great Emperors. However, with this opportunity, they should be able to catch up.","After all, there wasn’t much of a gap between them in the first place.","However, Genesis Substance was only icing on the cake, but could not provide coal in the <anno data-annotation-id=\"1e7b1366-af3e-4040-a820-87df91802a96\" data-title=\"snow\">snow 1 </anno>. After Brother Monkey and the others absorbed a few Regulations, they had reached their limit. They had to wait until their bodies went through Silent Destruction to be able to accommodate more Regulations.","From this aspect, they were considerably inferior to Ling Han.","Moreover, Ling Han had a feeling that after he had removed the Genesis World from his body, it was as if a lot of space had been vacated in his body, which could be used to accommodate even more Regulations.","In other words, even without the help of the Genesis Substance, if he cultivated in the outside world, the maximum number of Regulations he could accommodate would be increased to another level.","Brother Monkey and the others had already reached a bottleneck. They could no longer increase their cultivation level by depending on Genesis Substance. They had to take another step forward in appreciation of Regulations.","Thus, they didn’t ingest Genesis Substance anymore. That was purely a waste of treasures.","Furthermore, the Purple Shell Leaves on them was also slowly wilting. The mother vine was rooted here, and there were already flashes of lightning flickering indistinctly, ready to attack them at any moment.","There was nothing else that could be done. Brother Monkey and the others could only leave first.","The large black dog wanted to stow away some Genesis Substance before leaving, but it was impossible to bring a Spatial Spirit Tool here, so how could he stow anything away?","At most, he would only keep a mouthful in his mouth, but could it be that he would have to keep it like this forever?","Meanwhile, Ling Han continued to cultivate by the pool. He was already used to being struck by lightning, and had even developed a habit of instinctively parrying when he was experiencing the great dao.","57th, 58th, 59th!","The number of Regulations he could absorb was increasing. Though the rate of increase was becoming slower and slower, it was also very stable.","60!","61!","62!","Though Ling Han’s heart was as calm as an ancient well, he was also filled with slight anticipation.","70 Regulations was a dividing line. Once he crossed it, he would be able to match a Pseudo-Emperor.Any more than that, he would be able to defeat even a Pseudo-Emperor.","What was the greatest threat to him now?","It was not the 36 Divine Beasts that were all hiding in the Primitive Abyss, rarely showing themselves.","Nor was it the Lords of Death, because they would be greatly restricted, and could not easily make a move.","Instead, it was the Natural-born Gold Spirit!","This was a Pseudo-Emperor in itself, and added with being controlled by a sliver of divine sense from the Lords of Death, how terrifying would its battle prowess be?","Even if Buddha Doga and the others joined forces, they could only just barely block it. It could be claimed that this was the number one battle prowess of the Great Emperors.","The Natural-born Gold Spirit didn’t have any restrictions. It could go wherever it wanted, so the threat it posed was naturally great.","65, 66, 67... 69!","There was only one left, but the Genesis Substance in the pool would more or less be consumed completely by Ling Han.","Charge, no matter what, he had to reach seventy flashes.","Ling Han grasped this last chance, appreciating the great dao, extracting the Regulations.","When the light of great dao disappeared, his figure also trembled, and as his eyes opened, brilliance exploded. Pa, pa, pa, pa, it actually burst open even the Void.","It should be known that the structure here was extremely sturdy. Even if a battle broke out between Great Emperors, they would not be able to cause much damage. And now, he actually managed to burst open the Void. Just how terrifying was that?","Though the Void had only burst open for a moment, and immediately closed back up again, and there was absolutely no way anyone could enter.","The lightning struck again, yet Ling Han couldn’t even be bothered to attack, and allowed it to strike him. However, when the lightning struck him, multiple patterns of light appeared on his body.","That was the 70 eight-star Regulations formed into a net!","Ling Han was completely unscathed.","He stood up and came out of the tree hollow.","Brother Monkey and the others had already waited for a long time, and they all asked, \"How’s your progress?\"","Ling Han smiled, \"I can rival a Pseudo-Emperor!\"","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">A Chinese saying that means help delivered when you are in need is better than congratulations offered when you are successful.</annotations>"]},{"number":4772,"title":"Chapter 4772: Arrival of the Great Emperor","paragraphs":["Hearing Ling Han’s reply, Brother Monkey and the others were all excited.","\"Come, let’s go and have a great battle!\" the large black dog roared.","Ling Han smiled, \"Should I seek out the Lords of Death, or the Divine Beasts?\"","This immediately caused the large black dog to wilt. A Pseudo-Emperor was still not enough in front of Great Emperors.","\"Then let’s go deeper and search for Genesis Substance?\" the little azure dragon said.","Ling Han shook his head, swept his gaze over Mo Ziyun and the others, and said with a smile, \"We have to leave first, and send out the Battle Armors that they are wearing.\"","\"En!\" This made Brother Monkey and the others all nod. Whether they had Battle Armors or not truly made a difference in the Primitive Abyss.","If this batch of Battle Armors was transported out, more people would be able to enter this place and join the teams that were searching for Genesis Substance.","\"Also, I want to see if these people will be ’created’ after they disappear,\" Ling Han added.","The little azure dragon was even more curious if the True Dragon Emperor was also created.","If that was the case, then he would hate the existence that had created the True Dragon Emperor, because this was a great insult to his father!","Thinking back to the past, the True Dragon had been rampant in the world, and was called the Number One Divine Beast, but now?","He had been defeated by a fallen Great Emperor in just two or three moves. This was practically a great humiliation to the line of the True Dragon!","They captured Mo Ziyun and the others, then retreated all the way back, tying An Heming and the others together. Then, they exited the Demonic Star Lake, and returned all the way.","It was quite peaceful when they returned. They didn’t encounter the storms of heaven and earth, and in just two months, they arrived at the Dragon Head City.","With such a large number of people, how were they supposed to pass through this city?","Go around it?","No.","Because the Dragon Head City was actually built from a severed mountain range, if they wanted to circle around it, they had to cross mountains and ridges. However, this mountain range was too terrifying. There was a super killing intent, and it was not difficult for a Pseudo-Emperor to be killed. Thus, if they took risks by circling around the city, it was extremely possible that their party would be completely wiped out.","This caused Ling Han to sigh with emotion. A Great Emperor was indeed a Great Emperor. He had actually transformed a dangerous place into a city. His power was too astonishing.","Then, should they walk into the city, and then strut out?","However, they had brought a large number of disciples of Great Emperors with them, so it would be difficult for them not to attract attention.","\"In comparison, it’s safer to enter the city.\" Ling Han finally decided. \"I have the Imperial Weapon in hand, and now I have Pseudo-Emperor battle prowess now. No matter what, I should be able to block two to three moves from the True Dragon Emperor.\"","Thinking of this, the four of them were filled with confidence, and Ling Han was even more expectant. If he were to battle with the True Dragon Emperor now, though he would definitely lose, just how many moves would he be able to block?","They knocked Mo Ziyun and the others unconscious, then boldly knocked on the doors.","\"Lord, Lords!\" When they discovered that there were actually so many people wearing Silver Battle Armors, the guards were so shocked that their eyes almost popped out of their heads, and could not even speak properly.","Ling Han nodded, \"These Lords are all severely injured, and need to enter the city as soon as possible for treatment!\"","\"Yes, yes, yes!\" The guard hurriedly invited Ling Han and the others respectfully into the city, and then reported to his superiors. With so many disciples of Great Emperors, this was of great importance.","Ling Han and the others didn’t wait, immediately bringing people with them.","With their speed, they arrived at the other side of the city gates in a short while.","Once they exited these gates, they would be able to truly set out on the path to leave.","\"The Lords are here to do something, hurry up and open the doors!\" the little azure dragon immediately shouted loudly.","Seeing so many people dressed in Silver Battle Armor, the guards were already stunned. How could they dare to ask too many questions? They hurriedly opened the city gates.","Ling Han and the others exchanged a smile before leaving the city with their \"trophies\".","At this time, even if the city discovered something was off, when they chased out again, would they still be able to catch up to Ling Han and the others?","Moreover, the True Dragon Emperor didn’t appear, so even if they chased after them, they would only be delivering themselves up to die.","Boom!","But they were out of luck. They had not walked too far, when they encountered a storm of heaven and earth. Frightening meteorites descended from the skies, and even a Great Emperor would frown at the force of their impact. Naturally, they could only stop in their tracks, and even retreat.","After taking a few steps back, Ling Han suddenly frowned.","He could sense a powerful aura rapidly surging over. It would probably arrive in two to three breaths.","After him, Brother Monkey and the others also sensed this aura.","\"Haha, the True Dragon Emperor has come out of seclusion and caught up to you guys. You guys are done for!\" An Heming immediately said with a cold chuckle.","—These few people had already regained consciousness, but their cultivation levels had been sealed by Ling Han, so they were unable to resist.","Furthermore, the gravity fields here were too strong. Even if they were wearing Silver Battle Armors, they were barely able to survive.","\"Once a Great Emperor appears, all of you will die!\"","\"Humph, daring to kidnap disciples of Great Emperors, you guys are really outrageously bold!\"","These prisoners all smirked coldly.","\"What are you shouting for? Believe it or not, Grandpa Dog will kill all of you first!\" The large black dog’s eyes shone with viciousness, scaring An Heming and the others so much that they didn’t dare to make another sound.","This was called a wise man does not fight when the odds are against him. Once the True Dragon Emperor arrived, that clown would ultimately be unable to do anything else.","\"Little Han, what do we do?\" the little azure dragon asked.","’F*ck! This was a Great Emperor that was coming!’","Meanwhile, Brother Monkey directly drew out his staff. So what if he was a Great Emperor? He would fight to his heart’s content.","Yet Ling Han looked surprised, and did not answer.","Xiu, just how fast was the speed of the Great Emperor? In a mere instant, a massive Azure Dragon had already caught up to them, and appeared in the skies behind them. It was a dragon soaring in the skies, exuding supreme dominance.","\"True Dragon Emperor!\" An Heming and the others exclaimed in excitement.","After being trampled over by Ling Han for so long, they finally saw their savior.","The large black dog and little azure dragon bared their teeth. Meanwhile, Brother Monkey tightened his grip on the metal staff and was just about to charge out to fight.","\"Brother Monkey!\" Ling Han stretched out a hand and placed it on Brother Monkey’s shoulder, \"Leave it to me!\"","Brother Monkey frowned. Under normal circumstances, Ling Han could use the Imperial Weapon to exchange a few moves with the True Dragon Emperor, covering for their escape and allowing them to escape in time.","However, this was the Primitive Abyss. Behind them was a violent meteorite rain, and anyone who entered would definitely die.","Thus, if they fought here, they could only fight to the death!","Fighting to the death with a Great Emperor, what was the result?","\"Don’t worry!\" Ling Han laughed loudly, and actually took the initiative to charge out. With a leap, he had arrived in midair. With a wave of his fist, boundless energy entwined around him, turning into furious fists the size of a small mountain that ruthlessly crashed towards the True Dragon Emperor.","After obtaining Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess, he would also be able to break free from the extreme weight of gravity to a certain extent, and soar through the air.","The True Dragon Emperor humphed coldly, and stretched out a claw to parry Ling Han’s attack.","Peng!","The fist and claw collided, and a blinding light instantly exploded in the sky. So what if they were Saints? They could only feel their vision blur, and could not see anything at all.","However, everyone shook their heads internally. Fighting a Great Emperor head-on, just how stupid was he to do that?","’You’re seeking death!’","The large black dog, Brother Monkey, and little azure dragon were also very surprised, because Ling Han actually did not awaken the Imperial Weapon.","Hiss, would Ling Han be so arrogant?","Absolutely impossible!","Could it be?","The eyes of the large black dog and the others lit up."]},{"number":4773,"title":"Chapter 4773: Pseudo-Emperor Battle","paragraphs":["\"Ah, Grandpa Dog’s poor eyes have been blinded!\" the large black dog shouted.","This rendered An Heming and the others speechless. ’Are you f*cking too open-minded, or are you completely heartless? One of your people is fighting a Great Emperor, yet you’re still in the mood to joke around?’","This had already surpassed the range of despicable, right?","In the skies, the ball of light gradually dimmed.","Everyone’s eyes swept over the surroundings, yet they all looked incredibly shocked at the same time.","Ling Han was actually standing proudly in midair. He wasn’t as dead as everyone had imagined.","How was this possible?","How was this possible!","That was the True Dragon Emperor. With a single strike, the heavens and earth would collapse. If this was in the outside world, galaxies would collapse, one after another.","And now, the attack of a Great Emperor actually did not manage to kill Ling Han?","Heavens!","Everyone looked at Ling Han in shock. Could it be that this guy wasn’t a Saint at all, but rather a Great Emperor?","However, Brother Monkey and the others knew that Ling Han wasn’t a Great Emperor, but having Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess.","Being able to fight the True Dragon Emperor to a tie—at least, he hadn’t been defeated—what did that mean?","Right now, the True Dragon Emperor was only at the Pseudo-Emperor level.","Why?","Perhaps he had been severely wounded by Great Emperor Senluo, and had not recovered even until now.","If they knew that the True Dragon Emperor had actually been killed by Great Emperor Senluo once, they would have guessed that the True Dragon Emperor had probably been revived again. However, it could not directly reach the cultivation level of a Great Emperor, and needed to recover step by step. At present, it had only reached Pseudo-Emperor level.","But no matter what, the present cultivation level of the True Dragon Emperor was no longer capable of crushing Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, \"Fake True Dragon, hurry up and reveal your true form!\"","\"A mere Saint can actually possess Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess, truly remarkable!\" The True Dragon Emperor spoke up, his voice booming, reverberating throughout the surroundings.","What!","Hearing these words, Mo Ziyun and the others were all numb with shock. As it turned out, Ling Han was really a Saint, but his battle prowess was... shockingly Pseudo-Emperor-level.","Hold on, so what if he was at the level of Pseudo-Emperor? Shouldn’t he be a piece of cake in front of a Great Emperor?","They were both stunned and dumbfounded. Why did they suddenly not understand?","\"That’s right. You should be the savior that those old b@stards are looking forward to!\" The True Dragon Emperor nodded, \"Very good. After killing you, those old b@stards should give up resisting!\"","These words came out of nowhere, and Mo Ziyun and the others were completely confused.","What old b@starrds? What savior?","However, Ling Han’s heart throbbed wildly. The True Dragon Emperor’s so-called old b@stards... was he referring to the Great Emperor Wu Ya, the Battle Saint Emperor and the others?","Many, many years ago, these Great Emperors had already entered the Primitive Abyss in search of the opportunity to attain immortality. Meanwhile, Ling Han had also received a message from the Great Emperor Wu Ya, saying that the Primitive Abyss was in dire need of reinforcements.","Thus, connecting the two together, the words of the True Dragon Emperor were very understandable.","Sure enough, the 36 Divine Beasts were enemies with the Battle Saint Emperor and the others!","However, what exactly was the point of conflict here?","Was this still immortality?","It didn’t seem like it. They hadn’t died even after so many years, which meant that everyone had obtained the technique of immortality. Why did they still have to fight to the death?","Moreover, if the war situation at the front lines was tense, why would the True Dragon Emperor and the others be distributed in this relatively outer circle?","A dignified Great Emperor was actually only used to guard the city? Wasn’t that ridiculous?","Ling Han felt like his mind was in a mess. There were more and more clues, so how could the truth that he had pieced together become more and more ridiculous?","The True Dragon Emperor didn’t waste any more words as he charged over with his colossal body. He swiped with his claw, and it was as if a star were crashing down. It was as heavy as could be.","Ling Han was unafraid. He already possessed Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess.","Peng!","He replied with a punch of his own, greeting the attack of the True Dragon Emperor.","Everyone saw a scene that caused their eyes to pop out in shock. Ling Han was battling fiercely with a Great Emperor, and was not at a disadvantage at all.","This person was actually a Saint! How could they believe this?","\"Good one!\" Brother Monkey and the others cheered for Ling Han. They had watched Ling Han slowly grow from weak to strong, and even Brother Monkey, who had become sworn brothers with Ling Han on a whim, would never have imagined that Ling Han would actually become so powerful, and at such a fast speed at that.","\"Little Han, work harder, we’ll have roasted dragon meat and stewed dragon meat to eat tonight!\" The large black dog drooled loudly. It was well known that the most delicious meat from the skies was that of a dragon, and the most delicious meat from the lands was donkey meat.","The little azure dragon’s expression instantly darkened. \"Old Black, are you asking for a beating?\"","Ling Han laughed loudly, \"All right, we’ll eat dragon meat tonight!\"","He attacked aggressively, every move domineering.","The True Dragon Emperor was actually forced to the point that he could only parry, and this made him extremely depressed.","How could a dignified Great Emperor endure this?","He could be considered to be having a bad year. First, he had been thrashed by the Great Emperor Senluo, then he had been beaten to burst by Great Emperor Senluo. Now, his abilities had not recovered yet, and that was even worse. He was actually being ravaged by a Saint.","\"Ah!\" The True Dragon Emperor roared in fury. His dragon’s might boiled, turning into a terrifying shockwave.","However, what use was this to Ling Han?","Ling Han channeled the Destructive Energy and light of great dao at the same time, and a strong killing intent emanated from his entire body.","Today, he was going to kill an Emperor to prove his Dao!","\"What!\" The True Dragon Emperor looked stunned, \"A mere Saint can actually grasp the light of great dao?\"","In an instant, realization dawned on him. \"So, you’re the Stone of Life that those old geezers threw out!\"","\"I can’t let you live!\"","The True Dragon Emperor raised his head and roared at the sky. The soundwaves were like waves that spread into the distance in waves.","Hearing these words from the True Dragon Emperor, Ling Han’s thoughts instantly flew.","’Stone of Life?’","It should be the Divine Stone that he had come out of rfrom the Genesis World.","However, judging by the True Dragon Emperor’s tone, there should only be one Stone of Life, which later turned into seven.","—It was believed that the Stone of Life should have been obtained by Xuan Taiyu. However, after the battle between Xuan Taiyu and the Lords of Death, the Stone of Life was shattered into seven pieces, which flew to various corners of the universe, giving rise to seven Genesis Worlds.","Ling Han had long since suspected that there was a link between the Divine Stone and the Primitive Abyss, but he had never imagined that this was actually sent out from the Primitive Abyss by the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others.","\"Ang!\" As the True Dragon Emperor attacked, it continued to release dragon’s roars.","Ling Han, meanwhile, was solemn. With how terrifying the Destructive Energy and the light of great dao were, he had already suppressed the True Dragon Emperor. However, if he wanted to kill this Lord, it was not something that could be done in a short while.","However, this True Dragon Emperor had already sent out a call for help. He was sure that not too long after, the Azure Phoenix Emperor would arrive. In fact, Crimson Ape Emperor and the others would also appear.","If he were really blocked by the few Great Emperors, then no matter how powerful Ling Han was, his only fate would still be death.","Hence—","Ling Han summoned the Clear Bamboo Sword. It suddenly awakened, rapidly increasing his battle prowess. At the same time, he also released the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, increasing his defense and allowing him to penetrate deeply, only attacking and not defending.","This time, the True Dragon Emperor felt immense pressure.","It was equivalent to having to face a Great Emperor and a Pseudo-Emperor at the same time, and this Pseudo-Emperor still had a Pseudo-Imperial Weapon protecting him.","How was he supposed to withstand this?"]},{"number":4774,"title":"Chapter 4774: Slaughtering Emperor","paragraphs":["Ling Han’s attacks became fiercer and fiercer, one wave stronger than the last.","There wasn’t much time left for him, and the meteorite shower just happened to cut off the True Dragon Emperor’s path of retreat, giving him a chance to kill the True Dragon Emperor.","Otherwise, even Saints were difficult to kill, what more a Pseudo-Emperor.","Below, Mo Ziyun and the others were already watching dumbfounded.","Heavens, there was actually a possibility that the True Dragon Emperor could be killed!","Even if the True Dragon Emperor was now a Pseudo-Emperor, they still couldn’t accept this at all.","In their hearts, every Divine Beast was all-powerful and invincible.","Looking at this kind of battle, all of them felt their scalps go numb. How could it be that the invincible Great Emperor would be slaughtered today?","The True Dragon Emperor fought to the death. Firstly, he had already been forced to the point of no retreat by Ling Han. He had to dodge the meteorite rain even when he had been a Great Emperor, what more when it was only a Pseudo-Emperor that was fighting now. Secondly, he had already sent out a signal for reinforcements, and reinforcements should arrive soon.","Thus, what he had to do now was to hold Ling Han back.","Although he was extremely confident, Ling Han was still a variable that could slightly affect \"his\" grand plan. Thus, he had to be eliminated.","In any case, it didn’t matter even if he died. It wasn’t like he couldn’t come back to life.","Fight, fight, fight.","Ling Han also knew that time was of the essence. Even the Imperial Weapon and Pseudo-Imperial Weapon were summoned at the same time. He had to kill the True Dragon Emperor as soon as possible.","Boom!","He spared no expense, and even used the holy flame.","Once this move was used, his battle prowess instantly rose to another level.","The True Dragon Emperor’s expression finally changed drastically. \"Even the Destruction Origin Seed has fallen into your hands?\"","If it was said that there was only a slight possibility that it would affect his grand plan previously, then now, the possibility had increased tenfold!","The Seed of the Holy Flame was also called the Destruction Origin Seed?","No wonder its destructive power was so terrifying. It was also related to the word \"destruction\".","Ling Han humphed, \"Now you can go on your way in peace!\"","He had even used this holy flame, which meant that Ling Han was going to put his life on the line, and he had the upper hand in the first place. If he put his life on the line again, just how terrifying would his battle prowess be?","The True Dragon Emperor had nowhere else to retreat, so he could only face this attack head-on.","And right at this moment, the meteorite rain actually began to weaken.","This terrifying storm of heaven and earth was about to end.","The True Dragon Emperor looked pleasantly surprised. Once the storm of heaven and earth ended, he would be able to escape.","Though he could still come back to life, there was ultimately a price to be paid. If he could avoid death, he naturally would.","\"You won’t have the chance!\" Ling Han said coldly. He had already used the holy flame, so how could he allow the True Dragon Emperor to escape?","Hong! Hong! Hong!","He aggressively attacked, and the Imperial Weapon and Pseudo-Imperial Weapon bombarded him madly, endlessly smashing into the body of the True Dragon Emperor.","\"Wu!\" Even someone as powerful as the True Dragon Emperor let out a muffled groan. Whether it was the Imperial Weapon or the Pseudo-Imperial Weapon, being blasted by it would result in great pain.","However, what he was most wary of was still Ling Han’s own attack.","The holy flame, Destructive Energy and light of great dao were combined. The destructive power they formed was too terrifying, and even he didn’t dare to take them head-on. Otherwise, with his current cultivation level of Pseudo-Emperor, he would definitely die.","The problem was, were Imperial Weapons and Pseudo-Imperial Weapons weak?","After taking a few consecutive blows, the True Dragon Emperor was also throwing up blood madly. He couldn’t hold on any longer.","’Hmm?’","Ling Han suddenly sensed that an incredibly powerful aura was rapidly approaching from behind him.","The Azure Phoenix Emperor!","\"Haha, your time of death has come!\" the True Dragon Emperor said with a laugh.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"As a mighty Great Emperor, you actually need someone to save you? You’re not worthy of being called a Great Emperor at all!\"","\"Die!\"","He charged forward. At this moment, the True Dragon Emperor had been blasted several times by the Imperial Weapon and Pseudo-Imperial Weapon. He was at its weakest, so how could he possibly withstand the attacks?","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Ling Han threw three punches in a row, all of which landed on the True Dragon Emperor’s chest. The power of his punches entered the True Dragon Emperor’s body, and their destructive power was boundless. In an instant, the True Dragon Emperor’s vitality was extinguished.","Heavens!","Seeing this scene, everyone was numb with shock.","Slaughter an Emperor!","A mere Saint had actually performed the miracle of killing an Emperor, even if the cultivation level of this Great Emperor had already \"fallen\" to Pseudo-Emperor-level.","Mo Ziyun and the others could not believe their eyes. Even if the Azure Phoenix Emperor was rapidly approaching them from behind, they could not feel anything at all. In front of their eyes, and in their minds, they could still see the scene of the True Dragon Emperor being forcefully destroyed by Ling Han.","\"Let’s go!\"","Ling Han did not hesitate in the slightest. He picked up Brother Monkey and the others, then picked up Mo Ziyun and the others as well. Finally, he dragged the True Dragon Emperor’s corpse with him, and charged forward madly.","\"Humph, I’m here, and you still want to run?\" The Azure Phoenix Emperor’s voice sounded in Ling Han’s mind.","F***, the Azure Phoenix was actually a man?","Ling Han was shocked. This Divine Beast had revived, and actually changed its gender?","He mocked internally, then fled with all his might.","Shua, shua, shua! He continuously slashed out with the Clear Bamboo Sword. Sword Qi danced unhindered, and no matter what, it would be able to stop the Azure Phoenix Emperor for a while.","However, a Great Emperor and Pseudo-Emperor weren’t from the same dimension at all. Ling Han could kill the True Dragon Emperor, but in front of the Azure Phoenix Emperor, he couldn’t even withstand a single blow.","So what if the Imperial Weapon delivered an attack? With a casual flap of his wings, the Sword Qi that blasted out would be shattered, and it could be said that the obstruction to him was negligible.","Thankfully, no matter what, Ling Han still had Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess, so his speed had naturally increased to another level. Even if the Azure Phoenix Emperor was closing in on him, he could still maintain it for a while before being caught up.","Boom!","Right at this moment, the storm of heaven and earth came again.","A flame gushed out, turning into a spring that spread out in all directions.","Coincidentally, the location of Ling Han and the Azure Phoenix Emperor just happened to sandwich the spring of flames. Thus, the moment the flames appeared, they turned into a wall of fire, separating Ling Han and the Azure Phoenix Emperor on either side.","Even as powerful as the Great Emperor, he could only stop and retreat in the face of this storm of heaven and earth. Otherwise, he would definitely die if he faced it head-on.","Ling Han didn’t dare to breathe a sigh of relief. The violent flames were hot on his heels, and if he was one step slower, he would be caught up. It was guaranteed that even a Pseudo-Emperor would be burnt to ashes.","He ran with all his might, and the speed of the flames was actually not slower than him. They continued to close in on him from behind.","\"Little Han, hurry up and run! Grandpa Dog’s hair is about to be burnt bald!\" The large black dog was still screaming in pain.","Ling Han’s body was also boiling hot. Even if the flames hadn’t reached him yet, they had already caused him a lot of trouble.","He ran madly, and after running for a whole five days and five nights, the flames behind him finally stopped chasing him. They had already burned to the limit of their range, and the flames soared skywards, which was extremely terrifying.","Ling Han glanced at it, then turned around and left.","Now that the danger had been resolved, everyone naturally rushed on their own, and even if Mo Ziyun and the others had already recovered their cultivation level, they did not dare to make any rash moves.","Could they not see that Ling Han was holding the corpse of the True Dragon in his hands?","If they didn’t want to die, they had best listen obediently.","A few months later, they came out of the Primitive Abyss and arrived on the Four Origin Planet.","All three Pseudo-Emperors were nowhere to be seen.","This was very normal. They had gone to recruit other Imperial Clans, and this trip would take at least 400 years, and taking into account the time in the Primitive Abyss, that would take as long as 40,000 years.","It was still too early!","However, because Hu Niu, the empress, and the others had also gone to the Primitive Abyss, they soon returned.","\"Eat meat!\" When she saw the True Dragon’s corpse, Hu Niu’s eyes instantly shone brightly, and she drooled.","\"Haha, we’ll eat dragon meat tonight!\" Ling Han waved his hand and decided.","Everyone cheered. This was True Dragon meat, and it was Pseudo-Emperor-level at that. It was definitely very nutritious.","The little azure dragon: \"...\"","Why didn’t anyone ask for his opinion!"]},{"number":4775,"title":"Chapter 4775: Calling for help","paragraphs":["Ling Han reserved a portion of dragon meat for Buddha Doga and the others. He then prepared the rest of the meat and began cooking.","This was True Dragon meat! Even though it was only a Pseudo-Emperor, it was still emanating Imperial Might. Saints could not approach at all.","Ling Han could only cleanse the Imperial Might and harmful substances from the dragon’s flesh, leaving behind only pure natural energy.","Cooking this was also extremely slow. How difficult would it be to thoroughly cook a Pseudo-Emperor-level precious meat?","It was still because this True Dragon didn’t live up to its name, and its physical body wasn’t all that tough. Otherwise, if it was the one from the ancient era, even a Pseudo-Emperor could not slice open its flesh.","However, before the dragon meat was cooked, they discovered that the Primitive Abysswas exuding a terrifying aura one after another.","The Azure Phoenix Great Emperor, Crimson Ape Great Emperor, Flying Snake Great Emperor... the remaining eight Great Emperors in the first level all appeared!","This lineup could be said to be terrifying.","Eight Great Emperors. Even if these were inferior to the batch from years ago, their advantage lay in their numbers. It was guaranteed that even the Lords of Death would turn around and flee upon seeing them, not daring to face them head-on.","How could Ling Han still have the time to cook? He hurriedly stored all three planets into his body, including the Genesis World dimensions that he had previously split out. Then, he fled into the Void to avoid being traced by the Great Emperors.","If he were to battle against a Great Emperor, he would definitely be no match for it at this moment. However, it would still be no problem for him to dodge the search of the Great Emperor.","The eight Great Emperors split up, and began a search in the vast space. However, even if the Great Emperor possessed all-powerful abilities, it was practically impossible to find Ling Han in such a large space.","Ling Han waited quietly. A dozen over days later, he finally came out of the Void, and released the three planets and the dimensions.","Continue.","Ling Han became a chef again. Then, a month later, the dragon meat was finally cooked.","Eat!","As long as one had reached Saint Tier, everyone would have a share. This was Pseudo-Emperor-level dragon meat. It was definitely very nutritious.","However, even Saints could only take a small bite. Multicolored light burst from their bodies, and it was as if they were about to ascend and die.","Only Ling Han was completely unconcerned, and ate ravenously, not stopping at all.","After eating, everyone immediately began to sit cross-legged and cultivate.","This was the meat of a Pseudo-Emperor, how many people in history would be able to eat it?","Weng, weng, weng! Resplendent light continuously exuded from their bodies. This meant that they had all attained a breakthrough.","Ling Han’s improvement was also obvious. He had touched the ceiling of his cultivation level.","At the level of Three Star Saint, he had accommodated too many Regulations, which was more or less his limit. Thus, even if he still had Genesis Substance, he could not possibly accommodate more Regulations without his body experiencing Silent Destruction again.","The breakthrough this time could also be said to have come naturally.","Ling Han started to break through.","It took a very long time, and after a whole half year’s time, he finally managed to have another part of his body go through Silent Destruction, and advance into the level of Four Stars.","75 Regulations!","Ling Han believed that with his current strength, he should be able to exchange blows with Qian Yanghao and Xia Houping. When he reached the level of 80 Regulations, he would be able to match Buddha Doga. And when he reached the level of 85, or even 90 Regulations, he would be able to look down on the level of Pseudo-Emperor.","It seemed like he had found another way to rapidly increase his cultivation level!","It should be known that within the Primitive Abyss, there were still 35 Divine Beasts.","Unfortunately, these were all Great Emperors, and he was no match for them.","Hold on!","If the Great Emperor could also be revived, then didn’t that mean that the True Dragon Emperor would soon appear again?","If that was the case, they would be able to eat dragon meat again.","Ling Han waited for a while, then quietly entered the Primitive Abyss by himself.","Of course, just to be safe, he drew everyone into his body.","He arrived at the Dragon Head City and used his divine sense to scan the surroundings. However, he couldn’t find any signs of the True Dragon Emperor.","Was it because there was too little time, and this Great Emperor had not been revived yet? Or was it because he feared that he would fleece him again, so he might as well not revive here?","Ling Han couldn’t find out the answer, but he also didn’t find any new disciples of the Great Emperor in the city.","He was unwilling to give up, so he hid in the city, and observed if anything strange had happened.","However, after a few years, the eight Divine Beast Emperors returned, and the Azure Phoenix Emperor directly stood guard here.","Ling Han didn’t dare to stay any longer and quietly left the city, leaving the Primitive Abyss.","Now, it would become extremely difficult to enter the Primitive Abyss to search for Genesis Substance.","The beings there had already set their eyes on him. Previously, the eight Divine Beast Emperors had all come out to search for him, and now, the Azure Phoenix Emperor was guarding here, which made him extremely wary.","Hold on.","Ling Han suddenly faltered. Could it be that these Divine Beast Emperors were standing guard here just to intercept him?","Otherwise, just for the sake of mining, what need was there for Great Emperors to be mobilized?","He possessed the elements of the Primitive Abyss, such as the holy flame, Destructive Energy and light of great dao. Thus, those Great Emperors were very wary of him, and did not want him to pass through the many barricades to meet up with Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others.","With this in mind, the fact that the 36 Divine Beast Emperors were overseeing the core path that led to the Primitive Abyss could be explained.","Hiss, going by that theory, could it be that in the core of the Primitive Abyss, there were even more Divine Beast Emperors?","In the ancient times, the number of Divine Beasts was indeed not just thirty-six.","Ling Han gritted his teeth. He had finally dealt with a True Dragon Emperor after much difficulty, but why did the situation seem to have become even more dire?","\"I can’t go to the Primitive Abyss for the time being,\" he muttered. \"Those Great Emperors are definitely looking for me everywhere. F*ck, there are still the Lords of Death outside. Why do I feel like I’ve become a rat?\"","He couldn’t help but reflect on his actions. Had he done some heinous deed? How had he fallen to such a miserable state?","\"Little Han, I just received news!\" The large black dog ran over, \"Among those fallen Imperial Sons, several Pseudo-Emperors have emerged all of a sudden. They are presently attacking those Imperial Clans that have fled. Those Imperial Clans are all in imminent danger, and are seeking help from us.\"","Though there was no Galaxy Network, through the sequence in which the life tokens were shattered, Four Origin Planet could still communicate with the various Imperial Clans.","\"All right, send out troops to save them!\" Ling Han’s eyes lit up. He had just obtained Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess, and was just wanting to make a move.","The large black dog shook his head, and said, \"However, we’ll need at least 200 years to reach that place. By then, it’ll probably be too late.\"","Ling Han smiled and said, \"I couldn’t do anything before, but now, I should be able to set up a teleportation formation for an extremely long distance.\"","\"You can do that from so far away?\" the large black dog asked in shock.","Ling Han nodded, \"We’ll only know after trying.\"","Previously, there was nothing he could do, because he only had Saint-level battle prowess, but it was different now. His battle prowess had already advanced into Pseudo-Emperor-level. More importantly, he had a great many Silver Battle Armors in his possession. If he dismantled them and used them as formation foundations, they would be able to withstand the burden of super long-distance teleportation."]},{"number":4776,"title":"Chapter 4776: Breaking through the Imperial Formation","paragraphs":["Ling Han began to construct the Transfer Formation.","This was not much different from an ordinary Transfer Formation. However, because the distance they could cross was really very far, it naturally had extremely high requirements for energy consumption and ingredients.","You see, even a Pseudo-Emperor would have to expend Imperial Source to arrive at the destination, which showed how colossal the price was.","Ling Han’s trump card was those Silver Battle Armors. There was Genesis Substance inside them. Though the amount was very limited, if it was used to construct a Transfer Formation, there should still be a chance of success.","On one side, he was constructing, and on the other side, he was also communicating with the corresponding Imperial Clan, and similarly set up the sub-formation for the Transfer Formation.","—The Imperial Clan naturally did not have Genesis Substance, but that was all right. Whichever side one was teleporting from, that side would bear the lion’s share of the expenditure. Thus, Ling Han only had to bring enough materials, and construct a new sub-formation at the Imperial Clan’s side.","The key was whether he could be teleported to the right location or not.","In just a single day, Ling Han had already finished constructing the Transfer Formation.","Through the connection of their life tokens, the Transfer Formation on the other side was also completed.","All right, let’s set out.","Because he didn’t know if he could succeed, Ling Han was naturally the only one on the first mission. Only when he safely arrived would he send out a signal for Brother Monkey and the others to come over.","Of course, the fewer people that came, the better. To travel so far across the universe, the expense was really too great. Ling Han might not even have enough materials in his possession.","Because of their close relations, the first stop that Ling Han chose was the Donglin Planet.","Weng, the teleportation began. The formation foundations created by the Silver Battle Armor immediately emitted a shocking light, and then Ling Han suddenly disappeared.","He began to traverse through the Void at a high speed. In just over half a day, the Void passageway suddenly exploded, and Ling Han’s whole person was thrown out. Boom, violent energy surged, which was extremely terrifying.","Thankfully, he presently had Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess, and this was only slightly troublesome for him, but could not wound him.","Ling Han looked around. This was a world of darkness, but it was not an empty space. Instead, there were a great many stars, but they had all dimmed and extinguished.","He revealed a smile. Though the teleportation had failed, it had also sent him to the central area of the universe. It would be simple to find those Imperial Clan planets from here. It would only take a few steps to get there.","His divine sense spread out, and Ling Han began to locate the whereabouts.","...","On the other side, Donglin Planet.","Peng, they had finished constructing the Transfer Formation. This was a sub-formation, which had the effect of being a location to be navigated to. They were filled with anticipation that Ling Han and three Pseudo-Emperor would appear together to resolve a great disaster, but all of a sudden, this sub-formation actually exploded.","They were done for!","In the clan, the Saints and Venerates all wore ugly expressions.","These were the core members of the Chi Clan. At present, there were two Saints and eleven Venerates.","\"Ancestor, what are we going to do?\" a Venerate said to Chi Taiming. His name was Chi Xuan, and he was extremely young. He was only a few thousand years older than Chi Menghan. Previously, he had been the Imperial Son of the Chi Clan, but following Chi Menghan’s sudden appearance, his brilliance had dimmed.","However, now that Chi Menghan had \"married\", his status had also risen accordingly. He had become an important heir of the Chi Clan again, and was on the same level as Chi Dao.","\"It’s impossible for Buddha Doga and the others to arrive!\" Chi Xuan said. \"Why don’t we surrender?\"","Chi Taiming couldn’t help but raise his white brows, and said in displeasure, \"We’re the descendants of an Ancestral King. In the past, Ancestor ruled over an era and suppressed demons and monsters from the Netherworld, and now we’re actually going to surrender to these demons and monsters? Humph, how are we supposed to meet Ancestor after death?\"","Chi Xuan muttered internally. Ancestor had long since passed away. His soul had fused with heaven and earth, and even if they died, they could not possibly meet him.","However, he didn’t dare to say this directly, so he could only hesitate.","\"However, Ancestor, the army is at the city gates. If we fight to the death, it’s very likely that the entire clan will be destroyed!\" Another Venerate advised. His name was Chi Xiyue, and he was much older than the others. The whiteness of his beard was not the slightest bit inferior to Chi Taiming.","Chi Taiming was unmoved, and said, \"Menghan and Ling Han are together. I’ve already sent out news that if all the members of the Chi Clan die in battle, they’ll have a son with the surname of Chi! In any case, the Imperial Weapon can’t be seized, and in the future, when Menghan passes down the control technique, our Chi Clan can still start from the beginning again!\"","Chi Xuan, Chi Xiyue, and the others who voted to surrender all frowned. They didn’t want to die!","\"Ancestor, just how valuable is the Imperial Weapon? If all of us from the Chi Clan die in battle, who knows if Ling Han will ask Menghan for the method to control the Imperial Weapon, and take advantage of the opening to snatch the Imperial Weapon!\" they continued to persuade.","\"Humph, if you guys have so much energy to talk, why don’t you save it for battle!\" Chi Taiming’s tone was very heavy, showing that the old man was already very furious.","If it was not for the fact that these two people were his descendants, he might have long since killed them with a single palm strike.","The words of a Nine-Star Saint were no less than the willpower of heaven and earth, and you guys are actually still blabbering nonsense?","Boom!","At this time, a massive sound of impact rang out in the skies, and the whole ground was trembling endlessly.","\"Chi Clan, surrender quickly!\" A voice rang out. If one were to carefully distinguish it, they would be able to tell that this was Shi Gang.","Outside the imperial formation, there were 12 Skeleton Saint Tools standing behind Shi Gang. Meanwhile, he controlled the Imperial Weapon, the Demon Subduing Staff, to continuously attack the imperial formation.","He was shockingly a Pseudo-Emperor!","Pseudo-Emperor and Imperial Weapon. This lineup was too frightening. Furthermore, the twelve Skeleton Saint Tools were incredibly powerful, barging into the imperial formation by force. Even the imperial formation could only stop them, and could not damage them. It implicated a great amount of power, causing Shi Gang to be able to continuously weaken the might of the imperial formation, and it was only a matter of time before the imperial formation was completely broken.","He was not in a hurry. That way, he would have the thrill of a cat toying with a mouse.","He was a petty person, so once he became a Pseudo-Emperor, he immediately charged over to the Donglin Imperial Clan. He wanted to capture a few people from the Donglin Imperial Clan and use them to threaten and toy with Ling Han.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Under the powerful bombardment of the Demon Subduing Staff, the imperial formation was on the verge of collapse.","If it was just an Imperial Weapon, though the Imperial Formation could do nothing against it, it was also unafraid. However, added with a Pseudo-Emperor and twelve Skeleton Saint Tools, it was a completely different story.","Kuang!","After reaching a critical point, the imperial formation finally crumbled.","\"Hahaha!\" Shi Gang laughed loudly, his hand holding the Demon Subduing Staff, as he strode into the ancestral grounds of the Chi Clan.","In this world, who could stop him?","\"Unfilial brats of the Chi Clan, are you still not going to bow your heads and plead your crimes to me?\" He activated his Imperial Might, an aura that could drive one to despair.","Pa, pa, pa! Countless people fell to their knees. It wasn’t that they truly wanted to surrender, but rather that they couldn’t withstand the Imperial Might.","A Pseudo-Emperor still bore the name of Emperor!","\"Lord Shi, on behalf of the Chi Clan, we are willing to submit to you!\" Chi Xuan and Chi Xiyue immediately called out loudly.","In the present situation, if they were the ones who surrendered first, it would definitely be of great significance to Shi Gang.","\"Traitors!\" Chi Taiming couldn’t help but humph, and a cold light finally shot from his eyes.","There was no need for this kind of clansmen to exist!"]},{"number":4777,"title":"Chapter 4777: Pseudo-Emperor, Shi Gang","paragraphs":["Chi Feihong immediately moved, grabbing out at Chi Xuan and Chi Xiyue.","He was a Saint, so how could Chi Xuan and Chi Xiyue block or dodge his attack?","However, even though he had grabbed down, he was unable to withdraw his hand.","A disdainful smile appeared on Shi Gang’s face, and he said, \"Where did you get such courage to attack me?\"","Chi Feihong’s forehead was covered with cold sweat. Though the large hand he had stretched out was formed from a sliver of divine sense that was wrapped with Regulations, and was not his real body, it was still firmly restrained, and could not be retracted. In fact, it was about to be severed.","If this was really severed, then his spirit would definitely be wounded.","\"Humph!\" How could Chi Taiming just stand by and watch? He was just about to make a move.","\"Break!\" Shi Gang said calmly. Peng, Chi Feihong’s extended hand immediately crumbled, but there was no trace of blood. Instead, it was extremely pure energy that immediately returned to the heaven and earth.","He was a Pseudo-Emperor!","Moreover, even if he had not become a Pseudo-Emperor, with his aptitude as the personal disciple of a Great Emperor, he had long since been able to match a veteran nine-star Saint like Chi Taiming when he had been a six-star Saint.","Thus, in his eyes, the Chi Clan only had two things to rely on: the Imperial Formation and the Imperial Weapon.","Now that the Imperial Formation had been unravelled, in the case of Imperial Weapon, he would also have one in his possession that could cancel it out.","Then, in a battle of elite against elite, who could be a match for him?","Chi Taiming took a deep breath before proudly stepping forward to block his path.","\"If you don’t die from old age, you’re a <anno data-annotation-id=\"e9019821-c611-42c1-b135-9d1905a329d0\" data-title=\"thief\">thief 1 </anno>!\" Shi Gang sneered, his expression filled with mockery, \"When I swept through the universe all those years ago, who knew where you were! And now, you actually dare to brandish your weapons in front of me. I really don’t know where you got your courage from!\"","He flicked out a finger, and the Imperial Might surged. Peng, Chi Taiming was sent backwards, completely no match for him.","And this was still because he wanted to play around with him. Otherwise, how could the attack of a Pseudo-Emperor be blocked by a Nine-Star Saint?","Chi Taiming gave a loud shout. Weng, the Mysterious Ice Banner immediately flew over and hovered above his head.","Imperial Weapon!","Seeing the Imperial Weapon, Shi Gang finally showed a hint of caution. Even if he was now a Pseudo-Emperor, if it was a head-on clash with an Imperial Weapon, it would still mean definite death for him.","However, he also possessed an Imperial Weapon, so what did he have to fear?","Weng, the Demon Subduing Staff immediately shone with majestic light, and Imperial Might boiled like water. This was much stronger than Shi Gang.","The Imperial Weapons cancelled each other out, but Shi Gang was still invincible, what more when he had twelve Skeleton Saint Tools with him. Each one of them could drive a Saint to despair.","\"Lord Shi Gang, we have come to surrender!\" Chi Xuan and Chi Xiyue ran towards Shi Gang.","\"All right!\" A smile appeared on Shi Gang’s face. It was too easy to destroy a force, causing them to kill each other due to internal strife. That was what was interesting.","He suppressed Chi Taiming with all his might. Chi Taiming was no match for him at all, and he continued to attack Chi Taiming relentlessly, to the point that he was throwing up copious amounts of blood.","\"Ancestor, ancestor!\" the members of the Chi Clan all called out, all of them filled with grief and indignation.","They were members of the Imperial Clan, yet a nine-star Saint was still easily pummeled to the point of throwing up blood even though he had attacked with his Imperial Weapon. This caused them to feel extreme fury and despair.","What kind of world was this!","\"Shi Gang, you won’t be smug for long. When Ling Han becomes a Pseudo-Emperor, you’ll all be swept aside!\" Chi Feihong shouted loudly.","Ling Han, it was Ling Han again!","Shi Gang couldn’t help but feel his killing intent rise. In his heart, Ling Han was a forbidden name.","He was the personal disciple of the Great Emperor, yet he had been mercilessly defeated by Ling Han.","In fact, his fiancee was actually having an affair with Ling Han, causing him to feel like he had been cuckolded.","He couldn’t help but humph coldly, \"In front of me, what is Ling Han worth? Not too long after, I will deliver your heads to him. I really want to see what kind of expression he would have on his face!\"","Peng! Peng!","He moved, and with just two casual strikes, Chi Feihong and Chi Taiming were both sent flying, throwing up blood endlessly in midair.","And this was still because he had deliberately held back. Otherwise, he would definitely have insta-killed them.","He was naturally not being benevolent, but rather wanted to slowly torture these two people to death.","Don’t say, when they saw the two Saints being toyed with in the palm of his hand, the majority of them had lost all hope, their eyes dim, without the slightest bit of light.","Indeed, there was only endless darkness in front of them.","Peng! Peng!","Shi Gang had no intention of stopping at all, and continued to trample on Chi Feihong and Chi Taiming. He was going to torture them to death.","He had gone too far!","The Chi Clan elites were also filled with fighting spirit. Worse come to worst, they would all die. They were the Donglin Imperial Clan, and would only be willing to become ghosts that had died in battle, and not live to be slaves that would kneel in submission!","\"Die!\"","These people all rushed forwards, but with a flick of Shi Gang’s finger, they were either killed or sent flying.","\"Shi Gang, my brother-in-law will definitely kill you!\" Chi Dao spat out blood as he said this. A gust of wind from his finger had torn open his stomach, causing his intestines to spill out. He looked extremely miserable.","Shi Gang smiled balefully and said, \"I heard that your sister is one of the top ten beauties of the universe. Hehe, I don’t mind keeping her by my side as a maid!\"","He stretched out a hand and grabbed out at Chi Dao.","In this place, he was completely capable of giving and taking as he liked, and no one could stop him.","\"Retract your filthy hand.\" A voice suddenly rang out.","’Hmm?’","Shi Gang faltered slightly. Why did this voice sound a little familiar?","He naturally would not obey. As a dignified Pseudo-Emperor, he had a certain amount of say even in front of a Great Emperor.","His hand tightened, and he was just about to capture Chi Dao, but he suddenly realized that he actually couldn’t retract his hand that he had stretched out!","This naturally wasn’t his true hand, but a manifestation of his power of belief. However, wasn’t it a piece of cake for a Pseudo-Emperor to obliterate a planet with a single thought? He couldn’t even retract his manifested hand?","Hiss, who had made a move?","\"Who are you, sir?\" Shi Gang said calmly. \"Could you be a friend from the Primitive Abyss? Our GrGreat Emperor has said that we will not interfere with each other. Otherwise, the twelve Great Emperors would not mind making a move and turn the Primitive Abyss into a river of blood.\"","These words displayed the domineering nature of the Lords of Death.","In their eyes, the 36 Divine Beasts were nothing at all. It was only a matter of making a trip. With the 12 Emperors working together, they could easily crush them.","Thus, they had their own plans and those in the Primitive Abyss had best not interfere, or they would only be seeking their own demise.","\"Hehe, you wanted to see me?\" The voice rang out again.","\"Stop acting, get out here!\" Shi Gang shouted loudly.","\"Since you’re so eager to see me, I’ll grant you your wish.\"","A figure descended from the sky. Peng! He stood on the ground, tall and slender, his black robes fluttering in the wind.","\"Ling, Ling Han!\" The members of the Chi Clan instantly erupted.","Their savior had arrived!","However, elites such as Chi Feihong, Chi Taiming, and the others all frowned. No matter how strong Ling Han was, he was only a Saint, so how could he stand against a Pseudo-Emperor?","Shi Gang was initially stunned, but a cold smile immediately appeared on his face.","It would not be like how it had been before!","Previously, he had indeed been no match for Ling Han. The latter’s title as the strongest Saint of all eternity was definitely not just for show.","However, he was no longer a Saint now, but a Pseudo-Emperor!","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">A Chinese saying used to scorn an old person that lacks morality or proper behaviour</annotations>"]},{"number":4778,"title":"Chapter 4778: Blood from a Single Punch","paragraphs":["\"Where’s Buddha Doga, Qian Haoyang, and Xia Houping?\" Shi Gang asked calmly. These were his true opponents.","Ling Han?","He was not worthy!","Ling Han shook his head, and said with a smile, \"Do I still need those seniors to deal with trash like you?\"","\"What big talk!\" Shi Gang was about to explode in fury, \"I am a Pseudo-Emperor! Pseudo-Emperor!","Ling Han shook his head, \"Being so flustered and exasperated, and having such poor temperament, you actually managed to become a Pseudo-Emperor?\"","He activated his eye technique, and looked towards Shi Gang. He saw that there were eight regions in Shi Gang’s body that had gone through Silent Destruction, but there was one region that was incredibly active, and was self-contained, so he could not see it clearly.","There were far too few Pseudo-Emperors. Thus, the level of Pseudo-Emperor was not further differentiated into levels, but in truth, there were also weaker and stronger Pseudo-Emperors.","The cultivation of Saints was to slowly have their bodies go through Silent Destruction, so that they could be assimilated with heaven and earth, accommodating more Regulations, while Pseudo-Emperor was the opposite.","If one wanted to become Emperor, they would need to be independent of heaven and earth.","Thus, the cultivation of a Pseudo-Emperor was actually a reversal of Silent Destruction Tier. Step by step, a body that had gone through Silent Destruction was revived again, but it was not a simple revival, but rather becoming self-contained.","When the body that had gone through Silent Destruction nine times was fully awakened, then the stage of Pseudo-Emperor would come to an end, and they could truly attempt to break through to become Emperor.","In this process of destruction and revival, the change in battle prowess was like the difference between heaven and earth.","Thus, the Pseudo-Emperor had the word \"Emperor\" in its name, suppressing all Saints.","Shi Gang had now revived a portion of his body, which meant that he had just taken the first step on the path of Pseudo-Emperor, and to provide further description, he was now a one-star Pseudo-Emperor, and the limit was nine stars.","However, for a particular freak, this was actually not applicable.","—As long as Ling Han was given enough Genesis Substance, he could completely cultivate 99 eight-star Regulations under the condition of going through Silent Destruction four or five times. Then, he would be able to directly revive his body, and become a Pseudo-Emperor.","And because he had only performed Silent Destruction four to five times previously, when he was in Pseudo-Emperor Tier, he only needed to revive four to five times, and he would be able to reach the end of Pseudo-Emperor Tier.","Though the path he had taken would be shorter, there was no doubt that he would be stronger.","Of course, giving any Saint the Genesis Substance would allow that person to reach the limit of what Regulations he could accommodate without experiencing Silent Destruction nine times. Then, at the level of Pseudo-Emperor, this person would be able to reach the pinnacle even faster.","This was the effect of Genesis Substance. It was icing on the cake, and elites would become stronger.","Shi Gang= was furious. I am now a Pseudo-Emperor, and you still dare to look down on me like this?","\"Ling Han, just in time, you delivered yourself to my doorstep!\" He was only wary of Buddha Doga and the others. After all, they were veteran Pseudo-Emperors, so his abilities were definitely superior to them.","But Ling Han?","So what if he was the strongest Saint? Could he compare to a Pseudo-Emperor?","He waved his hand again, and grabbed out at Ling Han.","So what if Buddha Doga and the others were waiting on the sidelines? The 12 Skeleton Saint Tools were enough to block their attacks and buy him some time to retreat.","Humph, he would properly torture Ling Han.","He actually dared to cuckold him!","Boom! How astonishing was the attack of a Pseudo-Emperor?","A large hand blotted out the skies and covered the earth, as it brandished the Imperial Might. That was the strongest attack in the world.","Chi Taiming and the others were all looking forward to see which among Buddha Doga, Qian Yanghao and Xia Houping had arrived.","However, Shi Gang’s attack had already reached him, but there was still no Pseudo-Emperor that made a move.","This!","What was going on?","Right at this moment, Ling Han smiled and casually threw a punch at Shi Gang.","Peng! With a single punch, Shi Gang’s large hand instantly crumbled. However, the power of Ling Han’s punch didn’t dissipate, continuing to attack Shi Gang.","What!","Everyone was numb with shock. How was this possible?","Against a Pseudo-Emperor, not only was he not insta-killed, but he even had the upper hand?","’Holy f*ck!’","Shi Gang was also incredibly stunned, but when the attack came, he still instinctively retreated, dodging this attack.","However, he had still managed to capture Chi Dao with his divine sense just then, yet his divine sense had been trapped and could not be retracted. Now that he had taken the initiative to retreat, it was equivalent to him cutting his losses and directly severing this sliver of divine sense.","Though it was rare, he still felt a sharp pain, and blood was dripping from his nose.","This caused everyone to be even more shocked. One strike was enough to make a Pseudo-Emperor bleed; this was awesome to the extreme.","Shi Gang frowned deeply, and exclaimed in shock, \"Y-y-you, could it be that you have broken through to Pseudo-Emperor-level?\"","Otherwise, how could he have sent him retreating with a single strike?","Ling Han immediately said solemnly, \"Don’t speak carelessly. I am a genuine Saint!\"","If he was really a Pseudo-Emperor, he would either have already charged into the Primitive Abyss and created a massacre, or started an outright war with the Lords of Death. How could he possibly playing around with small fry like Shi Gang?","\"Really, you think too highly of yourself!\" Ling Han said bluntly.","Shi Gang almost went mad with fury. He was a Pseudo-Emperor.","Pseudo-Emperor!","Someone who had the word ’Emperor’ in his name, and possessed the strength to sweep aside all opposition in the universe, was actually underestimated by Ling Han?","Er, the other party had sent him backwards with a single punch. It seemed like he really had that kind of qualification.","Shi Gang trembled in fury, and exclaimed, \"Impossible! If you were a Saint, how could you have possibly sent me into a retreat!\"","No matter how renowned the name of the strongest Saint in history was, no matter how strong he was, he could not possibly match a Pseudo-Emperor. This was an iron rule.","Ling Han sighed, \"Though I disdain from proving anything to trash like you, who asked me to be a good person?\"","He drew out his holy flame.","Yellow.","This was a Four-Star Saint, and he was completely honest.","How, how was this possible!","Shi Gang was dumbfounded. He had already seen the holy flame, so what else could be fake?","Ling Han was genuinely a Saint!","Heavens! How could there be such a powerful Saint?","Moreover, if Ling Han was a Nine-Star Saint, Shi Gang would still feel slightly better. However, he was only a Four-Star Saint. This was a huge blow to him.","The dignified Pseudo-Emperor was actually inferior to a Four-Star Saint?","This would make him a joke for all eternity.","\"I don’t believe it!\" he shouted loudly.","\"Whether you believe it or not, what business is it of mine?\" Ling Han said calmly, \"Furthermore, you are about to die, so there is even less need for me to care about your feelings!\"","\"Humph, you still want to kill me?\" Shi Gang sneered. He gradually calmed down, \"Even if your strength is superior to mine, as a Pseudo-Emperor, can you detain me?\"","\"Won’t you know if you try?\" Ling Han smiled faintly, and took the initiative to attack.","Boom! He threw a punch, yet it unleashed 12 streaks of light.","Not good!","Shi Gang had no time to stop it, and the 12 streaks of light already slammed into the Skeleton Saint Tools. Peng, peng, peng! The 12 war machines were instantly obliterated.","What terrifying destructive power!","Though Shi Gang was angered, he was more so shocked.","He had already become a Pseudo-Emperor. However, even if he used his full power, he would not be able to damage the Skeleton Saint Tool. It was formed from the fusion of several hundred Saintly Material, and after sustaining an attack, it would be divided evenly among every piece of Saintly Material. Thus, unless a true Great Emperor made a move, even an Imperial Weapon or Pseudo-Emperor would not be able to damage it.","It was clear how powerful Ling Han was.","He couldn’t help but feel dejected. He was already a Pseudo-Emperor, yet he was still no match for Ling Han.","’Damn it! Damn it!’"]},{"number":4779,"title":"Chapter 4779: Pseudo-Emperor goes all out","paragraphs":["\"How can you possibly be so strong?\" Shi Gang gritted his teeth and said.","This kind of strength was practically defying the natural order.","Just look at all the previous Great Emperors. Which one of them could match a Pseudo-Emperor when they were Saints?","None. Even if they had become a Nine-Star Saint, they would not be able to do so.","However, it just so happened that such a freak had appeared now, and he was standing on the opposite side at that!","He had to leave.","He no longer hesitated. It was definitely not appropriate for him to clash head-on with Ling Han. He needed to find help as soon as possible. He believed that as long as there were two Pseudo-Emperors combining forces, they would be able to match Ling Han, and they still had two trump cards.","The Natural-born Gold Spirit, and Little Ye!","The Natural-born Gold Spirit was a nine-star Pseudo-Emperor. Moreover, he was controlled by the twelve Lords of Death, and he himself was inclined towards killing. His battle prowess was unfathomably powerful, and even Buddha Doga and the other Pseudo-Emperors combining forces could only barely match him.","Little Ye was even more freakish. It was unknown where he had popped out from, but being earnestly nurtured by the Lords of Death, his cultivation speed was astonishingly fast. He had even advanced into Pseudo-Emperor Tier one step ahead of him.","This person could control the flow of time, and cultivators of the same cultivation level couldn’t even make a move. They would either age unbearably, or become infants.","Even if he had now become a Pseudo-Emperor, he still had to resist with all his might against Little Ye’s flow of time. Would he still have any excess energy to resist Little Ye’s attack?","\"You’re only running now?\" Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"It’s too late!\"","Peng!","Sure enough, Shi Gang was immediately sent flying back the moment he stepped forward.","He shockingly discovered that the space around him had already been restricted by Ling Han.","Hiss, the other party should have arrived long ago, and the reason why he did not immediately appear was to set up a restriction, to prevent him from escaping.","This... he was really too scheming.","Actually, this restriction was not all that powerful. He was completely capable of breaking through it, but this would need time.","However, would Ling Han allow him to slowly break through the restrictions?","If that was the case, would the other party still need to deliberately expend effort to set up such a restriction?","He suddenly turned around, like a trapped beast, exuding the ruthlessness of a life-or-death battle.","Being able to be taken in as the first generation Buddha Son, he naturally had outstanding talent. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been valued by Ah Han.","Now that he was in desperate straits, it instead ignited his fighting spirit.","\"Come!\" Ling Han said with a smile. Killing someone who had no fighting spirit was truly boring.","No matter what, this was still a first generation Imperial Son, so a battle with him should be able to satisfy him to his heart’s content.","Shi Gang shouted loudly, and charged towards Ling Han. His hands moved like axes, opening the sky and striking the ground.","Ling Han parried casually, appearing to be extremely relaxed.","As he saw it, Shi Gang’s strength was only equivalent to when he had grasped 65 flashes of Regulations, but now, he had grasped 75 flashes of Regulations. Just how wide was the gap between them?","Ling Han didn’t even need to use any ultimate moves, and he was already completely suppressing Shi Gang, so much so that the latter couldn’t see any hope of turning the tables.","\"I’ll give it my all!\" Shi Gang shouted loudly. Boom! The Imperial Might he exuded became even more intense.","He ignited the Imperial Source, and went all out.","This was an extremely significant boost to his battle prowess. At this moment, it was as if he had removed the \"Pseudo\" character from the name of Pseudo-Emperor and transformed into a Great Emperor Particle.","—Even if this was the weakest Great Emperor.","In this manner, Shi Ganginstantly took the initiative, suppressing Ling Han instead.","\"Ling Han, you are only a Saint, after all, and cannot burn the Imperial Source!\" Shi Gang said balefully, \"Thus, you have made a colossal mistake, to actually force me to this extent!\"","Otherwise, as long as there was the slightest bit of hope, he would not have chosen to burn the Imperial Source.","He had just advanced into Pseudo-Emperor, so how much Imperial Source could he possess?","Thus, after using it this time, he would basically fall from the position of Pseudo-Emperor.","Ling Han remained silent. He didn’t face this attack head-on. Instead, he summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","Kuang!","Shi Gang’s attacks landed on the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, causing the precious tower to shudder. However, it was completely undamaged.","This was Origin Gold, and it was one of the most powerful among Origin Gold. Moreover, it had been tempered by the Metal of Creation, so it wouldn’t be an exaggeration to call it the number one Origin Gold.","Such a terrifying attack would naturally create a powerful shockwave. Even the Origin Gold couldn’t block it, but with how tough Ling Han’s physique was, he could easily disperse such a shockwave.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"Looks like you won’t be able to kill me.\"","Shi Gang gritted his teeth. He had already ignited the Imperial Source, yet he was still unable to suppress this opponent?","Hiss, had this guy been deliberately sent down by the heavens to anger him to death?","However, it was only an instant, and Shi Gang turned around. Without the slightest hesitation, he broke through the restrictions, and left quickly.","If he left now, he could still save his life. Although his battle prowess would drop from Pseudo-Emperor, and he wouldn’t be able to seek Ling Han out for revenge in the future, it was still better than being killed on the spot.","\"Yi, you were speaking so confidently just now, so why did you suddenly turn around and run?\" Ling Han asked with a smile. Phoenix Wings Divine Flight activated, and he quickly chased after him.","Boom!","Shi Gang’s palm struck over, but Ling Han didn’t take it head-on. Instead, he turned around to dodge, and then shot out a murderous aura attack.","\"An!\" Shi Gang roared the Six Characters Bright King Curse against Ling Han’s murderous aura barrage.","For those in Pseudo-Emperor-level like them, martial arts techniques were actually no longer important. It all depended on whose power of belief was stronger, who grasped more Regulations, and whose power was stronger.","The two streaks of power of belief collided, and Shi Gang couldn’t help but grunt. His face had also become slightly pale.","He was astounded. The strength of Ling Han’s divine sense was actually superior to his!","Heavens, physique, divine sense, battle prowess, and so on were all freakishly strong. How could heaven and earth allow such a being to exist?","He continued to flee, yet Ling Han tailed tightly behind him, preventing him from escaping.","After combusting the Imperial Source, his battle prowess had indeed increased greatly, but even if Ge Qianqiu had combusted the Imperial Source, he had still been killed by a Lord of Death. Furthermore, it was done from an endless distance away, which showed that compared to a real Great Emperor, combusting the Imperial Source was not of much use.","This was the same for Shi Gang. He was indeed strong, and could even suppress Ling Han. However, he was unable to completely throw Ling Han off his tail.","More importantly, the Imperial Source was extremely limited, so how long could he last?","He was battered and exhausted. After fleeing for a while, he suddenly turned around and charged towards Ling Han, wanting to catch Ling Han off guard.","But who was Ling Han?","Just how much battle experience did he have?","As soon as Shi Gang became fierce, he immediately avoided a head-on confrontation, and when Shi Gang was just about to run, he immediately stuck close to him, not giving him the chance to escape.","It should be known that after he had used the Destructive Energy and light of great dao, the destructive power of his attacks had even surpassed the Imperial Weapon. Would Shi Gang dare to flee at all costs while allowing him to attack him as he liked?","A few minutes passed, and Shi Gang’s aura suddenly trembled. Then, it declined rapidly.","The Imperial Source had been completely burnt.","Ling Han didn’t say anything. He simply clenched his fists and continued to attack.","\"Humph!\" Shi Gang sneered, and brandished his palm to parry Ling Han’s attack. His aura instantly increased by another large amount.","—His Imperial Source Source had not been completely burnt. Just now, it was he who had deliberately put on a pretence.","Ling Han also smiled. Could it be that he had not seen through it?","How naive."]},{"number":4780,"title":"Chapter 4780: Showing off","paragraphs":["After Shi Gang exchanged a few more blows, his aura declined again.","This time, he had really burnt the Imperial Source completely.","A look of shock appeared on his face. At present, he only possessed the battle prowess of a nine-star Saint, so how could he be a match for Ling Han? Furthermore, even if Ling Han was willing to let him go, this Imperial Source was completely burnt, which was equivalent to exhausting his flame of life as well. How much longer could he live?","If he could escape, then with the abilities of the Twelve Lands of Death, it wouldn’t be a problem to extend his lifespan. However, this was also the key. How could he escape?","Even burning the Imperial Source was not enough, what more now?","Shi Gang didn’t beg for mercy. Instead, he gritted his teeth and fought Ling Han to the death.","But as a nine-star Saint?","Hehe.","Peng, Ling Han shot out a punch, and Shi Gang fell down from space at an incredibly fast speed. With a loud bang, he fell heavily onto the ground, raising dust and dirt all over the ground.","He wanted to get back to his feet, yet he was unable to do so. He felt as if all of his bones had been shattered.","Chi Taiming, Chi Feihong and the others all gathered around him, all of them filled with killing intent.","Previously, Shi Gang had been so arrogant and domineering, but now?","The wheel of fortune had turned. He had not thought that he would be reduced to fall to their mercy so quickly.","Meanwhile, Chi Xuan and Chi Xiyue were trembling in fear, and they were filled with grievance.","—Why couldn’t you, Ling Han, have appeared earlier, causing them to be muddleheaded for a moment, and lean towards the side of the Lords of Death? And Shi Gang, are you a f****** piece of trash? You are a dignified Pseudo-Emperor, and you actually can’t deal with a Saint?","But what was the use of regretting now?","\"Ling Han, the wheel of fate is already rolling, and there is nothing you can do to stop it. You will only be crushed into pieces!\" Shi Gang spat out blood as he said to Ling Han who was slowly descending, \"You will definitely die, you will definitely die!\"","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, \"Everyone dies, and I won’t be an exception. However, when I die, the universe will definitely be at peace!\"","His words were filled with confidence.","Even if Shi Gang was filled with resentment, he was still intimidated by this confidence. For a moment, he did not refute.","Just when he was about to say something else, Ling Han threw a punch. Peng! He was crushed into a bloody pancake, and even his divine sense was unable to escape. He was completely dead.","He had killed another Pseudo-Emperor.","Ling Han was very pleased with his own battle prowess. He was only a Saint, yet he was already able to kill a Pseudo-Emperor. This proved his previous thoughts: when he became a Pseudo-Emperor, he would definitely be able to stand against a Great Emperor.","\"When I become a Great Emperor, I will be able to pacify the unrest.\"","The Chi Clan had survived a calamity, so they were naturally all glad. Added with the fact that Ling Han could be considered a son-in-law of the Chi Clan, though the wedding had not been held yet, now that Ling Han had obtained the battle prowess of aPseudo-Emperor, how could the Chi Clan not be happy?","Although some people had died, the Chi Clan still held a banquet, which could be considered a welcome ceremony for Ling Han.","In the meantime, they asked why Chi Menghan hadn’t come, and even asked if Chi Menghan was pregnant, making Ling Han blush.","After staying on the Donglin Planet for two days, Ling Han decided to leave. Now, there was not only one Pseudo-Emperor that had appeared on the side of the Lands of Death, but rather several of them. These Pseudo-Emperors would frequently set off in pursuit of the Imperial Clans that were fleeing, causing the Imperial Clans to be in imminent danger.","Ling Han also took the Donglin Planet into his body while he was at it. For the current him, there was really no difficulty at all. However, he was still unable to take in an Imperial Weapon.","It didn’t matter. Worse come to worst, he would just wield the Imperial Weapon.","He connected to the heaven and earth, and began to locate the locations of the other Imperial Clans.","In the universe, the areas with planets had basically been transformed into the environment of the Netherworld. Even Ling Han’s divine sense could not penetrate into this place. However, the Imperial Clans had naturally long since stimulated their planets, and fled towards the edge of the universe. Thus, Ling Han only had to search in this outer region.","However, this area was too vast, so Ling Han would still need some time.","\"I found one.\"","\"I found another one.\"","\"...\"","Ling Han continuously located those Imperial Clans, but as long as they had not been targeted by the Lands of Death, Ling Han naturally would not move out either.","En.","Ling Han suddenly stood up, and Phoenix Wings Divine Flight unleashed. With a xiu, he broke through space.","The flaming wings flapped, and less than half a day later, Ling Han appeared in the Void. A massive star appeared in front of him, but it was obvious that a great battle had broken out. The Netherworld was launching a large-scale invasion.","This was the Demon Ox Imperial Clan.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over, and saw that the Netherworld being leading the team was Lin Dong, the son of Fire Clouds Ancestral King.","This guy had also become a Pseudo-Emperor. With the Fire Clouds Sword in hand, he slashed down repeatedly, heading towards the Demon Ox Planet.","Thankfully, there was an Imperial Formation on the Demon Ox Planet. Every time the Sword Qi slashed down, a spherical shield of light would appear, enshrouding the entire planet and dispersing the attacks of the Imperial Weapon.","Theoretically speaking, there was an inexhaustible supply of energy for the Imperial Formation, unlike the Imperial Weapon, which could only be activated for a short period of time. It was the most reliable defense system in the world.","However, it was a Pseudo-Emperor that was controlling the Imperial Weapon!","This was completely different. Though a Pseudo-Emperor did not have the might of a Great Emperor, it was completely no problem for one to support the continuous channelling of the Imperial Weapon. Furthermore, Lin Dong also had the help of six Skeleton Saint Tools, which was even more terrifying. They held back a great deal of the might of the Imperial Formation, allowing Lin Dong to gain the upper hand.","Not too long after, he would be able to break through the imperial formation, and penetrate straight in.","Ling Han humphed, and directly charged over.","\"Ling Han?\" When Lin Dong saw Ling Han, he couldn’t help but be startled.","Yi, the person that the Lands of Death wanted to kill the most was Ling Han, but he could not be found anywhere. In fact, the Lords of Death had attacked Ling Han time and time again, and Ling Han had managed to escape. He had not thought that Ling Han would actually appear on his own volition.","After being stunned for a moment, Lin Dong laughed loudly.","This brat definitely did not know that he had already advanced into Pseudo-Emperor-level, and thought that he was a Saint. Thus, he charged out without any reservations.","Haha, alright, I’ll give you a surprise.","\"You’re quite bold, daring to appear in front of me!\" Lin Dong said proudly.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"What is it? Could it be that you have become Emperor?\"","Precisely.","Lin Dong thought to himself, but his expression did not change, \"If I have become Emperor, would you still have a way out?\"","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"Then you should ask the Lords of Death. They’re more experienced.\"","’F*ck! You’re far too arrogant!’","Lin Dong cursed internally, but for the sake of an even greater surprise, he endured it, and said, \"Against trash like you, there is no need for the Great Emperors to move. I am enough to deal with you.\"","\"Come.\" Ling Han crooked a finger at him.","At this time, because Lin Dong stopped attacking the imperial formation, the members of the Demon Ox Imperial Clan also appeared.","Lin Dong was afraid that these people would expose his cultivation level, so he didn’t waste any more time and directly charged towards Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and replied with a punch.","\"No!\" the members of the Demon Ox Imperial Clan all shouted.","But how fast was the attack of a Pseudo-Emperor?","Shua, Lin Dong didn’t use the Fire Cloud Sword. He merely delivered a palm strike, yet it was as if it was a sharp blade that could slide open heaven and earth, arriving with a single thought.","Peng!","Ling Han’s fist landed on the tip of Lin Dong’s palm, and the two of them exchanged a head-on blow without any fancy moves.","They were done for!","The members of the Demon Ox Imperial Clan all closed their eyes. Fighting head-on with a Pseudo-Emperor was completely courting death."]},{"number":4781,"title":"Chapter 4781: Surprised?","paragraphs":["\"What!\"","An exclamation of shock, filled with disbelief.","Lin Dong stared dumbly at Ling Han’s smiling expression. At this moment, too many thoughts surged through his mind, and he didn’t know how to express them.","’Holy f*ck!’","He had become a Pseudo-Emperor, and wanted to bully Ling Han who was ignorant of this. He wanted to use this to trick him, and give Ling Han a big \"surprise\".","However, he had never imagined that he would be the one who would be surprised!","\"Are you surprised? Shocked?\" Ling Han asked with a smile.","How experienced was he? Furthermore, it had always been him that was showing off, and this guy actually wanted to show off in front of him?","Hehe, then he would only be shocked.","Lin Dong was were still speechless. He had really been frightened.","Ling Han was... a Pseudo-Emperor?","Hiss, when this guy was a Saint, he was already known as the strongest in all eternity, and now that he had become a Pseudo-Emperor... he should also be able to sweep aside all opposition at the level of Pseudo-Emperor.","All of a sudden, his whole body was covered with cold sweat.","\"Ling Han!\" Below them, the members of the Demon Ox Imperial Clan called out again, but this time, they were filled with pleasant surprise.","As it turned out, Ling Han had already become a Pseudo-Emperor.","\"Don’t misunderstand. I am still a Saint,\" Ling Han explained. You see, he has always been an honest person.","\"Do you think I’ll believe you?\" Lin Dong said coldly.","F***, who are you trying to fool? Being able to take a blow from me, and you actually call yourself a Saint? How could there be a Saint as shameless as you?","Speaking of shamelessness, where was that despicable dog?","Lin Dong couldn’t help but be distracted. Moreover, his thoughts had still been led astray at this moment. This was a clear sign of just how despicable the large black dog was.","Ling Han sighed, and took the initiative to show the holy flame.","Yellow represented a Four-Star Saint.","’Holy f*ck!’","This time, Lin Dong was truly shocked.","Ling Han really was a Saint.","Heavens!","A mere Four-Star Saint was actually capable of fighting him head-on. How could there be such a freak?","He looked at Ling Han, and understood that Ling Han wasn’t trying to kindly explain things to him. He was clearly trying to scare him.","And what was disappointing was that he had indeed been frightened.","Really, even if the same thing happened a hundred more times, he would still be shocked.","A Four-Star Saint was capable of fighting a Pseudo-Emperor; what kind of concept was that?","Beneath them, the members of the Demon Ox Imperial Clan were also shocked.","As it turned out, Ling Han was really a Saint. However, this was even more frightening than if Ling Han had become a Pseudo-Emperor.","Heavens! Heavens! Heavens!","At this moment, everyone was numb with shock, their minds blank. Only the six Skeleton Saint Tools were still attacking dutifully. They had no emotions.","\"Humph!\"","Ling Han’s figure moved, and with a flap of his fiery wings, he had instantly arrived in front of a Skeleton Saint Tool. Then, he shot out a kick.","Peng! Without a doubt, the Skeleton Saint Tool instantly exploded into pieces like an egg.","Ling Han didn’t stop at all. He kicked again, and again. After six consecutive kicks, the six Skeleton Saint Tools were all destroyed.","’Holy f*ck!’","This caused the members of the Demon Ox Imperial Clan to inhale sharply. It wasn’t like they didn’t know how powerful this Skeleton Saint Tool was. Even a nine-star Saint couldn’t defeat it, and the Imperial Weapon could only blast it backwards, unable to damage it. But in Ling Han’s case, f***, he was practically destroying everything in his path.","The strongest Saint in history?","These words were probably no longer enough to describe how powerful Ling Han was.","When Ling Han obliterated the six Skeleton Saint Tools, Lin Dong finally came back to his senses.","Ling Han really did possess a Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess, though he was only a puny four-star Saint.","\"I can’t let you live!\" He immediately charged over.","Ling Han smiled, and confronted Lin Dong head-on.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The moment the two of them exchanged blows, Lin Dong was at a disadvantage. He was no match for Ling Hanhui at all.","Lin Dong’s expression changed drastically. Though he was only a One Star Pseudo-Emperor, with the word ’Emperor’, he should be able to crush all life, and be invincible in this world.","How could he be inferior to a mere Four-Star Saint?","He could not understand, and could not accept either.","The position of Emperor noble and lofty, crushing everything. This level could only be seen, but could not be reached. Why did this logic not apply in this era?","Hong! Hong! Hong!","However, Ling Han’s fists rained down like mad, not giving Lin Dong any chance to catch his breath.","Lin Dong had no choice but to summon his Fire Cloud Sword to block Ling Han’s violent attacks.","He knew that Ling Han also possessed an Imperial Weapon. Thus, he didn’t dare to continue fighting at all. He immediately turned around and fled.","This time, Ling Han was unable to set up any restrictions, so he was naturally unable to stop Lin Dong from fleeing.","He gave chase, and Lin Dong didn’t linger in battle at all. He ran as fast as he could.","This made Lin Dong extremely sullen.","He was a Pseudo-Emperor. In history, had there ever been such a miserable Pseudo-Emperor that had to flee in panic? In fact, the person who was hunting him down was actually only a Saint.","As he pursued, it wasn’t long before Lin Dong entered the Netherworld. Ling Han also immediately sensed a terrifying divine sense surging over.","A Lord of Death!","Ling Han finally understood. In reality, the Lords of Death were already Yin souls. Thus, they were much more at home in the Netherworld. On the other hand, the Living Realm was completely incompatible with them.","Thus, once he entered the Netherworld, Lin Dong would be able to communicate with the Lands of Death, and the person he contacted... would naturally be the Fire Clouds Ancestral King.","Ling Han didn’t hesitate in the slightest. He immediately turned around and fled.","Boom!","Just as he rushed out of the Netherworld, he saw flames surging behind him, turning into a massive cloud of flames.","A large hand suddenly stretched out, grabbing out at Ling Han.","The Fire Cloud Ancestral King made his move.","A Great Emperor was a Great Emperor.","Ling Han couldn’t help but sigh. He clearly hadn’t appeared, and he was even in a weak state. However, this attack was still indescribably terrifying. It wasn’t something that a Pseudo-Emperor could withstand.","Weng, the Clear Bamboo Sword revived, and Ling Han slashed out with his sword.","The Sword Qi slashed onto the giant flaming hand, and immediately crumbled. Meanwhile, the giant flaming hand only paused slightly, and then grabbed out at Ling Han.","Boom, the Sword Qi shattered, forming a powerful rebound, causing Ling Han’s chest to boil.","Thankfully, his present physique was too tough. This shockwave was naturally no big deal, and was not enough to cause any damage to him.","Ling Han used the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, his speed extremely fast.","The Fire Cloud Ancestral King didn’t pursue him any further. He only revealed two massive eyes in the fiery clouds, which were even larger than stars. However, these eyes soon disappeared.","If he could not kill Ling Han, even a Lord of Death would not be willing to rashly awaken and hunt him down.","Ling Han ran madly, and returned to the Demon Ox Planet. Without another word, he also took the Demon Ox Planet into his body, and began to move it.","After a long time, he finally came out of the Void and released the Demon Ox Planet and Donglin Planet.","Ling Han didn’t construct another Transfer Formation for the ultra-long distance. It was too unstable, and could easily explode. Aside from him, even the physique of the little azure dragon wasn’t strong enough to withstand the energy shockwave from the explosion of the Void. Thus, it was best to wait until he made more adjustments to ensure his safety.","Only a day later, Ziwei Imperial Clan sent out a message for help.","Though Ling Han really did not like the Baili Clan, it was the Netherworld that was invading now, so he still had to prioritize the overall situation. Furthermore, Ling Han wanted to take advantage of this opportunity to kill a few more fallen Imperial Sons, and destroy even more Skeleton Saint Tools. Thus, he still went on his way."]},{"number":4782,"title":"Chapter 4782: Betrayal","paragraphs":["This trip to the Ziwei Imperial Clan was only half a day’s journey, and Ling Han walked out of the Void.","With Ling Han’s cautious nature, he naturally wouldn’t charge over just like that. He released his divine sense and wrapped it around the Ziwei Planet.","This time, the leader of the team was Di Wuji. He had also shockingly become a Pseudo-Emperor.","Yi, why did it seem like Pseudo-Emperors had become wholesale?","These were all the children of Great Emperors, and they had also appeared repeatedly in the long passage of history to train themselves. Naturally, all of them had outstanding natural talent, and had incredibly deep foundations.","However, the title of Emperor had held back who knew how many people since ancient times. Furthermore, Imperial Clans were unable to produce another Great Emperor, which was like a curse.","Thus, Ling Han wouldn’t find it strange if one or at most two of the Fallen Imperial Sons became Pseudo-Emperors. Instead, he would think that it was a natural course of events.","However, any fallen Imperial Son had actually become Pseudo-Emperors. This was something that Ling Han could not accept.","Could there be some kind of trick to this?","A heaven-defying treasure?","This was very possible. The Lords of Death had ventured deep into the Primitive Abyss before, and in the place where heaven and earth began, there were really too many treasures.","Just look at Ling Han. If he hadn’t come from the Genesis World, would he have been as freakish as he was now?","To say nothing of natural talent, among those who had been able to become Great Emperors since ancient times, whose natural talent would be inferior?","Moreover, Ding Shu and the others were also masters of their own Genesis World, so why couldn’t they compare to Ling Han?","Wasn’t it because they had obtained too few treasures from the Primitive Abyss?","Thus, it was not the slightest bit false that the treasures in the Primitive Abyss could defy the heavens and change one’s fate.","Multiple thoughts streaked through Ling Han’s mind, but in the end, they all turned into raging fighting spirit.","He wanted to destroy all of the Skeleton Saint Tools, and kill as many of the fallen Imperial Sons as possible. Then, he would slowly recover the lost territory.","The Twelve Lands of Death transforming the Living Realm into the environment of the Netherworld must be a massive scheme, and he definitely had to stop it.","Xiu, Ling Han’s figure landed, and hecould see that a bloody massacre was presently taking place here. The imperial formation had already been breached, and the Ziwei Imperial Clan was being massacred. Corpses lay all over the ground, looking extremely tragic.","Peng!","Ling Han immediately lashed out, unleashing a punch that smashed a Skeleton Saint Tool into smithereens.","\"Ling Han!\" His aggressive attack immediately attracted the attention of those nearby, drawing a wave of shouts.","The only difference was that the Ziwei Imperial Clan was filled with delighted cries, and when it came to Di Wuji’s side, it turned into a low growl filled with hatred.","\"Little wolf pup, long time no see,\" Ling Han said with a wave of his hand. However, he didn’t stop, and he continued to throw punches at the Skeleton Saint Tool. A dazzling column of light shot into the air, and another Skeleton Saint Tool was obliterated.","Di Wuji, on the other hand, was not in a rush to make a move. He merely stared coldly at Ling Han, killing intent seeping from his eyes.","A long time ago, he actually had the chance to kill Ling Han, but at that time, how could he take Ling Han seriously?","Unexpectedly, not only was he no match for Ling Han, even the Lord of Death had failed to kill Ling Han after several attempts.","This made him feel extremely displeased. An Imperial Son should have been able to do as he liked in this world, and he was now a Pseudo-Emperor, but in front of Ling Han, he did not feel the slightest bit of superiority.","However!","He humphed, \"Ling Han, today will be the day of your death!\"","\"Oh?\" Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Why are you so confident?\"","\"Because this is a trap set up against you!\" Another voice rang out. This was... Yang Yihuan. He had shockingly also become a Pseudo-Emperor.","\"Hehe.\" He Luo also appeared. He was also a Pseudo-Emperor.","The twelve Imperial Sons from the Twelve Lands of Death were all Pseudo-Emperors?","\"You’ve had enough. A mere Saint can actually force us Pseudo-Emperors to besiege you!\" Wu Xingtong said, her beautiful eyes shooting out a powerful killing intent.","Ling Han smiled faintly and shook his head, saying, \"Merely cats and dogs like you are nothing but trash in my eyes! Forget it, it would be better to play your true trump card!\"","This made Yang Yihuan and the others extremely angry and embarrassed, yet they couldn’t refute it.","Ling Han indeed had the right to do so.","\"Hehe, Ling Han, Lyou really are a person that is skilled in performing miracles.\" A short figure appeared, but it was a child that looked to be only about eleven or twelve years old.","Little Ye!","He cocked his head as he looked at Ling Han, looking completely innocent.","Only now did a serious expression appear on Ling Han’s face. This child was really too strange. When he was a Saint, he was already able to play around with Brother Monkey, the large black dog and the others. If it was not for the fact that he had grasped the light of great dao, he probably would not have been able to escape this calamity either. He could be considered a trump card on the side of the Lands of Death.","Now, Little Ye had also become a Pseudo-Emperor, and who knew how far his Mystical Power that allowed him to manipulate the flow of time had improved. Ling Han had no choice but to treat him seriously.","\"And the other one?\" he asked calmly, \"Since I have already fallen into the trap, what need is there for him to continue hiding?\"","\"Hehe, Iron Pillar, come out.\" Little Ye waved a hand. Weng, a terrifying murderous aura swept out, and a metallic figure appeared in front of them.","Natural-born Gold Spirit!","This was really a grand display. The side of the Lands of Death had mobilized a total of seven Pseudo-Emperors to besiege Ling Han, and among them, there was also such a deadly weapon like Little Ye and the Natural-born Gold Spirit.","Even if it was Buddha Doga, Qian Yanghao, and Xia Houping here, they would probably frown deeply.","Ling Han looked at Baili Haojie, shook his head, and said, \"As the son of the Great Emperor, you’re colluding with the enemy. How can you face Great Emperor Ziwei?\"","Baili Haoji looked furious, and shouted, \"What nonsense are you spouting?\"","Ling Han scoffed, \"To trick me into coming here, how could your Baili Clan not have participated?\"","Baili Haojie humphed, \"If our Baili Clan was also involved, how could so many people have died?\"","\"That’s why I said, you’re quite ruthless!\" Ling Han said slowly.","When his words fell, a great many members of the Baili Clan erupted.","\"Second Elder, is this real?\" they all asked.","As long as one was not an idiot, they would realize that though there were many deaths in the Baili Clan, they were basically all weaker members, and collateral branches. Very, very few people from the main branch of the clan had died. This was indeed suspicious, but the battle previously had been too intense, so who would think in this direction?","As it turned out, the main branch had sold them off, the collateral branches!","Baili Haojie flew into a humiliated rage, pointing at Ling Han and saying, \"Don’t slander me.\"","Ling Han ignored him. In his eyes, Baili Haojie was completely insignificant. He had only spouted a few nonsense words to him on impulse, so what need was there for him to argue so hard?","\"Ling Han, you’re really smart!\" Di Wuji said with a smile. \"Unfortunately, you’re already surrounded. Even if you have wings, you won’t be able to escape!\"","Ling Han merely smiled. Since he could tell that this was a trap, how could he not have set up alternative arrangements?","He had long since discovered that there was an obscure net here. It would be retracted once he entered, but previously, he had already noiselessly destroyed a hole in this net.","If he wanted to leave, it would be a piece of cake.","However, it was rare for so many fallen Imperial Sons to be here, so he wanted to take the chance to kill a few of them.","\"Come battle!\" he shouted loudly, and directly charged out.","And his first target was shockingly Baili Haojie.","His speed was too fast, and the side of the Lands of Death had no intention to protect Baili Haojie. Thus, Ling Han directly charged over."]},{"number":4783,"title":"Chapter 4783: Barging Through the Encirclement","paragraphs":["Baili Haojie was the son of a Great Emperor, so there was no doubt about his natural talent and abilities. However, he was facing Ling Han.","Ling Han had killed even two Pseudo-Emperors, what more a mere Saint?","Baili Haojie’s expression changed drastically, and he subconsciously put on a defensive stance.","Peng! Ling Han’s punch landed, and Baili Haojie was obliterated into nothingness.","All of a sudden, the members of the Baili Clan all had complicated feelings. It was unknown whether they were happy, sad, angry or hurt.","This was the son of the Great Emperor, their Second Elder, yet he had actually collaborated with the Lands of Death, and betrayed a large number of his clansmen. How could he not deserve to die?","But with the death of Baili Haojie, the Baili Clan had completely declined, and no one else had any hope of breaking through to become Emperor.","In fact, with the army from the Lands of Death bearing down on them, it was hard to say whether the Baili Clan would still exist.","They all looked at Ling Han with complicated expressions. If this person was a member of their clan, how good would that be?","\"To make a deal with the devil,\" Ling Han said calmly, looking towards Di Wuji and the others.","They must have promised Baili Haojie some benefits. It was even possible that they promised that he would become a Pseudo-Emperor, and that was why Baili Haojie was willing to give up the dignity of the Imperial Clan.","In Baili Haojie’s mind, if he became a Pseudo-Emperor, he would have hopes of becoming Emperor, and as long as he could become a Great Emperor, what need was there for him to worry about not being able to conquer the whole universe and establish an outstanding reputation?","Unfortunately, these fallen Imperial Sons only watched as Ling Han made his move. They had absolutely no intention of rescuing him.","Hence, to make a deal with the devil, he had brought this upon himself.","\"Hehe, it’s time for you to die,\" Little Ye said, taking the initiative to attack.","The moment he moved, the Natural-born Gold Spirit immediately moved as well, joining him in a pincer attack on Ling Han.","These two \"people\" were both incredibly powerful.","When Little Ye was a Saint, she was already able to fight Ling Han head-on, and was only at a slight disadvantage. Now that he had advanced into Pseudo-Emperor-level, his abilities had naturally improved astonishingly. It could be said that he was only slightly inferior to Ling Han, and this was enough to become a strong rival for Ling Han.","Moreover... there was also the Natural-born Gold Spirit.","This was the true killing weapon.","This kind of spiritual matter that the heaven and earth had nurtured was a nine-star Pseudo-Emperor from the moment it was born. Furthermore, because of its unique nature, it was even stronger than the majority of nine-star Pseudo-Emperors. Furthermore, he was controlled by the twelve Lords of Death, which undoubtedly increased his battle prowess by tons.","The combined forces of Buddha Doga and the other Pseudo-Emperors was only barely able to block it, which showed how powerful it was.","No matter how freakish Ling Han was, he had only grasped 75 Regulations, and had not yet stepped into the threshold of Pseudo-Emperor, so how could he possibly match it?","Thus, he retreated at the first instant.","\"Hehe, now that you’re here, don’t leave!\" Little Ye moved, and pressed down on Ling Han. Weng, near Ling Han, the flow of time instantly decreased rapidly, which also caused Ling Han’s speed to become extraordinarily slow.","Ling Han released a battle cry, and the light of great dao burst forth. Instantly, the flow of time that had bound him instantly lost its effect.","However, the Natural-born Gold Spirit had already arrived. With a wave of its palm, it turned into a supreme God Tool that slashed towards Ling Han.","This was formed from his arm, and his body was comparable to the Origin Gold. If this attack landed, it was guaranteed that a Pseudo-Emperor would also be severed in half.","Even if Ling Han’s physique was tough, he didn’t dare to face it head-on now. He could only retreat rapidly.","\"Hehe, big brother, stay and play!\" Little Ye, who was standing on the sidelines, said innocently.","\"Old monster that has lived for who knows how many years, get lost!\" Ling Han shot out a punch.","Little Ye’s expression changed drastically. Old, old monster?","\"You’re seeking death!\" he shouted. Zi, two columns of light immediately shot out from his eyes, slashing towards Ling Han.","Towards Little Ye, Ling Han was only slightly apprehensive, but there was absolutely no possibility of fear.","Peng!","He greeted it with a punch, forcibly blasting Little Ye aside, and headed towards those Imperial Sons from the Lands of Death.","This caused the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters to grit their teeth. ’You’re being hunted by the Natural-born Gold Spirit, yet you still dare to attack us?’","These people all shouted loudly, and counterattacked Ling Han.","—Even if they were no match for Ling Han, it was completely no problem for them to block a few moves.","Ling Han barged through. Though he was no match for the Natural-born Gold Spirit, the others were no match for him either.","The Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters were all speechless. Seven Pseudo-Emperors moving together actually couldn’t suppress Ling Han!","Thankfully, the Inescapable Net had already been set up. Ling Han was now trapped, and it was only a matter of time before he was captured.","Thus, they all smirked coldly. From today onwards, there would no longer be a freak like Ling Han in this world.","Meanwhile, Ling Han sighed inwardly. He very much wanted to kill a few more Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters from the Lands of Death, but with the two pursuers, Little Ye and Natural-born Gold Spirit behind him, he really did not have much of a chance to make a move, and could only keep running.","Forget it. When his strength increased further, he would still be able to come back and reap the lives of these people.","\"Bullying with numbers, I’m not going to play with you guys anymore.\" Ling Han laughed loudly, and said, \"I’ll leave your dog heads with you guys for now. I’ll take them back another day!\"","With that said, he released a battle cry, and began to break out of the siege.","How fast was a Pseudo-Emperor?","Xiu, the fiery wings on Ling Han’s back flapped, and in an instant, he had gone millions and millions of km away.","\"Ling Han, you still want to leave at a time like this?\" The Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters all smirked coldly. ’Just wait to crash to the point that you’re bruised and battered.’","However, a shocking scene appeared. Ling Han flwewfurther and further away, and there was no sign that he was being blocked.","This!","These fallen Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters all exchanged looks, completely speechless.","Just now, they had been so confident, but in the end, Ling Han had just left without hesitation.","\"This brat must have destroyed the restrictions long ago, and that’s why he could leave so calmly.\"","\"How devious!\"","The expressions of Di Wuji and the others were extremely ugly. Just think, they had made so many preparations in such a rush, yet in the end, they were completely played around with by Ling Han.","All of a sudden, they all turned their eyes on the Baili Imperial Clan, their killing intent blazing.","Since they had not managed to kill the main culprit, they would vent their anger on these people.","Sensing the cold killing intent from these Pseudo-Emperors, a great many people from the Baili Imperial Clan shouted, \"Lords, we had an agreement; you would be responsible for protecting our safety!\"","\"Protect your sister!\" Di Wuji humphed, and spat out a flame from his mouth. It instantly enveloped the entire Ziwei Planet, melting it completely.","The imperial formation was already damaged, and the Imperial Weapon was nowhere to be seen. So, how could it block the attack of a Pseudo-Emperor?","\"We didn’t manage to kill that freak this time. Who knows how powerful that brat will become the next time he appears!\" Yang Yihuan said with a frown.","\"Humph, no matter how freakish he is, as long as he does not become Emperor, he would not be able to stand against a Great Emperor!\" Di Wuji stated calmly.","\"That’s right. Our plan is about to be completed. As long as our elders improve further, hehe, even if that brat becomes Emperor, so what?\" He Luo nodded as well.","\"However, this boy is ultimately a great scourge, a variable. If there is a chance, we still have to get rid of him,\" Wu Xingtong said coldly. The Battle God Palace had been razed to the ground by Ling Han. This was a public provocation to the Wu Clan.","\"En!\" These Pseudo-Emperors all nodded."]},{"number":4784,"title":"Chapter 4784: Wedding Again","paragraphs":["Ling Han located the Imperial Clans one by one. After storing all the stars into his body, he began to set up formations and teleport them over extremely long distances.","The Imperial Formations were closed, and the Imperial Weapons were also hanging on his body. None of these could be stored into his body.","When the formation was set up, Ling Han immediately activated it and entered.","Weng, the teleportation began.","He had already experienced it once. Though it was a slight failure, it still allowed him to make some modifications. After travelling in the Void for half a day, peng, this passage exploded again.","Ling Han was instantly sent flying, his whole body covered in blood. Thankfully, he was not severely injured.","It was really terrible. He had to suffer like this every time.","Ling Han shook his head, and looked around. This place was completely empty. There were no stars, no sun, only darkness.","\"Where is it?\" he murmured, and began to search for Four Origin Planet.","If the distance was too far, then even if there was a mark that he had left on the Four Origin Planet, Ling Han would not be able to sense it. Thankfully, though he had been blasted out of the Void passageway, he was not too far away from the Four Origin Planet.","He began his journey again. Seven days later, the Four Origin Planet was already within sight.","Ling Han didn’t directly descend. Instead, he first released the planets in his body. Otherwise, if he released them on the Four Origin Planet, who knew how much damage would be caused by the collision of the planets.","He returned the Imperial Weapons to these Imperial Clan elites, and the Imperial Clan elites breathed a sigh of relief. They were truly afraid that Ling Han would take them for himself and not return them!","Though they could forcibly retrieve the Imperial Weapon, they would definitely become enemies with Ling Han, and in such a difficult time, the consequences of offending Ling Han were extremely serious.","Hehe, Ling Han wasn’t interested in their Imperial Weapon at all.","After returning to the Four Origin Planet, the empress and the others were naturally very happy.","He went to see Liu Yutong, Shui Yanyu and the others. After these people entered into the great universe, they could use the cultivation techniques of this world to cultivate, and now, they had steadily stepped into the level of Blood Transformation Tier and Mystery Realm Tier.","However, so far, not one of them had stepped onto the Celestial Path.","They had long since moved to the Four Origin Planet, and as their cultivation level increased, the most obvious change was that their bodies had become larger.","It should be known that when dimensions were taken out, they were only the size of a fist, so just how big was a planet?","Even a star was tens of thousands of times smaller than a grain of rice, let alone a human.","However, as they cultivated, they all grew larger, and were now about as tall as an arm. They were even \"larger\" than the dimension itself.","It could be imagined that the dimensions were equivalent to an Eighth Tier Heavenly Venerate. Meanwhile, how could Blood Transformation and Mystery Realm Tiers not be hundreds or even thousands of times more powerful than Heavenly Venerable Tier?","Thus, the increase of one’s cultivation level would definitely lead to the growth of one’s body size.","He was sure that once these people advanced into Celestial Path, they would all be able to return to the size of normal people.","Ling Han sent someone to monitor the life tokens. As long as Buddha Doga and the others sent a message, he would immediately tell them to return.","Er, though their trip would have amounted to nothing, it was still better than them continuing to search blankly in the universe.","After doing all this, Ling Han went to the Primitive Abyss again. However, the Azure Phoenix Emperor was standing guard at the entrance, and Ling Han was immediately hunted down by him the moment he entered.","Faced with a Great Emperor, even if it was a Great Emperor whose cultivation was very problematic, Ling Han was still no match. His only option was to flee.","Thankfully, the Imperial Weapon showed its might, and added with Ling Han’s tough physique and Phoenix Wings Divine Flight’s speed, he still managed to escape successfully.","This time, Ling Han couldn’t go to the Primitive Abyss, and the core area of the universe was now the territory of the Lands of Death. Ling Han was stuck in a dilemma. He couldn’t go anywhere.","So be it.","Ling Han was on the Four Origin Planet, guiding the cultivation of the people from the Genesis World, so that they could step onto Celestial Path sooner.","He did some calculations. He was presently a Four-Star Saint, and theoretically, he could only complete the Silent Destruction five times at most, and now that he had grasped 75 Regulations, he was still short of 24 to attain the consummate level.","In that case, one time of Silent Destruction could allow his body to accommodate five more Regulations, he would be able to cultivate 99 Regulations when he was a nine-star Saint.","This was completely possible!","Thus, even if Ling Han could no longer obtain Genesis Substance, he could still cultivate to the limits of Saint Tier.","Of course, this was only a matter of time.","Would the Netherworld or the Primitive Abyss give him so much time?","\"Without the help of Genesis Substance, I would have to cultivate diligently for at least a thousand years or so to be able to advance another level. Furthermore, this is only advancing to five stars. The further I advance, the more time I would need to advance another level. Perhaps, it would take me more than ten thousand years to break through to become a nine-star Saint.\"","This was the main issue!","To say nothing of when the Lord of Deaths and the others would attack, just look at Yang Yihuan and the other fallen Imperial Sons. They were all Pseudo-Emperors now, and they only had to advance one step further, and they would become Emperor!","Although becoming Emperor definitely wouldn’t be as \"easy\" as becoming a Pseudo-Emperor, these people were all extraordinarily talented prodigies. This was a period of thousands of years, so the variables were really too great.","Once one of them became a Great Emperor, Ling Han would only be able to become a Pseudo-Emperor, at most. Even if he could match a Great Emperor, would he be able to turn the tide?","Furthermore, the Great Emperors had all planned for countless eras. Perhaps, the Great Emperor of this era would be able to become an existence that surpassed the Great Emperors of other eras. Then, Ling Han would be even more unable to calm the darkness.","Ling Han wracked his brains. He still wanted to increase his cultivation level faster, but there was nothing he could do.","\"Yang Yihuan and the others must have obtained a great opportunity. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have been able to collectively advance into Pseudo-Emperor-level,\" Ling Han murmured. \"It would be great if I could obtain their secrets.\"","However, charging into the territory of the Lords of Death and stealing this kind of secret?","Forget it.","Ling Han cast aside his distracting thoughts first. With the support of his alchemical pills, the cultivation level of the people from the Genesis World all soared, ushering in a great explosion.","On the other side, Buddha Doga and the others finally made contact with Four Origin Planet. After learning that Ling Han had already taken the Imperial Clans away, they began to return.","That would be another 200 years of long journey.","In this period of time, Ling Han cultivated and meditated and didn’t go anywhere.","Shui Yanyu, Liu Yutong, and the other beautiful wives all advanced into Celestial Path one after another. Their bodies were no different from normal people, and their family had truly been reunited.","200 years passed, and Buddha Doga and the others returned. When they found out that Ling Han had already become a Pseudo-Emperor, they were all very gratified.","At this time, Ling Han decided to hold another wedding.","He, Chi Menghan, and Song Lan had already become husband and wife in reality, but they had yet to hold a wedding, so he might as well take this opportunity to make up for it.","Furthermore, in this kind of dark age, there was indeed a need for something that would make one happy.","However, when Hu Niu found out, she immediately shouted that she too wanted to be the bride.","With her disturbance, the empress directly requested that she too wanted to be a bride, and though Liu Yutong and the other beautiful wives did not say it explicitly, the meaning in their eyes was very clear. They too wanted it.","After all, this was a great world, and represented a new beginning.","Fine then. With a wave of Ling Han’s hand, they would all get married again."]},{"number":4785,"title":"Chapter 4785: Barging In","paragraphs":["When the news spread out, all the Imperial Clans naturally sent Saints to offer their congratulations.","Right now, Ling Han was like their only savior and hope. Moreover, in terms of battle prowess, he was also a Pseudo-Emperor.","This was the wedding of a Pseudo-Emperor; who wouldn’t give him face?","Thus, on the day of the wedding, there were many guests on the Four Origin Planet. There were envoys from the great Imperial Clans, as well as old friends from the Genesis World.","As for Yue Hongchang and Ling Dongxing, because their aptitude was poorer, even with the support of Ling Han’s alchemical pills, they were still unable to step onto the Celestial Path. Their figures were only the size of a forearm, and attracted a lot of attention.","When the great Imperial Clans found out that this was actually Ling Han’s parents, they couldn’t help but feel astonished.","Yi, why was it like this?","The wedding banquet lasted for a total of three days, and the hosts and guests were all satisfied.","When it came to happy events, people were really in high spirits. When they were consummating their wedding night, Ling Han had mixed feelings, and experienced the ebb and flow of life. He suddenly entered into a state of enlightenment.","He cultivated in seclusion for nine days, and when he reappeared, he was already a Five Star Saint!","When Ding Shu and the others found out about this, they were all extremely speechless.","They were all the Genesis World’s leaders, so why are you so outstanding?","Comparisons would drive one crazy.","After this breakthrough, the number of Regulations that Ling Han had grasped had also reached as many as 80.","He once again asked for guidance from Buddha Doga, Qian Yanghao and Xia Houping. In a fierce battle, he could fight Qian Yanghao and Xia Houping to a tie, but against Buddha Doga, he was still slightly inferior.","This was because both Qian Yanghao and Xia Houping had awakened eight times, while Buddha Doga had awakened nine times, reaching the pinnacle of Pseudo-Emperor.","However, the next step would be becoming Emperor. This would need the help of heaven and earth. Buddha Doga had already fought for it in his last life, so heaven and earth wouldn’t give him another chance to start over. Thus, his limit was Pseudo-Emperor, and he would never be able to take another step forward.","They were discussing where they should go next.","Time was tight, and Ling Han couldn’t afford to cultivate slowly. However, if he wanted to rapidly increase his cultivation level, he would either have to pluck chestnuts from the Lands of Death, or go to the Primitive Abyss to find Genesis Substance.","Neither path seemed to be easy to walk.","\"Let’s go to the Primitive Abyss!\" Buddha Doga said resolutely. His eyes were resolute, and he continued, \"The three of us will open the path for you!\"","Ling Han’s eyes involuntarily narrowed. He was both touched and uneasy.","Right now, the Azure Phoenix Emperor was standing guard at the entrance to the Primitive Abyss. It was clear that he didn’t want Ling Han to have another chance to enter. Meanwhile, the three Pseudo-Emperors would open the path for him, allowing him to enter. This would not be too difficult.","The problem was, if the Azure Phoenix Emperor pursued Ling Han, what would he do?","He couldn’t expect heaven and earth to coincidentally create an energy storm to separate Ling Han and the Azure Phoenix Emperor, right?","It could not be ruled out that there was such a possibility. However, the possibility of this was too small, and to bet one’s life to encounter this kind of luck was no different from committing suicide.","Thus, to ensure that Ling Han was fine, the three of them, Buddha Doga and the others, had to delay the Azure Phoenix Emperor. This would be dangerous. It was very possible that the three Pseudo-Emperors would be severely wounded, or even one or two of them would actually die.","How could the might of a Great Emperor be so easily violated?","Even if there was a problem with this Great Emperor.","\"Seniors!\" Ling Han hesitated. Old Man Ge had already died to save him, and he didn’t want to see anyone else die because of him.","\"It’s all right!\" Buddha Doga said with a smile. \"We’ll each borrow a few Imperial Weapons. If it is just escorting you into the Primitive Abyss, I’m sure we can do it!\"","He was brimming with confidence as he said this.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before nodding and saying, \"Alright!\"","Time was of the essence, and there was no time for him to be pretentious.","Because this venture was really dangerous, Ling Han chose to act alone. Otherwise, if he brought Brother Monkey, the large black dog, and the others with him, it would definitely increase the difficulty level for Buddha Doga and the others ten to a hundred times over.","Ding Shu, Jing Haoran, and Shui Qingchang, the three Genesis World rulers, remained on the Four Origin Planet. If they really encountered an attack fromthe Lands of Death, or if the Divine Beast Emperors from the Primitive Abyss appeared, they would also be able to immediately absorb all the planets into their bodies and flee.","Without Emperor-level battle prowess, this was something that could not be helped.","Ling Han spent a few days with the women before setting off with Buddha Doga and the others.","This time, entering into the Primitive Abyss, it was probably impossible for him to come out unless he had cultivated to the battle prowess of a Great Emperor. Firstly, he himself was unwilling, and secondly, with Great Emperors standing guard, it would be very difficult for him to come out.","Thus, everyone was reluctant to part.","\"Husband, you have to take care of yourself!\" Shui Yanyu, Chi Menghan and the other beautiful wives all reminded him repeatedly.","\"Remember to bring gifts back!\" Of course, this was Hu Niu. Her eyes were shining, and there was drool at the corners of her lips. She was already anticipating Ling Han bringing her delicious food, such as dragon meat and whatnot.","\"Little Han, go and flatten those fake Divine Beasts!\" the little azure dragon shouted from the sidelines.","\"Jiu!\" The little red bird nodded. She and the little azure dragon shared the same feeling. Her already dead parent had actually come back to life; this was blasphemy!","\"Pick up a few more girls, and trample on a few more prodigies!\" Meanwhile, the large black dog slung an arm around Ling Han’s shoulder, \"If you have Origin Gold, remember to get a piece for Grandpa Dog. See, Grandpa Dog’s underpants have been torn and haven’t been mended yet!\"","It even deliberately raised its behind.","Peng! Ling Han shot out a kick, and the large black dog instantly disappeared into the distance.","Only the empress did not speak. She gave Ling Han a domineering kiss, and quite a number of people covered their faces at the sight. This was too embarrassing.","Next, it was those juniors of Ling Han’s. In the Genesis World, he had lived for more than an epoch. He had a string of children and grandchildren, and all the great Imperial Clans were gritting their teeth upon seeing this. At first, they had thought that Ling Han was a young man, but why was his family so huge, and with so many generations at that?","After bidding farewell for a very long time, Ling Han and the three Pseudo-Emperors set out, and once again arrived at the entrance of the Primitive Abyss.","They entered, and when they reached the end of this passageway, they sensed the Imperial Might that was spreading out.","A massive Azure Phoenix lay there, blocking the path of entry.","\"As expected, you guys have still come!\" The Azure Phoenix Emperor released a baleful cry. With a flap of its wings, xiu, xiu, xiu, tens of thousands of feathers had already shot over. They were all entwined with nine-star Regulations. This was too terrifying.","Weng, weng, weng! Ling Han and the others activated the Imperial Weapon at the same time, and moved against the flow, greeting the Azure Phoenix Emperor.","Ling Han’s Imperial Weapon was naturally the Clear Bamboo Sword. Meanwhile, the Imperial Weapon of Buddha Doga and the others had been \"borrowed\" from the other Imperial Clans.","In this kind of situation, there was no room for these Imperial Clan elites to keep their secrets.","The four Imperial Weapons unleashed their might at the same time, which was equivalent to four Great Emperors awakening at the same time. They attacked the Azure Phoenix Emperor together.","In truth, it was impossible for the Imperial Weapon to compare to the Great Emperor. However, in an era when there was no Great Emperor, the Imperial Weapon was strong enough, and could easily suppress Saints. That was why there was the saying that the might of the Imperial Weapon was equivalent to the awakening of the Great Emperor.","However, the four Imperial Weapons unleashed their might at the same time, and this was still extremely terrifying. Furthermore, after all, there was also a problem with the Azure Phoenix Emperor itself. It could not compare to a true Great Emperor.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ling Han and the others joined forces, and actually managed to block the Azure Phoenix Emperor. However, it was clear that they were still at a disadvantage.","The might of a Great Emperor was just that domineering, not allowing others to be dissatisfied."]},{"number":4786,"title":"Chapter 4786: High purity ores","paragraphs":["A Great Emperor was too strong. The four Pseudo-Emperors had activated the Imperial Weapon, and could only barely hold up against a Great Emperor.","And in terms of stamina, how could a Pseudo-Emperor compare to a Great Emperor?","Thus, if the battle dragged on for too long, it would definitely be Ling Han and the others that would be horribly defeated.","\"Go!\" Buddha Doga shouted.","The three Pseudo-Emperors went all out, forcing the Azure Phoenix Emperor to reveal an opening. Meanwhile, Ling Han took the chance to pass through. Using Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, he flew through this opening.","\"Humph, you’re seeking death!\" the Azure Phoenix Emperor said with a cold chuckle. He didn’t even turn around, and with a flap of his wings, he manifested a gigantic palm that grabbed at Ling Han.","Weng, weng, weng! At this moment, Buddha Doga and the others actually combusted the Imperial Source Source at the same time, instantly raising their battle prowess to a whole new level, detaining the Azure Phoenix Emperor firmly.","\"Ah!\" The Azure Phoenix Emperor was furious, but after combusting the Imperial Source, the battle prowess of the three Pseudo-Emperors had greatly increased, and added with the help of the Imperial Weapon, they were completely qualified to hold him back.","The Azure Phoenix Emperor sent out a message to contact the other Divine Beast Emperors to snipe Ling Han. Meanwhile, he stared at the Buddha Doga and the others, revealing a baleful killing intent.","\"Since you people are so determined to seek death, I shall oblige you!\"","\"Retreat!\" When Buddha Doga and the others saw Ling Han’s figure disappear, they immediately stopped burning the Imperial Source and began to retreat.","Although a Pseudo-Emperor had limited Imperial Source, it was enough to burn a few times.","Since the Azure Phoenix Emperor had already lost track of Ling Han, he naturally wouldn’t waste any more time. Instead, he continued to hunt down the three Pseudo-Emperors. As a great and noble Great Emperor, how could he swallow this anger?","Three fled, and one pursued. Of course, a Great Emperor’s speed was faster, but when the Azure Phoenix Emperor was about to catch up to them, the three Pseudo-Emperors would activate the Imperial Weapon in unison to oppose him.","Speaking of battle prowess, the three Pseudo-Emperors added with three Imperial Weapons were definitely no match for a true Great Emperor. However, if they were only focused on defense, there wouldn’t be too much of a problem.","Thus, Buddha Doga and the others retreated continuously. Although there were times of crisis, they didn’t face any danger.","The Azure Phoenix Emperor was truly enraged by now, and he chased after Ling Han like crazy. He didn’t look like he was going to give up.","...","Back to Ling Han. After breaking through the defenses of the Azure Phoenix Emperor, he rapidly advanced. Then, he quickly withdrew all his aura, assimilated with the environment, and slowed down his speed.","It was not that he did not know. Merely in this first level, there were nine great Divine Beasts — er, perhaps there were now eight of them.","But even if just one of the Divine Beasts came, it was not something that he could stand against at present.","Thus, he had to hide himself.","Weng, weng, weng! Not long after, Ling Han discovered a terrifying aura surging over.","This was the Flying Snake Emperor.","Ling Han only glimpsed a shadow, but he was absolutely certain that it was the Flying Snake Emperor.","He became even more cautious. Being hunted down by a Great Emperor, how could this be a joke?","Because he did not encounter the storm of heaven and earth, several days later, Ling Han arrived at the Dragon Head City.","At present, there was no Azure Phoenix Emperor standing guard here, nor was there the True Dragon Emperor. To Ling Han, this was practically no different from being completely unguarded.","He observed for a moment, and discovered that the nine great disciples... had come back to life!","So, the number of people here would never decrease, and would never increase, right?","Everyone’s fate was decided by birth. Some would become disciples of the Great Emperor, and were in the limelight, while others would become Saint-level guards. At least, they could be considered an important figure, and there were also some that would become miners, working day and night.","Ling Han snuck into the treasure storage again. He wanted to see how much ore they had gathered, and the result disappointed him.","Because every time he accumulated enough, the Great Emperor would begin to refine the Metal of Creation. He would either succeed, or fail. He only had that little bit stored away, and could not possibly have too much.","This time, because of the additional information provided by the Great Emperor Wu Ya, Ling Han guessed that these Divine Beast Emperors refined and created the Metal of Creation in order to forge a transcendent Imperial Weapon, to be used against the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others.","Otherwise, it would really be meaningless.","Ling Han stood in the mineshaft, deciding what he was going to do.","By now, the Great Emperors in the first level would definitely be looking for him everywhere. Thus, it should be a good choice for him to hide in the mine area for a while.","In any case, time passed quickly here, so there was no need to worry even if it was slightly wasted.","Thus, Ling Han decided to settle down here.","He didn’t wear the special Battle Armor here, because Ling Han didn’t have a Spatial Spirit Tool in his possession, nor could he store it inside his body. Thus, it would be more convenient for him to travel without it.","After all, he had already been able to resist the extreme weight of gravity here before. Now, he even possessed the battle prowess of a Pseudo-Emperor.","There were many miners here, but with Ling Han’s strength, if he didn’t want to be discovered by them, who would realize that there was another person here?","However, it wasn’t long before a story of ghosts circulated among the miners. Some people swore solemnly that they saw people walking around here, but they disappeared in a flash.","Several days later, exclamations of shock suddenly traveled over from the mine. Everyone was overjoyed.","What was going on?","Ling Han ran over to take a look. As it turned out, the miners had dug out an extremely pure ore.","This attracted the attention of the Third King that was standing guard here. Holding this piece of ore, the Third King couldn’t help but laugh loudly, appearing to be extremely excited.","Ling Han also laughed loudly, and calmly walked over.","At the beginning, no one realized that something was off. After all, everyone was very excited, but when someone glanced at him, the situation became strange.","The others all lowered their voices, and then turned even more gazes towards Ling Han.","Who was this person?","\"Who are you?\" The eyes of the Third King were also fixed on Ling Han.","\"Third, that’s not very nice of you. We’ve already met so many times,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","The Third King was very confused. This person was extremely unfamiliar, and he had never seen him before!","\"Humph, you actually dare to enter this place secretly. No matter who you are, nothing good will happen to you!\" The Third King moved directly, grabbing out at Ling Han.","Three hundred years in the outside world was more than thirty thousand years in the Primitive Abyss. Thus, this new Third King had long since cultivated to become a Saint. In fact, he was a Six Star Saint at that.","Combined with the Silver Battle Armor, his battle prowess was still quite shocking.","Boom, the large hand he stretched out was as black as ink, and grabbed hold of Ling Han in a single move.","\"Die!\" His fingers clenched into a fist, and he was just about to strangle Ling Han to death.","However, he shockingly discovered that as his fingers curled, he could not tighten his grip at all.","Was this a Saintly Material?","No, even Saintly Material, under his destructive power of as high as twenty stars, should have some slight distortion.","You f******.... freak!","Ling Han broke into a smile, \"Third is still as cordial as always, shaking hands right off the bat!\"","The Third King withdrew his hand. His eyes darted around madly, but in this place, he could not send out any signal at all, seeking the help of the Great Emperor.","What could he do?","All of a sudden, a thousand thoughts flashed through his mind.","\"Come, give me that piece of ore,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","\"Humph, don’t seek your own death!\" The Third King refused decisively. This was something that the Great Emperor had specified that he wanted. If he surrendered it to Ling Han, he would also be severely punished.","Ling Han shook his head, and muttered, \"Are you forcing me to kill you again?\""]},{"number":4787,"title":"Chapter 4787: Stone Mountain","paragraphs":["\"What nonsense are you spouting!\" the Third King shouted.","\"Sigh!\" Ling Han couldn’t be bothered to speak any more nonsense. He sent out a palm strike, and pa, the Third King turned into a mush of blood. Even with the protection of the Silver Battle Armor, it was useless.","Ling Han’s attacks were too domineering. Even if he couldn’t shatter the Silver Battle Armor, the shockwaves of power still turned the Third King into minced meat.","A mere six-star Saint!","This scene caused the other miners to break out in a cold sweat. It was too terrifying. The disciple of the Great Emperor that was like a god in their eyes was actually unable to withstand a single blow. Could it be that this person was also a Great Emperor?","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"All right, all right. Now that the excitement is over, let’s all go back to whatever we were doing. Please do not delay our proper business.\"","Er, are you going to take over as supervisor?","The miners didn’t dare to disobey at all. After leaving the mine, without the protection of the Battle Armor, their only fate would be death. Thus, they were like birds trapped in a cage, unable to resist at all.","They could only mine obediently, and Ling Han also took down the other three Saints that were standing guard here. He only had to take off their armor, and they could only stay here obediently.","Meanwhile, Ling Han held onto that piece of ore. After removing the impurities one by one, he actually obtained a piece of Metal of Creation that was the size of a thumb!","This was really a great gain.","It should be known that even the Metal of Creation that the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others had \"sent\" through the Natural-born Gold Spirit was only this size, yet it had caused the True Dragon Emperor to personally come out to fight over it.","It was also because of this that the \"Abyss Party\" had appeared before the \"Land of Death Party\" for the first time.","The two weren’t in the same group, but they couldn’t be considered enemies either. At the moment, the Abyss Party was guarding the Primitive Abyss, and it seemed like they didn’t have any ambitions. Meanwhile, the Land of Death Party also minded their own business.","If such a piece of Metal of Creation fell into the hands of the Abyss Party, who knew how much trouble it would bring to the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others.","\"Hehe, this proves that I am very lucky, to have come at such a coincidental time.\" He began to praise himself very shamelessly.","He took out the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, wanting to immediately use it to improve his Pseudo-Imperial Weapon.","The Metal of Creation was continuously fused into the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, causing this precious tower to undergo some kind of transformation, but it wasn’t obvious now.","Ling Han had a feeling that this was a massive change that was brewing in the Origin Gold.","Once it happened, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower would undergo a complete transformation.","The Great Emperor Wu Ya said that the Metal of Creation could forge the strongest Imperial Weapon, and this was definitely not empty words.","Furthermore, Ling Han felt that it should not be an Imperial Weapon, but an existence that had surpassed the Imperial Weapon.","However, this required a large amount of Metal of Creation.","No wonder the 36 Divine Beasts were all stationed here. If they could really forge a Transcendent Weapon, and with the control of the Great Emperors, would they be able to insta-kill another Great Emperor?","Just like how the Pseudo-Emperor wielded the Imperial Weapon, what other Pseudo-Emperor would dare to face it head-on?","Thankfully, this was a qualitative change. It would only happen when a certain critical point had been reached. Otherwise, while there was improvement, it would not be too great.","As far as Ling Han could tell, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower had only become slightly sturdier than before. However, it didn’t seem to have become much more powerful.","Three months later, another three Saints came over to change shifts, and Ling Han captured all of them.","However, this also meant that he couldn’t stay here any longer. Afterward, the Dragon Head City would definitely send people over to investigate.","Ling Han simply absorbed all of them into his body. Even if the beings in the Abyss could create life, they would still need time, right?","Then, he strode off, heading towards the Azure Phoenix City.","His luck wasn’t bad, and he didn’t encounter any storms of heaven and earth along the way. Thus, after only five days, Ling Han arrived at the foot of the Azure Phoenix City.","He couldn’t help but think. Previously, he had participated in the Nine Cities Tournament here, and had even won the heart of a little girl. Who knew if this Mo Ziyun had also been reborn now, and when she met him, would she be attracted to him again?","Ling Han definitely wouldn’t tease this new Mo Ziyun again out of boredom. Instead, he quietly passed.","There was no Great Emperor standing guard here. The Azure Phoenix Emperor had gone to stand guard at the passageway, and the True Dragon Emperor had hidden in some unknown corner and was starting from the beginning again. Thus, this led to an empty space in two cities.","However, Ling Han didn’t dare to act recklessly. At the very least, the Flying Snake Emperor was looking for him everywhere. If he discovered any unusual movements in the two cities, he would definitely rush over at the first instant.","Thus, Ling Han kept a low profile as he continued to advance.","From here onwards, it was also incredibly unfamiliar to him. This was a path that he had never walked before.","Ling Han didn’t head to the third city. As long as they could trace his movements, they would be able to guess that his third stop should be the next city. Perhaps, there was already a Great Emperor waiting with an army there for him.","Thus, Ling Han walked all over the mountains and plains. His goal was to become stronger, and the main means of becoming stronger was Genesis Substance. Since that was the case, why did he have to go to the city?","However, Genesis Substance was too rare.","Even if this was the core area of the Primitive Abyss, where Genesis Substance was much more likely to be produced, it was still completely a matter of luck to find it.","Ling Han was willing to test this kind of luck. The flow of time here was a hundred times faster than outside, which gave him such confidence.","He walked slowly. Though he was not wearing Battle Armor, with his present physique and strength, it was still very easy for him without Battle Armor.","Unless he encountered a storm of heaven and earth, the Primitive Abyss no longer posed any threat to him.","From here, it looked no different from the outer circle. It was a barren plain, and looked harmless.","Of course, even Saints would be immediately crushed into dust if they entered this place without any protection.","Ling Han strode forwards, and very soon, a stone forest appeared ahead of him.","He did not take a different path, and entered straight ahead.","Hong long long, not long after, he suddenly heard a loud boom. That was the ground trembling.","It should be known that the structure here was extremely sturdy. Even if a Great Emperor made a move, the damage that he could cause would be limited. Then what kind of existence could cause even the ground to tremble?","Ling Han couldn’t hide his curiosity. He walked quickly, and after walking for another distance, he shockingly discovered that there were actually multiple rocks rolling forwards on the ground.","This scene was very majestic. Every rock seemed to have a life of its own, and was heading in the same direction. It was like ten thousand horses were galloping, and that was why the ground was trembling so much.","Yi, what was this? A mudslide?","Ling Han walked a little further ahead, and discovered that all the stones were rolling here, piled up one by one, as if they were building bricks.","Interesting, what was going on here?","Because of his curiosity, Ling Han stopped to watch for a while longer, wanting to know what was going on.","Soon, more and more rocks rolled here, turning into a mountain peak.","At this moment, no more rocks rolled over. Peace returned to the surroundings. Aside from the fact that there was a mountain of rocks here, there was nothing else unusual.","That was it?","Ling Han gritted his teeth. He was really bored out of his mind.","But right at this moment, boom, boom, boom, boom sounded again, and the mountain of rocks ahead of him actually moved."]},{"number":4788,"title":"Chapter 4788: Pseudo-Emperor Stone Spirit","paragraphs":["It was as if these rocks had a life of their own. They continued to roll, accumulating on their own, and actually formed a human figure.","Stone, giant!","It was 30 meters tall, its arms extending below its knees. It had a round, plain head, and no features, but it seemed to have a pair of invisible eyes, making Ling Han feel like he was being targeted.","The key was his aura.","The aura of a Pseudo-Emperor surged over, bearing a mountain of pressure.","This rock monster was actually a Pseudo-Emperor!","Ling Han couldn’t help but sigh with emotion. In the outside world, those who could become Pseudo-Emperor did not outnumber the various Great Emperors of eras past by much, but in here, random rocks could be piled together to form one. How could he not sigh with emotion?","Cultivating arduously was inferior to a single thought from heaven and earth!","The rock golem cocked its head to one side, as if it was surveying Ling Han. However, in the next instant, it brandished its long and thick arms and ruthlessly smashed them down on Ling Han.","Boom, this attack was extremely powerful and terrifying.","How could the attack of a Pseudo-Emperor not be shocking?","Ling Han had now grasped 80 eight-star Regulations, so how could he be afraid? He immediately raised his fist to greet the attack.","Peng!","The two fists that differed greatly in size instantly crashed into each other, creating an incredibly powerful shockwave. Peng, peng, peng! Even if the rocks here were heavier than tens of thousands of stars, so what? Being shaken by a Pseudo-Emperor-level shockwave, they all began rolling, as if an earthquake had happened again.","The might of Pseudo-Emperor was as powerful as could be.","However, this also showed how sturdy the structure of heaven and earth here was. Even if Pseudo-Emperors moved, they could only cause the rocks here to roll around, and they were actually not sent flying!","Ling Han’s body shuddered, and he involuntarily retreated several kilometers before coming to a halt.","Good lord!","He thought to himself, ’This rock golem’s battle prowess is not inferior to that of Buddha Doga.’","The heaven and earth had moved, and it was a nine-star Pseudo-Emperor directly?","Ling Han didn’t think that this rock golem had also cultivated step by step to become a Pseudo-Emperor. Cultivating here? That was completely unrealistic!","Thus, it must have been born as a Pseudo-Emperor, and a peak stage Pseudo-Emperor at that.","Without having a body that experienced nine times of Silent Destruction, how could it be revived?","Realization immediately dawned on Ling Han. The current system of cultivation was only invented by the cultivators, so why couldn’t there be a second or third system of cultivation?","Directly speaking of the core, wasn’t the purpose of cultivating for the sake of strength?","However, wasn’t the strength and weakness of this world all decided by heaven and earth?","The heaven and earth wanted this rock golem to be Pseudo-Emperor-level and its battle prowess would be the strongest level among Pseudo-Emperors. What need was there for it to cultivate like that?","All of a sudden, Ling Han’s mind and spirit fluttered. It was as if he had caught hold of something, but at the same time, it was as if he had caught hold of a chaotic mess. It was extremely difficult to find the correct thread.","Boom, at this moment, the rock golem threw another punch, and a terrifying energy surged.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and withdrew his thoughts that had strayed. He raised his fist and confronted the rock golem head-on.","Fighting against Buddha Doga, because both sides had restraints, it could only be considered a sparring match to test out battle prowess. He could not truly test out his own limit of battle prowess.","However, this rock golem was different. It wouldn’t hold back.","Ling Han also needed an opponent of this level to exert enough pressure on him. Only then would he be able to unleash his potential.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two great Pseudo-Emperor-level beings clashed head-on, and without any fancy moves at all, unleashed their full battle prowess.","Because he had not used such trump cards like Destructive Energy, light of great dao and so on, Ling Han was naturally at a disadvantage. Furthermore, the disadvantage was very obvious. However, he had the intention to force out his limits, and was not willing to use his trump cards, even after so long.","In this way, his situation was in imminent danger.","\"Roar, roar, roar!\" The rock golem sent Ling Han flying with a punch, causing all the pores on Ling Han’s body to burst. Blood oozed out, and he instantly became a bloody figure, making this guy extremely excited. He pounded his chest like a gorilla.","\"Hehe, do you want me to introduce my Little Stone to you?\" Ling Han wiped the blood from the corner of his lips. This rock golem reminded him of the rock golem that he had subdued in the Genesis World. Both of them had different methods but achieved the same result. However, that Little Stone in the Genesis World was too weak, and had just stepped onto the Celestial Path.","\"I don’t know if you’re male or female. If you’re male, wouldn’t that be gay?\" he continued to mumble.","Boom! The rock golem threw a punch at Ling Han without any mercy.","Ling Han fought with all his might, but the gap in battle prowess was too obvious. After a long battle, Ling Han was at a complete disadvantage. It was only a matter of time before he lost.","The rock golem seemed to be very excited, and released a wave of divine sense through its \"roar\". Its attacks became even more rapid, as if it wanted to defeat Ling Han in one go.","\"Hey, come!\" Ling Han felt that it was about time. His battle prowess limit had already been forced out, and he could no longer just stay passive and take a beating like this.","Boom!","His hands shook, and his fists were immediately entwined with the light of great dao and Destructive Energy, exuding an incredibly dangerous aura.","The rock golem was startled. Although it didn’t have any facial features, it was clear that it was showing a hint of seriousness.","\"You don’t dare to come?\" Ling Han laughed loudly.","The rock golem seemed to have been angered. With a leap, it flew high into the air, and then landed heavily.","With its terrifying weight, even if it was just being crushed by such an impact, it was enough to kill any Saint.","Ling Han didn’t dare to let the rock golem crash into him, so he hurriedly retreated. Then, he swung his fists repeatedly, blasting towards the rock golem.","The rock golem howled. The blockhead seemed to have gone mad from the battle, and faced Ling Han’s iron fists head-on.","Peng, with this blow, Ling Han was indeed sent flying again, but the rock golem also roared loudly, its divine sense rippling like an ocean.","The damage caused by this punch was too terrifying. Even with the rock golem’s defenses, it couldn’t withstand it. Both its fists caved in, turning into dust.","The rock golem cocked its head as if pondering something. Then, it swung its arms, and pa, pa, pa, the rock on its fists fell off, turning into bare wrists.","Yi, is this considered cutting one’s losses?","But in the next instant, the rock golem stretched out its arms, and two large rocks nearby suddenly flew over and attached themselves to its bare wrists respectively, forming two fists again.","This?","’You can do that?’","Ling Han couldn’t help but grit his teeth. If he couldn’t kill the rock golem in one go, then as long as there were rocks nearby, not only would this guy not die, he might even be unable to injure it?","This was this big guy’s home ground.","Forget it, he couldn’t start a battle here.","Ling Han immediately turned around to flee. He didn’t linger in battle at all.","The rock golem was dazed for a moment. ’I was just having fun fighting, so why aren’t you fighting anymore?’","No way!","It immediately broke into a run, and set off in pursuit of Ling Han.","One ran, while the other pursued, moving unhindered in this massive stone forest.","It was unknown whether it was luck or misfortune, as they actually did not encounter any storms of heaven and earth along the way. Otherwise, Ling Han and the rock golem might have been stopped, and be forced to battle, or the rock golem might have given up its pursuit.","Two months later, they finally rushed out of this vast stone forest, and a great ocean suddenly appeared ahead of them."]},{"number":4789,"title":"Chapter 4789: Turning an enemy into a friend","paragraphs":["The sea was expansive, and the waters were dark blue. There was no wind or waves, and it was like a beautiful piece of agate.","Ling Han suddenly stopped in his tracks, and stood on the beach.","\"Stupid big guy, do you really think I’m afraid of you?\" he asked with a smile.","The rock golem’s body suddenly trembled, making Ling Han think that there was something wrong with it. He didn’t expect that a wave of divine sense would immediately transmit over. Although it didn’t have much meaning, it was very obvious that it was laughing.","’Er, are you saying that I’m bluffing?’","Just how much was he looking down on him?","Ling Han gritted his teeth. Although this was a Pseudo-Emperor, in terms of intelligence alone, it was very low.","He was actually being mocked by such a rock golem with low intelligence?","\"All right, I’ll beat you to your heart’s content!\" Ling Han laughed loudly, and brandished his fist at the rock golem. Boom, Destructive Energy surged, and the light of great dao shone.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The battle between the two sides was incredibly intense.","If it were Budha Doga, he definitely wouldn’t engage in close-quarter combat with Ling Han. Instead, he would distance himself from Ling Han and avoid coming into direct contact with Destructive Energy and light of great dao. The destructive power of that was really too great. In fact, it even surpassed the Imperial Weapon.","Just one question, would a Pseudo-Emperor dare to face an Imperial Weapon head-on?","No!","Thus, the might of Ling Han’s attack was even more terrifying than the might of the Imperial Weapon. No matter how tough the rock golem’s skin was, it couldn’t be helped that it was seeking death.","In a few moments, its fists were gone. However, there were no rocks here to replenish its energy, so it could only use its arms to attack. Fortunately, it was made of rocks in the first place, so this did not have much effect on it.","Then, its arms became shorter and shorter, bit by bit, right until it became armless.","\"Wu?\" The rock golem was also very confused. Yi, why was it that as they fought, my arms have disappeared?","However, a blockhead was still a blockhead. Without arms, what was there to be afraid of? Didn’t he still have a pair of legs?","This time, it switched to using its feet, and stomped madly on Ling Han.","Ling Han did the same thing. Not long after, the rock golem’s two legs were gone, leaving behind only a massive body and a massive head.","But this guy was a fool. What if he lost both his arms and legs?","It directly rammed its body into Ling Han, but if it didn’t change its battle style, how could it not suffer losses?","Soon, its body was also destroyed, and its head was also gone. Finally, an earthen-yellow crystal was left behind, exuding a powerful life force.","This was a little similar to Genesis Substance, but there was also a difference. It was like it had the same origins as Genesis Substance but had evolved into a new branch.","Ling Han had a feeling that if he refined this crystal, his cultivation level wouldn’t increase, but his life force would become much, much stronger.","It was this crystal that had given life to the rock golem. Otherwise, the rocks that had been piled up would only be rocks.","Ling Han hesitated. He could refine this crystal. Though it could not increase his cultivation level, it could strengthen his life force to make up for the massive expense he had previously expended.","However, this rock golem was especially innocent. In fact, when it was fighting with him, it was only purely fighting, and did not leave with the thought that it would definitely beat him to death.","Could he take in a lackey?","A peak stage Pseudo-Emperor-level lackey should be very interesting.","Ling Han took the crystal and walked back, arriving once more in the stone forest. Then, he placed the crystal on a rock.","Instantly, this rock immediately trembled lightly. Then, the rocks in the surroundings seemed to have boiled, and began to tremble.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Multiple rocks were absorbed over, and piled up on the first rock. After a few rocks, the earthen-yellow crystal could no longer be seen, and was surrounded within the rocks.","Then, visibly, a rock golem was rapidly piled up.","Though it was not quite the same as the last one, er, after all, it was not built from the same pile of rocks, but it gave Ling Han the same feeling.","Silly, naive.","Boom, as soon as the rock golem appeared, it threw a punch at Ling Han.","\"Stupid big guy, you are really ungrateful!\" Ling Han stepped back.","However, the rock golem’s punch didn’t land. Instead, it stopped in midair.","It cocked its head, as if it was confused about something. Then, it obediently withdrew its fist, and sat down cross-legged in front of Ling Han.","A foolishly smiling wave of divine sense immediately spread out in Ling Han’s mind.","Er, he had really become stupid.","Ling Han stretched out a hand and patted the rock golem’s body. The rock golem didn’t resist, and seemed to be enjoying it very much.","\"Er, you have no eyes or nose. You look so awkward.\" Ling Han thought for a moment, then leaped onto the rock golem’s head, and began to carve on its \"face\".","The rock golem didn’t have any sense of pain. Its core was that earthen-yellow crystal, so if the crystal wasn’t damaged, it wouldn’t be damaged. The rocks it absorbed were only a protective layer.","Thus, the rock golem obediently allowed Ling Han to draw.","\"En, en, en, not bad.\" Ling Han smiled. Originally, the rock golem didn’t have a front or back, and now, he had drawn eyes, nose, and mouth on one side. This was the main face.","However, if there were others here, they would definitely shake their heads incessantly. That was because not only was Ling Han incompetent in naming, his skill in drawing was also worrying. The eyes, nose, and mouth that he drew were all crooked.","\"Er, it’s still better than before,\" Ling Han consoled himself.","\"People definitely have their strengths and weaknesses. My natural talent in martial arts is so freakish, and I’m also Alchemy Emperor and Formation Grandmaster. Thus, it’s normal that I’m not good at drawing.\"","However, he was still a bit driven mad. Why was it that when he was drawing formation patterns, no matter how complicated the veined patterns were, he could draw them in a neat and orderly manner, and when it was time to draw a nose and eyes, hey became incompetent?","\"Sigh, this can only be blamed on the heavens.\"","After resting for a while, Ling Han set off. The rock golem hurriedly followed behind him.","\"My family already has a Small Rock, so you can be called Big Rock.\" Ling Han thought for a moment, and gave the rock golem a name.","—His incompetence in naming was exposed without a doubt.","The rock golem didn’t mind this, and merely let out a cry with its divine sense.","\"Alright, as long as you’re happy.\"","Ling Han brought the rock golem along, and once again arrived at the side of the blue sea.","\"Looks like we can only fly over.\"","Without Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess, Ling Han wouldn’t have been able to fly under such extreme weight of gravity. However, it was a different story now. He had enough power to break free from the restraints of gravity and soar through the air.","However, flying here required additional energy. If there was no need, Ling Han actually didn’t want to fly. In any case, running on the ground wasn’t slow.","He soared into the sky and flew forwards. As for the rock golem, peng, it rushed into the sea, and after running a few steps with it, its entire body had already disappeared without a trace.","Er, what intelligence.","Forget it, you can just walk in the sea.","Ling Han activated his eye technique, and it was still visible that the rock golem had directly sunk to the bottom of the sea, and was currently running on the seabed.","Xiu, he continued to fly.","After walking for three days, Ling Han was already a little tired. However, he suddenly saw a small island appear ahead of him.","This was just in time for him to settle down.","Yi?"]},{"number":4790,"title":"Chapter 4790: Giant Turtle","paragraphs":["Yi, Ling Han was very surprised, because this island was floating on the ocean’s surface.","It should be known that the substances in the Primitive Abyss were all extraordinarily heavy. You see, the rock golem was clearly a Pseudo-Emperor, but it still sank directly into the sea, and could only run at the bottom of the sea.","What right did this island have to float?","Celestial medicine!","Ling Han’s sharp eyes focused on the island. There was a crimson plant growing on it, and it had borne a pure purple fruit. It was not big, and was about the size of an olive. It was completely transparent.","\"The aura of Genesis Substance.\"","Ling Han murmured softly, revealing an expression of delight. He had really not thought that after searching high and low for so long, he would inadvertently make a great discovery.","\"This is mine now.\"","His figure descended rapidly, heading towards the small island.","But right at this moment, xiu, xiu, xiu, over a hundred water arrows suddenly shot towards him.","Yi?","Ling Han was astonished. Why was he being attacked?","Who had attacked him?","He was puzzled, but Ling Han naturally wouldn’t allow the water arrows to hit him. He hurriedly turned around and dodged this attack.","Shua, shua, shua! The water arrows gushed out endlessly, shooting fiercely towards Ling Han.","F***, what the hell?","Ling Han was stunned, because the might of this attack had shockingly reached the level of Pseudo-Emperor.","The deeper one ventured into the Primitive Abyss, the more dangerous it was indeed. Beings with Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess appeared one after another.","Huala, a loud bang was heard, and then the rock golem came out of the seabed, leaping straight into the air. Then, it landed on the island, its fists smashing down fiercely.","Ling Han couldn’t help but grit his teeth in pain. ’You f****** are loyal to your master, I know that, but please don’t destroy my Celestial medicine.’","The Celestial medicine was a very special existence. It could grow in incomparably vile places, and its vitality was incredibly tenacious. But at the same time, it itself was also incredibly fragile, and would be destroyed at the slightest bit of attack.","The rock golem’s attack wasn’t as terrifying as Ling Han’s, but its advantage was its physique, which was stronger.","More importantly, it was fine even if its body was damaged. The rocks outside were only its armor in the first place.","Peng, peng, peng! The water arrows arrived, and left multiple holes on the rock golem’s body. However, the rock golem didn’t care at all. Its figure had already descended, and its fists smashed down rapidly.","Boom!","A loud boom rang out, and the entire island was smashed off its original position by the rock golem. Then, this island suddenly moved.","Ling Han saw that the island had four limbs, a head, and a tail protruding from different places... this was shockingly a giant turtle. Previously, it had only shrunk its body into its shell.","F***, no wonder he had been attacked.","Shua, shua, shua! The giant turtle and the rock golem battled fiercely, water arrows flying, fist shadows surging.","This giant turtle’s battle prowess was not inferior to the rock golem’s at all. In a fierce battle, the rock golem couldn’t get the slightest advantage. However, with its super strong defense, it didn’t lose out either. It released a wave of divine sense, and accompanied with its weird face, it was clearly a fierce battle, yet Ling Han felt that it was very hilarious.","He did not continue to watch the battle. The Celestial medicine was right in front of his eyes, so how could he possibly sit by and watch?","Moreover, with how simple-minded Big Rock was, what if he damaged the Celestial medicine?","Ling Han made his move. He did not make a move on the giant turtle, but rather headed directly for the Celestial medicine.","Unless he had no other choice, he did not want to kill. After all, there was no animosity between him and this giant turtle, so there was no need for him to kill for no reason.","The giant turtle battled fiercely with the rock golem, and had no time to be distracted. Furthermore, Ling Han did not reveal the slightest bit of killing intent. At this moment, he had transformed into the Killing Saint of the Battle God Palace, but was countless times stronger than that old Killing Saint. If he did not reveal his killing intent, it would be extremely difficult for even a Pseudo-Emperor to discover his existence.","Xiu, Ling Han landed on the giant turtle, and plucked up the Celestial medicine.","\"Ang!\" The giant turtle released a roar of pain. Where this Celestial medicine had been pulled out, a wound actually appeared, blood gushing out.","Yi, this Celestial medicine was actually nurtured from the flesh and blood of the giant turtle?","Ling Han didn’t immediately leave. With a leap, he had already arrived in the air. If he killed the giant turtle, he would definitely be able to obtain even more benefits, but this kind of killing without grudges had surpassed Ling Han’s bottom line.","He indeed wanted to become stronger as soon as possible, but it would not be based on trampling over the lives of others.","Otherwise, what was the difference between him and the Lords of Death?","\"Big Rock, let’s go!\" Ling Han said.","However, the rock golem’s interest was piqued by the battle, and it completely ignored him. It continued to battle fiercely with the giant turtle, as if it was determined to win.","Fine then.","Ling Han leaped down and battled the giant turtle with the rock golem.","With two Pseudo-Emperors joining forces, and two at the strongest level at that, how could the giant turtle hold up against that?","After about a hundred moves, the giant turtle could no longer withstand it. With a swift dive, it sank into the ocean waters.","The rock golem wanted to give chase again, but Ling Han forcibly pulled it back.","\"Ang?\" It looked at Ling Han dumbly, looking puzzled.","If you’re a man, then don’t cower!","Could it be that you are not a man?","Ling Han smacked it on the head, \"Let’s go.\"","He had nothing to step on here, and he was unable to refine the Celestial medicine here. Moreover, Ling Han had flown continuously for three days. In this kind of land of extreme gravity, even he felt a little tired, and needed a good rest.","There was nothing else that could be done. His foothold had already fled, so Ling Han could only continue to fly.","Fortunately, after travelling for another two days, land finally appeared ahead of them.","Ling Han hurriedly descended, and recovered first.","The rock golem also came out of the sea, and when it walked to Ling Han’s side, it deliberately shook its body. Shua, drops of water dripped over.","It should be known that all the matter here was super concentrated. A grain of sand was equivalent to the weight of a planet, and a single drop of water was even more terrifying than the weight of a planet. When several hundred drops sprayed over, it was equivalent to several hundred Saints attacking at the same time.","Ling Han also bared his teeth, and looked towards the rock golem.","This guy was wearing a silly smile, as if he had not realized what he had done at all.","Alright, he was the one who had drawn this silly smile on his face, so he would admit it.","Ling Han took a good rest. After he recovered, he took out the Celestial medicine and began to refine it.","There wasn’t much Genesis Substance in this Celestial medicine, but it still allowed Ling Han to accommodate three more Regulations.","He had reached 83 flashes.","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. As expected, if he wanted to quickly increase his cultivation level, he still had to come to the Primitive Abyss.","\"Big Rock, let’s go.\" He stood up and continued forward.","The rock golem was dumb. When Ling Han stopped, it would stop, and when Ling Han left, it would follow.","Very quickly, a mountain range appeared ahead of them. It was so tall that the summit could not be seen, and its length was endless.","It was impossible to circle around, and they could only climb over the mountains.","Ling Han and the rock golem started to climb the mountain. However, not long after they climbed the mountain, their speed slowed without prior discussion.","In this place, the gravity field had become even more terrifying, and more importantly, this mountain was too uneven. There were sharp rocks protruding like blades everywhere, and one would have to step on them with every step, and if one stepped on them, it was equivalent to cutting off their flesh.","Ling Han had to focus a large amount of his energy on defense. Otherwise, even with his physique, he wouldn’t be able to withstand it."]},{"number":4791,"title":"Chapter 4791: Kui Bull City","paragraphs":["They had only climbed a height of 30,000 meters, before Ling Han had no choice but to retreat.","He couldn’t hold on any longer. The soles of his feet were already badly mangled. If he continued to force himself, it was guaranteed that his feet would be ground off, followed by his ankles, then his thighs. His whole person would be ground to nothing.","He retreated to the foot of the mountain, and so did the rock golem. It stood dumbly beside Ling Han.","\"Let me see your feet,\" Ling Han said.","However, the rock golem didn’t react at all. It couldn’t understand Ling Han’s words.","Er.","Ling Han sat cross-legged on the ground, his legs raised.","The rock golem followed suit, plonking down and crossing its legs.","Its feet had also become distorted, and a part of its feet had been forcibly gouged out.","Hiss, what a terrifying place. Both he and the rock golem had suffered greatly.","It was only at this moment that Ling Han further realized just how terrifying the Primitive Abyss was.","Previously, it had only been a storm of heaven and earth. Though it was frightening, it could be dodged, but in this place, if one wanted to pass, they could only face the challenge head-on.","No wonder it was said that this was a place where even Great Emperors could enter but not exit.","Moreover, this wasn’t truly the depths of the Primitive Abyss yet.","\"It can’t be crossed?\" Ling Han looked at the great mountain that lay ahead of them, and frowned deeply.","He was not the type to admit defeat easily.","\"This is just right. I can use it to temper my willpower and physical body.\"","He channeled the Ten Cultivation Technique, and the injuries on his feet slowly healed. After resting for a while, he began to continue climbing the mountain.","The rock golem couldn’t recover its body, but it didn’t feel any pain anyway. Ling Han walked, and it followed, looking completely dumb.","This time, Ling Han ascended a further distance.","When they retreated back to the foot of the mountain, Ling Han was very satisfied with himself. As long as there was improvement, that would be a good thing.","He climbed the mountain every day, and as the days passed, the heights he could reach became higher and higher. However, in recent times, his improvement was also getting smaller and smaller, and he was just about to reach his limit.","In the future, he would still be able to improve, but it was possible that he would only walk an additional few dozen steps, or a hundred steps every day.","Looking at the soles of his feet again, even if he had an amazing technique like Ten Cultivation Technique, there were still multiple gashes left behind, as if they had been cut out by a flurry of sabers.","He was already like this, and the rock golem was even worse off. It had been forcefully degraded greatly.","— Its two legs had long since been worn down, but that was all right. By removing some part of its arms, it could still form two legs.","Even the rocks on his arms had been worn off, didn’t he still have a body? In any case, it was big, so he could dismantle it as he liked.","For Ling Han, this was not a waste of time. He had sharpened his willpower to become even sturdier, and his physique had also become considerably stronger. His battle prowess had improved greatly.","However, whether the blockhead had improved or not... Uh, Ling Han didn’t know.","Judging by its silly look, it probably had not.","Were they stuck at this mountain?","Ling Han thought for a moment, then shook his head.","He was already close to his limit. Even if he could squeeze out some more potential, his improvement wouldn’t be too great, and if the summit was in sight, he might be able to succeed if he put his life on the line.","However, the problem now was that the summit was not even visible. Ling Han could only make another attempt when his cultivation level increased again.","\"Perhaps, only a Great Emperor would be able to cross this mountain.\"","Ling Han murmured, and decided to take a different path.","He set off with the rock golem. After circling around the mountain range for a long time, another desolate plain appeared ahead of them, but there were rocks scattered everywhere.","The rock golem immediately charged out. Pa, pa, pa! Multiple rocks attached to its body, and its body began to grow larger. And this time, even if it had reached its original size, it did not stop. Instead, it was still growing larger.","Finally, it turned into a giant that was three hundred meters tall before stopping.","\"Er, are you afraid of losing too much of your body?\" Ling Han asked with a smile. This guy had absorbed so many rocks, so it would be able to support an expenditure for a very long time.","The rock golem didn’t understand, and simply \"grinned dumbly\" at him.","They passed through the stone forest, and after walking for another few dozen days, they saw that the mountain range had actually been severed, and there was a city in the middle.","It looked like a wild bull, vivid and lifelike.","\"Divine Beast... Kui Bull?\" Ling Han murmured. Among the Divine Beasts, only the Kui Bull was in the shape of a bull, and it only had one leg. It could not be any more obvious.","\"Yi, in that case, I have now entered into the area of the second level?\"","The Kui Bull Emperor was not among the nine great Divine Beasts of the first level.","Although the nine cities in the first level were different in depth, they all belonged to the same area overall, but this time, Ling Han had walked a very, very long path.","Thus, he had already walked out of the first level, and arrived at the second level.","\"If I want to continue forward, I either have to climb mountains, or pass through this city.\"","Ling Han thought quickly. The 36 Divine Beasts were all standing guard at the passageway into the Primitive Abyss. Then, did this mean that these areas were actually relatively safe areas, such as the corresponding area of this city? It was highly possible that there had been a passageway here in the past.","\"It’s impossible to climb the mountains. The requirements for abilities are too high, so if we want to continue deeper, we can only pass through this city.\"","Ling Han retracted all of his aura and observed the surroundings. If he rashly walked over and drew the attention of the Kui Bull Emperor, things would definitely become troublesome.","\"Hold on, the first level is an area, and the second level is self-contained.\"","\"With how big this space is, even the disciples of a Great Emperor can’t simply barge in.\"","\"Thus, I am completely capable of impersonating one.\"","Ling Han’s eyes lit up, and he said to the rock golem, \"Big Rock, let’s go.\"","The rock golem was dumb, and only when Ling Han set off did it hurriedly follow him.","Peng, peng, peng! It followed behind Ling Han, and when its feet landed, it created a loud sound.","It wasn’t long before Ling Han arrived before the city gates.","\"Stop right there!\" There were guards at the city gates, and they were all wearing Bronze Battle Armors. They blocked Ling Han’s path. \"Who are you?\"","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, \"I’m a disciple of the True Dragon Emperor, the Ninth King.\"","The guards faltered.","The True Dragon Emperor? The Ninth King?","\"That’s the first level area!\" The guard’s face was filled with disbelief. From the first level area to here, what kind of difficult journey would he have to go through?","Apart from those having Emperor-level strength, who else could pass?","Hold on!","He suddenly discovered the rock golem, and couldn’t help but reveal a shocked expression.","What a large rock golem, how could it exude such a terrifying aura, making him tremble and want to kneel down?","He was a Saint!","Ling Han smiled, \"This is my underling, who has escorted me all the way here.\"","The rock golem sized up the guard. It didn’t have much intelligence, but it could sensitively sense Ling Han’s will When it discovered that Ling Han didn’t have killing intent, it didn’t attack the guard.","In its eyes, this guard was like an ant, completely beneath its notice.","The guard nodded blankly. With such a powerful guard, it was no wonder that Ling Han could move unhindered.","\"Please wait for a moment, Lord. I have to go and make my report first.\""]},{"number":4792,"title":"Chapter 4792: Luo Wuyang","paragraphs":["Ling Han smiled, and waited at the gates.","Peng, the rock golem also sat down. With how heavy it was, once it sat down, even the ground was trembling madly.","Ling Han glanced at this guy, and the rock golem looked back at him blankly. Its two painted eyes, one higher than the other, were filled with hilarity.","Er, he was the one who had drawn it, so he shouldn’t laugh!","Ling Han sighed. Couldn’t there be someone more dependable by his side?","The large black dog and little azure dragon were both despicable characters. Although Brother Monkey didn’t have this problem, he would charge forward with a roar when he saw the enemy. This rock golem... Forget it, it didn’t even have a brain, so there was no need to have too many expectations.","After a while, Ling Han felt a powerful aura bearing down on him. He had not even reacted, when the rock golem suddenly jumped up, its fists pounding on its chest, looking very fierce.","\"Big Rock, calm down!\" Ling Han said. However, it was pointless to say this, as Big Rock didn’t understand it at all.","However, the rock golem could still sense Ling Han’s intent. Since Ling Han didn’t have any killing intent, it suppressed its urge and simply stared ahead.","Ling Han looked over, and a young man walked out of the city. He wasn’t wearing any kind of Battle Armor, but rather a snow-white tight-fitting suit, exuding a fierce and domineering aura, like a Great Emperor.","This wasn’t a Great Emperor, and Ling Han was certain of it. However, the other party had already cultivated to the level of Pseudo-Emperor.","Was this the disciple of a Great Emperor?","Hiss, they had only reached the second level, and already a Pseudo-Emperor had appeared!","\"It really is a Pseudo-Emperor!\" The white-robed man did not pay much attention to Ling Han. Instead, he merely stared at the rock golem, his eyes filled with both shock and greed.","In this place, living creatures that were naturally born were called Source Spirits, but generally speaking, they were all Saint-level. In such harsh environments, they would usually die the moment they were born, so they were very rare.","Most of those who managed to survive were Pseudo-Emperor-level, but they were even rarer. It would be as difficult as ascending the heavens to even encounter one, let alone taking one as a lackey.","This kind of creature was born with a natural inclination for freedom. Even if the Great Emperor made a move, he would only be able to suppress it, and not subdue it.","Thus, the fact this Stone Spirit was actually subdued by Ling Han made him extremely surprised and envious.","A Pseudo-Emperor-level guard!","The rock golem, meanwhile, pounded its arms, looking displeased. Though its intelligence was low, it was very sensitive to the evil thoughts exuded by every single person.","\"How dare you!\" The guard from before had also returned, and hurriedly raised the spear in his hands, but his arms were trembling.","The character in front of him was a Pseudo-Emperor.","Yet the white-robed man stretched out a hand to stop him, meaning that there was no need to be nervous, and in truth, if the rock golem was really going to flip out, what use would mere Saint-level guards be?","Only then did he turn to look at Ling Han, and said with a smile, \"I am Luo Wuyang, a disciple of Kui Bull Emperor.\"","Yi, did the Kui Bull Emperor only have one disciple? Otherwise, he would probably have added a few more disciples.","Ling Han nodded, and said, \"I am the Ninth King under the True Dragon Emperor, Han Lin.\"","\"Brother Han, please.\" Luo Wuyang gestured for Ling Han to enter the city.","Ling Han raised his head and glanced at it. If he took this step, it would be equivalent to entering a dragon’s lair or a tiger’s den. With a Great Emperor overseeing things, he could use the Imperial Weapon against it. Though there was hope of escaping, it was also possible that he would be detained.","But for the sake of strength, he naturally had no other choice.","Ling Han walked through the city gates.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The rock golem naturally followed them in. Because there was no powerful gravity field in the city, or rather, there was an anti-gravity field here, the rock golem instantly missed its footing and floated up.","\"Ang?\" The rock golem’s divine sense fluctuated in surprise and excitement, as if it was a child that had suddenly gotten an interesting toy. It instantly started to play around, and somersaulted in midair.","However, it was a Pseudo-Emperor. Once it released its restraints, it instantly set off turbulent waves. One after another, hurricanes formed, and began to blow around the city.","Thankfully, the buildings here were similarly extremely heavy, and could not possibly be damaged by this kind of hurricane wind. However, it was a different story for people.","The guard bore the brunt of it, and was instantly sent flying by the hurricane winds. With a peng, he crashed into a wall, and slid down, coughing up blood continuously.","The might of a Pseudo-Emperor was as powerful as could be.","Ling Han hurriedly calmed the rock golem down. If it continued to play around a few more times, the people in the city would be sent flying.","He had not come to crash the party.","Seeing that the rock golem was indeed obeying Ling Han’s commands and obediently walking on the ground, Luo Wuyang couldn’t help but look envious. Though he was a Pseudo-Emperor, he did not possess such a servant, so how could he not be envious?","Luo Wuyang and Ling Han walked in front, while the rock golem followed closely behind.","\"Brother Han, why did you suddenly think of coming here?\" Luo Wuyang asked. He was really curious, but it was not because he was suspicious of Ling Han’s identity. After all, the Primitive Abyss had never been \"invaded\".","Ling Han pondered for a moment before saying, \"It’s better to travel ten thousand miles than to read ten thousand books.\"","Luo Wuyang couldn’t help but feel speechless. This was f******* the Primitive Abyss.","How would you read ten thousand books here? And wasn’t walking ten thousand miles here a suicidal action?","With just these few words, he could confirm that Ling Han was definitely not a \"normal\" character.","\"How did you subdue this Source Spirit?\" Luo Wuyang asked again. This really made him too curious, and he could not figure it out no matter how hard he thought about it.","He knew that in the first area, the disciples of the Great Emperors were only Saint-level cultivators. Unlike the second area, where there were few disciples of Great Emperors, their individual abilities were much stronger. They were all Pseudo-Emperor-level existences.","\"I don’t know either. Perhaps it’s because I’m good-looking.\" Ling Han spread out his hands.","A muscle twitched in Luo Wuyang’s cheek. He already knew that Ling Han was not a normal character, but he was actually so f****** abnormal, which made him want to throw up blood.","Furthermore, you are good-looking, so if this Source Spirit follows you, what you mean is that others would not be good-looking.","How did this mouth grow? When it came to insulting others, he could practically kill others without spilling any blood.","\"Heh, so be it if Brother Han doesn’t want to tell me,\" he said in a calm voice. He naturally wouldn’t believe him.","He made arrangements for Ling Han’s accommodations, then informed Ling Han that he would arrange a celebratory feast for Ling Han.","Originally, Ling Han had wanted to leave the city. However, doing so could possibly cause two Great Emperors to pincer attack him. This was undoubtedly a very dangerous thing.","Thus, since his identity hadn’t been exposed, he didn’t mind feigning civility.","Two days later, Luo Wuyang indeed hosted a banquet for Ling Han.","Luo Wuyang was not the only one present. There were also a great many young prodigies in the city.","Everyone sat down, one after another. The resources of the Primitive Abyss were scarce, so they ate less, drank less, and dressed less. However, once they obtained meat, it would be a Saint-level Source Spirit, at least, and Celestial medicines were similarly Saint-level.","Thus, though there was not much food in front of everyone, it was still incredibly precious."]},{"number":4793,"title":"Chapter 4793: Conflict","paragraphs":["It was unknown whether Luo Wuyang was naturally courteous, or if he was deliberately trying to impress Ling Han by hosting such a \"luxurious\" banquet.","The Young Misses and Young Masters that had come all exclaimed in shock. This was a luxurious feast that they may not even have in a few hundred years.","\"Haha, Lord Luo is really generous.\"","\"That’s right. If it was not for Lord Luo, we may not even be able to eat such a meal in a few hundred years.\"","\"It is our fortune to have a disciple of the Great Emperor like Lord Luo!\"","Everyone began to flatter him.","Ling Han said calmly, \"Yi, shouldn’t you guys be thanking me? Without me coming here, which one of you would be able to eat?\"","This!","At this moment, everyone was speechless. How could there be such a shameless guy?","However, it had to be said that these words were actually quite logical.","In terms of cause and effect, that was indeed the case. If Ling Han hadn’t come here, they wouldn’t have been able to come here, and naturally wouldn’t have been able to eat such a great meal.","However, why was it so strange for Ling Han to say something that was clearly reasonable?","The corner of Luo Wuyang’s mouth twitched. This was not only abnormal, but also f****** shameless!","\"Haha, everyone, drink to your heart’s content, and eat to your heart’s content!\" He waved his hand.","Everyone chewed slowly. This wine had been brewed with Celestial medicines, and the meat was a Saint-level Source Spirit. They were all extremely precious. Usually, they would only be able to eat it once every few hundred or a few thousand years, so they had to savor it.","Yet Ling Han really ate as much as he liked. Very soon, he had finished all the meat and wine in front of him.","\"That—\" He looked towards Luo Wuyang.","\"Serve the dishes.\" After Luo Wuyang’s expression darkened, he waved his hand, indicating for the servant to replenish Ling Han’s food.","However, in the Primitive Abyss, food was really too precious. This was not a must-have item, yet was incredibly hard to obtain, so it had become a luxury item. Even if Ling Han’s food was replenished, it would still be pitifully little.","Ling Han didn’t care, and he quickly finished the food.","\"Give me another serving.\" This time, he did not even bother to speak to Luo Wuyang, and directly said to the servant beside him.","The servant’s expression also darkened. ’You really don’t treat yourself as an outsider.’","This was Luo Wuyang’s manor, and those who didn’t know better would think that you were the owner.","The servant looked towards Luo Wuyang, and Luo Wuyang waved his hand helplessly.","At this banquet, he actually wanted to show Ling Han his strength to intimidate him. He had not thought that Ling Han would be so shameless. This was practically like trying to signal to a blind man.","Some people were brave, and when they saw Ling Han do this, they quickly finished their own portion, and requested for an additional serving.","Luo Wuyang’s expression became even darker.","The Primitive Abyss was far too dangerous, so much so that even the Saint-level guards didn’t dare to leave the city so easily. Only he, one with great skill and courage, dared to pluck Celestial medicines and hunt Source Spirits by himself. This was a symbol of his strength.","But now?","He felt like a fool.","Why had the atmosphere suddenly veered off course? Not too long ago, everyone was still praising him, so why had they all become gluttons now?","Some people were brave enough to do it first, so others naturally followed suit. The result was great. Now, everyone was eating and drinking with their heads lowered, as if this was the true purpose of their coming to the banquet.","Luo Wuyang sighed. Had they all become stupid?","He had no choice but to use his divine sense to transmit a message to some people.","In this way, those people finally came to their senses as if they had just woken up from a dream.","\"Brother Han, why don’t you tell us how you obtained this Source Spirit?\" Someone stopped eating and drinking, and asked Ling Han.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before replying, \"Because I’m good-looking!\"","That person couldn’t help but feel his expression darken. ’Though you are indeed quite good-looking, there is no need to exaggerate so much, right?’","This was mockery. Were they not good-looking, and that was why they had not been able to obtain such a Source Spirit?","At this moment, everyone looked at Ling Han with a slightly resentful gaze.","\"Brother Han, is your Source Spirit Pseudo-Emperor-level?\" After a while, someone asked.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before saying, \"You’ll know once you fight it.\"","’Holy f*ck!’","Everyone was so infuriated that they wanted to vomit blood. Before you answered, you deliberately paused for a moment just to come up with a retort, right?","You don’t have any God Tools that can collect resentment, so why are you so keen on insulting others?","\"Hehe, let me try.\" Luo Wuyang stepped out.","Though he knew that this Source Spirit was Pseudo-Emperor-level, he did not know the exact details of its abilities. Thus, he could take this chance to find out.","In addition, he also wanted to show off his strength and let the rock golem know that following him was the wisest choice.","\"Okay.\" Ling Han nodded. Then, he said to the rock golem behind him, \"Big Rock , someone wants to fight you.\"","The rock golem didn’t understand, so it wore a blank expression.","Everyone looked at its eyebrows and crooked smile, and couldn’t help but want to complain again. What kind of drawing ability was this?","It must have been drawn by the rock golem itself. It had low intelligence, after all, and that was why it looked so ugly.","Thankfully, these were only thoughts, and had not been spoken out loud. Otherwise, Ling Han would definitely go berserk.","Was his intelligence f*cking low?","Everyone carried the tables and retreated into their rooms, clearing out the space. In any case, the structure here was sturdy. As long as they hid in their rooms, they would not be swept by the aftermath of the battle.","The rock golem foolishly retreated with Ling Han, completely unaware that it was the main character of the next event.","This caused everyone to laugh loudly. Sigh, with such low intelligence, his battle prowess would definitely be limited.","Ling Han also smiled, and locked his divine sense onto Luo Wuyang, suddenly unleashing his killing intent.","\"Ang!\" The rock golem immediately became excited, and released a divine sense-level cry, charging towards Luo Wuyang.","Previously, it had been very well-behaved, giving people the misconception that it was harmless. However, after moving, everyone knew that this was a Source Spirit that could run rampant in the Primitive Abyss.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The rock golem charged forwards, its feet stepping on the ground, releasing a massive boom, causing the whole ground to tremble violently.","Everyone was transfixed with shock. Such a Source Spirit was indescribably terrifying.","Meanwhile, Luo Wuyang revealed a bellicose expression. With a battle cry, he took the initiative to greet the rock golem.","As a Pseudo-Emperor, who would be afraid of—","Peng!","Luo Wuyang’s expression changed drastically. His whole person was sent flying.","He was completely outmatched!","He was only a Two-Star Pseudo-Emperor, but what about the rock golem?","It was at the highest level.","It should be known that previously, it was Ling Han who had faced off against the rock golem. Before using his ultimate move, he was also being suppressed by the rock golem, what more Luo Wuyang.","The rock golem’s attack succeeded, and it immediately set off in pursuit.","Even though it looked stupid, once it entered battle mode, its instincts were extremely terrifying.","A natural Source Spirit was born for battle.","In the past few days, it had been suppressed and unable to battle. Now that it had suddenly gotten a chance, the rock golem was practically beside itself with excitement.","It chased after Luo Wuyang and beat him up madly.","Peng, peng, peng! Luo Wuyang was no match at all, and was instantly pressed onto the ground."]},{"number":4794,"title":"Chapter 4794: Exchange","paragraphs":["Everyone was speechless.","That was Luo Wuyang! Not only was he a disciple of the Great Emperor, but he was also a Pseudo-Emperor.","But now, he was actually beaten to his heart’s content by a Source Spirit, completely unable to fight back. How could everyone accept this?","This was too tragic, wasn’t it?","\"Big Rock, Big Rock, that’s enough. If you continue, someone will die.\" Ling Han called a halt.","However, the rock golem was already excited by the battle, and didn’t listen at all.","In truth, it was not Ling Han’s servant. However, after Ling Han spared its life, it had been running around with Ling Han like a lackey.","After Ling Han called out a few times, the rock golem finally obeyed and stopped.","However, Luo Wuyang was already in a tragic state. He was lying on the ground, badly mangled.","Fortunately, Saints could regrow severed limbs, and Pseudo-Emperors were even more superior. As long as their Imperial Source was not damaged, they would be able to easily recover. It only needed a little time.","\"Hehe, you’ve already eaten and drunk, so everyone can leave now,\" Ling Han said with a smile, leaving with the rock golem.","Everyone was dumbfounded. This guy was really something. He had eaten and drunk his food and wine, and in the end, he had even beaten the host up. Luo Wuyang was really out of luck.","However, this Source Spirit was actually so powerful!","Everyone was stunned. Luo Wuyang was a Pseudo-Emperor. In their hearts, this was an existence that was only inferior to the Kui Bull Emperor, but now? He was easily pressed and pounded into the ground by someone else’s servant.","They were also incredibly envious. How lucky was Ling Han to have such a servant?","They really wanted to possess one as well.","Ling Han stayed for a few days. Just as he was about to leave, he saw Luo Wuyang pay him a visit.","\"Yi, Brother Luo’s injuries recover so quickly!\" he said.","Luo Wuyang couldn’t help but wear a dark expression. How could anyone speak like this?","Someone like you actually managed to live until now without being beaten to death. The heavens really are blind.","He really wanted to flip out, but when he saw the rock golem standing on the sidelines, looking like it was eyeing him covetously, he very consciously withdrew this kind of urge.","—He couldn’t possibly alert the Kui Bull Emperor just because of a disciple of a Great Emperor, right?","He couldn’t afford to lose face either.","Luo Wuyang controlled his emotions, and continued, \"That um, Brother Han, I want this Source Spirit. Name a price.\"","Ling Han looked at him seriously, \"Brother Luo, this is Pseudo-Emperor-level !\"","Have you seen anyone selling or buying Pseudo-Emperors?","\"A Genesis-level Celestial medicine!\" Luo Wuyang said through gritted teeth. He had only managed to find this after searching for 300,000 years. Originally, he had planned to use it to break through to become a three-star Pseudo-Emperor.","However, Genesis Substance could only add icing on the cake. Whether he could break through or not would have to depend on his own aptitude, and the problem was that he seemed to have reached his limit as well, and could not improve any further.","Thus, rather than wasting a Genesis-level Celestial medicine for nothing, it would be better to use it to exchange for a Pseudo-Emperor-level servant.","Ling Han pondered for a moment, \"Ten!\"","Luo Wuyang almost went crazy, \"Do you know how precious Genesis Substance is?\"","\"You also have to know how rare Pseudo-Emperors are,\" Ling Han also said.","This... was indeed the case.","Even if there were 10 Genesis-level Celestial medicines, it was still impossible for them to produce a single Pseudo-Emperor. With that calculation, it was him who would profit more from this transaction.","However, why did he keep feeling that something was off?","Yi, such a powerful guard, as long as there are ten Genesis-level Celestial medicines, you are going to give it up just like that?","Luo Wuyang shook his head, \"I only have a stalk of Genesis-level Celestial medicine in my possession.\"","\"Brother Luo, though we feel like old friends at first sight, even blood brothers have to settle accounts clearly, right?\" Ling Han said with a smile, \"You want to trade a single Genesis-level Celestial medicine for my Big Rock. You are really too greedy, aren’t you?\"","\"But I really only have one Genesis-level Celestial medicine,\" Luo Wuyang said, \"Otherwise, you can go to my treasure chamber and take a look for yourself.\"","\"Alright!\" Ling Han nodded without hesitation.","Yi, could you be a bit more shameless?","However, he was the one who had spoken, so Luo Wuyang could only helplessly bring Ling Han to the treasure chamber.","The contents of the so-called treasure chamber was actually mostly the remains of corpses. They were all Source Spirits of the Primitive Abyss. Of course, he hadn’t killed them, but rather they had been killed by the storm of heaven and earth. He had only picked up the corpses.","Additionally, that would be precious material, but it was mostly Saintly Material, and there was no Origin Gold, or any Metal of Creation.","The Celestial medicine that Luo Wuyang had spoken of was also placed here. It could be considered the most valuable treasure in this place.","\"I’ll take them all.\" Ling Han pointed at them.","Luo Wuyang couldn’t help but sneer, \"There are so many, can you fit them all?\"","The Spatial Spirit Tool was completely useless here. It would be crushed into pieces. You only have two hands, so how are you supposed to hold all this?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, \"You don’t have to worry about that. One word, do you want to trade or not?\"","\"Trade!\" Luo Wuyang immediately said. Though this treasure chamber had taken him innumerable years to accumulate, compared to the value of a Pseudo-Emperor Source Spirit, it was not worth mentioning at all.","\"All right, Big Rock is outside. I’ll leave it to you.\" Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, \"You can go out now. I want to properly admire my treasures.\"","’F*ck! These are mine!’","Luo Wuyang held back for a moment, and did not make a move.","In his eyes, Ling Han was nothing more than a Saint. He could easily deal with him.","However, they were both disciples of Great Emperors, so he didn’t dare to make a move.","Thus, he retreated out of the room, and went off to socialize with Big Rock.","Ling Han retrieved the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower and started to collect the items here.","The Spatial Spirit Tool couldn’t withstand the gravity fields here, but the Origin Gold could.","After collecting all the items, Ling Han strode out.","\"Big Rock, you can stay here from now on,\" Ling Han said with a smile. He waved a hand at the rock golem, then sent out a divine sense message, making the rock golem sit down peacefully.","In the previous journey, Ling Han had also tried to communicate with the rock golem. Although it wasn’t ideal, he had still reached some relatively simple tacit understanding, such as having the rock golem sit.","\"Brother Luo, then I won’t disturb you. I still have to continue my journey,\" Ling Han said.","Luo Wuyang had obtained a Pseudo-Emperor Source Spirit, so he couldn’t bother with Ling Han anymore. He nodded and said, \"Bye.\"","The deal was done, and his attitude immediately turned cold. After all, he had been quite angered by Ling Han just now.","Ling Han smiled, but did not take it to heart, because Luo Wuyang would go mad with anger later.","He exited the city and continued to advance towards the core area of the Primitive Abyss.","After walking for half a day, he muttered, \"It’s about time.\"","The rock golem was like a child, and its patience was definitely limited. Thus, if it was told to sit peacefully, half a day was the limit.","...","And in Kui Niu City, Luo Wuyang could no longer wait to show off the Rock Source Spirit to others.","Previously, he had been horribly defeated by the rock golem, and it could be said that he had lost all face. Thus, he naturally had to get back his pride immediately. After all, he was a disciple of the Great Emperor, so his identity was sensitive.","Furthermore, these days were really too boring.","Everyone came over, and when they saw the rock golem that was sitting upright, they all clicked their tongues in praise.","A Pseudo-Emperor-level Source Spirit!","\"Lord Luo, could you have this Source Spirit move agilely, and fully display its divine might?\" someone asked. This was also boot-licking Luo Wuyang, so that he would have a chance to perform.","Luo Wuyang nodded in satisfaction, \"All right.\"","He issued a command to the rock golem, \"Rise!\"","The rock golem didn’t move at all.","\"Get up!\" Luo Wuyang called out loudly again.","The rock golem still didn’t move.","This!","Luo Wuyang instantly felt very humiliated. In full public, this was very embarrassing, all right?","If it was not for the fact that he was no match for this Source Spirit, he really wanted to make a move.","Could it be that it was too stupid and did not understand his words?","\"Run!\" he roared. At the same time, he also used his divine sense to transmit his voice. This was a pure intent that had transcended the language barrier.","The rock golem suddenly stood up. Peng! It charged forward.","At this, Luo Wuyang finally showed an expression of joy. He was finally obedient.","Everyone also praised repeatedly. This was a Pseudo-Emperor-level servant.","\"That...\" A guest suddenly said weakly, \"That Source Spirit doesn’t seem to have turned back.\"","Er!"]},{"number":4795,"title":"Chapter 4795: Ran off","paragraphs":["That’s right, what happened to the rock golem?","If it was told to run, it would run. It didn’t know that it had to stop at all, nor did it know that it had to turn back, right?","This was what a retard was!","Luo Wuyang was speechless. This rock golem wouldn’t run all the wayand never come back, right?","As expected, a Pseudo-Emperor that had not reached that level by itself would be so retarted?","Luo Wuyang could only give chase. After all, he couldn’t let this retarded Source Spirit continue to run towards the setting sun and never return, right?","Seeing Luo Wuyang chase after it, everyone felt a <anno data-annotation-id=\"9d380756-eefc-4b60-948c-22ef7bf64234\" data-title=\"toothache\">toothache 1 </anno>.","Back to the other side, Luo Wuyang ran madly. The rock golem didn’t know how to hide its tracks at all, so it naturally left behind extremely obvious clues, allowing him to track it all the way, and soon arrived in the wilderness.","He had been worried that his strength was inferior to the rock golem, so he might not be able to catch up to this big guy.","However, after only half a day, he discovered that the rock golem’s tall figure had appeared ahead of him.","Yi, it actually stopped.","Luo Wuyang was very curious. This idiot actually knew to stop?","’What? You’re tired, so you want to take a rest?’","However, his expression immediately became dark, because there was another person standing beside the rock golem.","Ling Han.","Realization dawned on him. Ling Han had absolutely no plans to sell the Source Spirit to him. Instead, he was using the Source Spirit to scam him of all his wealth.","This was too despicable!","\"Han Lin!\" He arrived in a single leap, his face filled with fury, \"As fellow disciples of Great Emperors, you actually dare to bully me. Aren’t you afraid that I will make a complaint against you in front of the True Dragon Emperor?\"","Ling Han spread his hands, \"When have I bullied you?\"","\"This Source Spirit, you have already traded with me, and now you are taking it back. Wouldn’t that be bullying me?\" Luo Wuyang asked coldly.","Ling Han smiled and said, \"Brother Luo, you’re wrong to say that. I did trade it with you, but it came to find me on its own, so what does it have to do with me?\"","\"Alright, then I’ll bring it back now,\" Luo Wuyang said.","Ling Han spread his hands, \"Whatever.\"","Luo Wuyang turned to the rock golem and said, \"Come with me.\" He was afraid that the rock golem wouldn’t understand, so he used his divine sense to communicate.","However, the rock golem was completely unmoved, and ignored him completely.","Yi, he had still been able to understand just now, so why had he become stupid now?","How could he have known that when he shouted ’run’, he just happened to reach the limit of the rock golem’s patience, causing him to mistakenly think that he could control the rock golem.","Ling Han smiled, \"Brother Luo, farewell.\"","He turned around to leave, and the rock golem immediately followed.","F***!","Luo Wuyang was furious. This was intolerable, this was really intolerable, acting shamelessly right in front of him.","\"Han Lin, do you think I don’t dare to make a move on you?\" he asked balefully. He was already truly angered.","\"Come!\" Ling Han crooked a finger at Luo Wuyang.","He was too arrogant.","Luo Wuyang shouted loudly, and charged towards Ling Han.","However, before Ling Han could even make a move, the rock golem had already appeared before Ling Han.","Zhi!","Luo Wuyang hurriedly stopped in his tracks. It wasn’t like he hadn’t exchanged blows with the rock golem before. He was completely outmatched!","However, just because he had stopped, it did not mean that the rock golem would stop as well. This blockhead leaped up high, and descended towards Luo Wuyang.","How could Luo Wuyang dare to face it head-on? He hurriedly fled in all directions.","Pseudo-Emperor against Pseudo-Emperor, even if there was a gap in terms of battle prowess, but if one side only cared about fleeing, then no matter how strong the other side was, it would still have difficulty catching up with the side that was running.","Thus, Luo Wuyang kept running, while the rock golem chased fiercely behind him.","\"Han Lin, do you dare battle me?\" Luo Wuyang was battered and exhausted, yet there was nothing he could do. He could only challenge Ling Han to a battle.","Ling Han chuckled, \"Sure.\"","Though he said that, he had no intention of stopping the rock golem from making a move, and continued to watch the excitement.","\"Han Lin, you—\" Luo Wuyang was so furious that he almost threw up blood. Shameless, shameless, he had never seen such a shameless person.","Ling Han smiled, and said, \"Big Rock, come back.\"","However, the rock golem was reckless, and after he issued a few commands, it finally stood still dumbly.","Its face was filled with confusion. Why did he stop it?","Meanwhile, Luo Wuyang’s killing intent soared. Humph, this person was really arrogant, but where did his confidence come from? A mere Saint actually dared to face him, a Pseudo-Emperor, head-on.","\"You’re asking for your own suffering!\" With a leap, he had already charged right in front of Ling Han, brandishing his fists in a rapid barrage.","Peng!","Ling Han also threw a punch, and exchanged a blow with Luo Wuyang.","What!","Luo Wuyang shockingly discovered that an indescribably powerful force was assailing him. It was not something that he could stand against at all. Instantly, his whole person was sent flying, and fell backwards.","Peng, he fell heavily onto the ground, feeling dizzy and blurred.","He was also a little confused. What was going on?","He was actually no match for a Saint?","Luo Wuyang got back to his feet, and rubbed his chest. If it was not for the fact that it still hurt so much that he wanted to throw up blood, he really could not believe that he had actually been sent flying by a Saint.","Could it be that it was the rock golem that had attacked just now?","\"You, how do you have such strong strength?\" he asked.","\"A good-looking person’s luck would definitely not be too bad,\" Ling Han said with a smile. \"The heavens view me in a different light, and that’s why I’m so strong.\"","Luo Wuyang naturally wouldn’t believe him. He stared at Ling Han and said with a frown, \"You’re not a disciple of the True Dragon Emperor.\"","In the first level, the disciples of the Great Emperors were all Saints. At most, they would only be nine-star Saints, and it was definitely impossible that they would possess Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"That’s right.\"","\"Who exactly are you?\" Luo Wuyang took a deep breath.","\"Me?\" Ling Han smiled, and said, \"Ling Han, from the outside world.\"","\"What!\" Luo Wuyang paled in shock. People from the outside world could actually barge into this place?","Heavens, there were Great Emperors in charge of the first level. How had this guy managed to break through the blockade set up by the Great Emperors?","Though he was filled with doubts, Luo Wuyang still broke into a run and fled without the slightest hesitation.","He had to report this matter to the Kui Bull Emperor. An outsider with Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess had actually come to this place. This was a serious matter.","However, he had just moved, when he saw that Ling Han was already standing in front of him — previously, he had been sent flying with a punch from Ling Han, and Ling Han had already taken advantage of the opening to cut off his path of retreat.","He wanted to turn around and circle around him, but the rock golem roared and attacked him from behind.","At the same time, he had to face two beings with Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess, and each of them was stronger than him.","Luo Wuyang couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat. Under such a pincer attack, how was he supposed to escape?","Saints were hard to kill, and Pseudo-Emperors were even even harder to kill, but it could not be helped that he had been too careless just now, actually falling into the condition of being under the pincer attack of two Pseudo-Emperors.","What could he do?","At this moment, he actually couldn’t think of any strategy.","However, since Ling Han had already made his identity clear, how could he possibly allow Luo Wuyang to return alive?","He and the rock golem attacked from the front and back, not giving Luo Wuyang any chance to escape.","Luo Wuyang also began to put his life on the line. He went all out, unleashing his Pseudo Emperor-level power. Every move and every strike possessed world-shaking might.","However, compared to Ling Han and the rock golem, his strength was far inferior. So what if he put his life on the line? He would still be thrashed.","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">This has a similar meaning to \"having a headache\".</annotations>"]},{"number":4796,"title":"Chapter 4796: Great Emperor catches up","paragraphs":["Luo Wuyang tried his best to struggle, but the gap between their abilities was too wide, and he was completely unable to reverse the situation.","\"As an outsider, you actually dare barge into this place. When the Great Emperors make their move, you will definitely die a tragic death!\" he roared in fury. \"Even if you are the strongest Pseudo-Emperor, so what? In the end, you will still be blasted into dust.\"","Ling Han smiled, \"There is no need for you to worry about that!\"","He threw a punch, and Destructive Energy surged, turning into a terrifying shockwave that shot towards Luo Wuyang.","Luo Wuyang was currently engaged in an intense battle with the rock golem, so he couldn’t concentrate on resisting at all. Moreover, he couldn’t sense how terrifying Destructive Energy was either. He turned around and tried to block this attack.","However, there was nothing that the Destructive Energy could not obliterate. As the attack surged past, Luo Wuyang screamed, and his entire arm was forcibly turned into nothing.","He was shocked. Although a Pseudo-Emperor could regrow severed limbs, that would expend life force and time, and he had no time to recover now.","What kind of energy was this? How could it be so terrifying?","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ling Han launched Destructive Energy repeatedly, causing Luo Wuyang to suffer injuries repeatedly.","His battle prowess was inferior to Ling Han and the rock golem in the first place, and the gap was not just by a little bit either. He had been in a precarious situation all this while, and was teetering on the edge of life and death. How could he defend against Ling Han’s ultimate attack?","Under Ling Han’s mad barrage of attacks, Luo Wuyang was unable to block at all. Very soon, he was blasted into smithereens.","This was the third Pseudo-Emperor that had died at Ling Han’s hands.","However, Ling Han was astonished. A Pseudo-Emperor was capable of burning the Imperial Source. For example, Shi Gang didn’t hesitate to burn the Imperial Source at the most dangerous moment, even if it meant that he would fall from the position of Pseudo-Emperor or even die.","But now that things had come to this, could it be that he still had to keep it in reserve?","However, in the Primitive Abyss, both the Pseudo-Emperors that Ling Han killed didn’t burn the Imperial Source. It was the case for the True Dragon Emperor, and it was the same for Luo Wuyang as well.","Strange, looking at Luo Wuyang’s expression just now, he clearly knew that he was at the end of his rope, and was putting his life on the line. Why didn’t he burn the Imperial Source?","This was extremely abnormal.","Unless—","He did not have the Imperial Source!","Ling Han was suddenly shocked. That’s right, that must be the case.","The Imperial Source was the foundation of a Great Emperor, and also the basis for why a Great Emperor was a Great Emperor. However, these creatures that had suddenly appeared in the Primitive Abyss were extremely strange. It was as if everything had been planned out, and everyone was born for a certain level.","Was this still called cultivating?","It was just like... being created, and assigned to a specific location.","Thus, since they did not cultivate to that level by themselves, then it was understandable that a Pseudo-Emperor would not have Imperial Source, and why the True Dragon Emperor was inferior to the normal standard of Great Emperor.","There was no other reason, and that was because there was no Imperial Source.","As for why there was no Imperial Source but they possessed Emperor-level battle prowess, that could only be attributed to the strangeness of the Primitive Abyss Just look, weren’t rock golems, giant turtles, and so on born Pseudo-Emperors?","Furthermore, the core of the rock golem was an earthen-yellow crystal. How could this be Imperial Source?","Because he did not have the Imperial Source, even if he had the corresponding cultivation level, his battle prowess was inferior to those that had reached this level through hard work and cultivation.","Ling Han nodded, \"Big Rock, we should leave.\"","Initially, he had wanted to keep a low profile, but with his personality, he could not. Furthermore, his persona would always mysteriously crumble. Now that he had killed Luo Wuyang, he could only begin to flee.","He was sure that very soon, a Great Emperor would move out, and search for his whereabouts, wanting to kill him.","However, Ling Han still found a place to refine the Genesis-level Celestial medicine that he had obtained first.","He had just experienced Silent Destruction not too long ago, so his body was extremely accommodating to Regulations. When Genesis Substance was completely absorbed into his body, the number of Regulations he could accommodate also reached as many as 86.","He was only a mere thirteen flashes away from the finishing line.","As long as, as long as there were a few more Genesis-level Celestial medicines, or something like the Pool of Genesis, he would be able to reach the limit of 99 flashes, allowing him to have the qualifications to break through to Pseudo-Emperor Tier.","\"Continue searching.\"","Ling Han walked in this vast heaven and earth. Even if he had battle prowess on the level of Pseudo-Emperor, he still couldn’t walk very fast here. The gravity fields were too terrifying, and even a Great Emperor couldn’t ignore them, and stimulate his speed to the extreme.","On the way, Ling Han saw grotesque, bizarre scenes. A great many natural phenomena that were completely impossible appeared here, one after another, playing out endless fantastic scenes.","Weng!","Ling Han and the rock golem were still walking when they felt an incredibly powerful intent sweep over them. Under this intent, nothing could hide.","Not good, a Great Emperor had caught up!","Ling Han hurriedly used the Strange Shadow Steps and fled into the shadows. Then, he sent a mental message to the rock golem, \"Stupid big guy, run!\"","It was not the target of the Great Emperor’s attack. Thus, if it fled, the Great Emperor would definitely not waste time on it.","After all, he was still a Pseudo-Emperor. If he was determined to flee, it would definitely take a considerable amount of time for a Great Emperor to catch up to him.","However, he obviously overestimated the rock golem’s intelligence.","The rock golem was at a loss. Yi, why had Ling Han disappeared?","So strange!","This was so fun!","Are you here to play hide and seek with me?","It immediately went off to search for Ling Han, but it circled back and forth in this area, and did not leave.","Heavens!","Ling Han placed a hand on his forehead. What was he supposed to do?","Xiu, he had not even finished the thought, when he saw a massive Divine Beast fly down from the skies.","It looked a little like a bull, but there was a long single bull growing on its forehead. It was twisted like a curved blade, and there were spikes growing on its spine. They were extraordinarily thick like horns, and its whole body was mainly golden, with a hint of purple.","The Divine Beast... the Qiong Qi Emperor!","\"Ang!\" When the rock golem saw this, it immediately pounded its chest, and roared as it charged towards the Qiong Qi Emperor.","’Holy f*ck!’","Ling Han was rendered speechless. ’You’re not from the line of the Battle Saint, so why are you so stubborn? Can’t you see what level your opponent is? Yet, you’re charging over with a roar?’","It was rare that the line of the Battle Saint still had an inheritance, and the rock golem could only be seen here.","They had all died from recklessness.","At this moment, it was already too late for Ling Han to make a move. Qiong Qi Emperor waved a hand, and peng, the rock golem was immediately sent flying. Its massive body fell apart, revealing its core.","Qiong Qi Emperor followed up with another strike. Pa, that earthen-yellow crystal actually did not shatter, but there were also web-like cracks on it, and all of a sudden, the aura of life returned to silence.","The rock golem... died.","Someone as strong as a nine-star Pseudo-Emperor was actually killed in two moves?","Who asked it to be facing a Great Emperor?","In a head-on confrontation, a Pseudo-Emperor didn’t even dare to face the Imperial Weapon head-on, let alone the Great Emperor himself.","—Even if it was a Great Emperor that had a lot of issues.","Ling Han gritted his teeth, and forcibly suppressed the urge to appear.","If the rock golem was still alive, he would definitely jump out and take a gamble. He would activate the Imperial Weapon and leave with the rock golem.","But now, the rock golem was killed in a few moves, so even if he rushed out again, it would be useless.","Qiong Qi Emperor released his divine sense, and searched for Ling Han’s whereabouts.","Previously, he had already swept his gaze over Ling Han, but Ling Han was only a Pseudo-Emperor, after all. With such a great distance separating them, and after Ling Han had entered into the shadows, he naturally removed himself from being detected by his divine sense.","However, this brat would definitely not be able to escape too far."]},{"number":4797,"title":"Chapter 4797: Escape","paragraphs":["Qiong Qi Emperor searched over and over again. However, the Strange Shadow Steps was a top-notch hiding technique in the world in the first place, and it was highly possible that it had been passed down from the Void Emperor. It was naturally very awesome.","Additionally, Ling Han himself also had Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess. It was impossible for him to match a Great Emperor, but if he only had to avoid being searched by a Great Emperor, there was still a great chance.","Moreover, there was also a huge problem with this Great Emperor.","In the end, Qiong Qi Emperor could only give up and leave.","In a certain corner, Ling Han was sitting cross-legged, and did not immediately appear.","Perhaps Qiong Qi Emperor had not gone too far, but had rather hidden himself in the shadows, and was merely luring him out.","—If a Pseudo-Emperor could fool a Great Emperor Pseudo-Emperor with his unique movement technique, then wouldn’t it be even easier for a Great Emperor to fool the senses of a Pseudo-Emperor?","He was sure that this must be a trap.","\"Big Rock, I’ll definitely come back and take you away to see the outside world.\"","Ling Han thought to himself, and left with the Strange Shadow Steps.","After walking for a very far distance, he finally revealed himself.","Without becoming a Pseudo-Emperor, it was useless no matter how many Regulations he cultivated. He was completely unqualified to match a Great Emperor.","He gritted his teeth and clenched his fists. Although he hadn’t spent much time with the rock golem, the blockhead was simple and honest, and his thoughts were simple. He was basically a blank piece of paper, which had already made him develop a fondness for it.","How could he remain unmoved as he watched the rock golem being killed in front of his eyes?","He had to become stronger as soon as possible!","Ling Han didn’t want the same tragedy to happen to the empress, the large black dog, and the others.","He continued to advance, sensing the aura of Genesis Substance everywhere.","However, even in the Primitive Abyss, Genesis Substance was still extremely rare. After a few years, Ling Han still had zero gains.","This was not strange at all. Just look at Luo Wuyang, he had only managed to get a stalk of Genesis-level Celestial medicine after hundreds of thousands of years.","\"Hmm?\"","Ling Han was suddenly shocked. An incredibly powerful divine sense swept over, and then locked onto him.","Several years had passed, and he had finally been found by a Great Emperor again.","He immediately fled into the darkness, and in only an instant, a Divine Beast appeared.","It had the face of a human and the legs of a tiger. Its fur was extraordinarily long, and its tail was like a halberd.","Divine Beast, Taowu Emperor!","He was also unable to find Ling Han in the shadows, but he could confirm that Ling Han had not left this area yet.","\"Brat, come out!\" The Taowu Emperor shouted lightly. Weng, his voice reverberated, turning into a terrifying shockwave.","Pa! Pa! Pa!","On the desolate plain, countless rocks exploded one after another.","It should be known that every grain of sand here was as heavy as a star. With a shout from a Great Emperor, it actually caused countless rocks to explode. Just how strong was its might?","Peng, Ling Han was also blasted out.","Indeed, he had not fled too far, and had still been shaken by the soundwaves.","The moment he appeared, Ling Han immediately used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight and began to run madly.","\"You think you can escape?\" Taowu Emperor smirked coldly. With a single step, he had already caught up to Ling Han. With a sweep of his tail, he delivered a smack at Ling Han’s waist.","This whip of his tail was extraordinarily fast.","Even if Ling Han possessed the number one movement technique in the world, it was useless. There was no way he could dodge.","This was the attack of a Great Emperor!","However, this wasn’t Ling Han’s first time exchanging blows with a Great Emperor. He immediately activated the Clear Bamboo Sword, and slashed at Taowu Emperor.","Boom!","The Imperial Weapon and the Great Emperor clashed head-on, and a terrifying power rebounded back. Ling Han only felt a pain in the web between his thumb and index finger. The Imperial Weapon instantly flew out of his hand, and he couldn’t control it at all.","It didn’t matter. His divine sense was connected to the Imperial Weapon, and under his control, the Imperial Weapon shone brightly, protecting Ling Han.","Ling Han didn’t linger in battle at all. So what if he had an Imperial Weapon? Against a Great Emperor, he had no chance of winning at all. Staying in battle was merely courting death.","Moreover, the two great Emperors, Qiong Qi and Taowu, had already appeared. Who knows, even more Great Emperors would appear. If one more came, so what if he had the Imperial Weapon protecting him? It was guaranteed that he would die very quickly.","Just like how Luo Wuyang had previously been pincered by two beings stronger than himself, unable to escape, and could only fight to the death. Naturally, the only fate left was death.","He didn’t want to suffer the same fate, so he naturally fled.","In the Primitive Abyss, it was not impossible to escape from a Great Emperor.","The storm of heaven and earth!","This was something that even the Great Emperor would have to be wary of. Thus, as long as they encountered the storm of heaven and earth, he would have a chance to break free from the pursuit of the Great Emperor.","He fled, and Taowu Emperor chased after him.","Under normal circumstances, Ling Han wouldn’t be able to escape at all. He would be caught up repeatedly, and could only use the Clear Bamboo Sword to protect himself. However, under the terrifying shockwaves of power, even if he was a Pseudo-Emperor, so what? His whole body was covered with wounds.","If this continued, there would be no need for a second Great Emperor to appear. He would become severely injured due to the accumulation of injuries, and severe injuries would become fatal injuries.","However, it was at this moment that a second Great Emperor caught up to them.","Qiong Qi Emperor..","He charged over from the sidelines, and his aura as a Great Emperor was on full display. Merely this aura alone was enough to kill a Saint.","Ling Han’s heart shuddered. Once the two Great Emperors formed a pincer attack, he wouldn’t be able to escape even if he wanted to.","Shua, the wind suddenly blew.","Yi?","Ling Han saw that a sandstorm had appeared in the distance, and was rapidly sweeping towards him.","If it was another time, he would definitely turn around and run without another word when he saw this sandstorm.","But now, Ling Han looked overjoyed, and took the initiative to head towards the sandstorm.","\"Humph!\" The two Divine Beast Emperors both smirked coldly, and set off in hot pursuit.","The storms of heaven and earth were also divided into tiers. These sandstorms were not difficult for them, but they would greatly affect their vision and divine sense. Thus, if Ling Han really rushed in, it was possible that they would lose him.","Thus, they both launched their attacks. Two claws descended from the sky, and pressed down on Ling Han.","Ling Han unleashed his full strength. With a flap of his wings, xiu, his body suddenly sped up, and he actually charged out of the area that was enshrouded by the two claws in an inconceivable manner.","However, he also spat out a mouthful of blood, his face as pale as a sheet.","The acceleration just now was completely because he had channeled too much energy. It was too hurtful.","However, Ling Han didn’t stop at all, continuing to run forwards madly.","When the two Great Emperors attacked again, the sandstorm in front of them surged over at an astonishing speed, and Ling Han was already swept up in it.","At this moment, even the two Great Emperors were unable to determine Ling Han’s exact location.","Boom, the attack landed, and even the whole sandstorm slowed down for a moment, but there was no sign of Ling Han. Hu, the sandstorm continued to sweep by, and did not stop at all. Once again, it turned heaven and earth into a world of yellow sand.","The winds blew madly, and even the two Great Emperors had to put up a shield to resist. After all, every grain of sand was equivalent to a star, and with such a terrifying speed, just how terrifying would the destructive power be?","They advanced, searching for Ling Han’s whereabouts.","However, with how violent the sandstorm was, no matter what traces Ling Han left behind, they would still be blown clean. How could they catch up to him?","The two Great Emperors were also exasperated. They had moved personally, and a Saint had actually managed to escape.","No one would believe this even if they told them."]},{"number":4798,"title":"Chapter 4798: Reviving the rock golem","paragraphs":["Half a month later, Ling Han finally walked out of the sandstorm.","\"Wa!\" He spat out blood madly, his whole person already badly mangled.","In the last period of time, he had already expended all his power, and could only take the impact of the sandstorm head-on with his physical body. Even if his physique was tough, so what? He could not withstand this endless barrage of attacks.","If this continued for a few more days, Ling Han would probably be blasted to death by the sandstorm.","Thankfully, the heavens did not move to exterminate him.","Ling Han lay lifelessly on the ground.","After lying down for a few days, he finally woke up and channeled the Tenth Cultivation Technique to heal himself.","This healing process actually lasted for a whole seventeen years, and only then did Ling Han recover about fifty percent.","He left, and began to walk back.","He had sworn that he would take the core of the rock golem and leave. No matter what, he had to be buried on the Four Origin Planet.","However, the path of return was extraordinarily difficult. Occasionally, he would encounter the storms of heaven and earth, causing Ling Han to have no choice but to stop or retreat continuously.","After a whole 133 years, Ling Han finally arrived at the place where the rock golem had exploded.","However, it was also beneficial. After such a long time, his injuries had also completely recovered.","The Great Emperor naturally disdained from picking up a stone that had already been crippled. Thus, though so much time had passed, the crystal core of the rock golem was still lying there, entirely covered with a pattern of cracks, and had long since lost all signs of life.","Ling Han picked up this crystal core, and couldn’t help but sigh.","What an idiot.","He sat quietly for a while, and was just about to stand up and leave, when a thought suddenly occurred to him.","Could the rock golem be revived?","From a certain aspect, this was a little similar to a dead star.","Since he could revive planets, why couldn’t he revive the rock golem?","He could give it a try.","He gripped the crystal, and recalled how he had revived planets previously. Then, waves of power surged out, and entered into the crystal core.","There was no reaction; the inside of the crystal core had already shattered.","Ling Han didn’t expect to revive the rock golem instantaneously. He first repaired the inside of the crystal core, making it complete again.","In the blink of an eye, three years had passed.","Ling Han didn’t think that he was wasting time, because he discovered that he had developed a deeper understanding of the essence of life.","At this rate, he may be able to revive the dead.","\"Come, come back to life!\"","Ling Han shouted loudly. Boom, endless power surged into the crystal.","Weng, the surface of the crystal glowed, but immediately dimmed again.","Again!","Ling Han injected power into it again, filled with life and vitality.","Weng, the crystal lit up again, but it still dimmed again.","Again, again, again!","Ling Han continued to experiment, and the light that the crystal emitted lasted longer and longer. After a certain time, the light that it emitted finally stopped dimming.","Success?","Ling Han stood up and left. He found a forest of stone, then placed the crystal on top of the stones. Instantly, it was as if the stones in the surroundings had come to life, absorbing them one after another.","A rock golem appeared under Ling Han’s gaze.","\"Ang?\" The rock golem sent out a dazed wave of divine sense.","Why am I here? What happened?","\"Yi?\" Ling Han was also surprised. He discovered that his divine sense had actually developed a connection with the rock golem. This was a one-sided relationship, and he could influence, command, or even forcefully control this big guy.","When he revived the rock golem, it was inevitable that he would leave his mark on it, and with his mark, he would naturally be able to control the rock golem.","This was not Ling Han’s intention, but it was inevitable.","\"Congratulations, you’ve come back to life,\" he said with a smile.","In any case, he treated the rock golem as a friend.","The rock golem rubbed its head against Ling Han’s arm, appearing very affectionate.","Thankfully, this was Ling Han. Otherwise, even if it rubbed against him lightly, it would still be Pseudo-Emperor-level, and that was enough to break the bones and shatter the flesh of a Saint.","\"All right, let’s go.\"","Ling Han stood up, and the rock golem immediately stood up obediently. Now, this guy could finally be commanded.","The two of them continued onwards, searching for places that they had not set foot in before. Hopefully, they would have a burst of luck, and they would be able to find a Genesis-level Celestial medicine, or any Genesis Substance.","In the blink of an eye, more than seven hundred years had passed.","Ling Han did not gain anything, but the Divine Beast Emperors also seemed to think that he had died, and did not set out to look for him again.","\"Sigh, idiot, who knows how long we’ll have to travel to get Genesis Substance.\" Ling Han sighed. Time passed quickly here, but he couldn’t sense Regulations. There were Regulations outside, but the flow of time was normal.","Thus, if Ling Han wanted to rapidly improve himself, he could only depend on Genesis Substance.","\"Ang.\" The rock golem strode forwards. It was unknown whether it understood Ling Han’s sigh or not.","Ling Han sat on the shoulder of the rock golem. Travelling here was actually quite tiring, and the rock golem didn’t have a physical body, so it naturally wouldn’t feel tired. Thus, it was very good to act as a steed.","The higher he sat, the farther he could see.","’Hmm?’","Ling Han faltered. He had actually spotted a group of people ahead of him.","A group of people could actually be seen in this place?","With a thought from Ling Han, his appearance changed. Using his divine sense, he said, \"Come, let’s go over there.\"","He only had to release his divine sense, and he would be able to accurately make the rock golem follow his commands. However, if it was just talking, the rock golem would still be dumb.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The rock golem left in large strides, and raced towards the place that Ling Han had indicated.","Its speed was very fast, and with its astonishing weight, as it raced past, even the ground released a rumble, which caused a slight tremor.","Ahead of them, those people immediately turned to look.","The first thing they saw was naturally the rock golem, and they immediately revealed shocked expressions.","Source Spirit, and it was Pseudo-Emperor-level at that.","None of them were wearing Battle Armors, yet they could walk in the wilderness. From this, it could be determined that they were at least Pseudo-Emperor-level.","In truth, they were all disciples of Great Emperors in the second level.","They were all prepared for battle. The Source Spirits here did not have intelligence, and only knew to battle. Thus, this was an unavoidable hard battle.","Then, they saw Ling Han sitting on the rock golem’s shoulder.","\"Luo Wuyang!\"","They all exclaimed in shock. It was precisely because they knew each other that they were so shocked.","They hadn’t seen each other for tens of thousands of years, so how could this guy be so awesome, obtaining a Pseudo-Emperor as a servant?","This was practically enough to make anyone die of envy.","\"Brother Luo!\" A person approached, \"Were you the one who subdued him?\"","\"Otherwise, would it be you?\" Ling Han immediately retorted.","’Holy f*ck!’","That person was infuriated by Ling Han’s retort. How could you speak like that? Do we have a grudge?","His name was Zong Yuze, and he was a disciple of Qiong Qi Emperor.","\"Could it be that you think you can look down on us just because you obtained a Pseudo-Emperor-level Source Spirit?\" he said angrily.","\"That’s right.\" Ling Han nodded, \"Otherwise, why don’t you come and fight me?\"","How could Zong Yuze tolerate this? He immediately shouted loudly, and charged towards Ling Han.","Peng, the rock golem moved, and smacked Zong Yuze forcefully into the ground.","Er..."]},{"number":4799,"title":"Chapter 4799: Snowy Lotus Peak","paragraphs":["Ling Han broke into a smile, \"Does anyone else have any objections?\"","The remaining seven people were all speechless.","’Holy f*ck! He’s far too vicious!’","It wasn’t like they didn’t know how sturdy the ground was, but the rock golem smacked Zong Yuze into the ground with a single palm strike; what kind of great power was that?","They could not afford to trifle with him.","The rock golem withdrew its palm, as if it had just swatted a fly to death, and appeared to be completely nonchalant.","And in the ground, Zong Yuze only managed to climb out after exerting some effort.","His clothes were torn and tattered. In the previous situation, he could only try his best to ensure that he would not be injured, so how could he still care about his clothes?","\"Haha, we’re both disciples of Great Emperors, so let’s not ruin the peace.\" Ning Xuelin, a disciple of Bi Fang Emperor, stepped out to mediate the situation.","Ling Han naturally pretended to be so arrogant. In this way, everyone would keep their distance from him, and would not expose the fact that he was actually an imposter.","—Just how sensitive was a Pseudo-Emperor’s insight? If he spent all his time with these people, it was inevitable that he would be seen through.","For these disciples of the Great Emperors to suddenly gather together, there must be a great matter brewing.","Yi, could it be that there was also a Pool of Genesis here?","Ling Han thought expectantly. However, it was naturally impossible for him to ask, or he would immediately give himself away.","His expression was filled with pride, \"Haven’t you rested enough? It’s time to set out!\"","He didn’t say where they would be going. In any case, he wouldn’t lead the way.","Zong Yuze and the others were all furious. First, this guy came to strut around, and now, he was even commanding. He had really gone too far.","But there was nothing that could be done. The Source Spirit that he had subdued was a high-level Pseudo-Emperor. Its battle prowess was too terrifying.","Yang Deyu, a disciple of Zhu Jian Emperor, also spoke up to mediate the atmosphere, and said with a smile, \"Brother Luo, I heard that you have disappeared for several hundred years. So it turns out that you have gone to subdue this Source Spirit?\"","The Divine Beast Cities did not communicate with one another, and everyone was doing their own things. Only the Great Emperors would be exchanging information. Previously, they had all come out to hunt down Ling Han.","However, did the Great Emperors still need to report the situation to these disciples?","Thus, these people only thought that Luo Wuyang had gone somewhere to train, and had never thought that this person would actually be killed.","\"Are you envious?\" Ling Han looked towards Yang Deyu.","’Holy motherf*cker!’","Yang Deyu was also rendered speechless. Had this guy taken the wrong medicine? Why did he blast retorts back at everyone he came across?","\"All right, let’s set out.\"","The others were also very displeased, but firstly, they were all disciples of the Great Emperors, so they couldn’t possibly start a fight over such a small matter, right? Secondly, if they really came to blows, they might not be a match for the rock golem.","There was a world of difference between a high-level Pseudo-Emperor and Two Star and Three Star Pseudo-Emperors like them.","Everyone set off, but Zong Yuze and the others had clearly distanced themselves from Ling Han, looking like they wanted to ignore him.","This was naturally Ling Han’s motive. He put on a haughty expression, and had the rock golem follow behind these eight people.","In this way, he would be able to find out what these people were scheming before he revealed his identity.","Tsk, tsk. This was the first time that his persona was so stable. He did not have to worry at all that it would collapse. This was great.","The group travelled in silence. The atmosphere had already been completely ruined by Ling Han, and no one was willing to speak.","After walking for a few months, the temperature suddenly dropped drastically.","Ahead of them, a mountain peak that looked like a lotus flower appeared. It was covered with snow, and looked like a snow lotus flower.","\"We’ve finally arrived at the Snowy Lotus Peak,\" Zong Yuze said. He then immediately glanced at Ling Han. Along the way, Ling Han had taken delight in insulting others, and this had given him a psychological trauma.","This time, Ling Han ignored him. He was only observing this mountain peak.","It was too cold. Even if he hadn’t climbed the mountain yet, he still felt as if his blood was about to be frozen.","If they went up, they would definitely be turned into ice statues.","Were these people rushing to their deaths?","\"The temperature is still rising. We did not miss the time,\" a woman said.","Out of the nine people, only two were female. One was her, Du Ziying, who was a disciple of Xiemu Emperor, and the other was An Tingmei, who was a disciple of Taowu Emperor.","The others nodded as well. With the sensitivity of their divine sense, they could naturally sense the slightest change in temperature.","The temperature was rising, so were these people waiting, conspiring for some treasure on the mountain peak?","Was it the Pool of Genesis?","Ling Han was a little excited. If he was given another Pool of Genesis at this time, he would definitely be able to rush up to the height of 99 Regulations. Then, with a few more years of accumulation, with how fast time flowed in the Primitive Abyss, at most a hundred years would have passed in the outside world, so how could it be that he would not be able to rush up to the height of Pseudo-Emperor by then?","They waited, and this wait lasted for as long as 12 years.","The time was indeed a little long, but there was nothing that could be done. There were too many unpredictable changes here. Any random storm of heaven and earth would be able to stop people for eight to ten years. Thus, it was naturally better to arrive earlier than to plan to arrive just in time.","\"Let’s go.\"","Everyone continued to advance. At this time, though the temperature was still frighteningly low, it was already within the range that a Pseudo-Emperor could contend with.","Not long after, they began to climb the mountain.","This was extraordinarily dangerous.","The accumulated snow would not melt all year round, and after experiencing innumerable years of winds, it was already very firm. Furthermore, it was incredibly slippery. Furthermore, the gravity fields here were astonishingly powerful, so it was impossible for them to fly. They could only take one solid step at a time.","This caused the Pseudo-Emperors to slip and stumble here and there.","And it should be known that there were rocks everywhere in this place, and the edges of the rocks were covered with icicles, which were extraordinarily long and sharp. Ling Han had tried them out before. Even if it was a physique like the rock golem, a hole would still be created if it was pierced by the icicles.","Furthermore, there was also a strange poison in these ice pillars. If it was not for the fact that the rock golem’s body was only a suit of armor, and he could immediately dispose of that rock, it was possible that his whole body would be completely destroyed.","Thus, it was too dangerous to lose footing here. If his body was pierced by an icicle, he might die.","Everyone carefully and slowly climbed the mountain.","Only Ling Han was an exception. He had the rock golem, and the rock golem did not care. If he was damaged or scraped, he could just throw away the corresponding rock.","Previously, the rock golem had strengthened its body to the limit, absorbing a lot of rocks, so it could completely withstand this kind of expenditure.","If it had used up all the rocks?","When he returned to the stone forest and the desolate plains, he could simply absorb some more stones, and wouldn’t he be back to normal again?","Thus, Ling Han advanced all the way, his speed not too fast.","Zong Yuze and the others were all envious, but they all held back, and did not open their mouths to ask Ling Han to give them a ride, so that they would not seek their own humiliation.","However, after Ling Han walked for a while, the rock golem finally stopped.","After a long while, they finally caught up.","\"You guys... do you want me to give you a lift?\" Ling Han asked.","F***, you have finally found your conscience?","Everyone nodded. Walking here, one had to be very careful and tense. As time passed, even Pseudo-Emperors would be under great pressure, breaking out in a cold sweat.","Thus, it would be great if they could have an alternative means of transport.","\"I’ll trade Genesis Substance for it,\" Ling Han said with a beaming smile."]},{"number":4800,"title":"Chapter 4800: Cold Water of Death","paragraphs":["The faces of Zong Yuze and the others instantly darkened.","They really could not think too highly of this guy.","Hiss, they had never felt that this person was so greedy before. Why had he changed so much in these tens of thousands of years?","Ling Han continued to patiently tempt them, \"This place is very dangerous, and one could lose his life at the slightest provocation. No matter how precious worldly possessions are, can they compare to your life?\"","The eight people were speechless. You are obviously just f****** greedy, so why do you still have to act so sanctimonious? Pei!","\"Humph! Luo Wuyang, we’re all from the same side, so what you’re doing is far too uncourteous!\"","\"Even if we agree, do you think that we would bring such a treasure with us?\"","Everyone rebuked.","True.","Ling Han felt extremely regretful. He had initially thought that he could earn a small profit, but in the end, it was all for naught.","Forget it.","\"Then take it slow.\" He laughed, and gestured for the rock golem to continue climbing the mountain.","For the moment, he did not make a move. Firstly, he still did not know why these people had come, and if he killed them, there was nothing to be gained.","Additionally, though he and the rock golem were powerful, there were only two of them after all. It would be very difficult for them to capture and kill all eight Pseudo-Emperors.","Thus, he had to find a better opportunity.","The rock golem continued to advance. Although it could \"ignore\" the threats here, it couldn’t be too rash. Otherwise, it would grind away all the rocks on its body before it even reached the summit.","Even so, they were still much faster than Zong Yuze and the others.","Three days later, they reached the summit.","After all, this Snow Lotus Mountain wasn’t overwhelmingly tall. One could still see its summit with a single glance.","The summit was very flat, and there was a black pool.","What was strange was that even though this place was extremely cold, that if Pseudo-Emperors did not resist, even they would be frozen into a block of ice, the water in this pool still maintained a liquid state.","The black water, with a single glance, caused Ling Han to involuntarily shiver, as if a part of his body had suddenly died.","He had a feeling that if he touched this water, he would really die.","Was this the Water of Death?","Yi, could it be that what Zong Yuze and the others had come to find was not a treasure like the Pool of Genesis, but rather this liquid that was filled with an air of death?","\"Big Rock, do you dare touch this thing?\" Ling Han asked.","The rock golem hurriedly shook its head, sending a vague thought to Ling Han.","If its core came into contact with this liquid, it would immediately lose its life force, and if its arms came into contact with it, they would also immediately fall off its body, because they would lose vitality.","Thus, this thing was different from Destructive Energy.","Destructive Energy Energy directly turned objects into nothingness, vanishing completely, but this liquid was only death, absolute death. Even a Pseudo-Emperor couldn’t withstand it.","More importantly, what did Zong Yuze and the others want this liquid for?","—If their target was this thing.","With their strength, there was practically no one that could match them in this area. Could it be that they wanted to make a move on a Great Emperor?","That was impossible.","Yi?","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. Could it be that after collecting it, they would have to send it into the innermost depths?","There, the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others were currently fighting against some powerful mysterious force. They were at a disadvantage, but at least, they could still hold on.","In order to turn the tables, the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others gifted the Natural-born Gold Spirit, the Metal of Creation and so on. In fact, it was extremely likely that the predecessor of the Genesis World had also been gifted by the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others. It was called the \"Stone of Life.\"","But since the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others could set up arrangements, why couldn’t that mysterious force do the same?","Did they just blindly oppose the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others?","Hence, sending someone to retrieve this Water of Death, and then deal with the Great Emperor Wu Ya and the others?","Logically speaking, this made sense completely.","Ling Han broke into a grin. If that was really the case, then it was really fate that he had come across such a coincidence.","Since this was happening right before him, he would definitely not allow such a thing to happen.","Ling Han waited. This place was not bad, and it was just right to send Zong Yuze and the others on their way.","After waiting for another four days, Zong Yuze and the others finally climbed to the summit.","\"You came up so early, and actually just sat there all this while?\" Seeing Ling Han sit by the side of the pool, the eight people were about to go crazy.","At first, they had still been hoping that Ling Han would have long since retrieved the item. This would also save them some trouble, but after waiting for a long time for Ling Han to come down, they could only continue to climb the mountain as per their original plan.","But Ling Han... was actually sitting lazily by the side of the pool. This almost drove them mad with fury.","\"That’s right.\" Ling Han nodded, and asked in reply, \"What else would I do?\"","Yi, why can you speak in such a self-righteous manner?","Zong Yuze and the others exchanged looks. Though it was rare for them to see each other, this Luo Wuyang had changed too much.","Had he been provoked in some way?","Even if they were beaten to death, they would never have imagined that this was not Luo Wuyang at all, and that this was another person, because this theory was too unrealistic.","In this area, there had never been any invasion from external enemies.","\"Forget it, don’t waste your breath on him.\"","\"Hurry up and withdraw the Cold Water of Death. Let’s quickly descend the mountain. Who knows when this place will return to being dead cold.\"","These people said, and then took out the vessels that could contain the liquid.","In truth, these were just a few stones that had been hollowed out.","Sigh!","Ling Han sighed. Before confirming it, he still had a sliver of hope. Actually, these guys had come to find Genesis Substance.","Yet now, he could not hold himself back.","Zong Yuze and the others had come to retrieve the liquid that could kill Pseudo-Emperors.","Cold Water of Death?","Fine then.","Ling Han stood up, then snapped his fingers.","The rock golem immediately became excited, releasing a howling wave of divine sense. Then, it charged towards Zong Yuze and the others.","\"What is the meaning of this?\" Zong Yuze and the others were both shocked and furious. They could not have imagined that the rock golem would make a move at this time.","\"Luo Wuyang, hurry up and make it stop!\"","Ling Han laughed loudly, and returned to his original appearance, \"Apologies, I am not Luo Wuyang.\"","What!","Zong Yuze and the others were all shocked. How could this be? This person was actually an imposter.","No wonder!","Previously, this guy was always insulting others, making them so angry that they were about to throw up blood. As it turned out, he was not Luo Wuyang.","\"Who are you?\" the eight Pseudo-Emperors asked Ling Han, as they fought against the rock golem.","They were really too shocked. This was something that they would never have imagined, causing their heads to explode.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"You people won’t know even if I tell you... Forget it. I’m the most powerful Saint of all eternity, Ling Han.\"","Strongest in all eternity?","Hehe, what big boasts you have.","Hold on.","\"You’re a Saint?\" Zong Yuze and the others all came to a realization.","Ling Han released the holy flame, and said with a smile, \"True!\"","Heavens!","Zong Yuze and the others were all shaken quite a bit, and the rock golem almost broke through their line of defense with a single move.","Was it really a Saint?","However, this wasn’t the city, so why could this guy walk freely without wearing a Battle Armor?","Could it be that he possessed Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess?"]}]);
